&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidates may submit up to 5 applications during any rolling 30-day period.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidates may not reapply to the same role while an application is active or within 90 days of receiving a rejection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Once the applicable days has passed, candidates are welcome to apply again.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 data-lfile-container=&quot;d5053952-2b4c-4422-9693-d8a9db7a898d&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team and role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-lfile-container=&quot;d5053952-2b4c-4422-9693-d8a9db7a898d&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;Rubrik&#39;s sales organisation is a unified group of cross-functional professionals helping companies across every major industry, from financial services and manufacturing to the public sector, achieve true resilience against cyberattacks, malicious insiders and operational disruption. As an Account Executive in France, you will drive Rubrik&#39;s growth across one of Europe&#39;s most dynamic markets, owning the full sales cycle from first contact to close and building the pipeline that powers our growth across the French commercial landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;what-youll-do&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute a territory sales plan for France, driving net new logo acquisition through disciplined prospecting, pipeline development and focused account pursuit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run complete sales cycles end to end, from discovery and qualification through solution design, negotiation and close, consistently building toward and exceeding your targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage a high-quality pipeline that balances breadth across your territory with depth in your highest-priority opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Solutions Engineers, Channel Development and Rubrik&#39;s partner ecosystem to position our data security platform against the full scope of customer risk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop relationships with key decision makers and sponsors within target accounts, connecting Rubrik&#39;s capabilities to their most pressing business priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with channel partners, distributors and VARs to extend your reach and accelerate growth across the territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide market intelligence back to Rubrik leadership, including competitive signals, customer insights and partnership opportunities that shape our go-to-market in France&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;experience-youll-need&quot;&gt;Experience you&#39;ll need&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 to 5 years of closing experience in technology sales (IT infrastructure, SaaS, or ideally both)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to source your own pipeline and land net new logos within the French market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in French and English; you engage confidently with business and technical stakeholders in both languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of buying cycles, procurement processes and multi-stakeholder decision making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A driven, goal-oriented approach; you hold yourself accountable to pipeline metrics and push consistently to convert activity into outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with channel partners as part of a broader go-to-market motion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;preferred-qualifications&quot;&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in cybersecurity, data protection, backup and recovery, or adjacent infrastructure categories&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with MEDDPICC as a sales qualification and execution framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing relationships within the French market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Salesforce for pipeline management and forecast accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;#LI-VR1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;#LI-hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join Us in Securing and Accelerating the World&#39;s AI Transformation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik (NYSE: RBRK) is the Security and AI Operations Company, delivering one platform built at the intersection of data, identity, and AI. The platform enables agentic cyber resilience and trusted AI operations for enterprises worldwide, built to recover before disruption strikes and stay a step ahead, so security is never the reason ambition stalls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/rubrik-inc/mycompany/verification/&quot;&gt;Linkedin&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/rubrikinc&quot;&gt;X (formerly Twitter)&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/rubrikinc/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rubrik.com&quot;&gt;Rubrik.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Inclusion @ Rubrik&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Rubrik, we are dedicated to fostering a culture where people from all backgrounds are valued, feel they belong, and believe they can succeed. Our commitment to inclusion is at the heart of our mission to secure the world’s data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to hire and promote the best talent, regardless of background. We continually review our hiring practices to ensure fairness and strive to create an environment where every employee has equal access to opportunities for growth and excellence. We believe in empowering everyone to bring their authentic selves to work and achieve their fullest potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our inclusion strategy focuses on three core areas of our business and culture:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Company: We are committed to building a merit-based organization that offers equal access to growth and success for all employees globally. Your potential is limitless here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Culture: We strive to create an inclusive atmosphere where individuals from all backgrounds feel a strong sense of belonging, can thrive, and do their best work. Your contributions help us innovate and break boundaries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Communities: We are dedicated to expanding our engagement with the communities we operate in, creating opportunities for underrepresented talent and driving greater innovation for our clients. Your impact extends beyond Rubrik, contributing to safer and stronger communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer/Veterans/Disabled&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, disability, genetic information, protected veteran status, or any other status protected by applicable law. Rubrik provides equal employment opportunities to employees and applicants in all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, promotion, compensation, training, leave, and termination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik provides reasonable accommodations to qualified applicants and employees with disabilities in accordance with applicable law. If you need an accommodation to participate in the application process or to perform your job, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- ----- Accommodations may include changes to the application process, documents in an alternate format, a sign language interpreter, or specialized equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO IS THE LAW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/olms/regs/compliance/eo_posters/employeerightsposter2page_19final.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;NOTIFICATION OF EMPLOYEE RIGHTS UNDER FEDERAL LABOR LAWS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h3&gt;🧡 About Alma&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Alma, we believe sustainable commerce depends on fair, well‑balanced trade. Because finance plays a pivotal role in business, our mission is to put it back in its rightful place - serving merchants and consumers. Our installment and deferred payment solutions help merchants boost sales by 20% or more, increase customer loyalty, and deliver a seamless shopping experience - without encouraging bad debt. As the buy now pay later leader in France and active in 10 European countries, we&#39;ve empowered over +25,000 merchants and 10 million consumers. With 400+ Almakers and €100M+ ARR, Alma is scaling rapidly across Europe as a member of the Next40, and we&#39;re just getting started!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;👐 About the team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join the Checkout Experience squad within Alma’s Consumer Tribe, reporting to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/in/tetianavorgul/&quot;&gt;Tetiana&lt;/a&gt;, Group Product Manager. The squad is composed of an Engineering Manager and several Software Engineers, and works on key parts of Alma’s consumer checkout experience across online and in-store journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Manager, you will join as an individual contributor and take ownership of strategic product topics spanning checkout conversion, account creation and identity verification. You will work at the intersection of consumer experience, merchant needs, business performance and regulatory requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This position is a permanent contract (CDI) based in Paris with a hybrid working model.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;💼 About the job&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make checkout simpler and more effective:&lt;/strong&gt; Own and improve Alma’s checkout experience across e-commerce and in-store journeys, reducing friction and supporting conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn complexity into trusted experiences:&lt;/strong&gt; Own account creation and identity verification journeys, integrating KYC and CCD2 requirements into clear and seamless customer flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test, learn and repeat:&lt;/strong&gt; Use funnel analysis, customer insights and experimentation to identify opportunities, measure impact and continuously improve the product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make it happen together:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with cross-functional stakeholders to prioritize the roadmap and balance consumer, merchant, business, risk and compliance needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🧰 You will work with&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Slack&lt;/strong&gt; for day-to-day cross-functional communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notion&lt;/strong&gt; for product documentation, briefs and roadmaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Linear&lt;/strong&gt; for backlog and delivery tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Figma&lt;/strong&gt; for product design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Metabase&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Looker&lt;/strong&gt; for data analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🧩 About you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;To succeed in this job&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have proven experience as a Product Manager working on checkout, e-commerce, payments or another high-volume consumer transaction experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand conversion funnels and experimentation, and are comfortable using data to identify opportunities, define success metrics and prioritize initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can turn complex customer needs, business constraints and regulatory requirements into simple, intuitive product experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You demonstrate strong ownership, structured problem-solving and effective cross-functional collaboration, while using AI tools to improve your product work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;And it will be nice if you...&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with account creation, identity verification, authentication, KYC or fraud prevention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have built products in regulated environments, ideally within payments, BNPL, lending, consumer finance or another financial services context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked on in-store, POS or omnichannel experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with European markets or an interest in emerging purchase journeys, including agentic commerce and AI-assisted transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don&#39;t meet every single requirement? At Alma, we believe great hires come from diverse paths. If this role excites you, we encourage you to apply. We value potential, curiosity and the ability to grow as much as experience.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🧘 What&#39;s in it for you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you join, you will be able to grow and impact on:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive measurable impact on Alma’s checkout conversion across both e-commerce and in-store experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a strategic product scope at the intersection of checkout, payments, identity and regulation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape the future of checkout, including new purchase journeys initiated by AI agents and LLM assistants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🤑 Compensation &amp;amp; benefits&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary based on 12 months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Profit-sharing and employee savings plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance: 100% covered by Alma including family package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disability insurance: 100% covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sport: partnerships with Gymlib and Classpass, or €30/month reimbursement for your sports activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maternity/paternity leave: salary maintained at 100% during leave with no seniority requirement. Return to work at 4/5 schedule paid at 100% for 8 weeks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sustainable Mobility Package (FMD): €544.80/year (excluding full-remote contracts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meal vouchers: €10/day, 50% covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health: free access to MindDay platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid time off: 25 days/year (+ additional paid leave granted for employees on executive contracts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to our Learning &amp;amp; Development Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 weeks of full remote possible per year in summer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🎯 Interview Process&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Video call with a Talent Acquisition team member to understand your path, motivation &amp;amp; present you the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Video call with your future manager to deep dive the role, the team, your profile and answer all your questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Case study presentation with 2 team members (ideally in house) to assess your practical knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A coffee chat to further assess your skills and team fit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;References check.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🌍 Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Alma, we believe that diversity fuels innovation and makes our community stronger. We are committed to building a workplace where every person feels seen, respected, and empowered to do their best work whatever their gender, background, ethnicity, age, sexual orientation, religion, disability or lived experience. As an equal opportunity employer, we welcome applicants from all walks of life, and all employment decisions are made based on qualifications, merit, and business needs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;Nous recherchons un stagiaire pour rejoindre notre équipe, se développer dans nos espaces restauration et apprendre à offrir un service de qualité.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos principales missions :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Suivre sa checklist afin d&#39;assurer la mise en place et le bon déroulement du service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Travailler en lien avec les Commis, Chefs de rang et Floors managers afin d&#39;assurer une bonne coordination et la fluidité du service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Apporter les mets et boissons aux clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Savoir travailler en respectant les standards Soho House (speed of service, grooming...)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;S&#39;assurer de la satisfaction client à tout instant, reporter à son supérieur en cas de plainte&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintenir un niveau de propreté élevé dans le Club ainsi que les espaces de restauration, offices et les bars&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accueillir les nouveaux stagiaires et être capable de les former à votre poste&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participer de manière active aux briefings d’équipe, être force de proposition lors de ces derniers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connaître les différentes cartes, les produits des plats et savoir les recommander avec aisance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Le succès du stage et le développement des missions dépend de l’implication et de la motivation de chacun&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
