We are looking for detail-oriented professionals with experience in annotation, content review, quality assurance, or data operations to support multilingual and multimodal AI projects.


Project Details


Job Title: Generative AI Analyst - Dutch (Netherlands)
Location: Remote, Netherlands
Commitment: 4&nbsp;weeks
Employment Type: Freelance Contract&nbsp;
Pay Rate: $28/hour


