Security and Fraud:
Caseware takes the security of candidates seriously. All legitimate communication from us will come from email addresses ending in ----- and our open positions are always listed on reputable job boards and on our website https://jobs.lever.co/caseware. We will NEVER ask for payment or financial information from you. If you receive an unsolicited job offer, proceed with extreme caution.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pure Storage is seeking a Strategic Accounts Account Executive to accelerate growth of the Portworx platform across Strategic Telco accounts in EMEA. You will own a small number of named Telco customers and prospects, build and execute multi year account plans, and drive platform adoption with a focus on business outcomes such as resilience, risk reduction, faster application delivery, and operational efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with cross functional teams across Pure and Portworx, including Systems Engineering, Customer Experience, Marketing, Partner teams, Product, and field leadership. This is a high impact individual contributor role with a strong emphasis on strategic planning, disciplined execution, and customer intimacy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and grow a portfolio of named Strategic Telco accounts, delivering against annual and multi year revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute account plans that map buying centres, application priorities, Kubernetes roadmaps, and transformation programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop executive relationships across CIO, CTO, CISO, Head of Infrastructure, Platform Engineering, SRE, and Application leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex sales cycles from discovery through close, including security, risk, procurement, architecture review, and legal processes common in Telco.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position Portworx around measurable outcomes: application resilience, ransomware recovery, data protection, regulatory compliance, cloud portability, and modernisation at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate account teams and partner ecosystems, including GSIs, cloud providers, and regional partners, to drive pipeline creation and deal execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run a rigorous, value based sales process tailored to cloud native software, with accurate forecasting and strong hygiene in Salesforce and forecasting tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Customer Experience to expand adoption post sale, identify expansion triggers, and build customer advocacy within the Telco community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of competitive dynamics in Kubernetes data services, backup and recovery, and container storage, using insights to sharpen strategy and messaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Portworx in customer meetings and relevant industry events, with a field first mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven enterprise software sales experience, with a track record of closing and expanding high value, multi stakeholder deals in large organisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience selling into Telco, with an understanding of procurement, governance, risk, and security requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grasp of cloud native concepts and the Kubernetes ecosystem, plus the ability to credibly engage architects and platform teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to both technical and executive stakeholders, translating technical capabilities into business value and risk outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disciplined pipeline generation, qualification, deal management, and forecasting, with strong operational habits in SFDC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working in a matrixed environment, influencing cross functional teams without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and programme management skills, with clear account planning and stakeholder alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A customer first mindset and a bias for action, with resilience and curiosity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT FROM US:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: We celebrate those who think critically, like a challenge, and aspire to be trailblazers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: We give you the space and support to grow along with us and to contribute to something meaningful. We have been named Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in Technology™, Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in the Bay Area™, and certified as a Great Place to Work®!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: We build each other up and set aside ego for the greater good.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And because we understand the value of bringing your full and best self to work, we offer a variety of perks to manage a healthy balance, including flexible time off, wellness resources, and company-sponsored team events. Check out &lt;a href=&quot;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/&quot;&gt;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/ &lt;/a&gt;for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ACCOMMODATIONS AND ACCESSIBILITY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates with disabilities may request accommodations for all aspects of our hiring process. For more on this, contact us at &lt;a ---------- if you’re invited to an interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR COMMITMENT TO A STRONG AND INCLUSIVE TEAM:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re forging a future where everyone finds their rightful place and where every voice matters. Where uniqueness isn’t just accepted but embraced. That’s why we are committed to fostering the growth and development of every person, cultivating a sense of community through our Employee Resource Groups and advocating for inclusive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, sexual stereotypes, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or any other characteristic legally protected by the laws of the jurisdiction in which you are being considered for hire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us and bring your best.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring your bold.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure and simple.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Zscaler (NASDAQ: ZS) accelerates digital transformation so customers can be more agile, efficient, resilient, and secure. The Zscaler Zero Trust Exchange platform protects thousands of customers from cyberattacks and data loss by securely connecting users, devices, and applications in any location. Distributed across 200+ public data centers globally and thousands of private sites at the edge, the SASE-based Zero Trust Exchange is the world’s largest in-line cloud security platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the future of work is Human + AI and are building an AI-native enterprise where human potential is amplified by machine intelligence to solve the world’s hardest security challenges. Driven by deep customer obsession, we are committed to the mission, outcome, and to each other. We bring these commitments to life through three core behaviors: ownership and collaboration, trust through outcomes and impact, and a challenge culture with ongoing feedback. Ready to make an impact at the company pioneering security transformation in the AI era? Join us at Zscaler.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Role&lt;/strong&gt; We are looking for a Technical Success Manager to join our team. This is a remote role based in Netherlands reporting to the Senior Manager, Technical Success Management in the Customer Success Organization department. You will guide customers through their Zero Trust journey as the central post-sales point of contact, helping customers adopt and maximize Zscaler&#39;s solutions to secure their digital transformation objectives. Your role centers on providing expert advice, building relationships, and ensuring successful solution adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What you’ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0&quot;&gt;Understand customer goals, challenges, and technical needs to align with Zscaler solutions and drive satisfaction&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,1,0&quot;&gt;Build relationships with stakeholders, conduct reviews, and identify growth opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,0&quot;&gt;Anticipate challenges, provide proactive recommendations, and mitigate risks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,3,0&quot;&gt;Maintain deep understanding of Zscaler products and contribute to internal and customer-facing Knowledge Base best practices&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,4,0&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Sales, Support, and Product teams to deliver a seamless customer experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Who You Are (Success Profile)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0,0&quot;&gt;You thrive in ambiguity. You&#39;re comfortable building the path as you walk it. You thrive in a dynamic environment, seeing ambiguity not as a hindrance, but as the raw material to build something meaningful.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0&quot;&gt;You act like an owner. Your passion for the mission fuels your bias for action. You operate with integrity because you genuinely care about the outcome. True ownership involves leveraging dynamic range: the ability to navigate seamlessly between high-level strategy and hands-on execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2,0&quot;&gt;You are a problem-solver. You love running towards the challenges because you are laser-focused on finding the solution, knowing that solving the hard problems delivers the biggest impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,3,0&quot;&gt;You are a high-trust collaborator. You are ambitious for the team, not just yourself. You embrace our challenge culture by giving and receiving ongoing feedback—knowing that candor delivered with clarity and respect is the truest form of teamwork and the fastest way to earn trust.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,4,0&quot;&gt;You are a learner. You have a true growth mindset and are obsessed with your own development, actively seeking feedback to become a better partner and a stronger teammate. You love what you do and you do it with purpose.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What We’re Looking for (Minimum Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot;&gt;Foundational understanding of AI/ML technologies and experience leveraging, securing, or positioning AI-driven solutions to optimize outcomes within your functional domain&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience in customer-facing roles with a blend of technical expertise and account management, including product feature implementations and best-practice adoption&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot;&gt;Experience troubleshooting network issues and familiarity with tools such as Ping, Traceroute, and MTR&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot;&gt;Knowledge of ISO/OSI protocols including HTTP, SSL/TLS, FTP, and DNS&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel approximately 10% for customer-related requirements, with travel costs fully reclaimed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What Will Make You Stand Out (Preferred Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot;&gt;Experience utilizing AI-powered customer success platforms or predictive analytics tools to proactively identify customer adoption risks, anticipate technical escalations, and optimize retention strategies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;Experience running discovery discussions, building High/Low level design, and managing large-scale deployments or migrations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot;&gt;In-depth understanding of enterprise networks, cloud security technologies like SASE, SSE, and ZTNA, and authentication protocols such as SAML, LDAP, and OAuth&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;#LI-MP1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Zscaler’s salary ranges are benchmarked and determined by role and level. The range displayed on this job posting reflects the minimum and maximum target for new hire base salaries for this position across all Netherlands locations. Individual pay placement within this range is determined based on objective, gender-neutral criteria including job-related skills, relevant experience, and education or training. The base salary range listed for this full-time position excludes commission/bonus/equity (if applicable) and benefits. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€75.600&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€108.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;At Zscaler, we are committed to building a team that reflects the communities we serve and the customers we work with. We foster an inclusive environment that values all backgrounds and perspectives, emphasizing collaboration and belonging. Join us in our mission to make doing business seamless and secure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Benefits program is one of the most important ways we support our employees. Zscaler proudly offers comprehensive and inclusive benefits to meet the diverse needs of our employees and their families throughout their life stages, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various health plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off plans for vacation and sick time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-office perks, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Learn more about Zscaler&#39;s hybrid working model and benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.zscaler.com/candidate-resource-hub&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this role, you adhere to applicable laws, regulations, and Zscaler policies, including those related to security and privacy standards and guidelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing equal employment opportunities to all individuals. We strive to create a workplace where employees are treated with respect and have the chance to succeed. All qualified applicants will be considered for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy or related medical conditions), age, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, genetic information, disability status, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws. &lt;em&gt;See more information by clicking on the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Know Your Rights: Workplace Discrimination is Illegal &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;link.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pay Transparency&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler complies with all applicable federal, state, and local pay transparency rules.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing reasonable support (called accommodations or adjustments) in our recruiting processes for candidates who are differently abled, have long term conditions, mental health conditions or sincerely held religious beliefs, or who are neurodivergent or require pregnancy-related support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Solutions Engineer UAS / Aviation who will play a pivotal role in the future of our company. Our Solutions Engineer will be responsible for the integration, validation, and operational readiness of Auterion-powered drone systems. You’ll collaborate closely with the production team, as well hardware engineering, firmware/software teams, and operations while ensuring that every platform transitions successfully from a physical airframe into a fully validated flying robot ready for deployment. This role is ideal for someone who lives and breathes drone technology and enjoys bridging the gap between hardware, firmware, and real-world flight performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate in a highly hands-on environment with evolving system requirements, rapidly iterating across hardware and software integration challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform firmware flashing and configuration using PX4 and/or other autopilot&amp;nbsp; ecosystems, including sensor calibration, ESC tuning, and system bring-up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute End-of-Line (EoL) software validation and functional testing to ensure production readiness and reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct payload and camera load-seat testing, validating integration stability and operational performance under real-world conditions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot embedded system issues spanning firmware, communication interfaces, sensors, and hardware-software interactions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work independently to diagnose integration and flight-readiness issues while collaborating closely with engineering and manufacturing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to validation workflows for complete UAV systems, including components, integrated features, and operational flight configurations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support full-stack drone integration activities across hardware, embedded firmware, and flight software layers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve complex integration and reliability challenges involving sensors, flight controllers, communication protocols, and power systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive measurable impact on product quality, manufacturing throughput, and deployment readiness through improved validation and testing processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with hardware engineering, firmware/software teams, operations, and QC engineering to accelerate batch validation and reduce EoL cycle times&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interface with external vendors and equipment providers to support testing infrastructure, hardware integration, and operational readiness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in hands-on flight testing activities to validate platform stability, safety, and mission performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B.Sc. in Aviation Technology, Robotics, Embedded Systems, Electrical Engineering, or related field (M.Sc. optional)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience working with Autopilot, Mission planning and navigation Software, including firmware flashing, configuration, and flight validation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical foundation in embedded systems, firmware debugging, and hardware-software integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in C/C++ and/or MAVLink communication protocols or equivalent Datalink protocols&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with UAV sensor calibration, ESC tuning, and flight controller configuration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Linux-based development and debugging environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with UAV flight testing, system validation, and troubleshooting in real-world operational environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of drone manufacturing, QC processes, and End-of-Line testing methodologies is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration and communication skills when working with cross-functional engineering and operations teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently in fast-paced environments with evolving technical challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for drone technology and a hands-on engineering mindset focused on building reliable flying systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EU citizenship required&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;🚀 We’re on a mission to make money work for everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re waving goodbye to the complicated and confusing ways of traditional banking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After starting as a prepaid card, our product offering has grown a lot in the last 10 years in the UK. As well as&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/personal&quot;&gt;personal&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/business-banking&quot;&gt;business&lt;/a&gt; bank accounts, we offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/joint-account&quot;&gt;joint accounts&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/16-17&quot;&gt;accounts for 16-17 year olds&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/under-16s&quot;&gt;free kids account&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/flex&quot;&gt;credit cards&lt;/a&gt; in the UK, with more exciting things to come beyond. Our UK customers can also &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/savings&quot;&gt;save&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/investments&quot;&gt;invest &lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/pensions&quot;&gt;combine their pensions&lt;/a&gt; with us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With our hot coral cards and get-paid-early feature, combined with financial education on social media and our award winning customer service, we have a long history of creating magical moments for our customers!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re not about selling products - we want to solve problems and change lives through Monzo ❤️&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;📍London or Remote (UK)&amp;nbsp; | 💰 £79,000 - £93,000 + Incentive Awards tied to your performance +&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt; Benefits&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌟 About the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Borrowing (lending) business is growing rapidly across both existing products and with the planned launch of new initiatives. As our lending portfolio grows, our second line of defence Credit Model Validation team is growing with it - and we’re looking for a Credit Model Validation Manager to join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Credit Model Validation team is crucial in providing independent oversight and challenge to our model development teams in the first line of defence to help Monzo grow safely and ensure that the models we use deliver good outcomes for our customers. We’re looking for someone (maybe you?!) to join our validation squad and provide expert independent validation and oversight across our suite of credit models, covering critical business disciplines such as credit strategy and impairment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll have a particular focus on models used for customer-level decisioning and defining our credit strategies - such as underwriting scorecards, origination PD models and Net Present Value (NPV) / unit economics models - across all our lending products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong data and analytical skills are a must, as is deep expertise in credit risk modelling. You’ll have hands-on experience in either model validation or model development within a financial services environment, including practical experience using Python to develop, validate or analyse machine learning and statistical models. . In-depth knowledge of credit decisioning models would be a strong plus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔑 You’ll play a key role by…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading hands-on independent validation of models used for credit decisioning within our Borrowing strategies - covering a range of machine learning, decision science and NPV models. You will be ensuring that models are fit for purpose, appropriately governed, explainable and performing as expected&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting oversight and validation of broader credit risk models, including IFRS9, stress testing and economic response models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing deep understanding of Monzo’s credit models, and using this to provide impactful input and challenge to model developers to improve our modelling capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reviewing ongoing model performance monitoring to ensure our lending models perform within our risk thresholds, and providing support to our first line of defence teams when action is required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performing statistical analyses to independently assess model performance, including developing challenger models where appropriate to test model assumptions and strengthen validation conclusions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improving our Model Risk Framework, including overseeing our policies, standards and procedures to help embed best practice across the business. This means making sure we follow up-to-date regulatory guidelines, and adapt our processes to make sure they remain relevant as modelling techniques evolve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Writing clear and impactful model validation reports, and presenting the findings and actions in relevant committees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering with colleagues in the first line of defence credit strategy and modelling teams - and wider risk teams across Monzo - to support the embedding of our model risk framework and establishing consistent validation standards across the organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embracing new and innovative technology, including leading the adoption of AI tools to enhance our model validation approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;🤩 We’d love to hear from you if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a strong background and practical experience in credit model development and/or validation - in particular with exposure to machine learning or statistical models used in credit decisioning, such as decision science scorecards, origination / underwriting PD models, and NPV / unit economics modelling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are data driven, with strong analytical skills and deep understanding of statistical techniques for credit and model risk. Being able to get hands on with data is critical - so strong SQL and Python skills are essential, and experience with data visualisation tools such as Tableau, Looker or similar is a plus!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand how models are used in real-time decisioning and lending strategies, and how to balance commercial and risk outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong written and verbal communication skills, and are able to articulate problems and solutions using clear and simple language. This is particularly important for breaking down complex issues and priorities to non-experts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a track record of building and maintaining trusting relationships with stakeholders at all levels, and can provide effective and respectful challenge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are impact-driven, and proactive in identifying issues and opportunities to improve outcomes for both our customers and our business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are passionate about technology, and what we’re doing here at Monzo excites you!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our technology stack&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We rely heavily on the following tools and technologies (note we do not expect applicants to have prior experience of all them):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.google.com/&quot;&gt;Google Cloud Platform&lt;/a&gt; for all of our analytics infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.getdbt.com/&quot;&gt;dbt&lt;/a&gt; and&lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.google.com/bigquery/&quot;&gt; BigQuery SQL&lt;/a&gt; for our data modelling and warehousing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python for data science and machine learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://golang.org/&quot;&gt;Go&lt;/a&gt; to write our application code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://aws.amazon.com/&quot;&gt;AWS&lt;/a&gt; for most of our backend infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The interview process:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our interview process usually involves up to four main stages via Google Hangouts:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An initial call with our recruiter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A call with our Senior Model Validation Manager, the hiring manager for the role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A role-specific call with colleagues from our credit modelling teams. We’ll share a short case study in advance, but you won’t need to submit a written response; we’ll use it to guide the discussion during the interview.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A behavioural interview&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🙌 What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💰 £79,000 - £93,000 + Incentive Awards tied to your performance benefits.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📍 This role can be based in our London office, but we&#39;re open to distributed working within the UK (with ad hoc meetings in London).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;⏰ We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, and at times that suit you and your team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📚 £1,000 learning budget each year to use on books, training courses and conferences.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏡 We will set you up to work from home; all employees are given MacBooks and for fully remote workers we will provide extra support for your work-from-home setup.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;➕ Plus lots more! Read our full list of&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers&quot;&gt;benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have some guidelines on using Artificial Intelligence (AI) to ace an application and interview at Monzo. You can read them &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/the-ultimate-guide-on-using-ai-to-ace-an-interview-at-monzo&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ll close this role once we have enough applications for the next stage, so please apply as soon as you can - we don’t want you to miss out!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;LinkedIn Tags: &lt;strong&gt;#LI-TK1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunities for everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity and inclusion are a priority for us and we’re making sure we have lots of support for all of our people to grow at Monzo. At Monzo, we’re embracing diversity by fostering an inclusive environment for all people to do the best work of their lives with us. This is integral to our mission of making money work for everyone. You can read more in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/diversity-and-inclusion&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;, 2026 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/our-2026-diversity-and-inclusion-report&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Diversity and Inclusion Report&lt;/a&gt; and 2025 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/gender-pay-gap-report-2025&quot;&gt;Gender Pay Gap Report.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to age, ethnicity, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, or veteran, neurodiversity or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a preferred name, please use it to apply. We don&#39;t need full or birth names at application stage 😊&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Overview&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is a new-logo sales role focused exclusively on private-sector accounts with 500–1,999 employees across the UK, Ireland and South Africa. Operating in a channel-first organisation, you will own a fully indirect sales motion and build a greenfield territory without an inherited customer base. This role does not have dedicated BDR support and is accountable for independently generating sufficient pipeline to achieve its ARR target. You will use account, SKU and industry-growth data to create, own and execute a territory plan that delivers sustainable net new ARR growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What will you be doing?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a Mid-Market Account Executive, you will identify, develop and close new-logo opportunities across the defined territory. You will manage the full sales cycle through partners, from self-sourced pipeline creation and qualification through to commercial close, with an indicative fully ramped net new ARR target of approximately USD 700,000.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities will include: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Creating, validating, owning and executing a data-led territory plan that clearly shows how you will achieve your net new ARR target, including the priority accounts, sales plays, partner routes to market and supporting resources required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Developing new prospects solely through new-logo acquisition across private-sector accounts with 500–1,999 employees in the UK, Ireland and South Africa, without an inherited customer base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Managing complex, fully indirect sales cycles through channel partners using a consultative, platform-led rather than point-solution approach, engaging business and technical stakeholders throughout the buying journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Planning and delivering presentations that give prospective insights into how our solutions solve their challenges &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Working in direct partnership with the Partner Account Manager as a core part of territory planning, partner activation, pipeline creation and deal execution. The AE and PAM will jointly develop and execute partner-led routes to market, supported by Solution Engineers and Marketing to progress and close business. Customer Success support becomes available once the customer reaches the appropriate qualifying ARR threshold.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Communicating new product developments to prospective clients &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Attending remote and on-site meetings with clients (note this is a field role thus in person customer and partner collaboration emphasized)  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Collaborating with teams in different territories and offices &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Using available account, SKU and industry-growth data to identify whitespace, prioritise opportunities and execute effective sales campaigns across the private-sector territory; this role is not aligned to a single industry vertical.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Self-sourcing and qualifying your own pipeline without BDR support. PAM, SE and Marketing resources are expected to complement—not replace—your personal prospecting and pipeline-generation activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Maintaining an accurate and current pipeline of opportunities within the CRM system &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;OK, I&#39;m interested... is this the job for me?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We look for people who value agility, passion and teamwork; those who can bring fresh ideas to the table and want the opportunity to learn, grow, and expand their careers. Bring your aptitude and build upon what you do best for our customers, partners, team, and you.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;In this role, you are accountable for building a greenfield territory and delivering new business solely through new-logo acquisition. You will use available account, SKU and industry-growth data to identify opportunities across the private sector rather than specialising in a single vertical. Success requires an entrepreneurial, self-motivated approach: you will create your own pipeline, coordinate the resources around you and own execution from territory strategy through to net new ARR delivery. All opportunities will be progressed through partners in line with our channel-first model.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Other qualities you’ll need to be a fit for this role include: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;11&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;3–5 years of previous B2B sales experience, with a demonstrable record of winning new-logo business and delivering against ARR or recurring-revenue targets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;11&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Experience in the software/technology industry is preferred, but not essential &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;11&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Experience with executive selling, both business and technical &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;11&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Excellent communication and listening skills &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;11&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Determination to surpass performance goals &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;11&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Willingness to learn and&amp;nbsp;bring new ideas  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;11&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Ability to work individually and within a highly collaborative team environment &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;11&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Plenty of initiative &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;11&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Familiarity with an ARR-based compensation plan and quota, with the ability to build and manage sufficient self-generated pipeline to support an indicative fully ramped net new ARR target of approximately USD 700,000.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;11&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Proven ability to operate in a 100% indirect sales model, building strong, highly collaborative relationship selling through channel partners and work closely with Partner Account Managers and jointly owning partner strategy, pipeline development and opportunity execution.&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[8]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits we offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market-competitive compensation including bonus scheme&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career progression and internal mobility opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 days of annual leave, in addition to public holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GBP 1.000,00/Year towards our Tuition Reimbursement Program&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Referral Program&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Corporate Donation Matching Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maternity policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company sponsored events / regular team building events &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extra paid perk days - Birthday off, Family/Life Event Day, Volunteering...&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-SB1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;Any personal data you share with us during the application process will be processed strictly in compliance with applicable data protection laws and our &lt;a id=&quot;menur12n&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;https://www.avepoint.com/company/privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Ping Identity:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Ping Identity, we believe in making digital experiences both secure and seamless for all users, without compromise. We call this digital freedom. And it&#39;s not just something we provide our customers. It&#39;s something that inspires our company. People don&#39;t come here to join a culture that&#39;s built on digital freedom. They come to cultivate it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our intelligent, cloud identity platform lets people shop, work, bank, and interact wherever and however they want. Without friction. Without fear.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While protecting digital identities is at the core of our technology, protecting individual identities is at the core of our culture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pingidentity.com/en/company/championing-every-identity.html&quot;&gt;We champion every identity.&lt;/a&gt; One of our core values, Respect Individuality, reminds us to celebrate differences so you are empowered to bring your authentic self to work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re headquartered in Denver, Colorado and we have offices and employees around the globe. We serve the largest, most demanding enterprises worldwide, including more than half of the Fortune 100. At Ping Identity, we&#39;re changing the way people and businesses think about cybersecurity, digital experiences, and identity and access management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Professional Services Technical Consultant, you will play a technical role in the architecture and successful installation, integration, and deployment of Identity and Access solutions in our clients&#39; environments. You will also assist our implementation partners in that process. You will report to the Director of Professional Services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver technical consulting to our customers and partners from various industries including financial services, manufacturing, government, utilities, and more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate client business, process, systems, and technology requirements and advise clients on best practices to help guide and solidify proposed designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consult with clients to assess current problem states, establish desired future states, and make solution recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the detailed solution design, implementation, and delivery of Ping Identity IAM product solutions to our clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with customers to install, deploy, and configure Ping Identity solutions to meet the customer&#39;s requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Ping Internal teams on escalated customer issues requiring deployment expertise.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in services pre-sales processes including presentation of effort size, best practices, and feasibility studies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop materials for providing technical consulting (e.g., best practices, report templates, delivery guides, knowledge base articles).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help partners ensure they design an architecture aligned to Ping best practices for a successful customer deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and assist in the development of internal and external technical resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical delivery from discovery and design through implementation, testing, production readiness, and handover, coordinating dependencies and surfacing delivery risks early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and validate secure, scalable, highly available IAM deployments across cloud, hybrid, and on-premises environments, including integration, operational, and disaster-recovery considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot complex implementation and production issues by analysing logs, traces, configurations, and network behaviour; work with Support and Product Engineering to drive resolution where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute technical validation activities, including integration, end-to-end, performance, and resilience testing, and support cutover and go-live planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce clear implementation documentation, runbooks, and knowledge-transfer materials so customer and partner teams can operate and support the solution after delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance strong security controls with a seamless user experience when shaping identity journeys and recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience working in a consulting capacity with a minimum of 2 years working directly in the Identity and Access Management space within a large organization or enterprise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in a consulting capacity within the Identity and Access Management space, including practical System Integration and Implementation experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A capability-maturity approach to IAM deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with subjects such as TCP/IP networking, OAuth 2.0, SAML 2.0, OIDC, LDAP, and Data Stores&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Java/JavaScript/Groovy, HTML/CSS to support web application development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in effort estimates and sizing of projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated, willing to take initiative, organized, able to work unaccompanied, and manage communications appropriately&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor of Science in a related field (e.g. Computer Science, Electrical Engineering, or Information Systems) or equivalent work-related level of experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Availability to travel up to 50% of the time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding cross-functional cooperation skills in particular with our Go-To-Market units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, both verbal and written&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience integrating IAM platforms with enterprise directories, applications, APIs, and identity systems, including federation, authentication, and user lifecycle or provisioning flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with identity standards and protocols such as SCIM, HTTP/REST APIs, and common directory and federation patterns, in addition to OAuth 2.0, SAML 2.0, OIDC, FIDO and LDAP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing or delivering IAM solutions in cloud, hybrid, or on-premises environments, including deployment, upgrade, resilience, and operational support considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong diagnostic skills across application, identity, and network layers, with experience using logs and traces to isolate and resolve integration issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience planning and carrying out technical testing, production cutovers, and transition to customer or partner operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to facilitate technical discovery and design workshops, explain trade-offs clearly, and adapt recommendations to customer constraints and desired outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within structured delivery practices, including managing technical risks, dependencies, decisions, and changes across a customer engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have an advantage if:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Computer and Software Security certifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ForgeRock or Ping training badges/certifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skills with DevOps best practices, including deployment automation tools, CI/CD, Docker, Terraform, and Kubernetes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Ping Identity products and architectures, such as PingFederate, PingAccess, PingDirectory, PingOne, or PingID.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with identity governance, privileged access, customer identity, or workforce identity use cases beyond a single IAM product or deployment pattern.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with observability and operational tooling, such as centralised logging, monitoring, alerting, and distributed tracing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with source control, infrastructure-as-code, configuration management, and automated testing for repeatable IAM deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience migrating identity services, applications, or user populations from legacy platforms to modern IAM architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Ping:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in and facilitate a flexible, collaborative work environment. We’re growing quickly, but remain true to the innovative, can-do startup values that got us here. Most importantly, we keep hiring talented, smart, fun, and genuinely nice people because that’s who we want to succeed with every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here are just a few of the things that make Ping special:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company culture that empowers you to do your best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Resource Groups that create a sense of belonging for everyone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular company and team bonding events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive benefits and perks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global volunteering and community initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous PTO &amp;amp; Holiday Schedule&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Progressive Healthcare Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement Programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity for Education Reimbursement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commuter Offset (Specific locations)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ping is the collective sum of all our individual experiences, backgrounds and influences and we pride ourselves in growing and learning together. We are committed to building an inclusive and diverse environment where everyone’s individuality is respected and everyone has an Identity. In recruiting for new colleagues, we welcome the unique contributions you can bring and encourage you to be your best self.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are an Equal Opportunity/Affirmative Action employer.&amp;nbsp; All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex including sexual orientation and gender identity, national origin, disability, protected Veteran Status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable federal, state, or local law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Are you someone who thrives in a fast-paced environment, where you are given the autonomy and support to handle large amounts of responsibility?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Are you looking for the opportunity to accelerate your sales career whilst also being surrounded by an exceptional entrepreneurial team with motivated and extremely driven people?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be responsible for managing and growing a portfolio of sponsors across our international conferences, building long-term relationships with senior decision-makers and driving sponsorship revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-performance B2B sales role with a strong focus on sponsor retention, renewals and account growth, alongside identifying and closing new sponsorship opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a commercially driven salesperson who enjoys building strong client relationships, growing accounts and consistently delivering against revenue targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You should have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At least 2 years of B2B sales experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A proven track record of achieving or exceeding individual revenue targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience managing client relationships, retaining customers and identifying opportunities to grow existing accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Confidence engaging, pitching and negotiating with senior decision-makers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong commercial instincts and the ability to identify new revenue opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ambition, resilience and ownership – you take responsibility for your portfolio, performance and results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent communication and relationship-building skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;This role might not be the right fit if...&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You prefer a role focused purely on relationship management, without responsibility for sales and revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don&#39;t enjoy negotiating, closing deals and working towards commercial targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re not comfortable taking ownership of client relationships and proactively identifying opportunities to grow accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re looking for a hybrid or remote position – our London team works together from the office five days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage and retain sponsors:&lt;/strong&gt; Build strong, long-term relationships with an existing portfolio of sponsors, driving renewals and repeat business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow existing accounts:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify opportunities to upsell, cross-sell and increase sponsorship revenue within your portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive new business:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify, pitch and close new sponsorship opportunities to expand our client base.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own your revenue targets:&lt;/strong&gt; Take responsibility for achieving ambitious individual sales and retention targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver exceptional partnerships:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with our content and delivery teams to ensure sponsors receive a high-quality experience and see value in their partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Competitive salary and market-leading OTE.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Significant ownership and responsibility from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The opportunity to work closely with our senior leadership team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;International travel to our conferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Training, coaching and ongoing development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong opportunities for internal progression as we continue to grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About us&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;United Media is building a global B2B media and conferences group, bringing together executives, investors, founders and industry leaders through conferences, communities and media brands. Our portfolio spans industries including private equity, insurance, finance, HR and retail, creating opportunities for professionals to connect, learn and grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start date:&lt;/strong&gt; As soon as possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monday–Friday, we work from our &lt;strong&gt;WeWork office in Victoria, London&lt;/strong&gt;. Due to the collaborative nature of our work, we do not offer remote work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You must have the &lt;strong&gt;right to work in the UK&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Come join the organization that is redefining security for the AI era. As one of the&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wiz.io/blog/100m-arr-in-18-months-wiz-becomes-the-fastest-growing-software-company-ever&quot;&gt; fastest-growing startups ever,&lt;/a&gt; we enable teams to secure cloud and AI applications by connecting code, cloud, and runtime into a single shared context. Trusted by security teams all over the world, we have a proven&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.g2.com/products/wiz-wiz/reviews&quot;&gt; track record of success&lt;/a&gt; and a culture that values world-class talent. Not to mention, we&#39;re now&lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.google.com/blog/products/identity-security/google-completes-acquisition-of-wiz&quot;&gt; powered by Google&lt;/a&gt;, meaning we offer our customers an AI-powered platform that harnesses Google’s Threat Intelligence and Security Operations to better detect, prevent, and respond to threats across all environments, allowing for further innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Wizards from all over the globe work together to protect the infrastructure of our customers, including over 65% of the Fortune 100, who trust us to scan and secure over 230 billion files daily. We’re honored to be a leading player in a massive and growing market, and we continue to look for exceptional Wizards who are eager to make a significant impact on our team. At Wiz, you’ll have the freedom to think creatively, dream big, and use your full range of skills to contribute to our momentous growth. Come join our team and help us create secure cloud environments that allow even the best companies to move faster, all while having some fun!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor of Science in Computer Science/Software Engineering or related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6 + years of experience with Backend Engineering in a high-level programming language (e.g., Java, C#, Golang).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud platforms (e.g., AWS, GCP, Azure).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with microservices based architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with databases and message queue technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with continuous integration and deployment (CI/CD).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity or experience with Golang, GraphQL, PostgreSQL, Neptune, Docker, and Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Job&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We&#39;re looking for an experienced&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Backend Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to join our expanding R&amp;amp;D team and help drive the growth of Wiz. In this role, you&#39;ll be responsible for developing and maintaining large-scale distributed components that power Wiz. We&#39;re looking for candidates who are passionate about tackling scaling challenges and take pride in writing clean, efficient, and maintainable code. Join us in our mission to secure the cloud.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our tech stack includes a multi-cloud architecture (Azure, AWS, GCP, OCI, Alibaba Cloud) with Golang, GraphQL, PostgreSQL, Neptune, Docker, Kubernetes, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-end development of backend software components (research, design, development, testing, rollout, monitoring).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to technological and architectural decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conducting design and code reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analysing and improving efficiency, scalability, and stability of various backend system components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with cross-functional teams (e.g., Frontend, DevOps) to deliver top-tier features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;Applicants must have the legal right to work in the country where the position is based,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;without the need for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;visa &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;sponsorship.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;This&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt; role does not offer&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;visa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;sponsorship&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wiz is an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, reproductive health decisions, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, genetic information, political views or activity, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you acknowledge that Wiz will process your personal data in accordance with &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wiz.io/legal/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Wiz&#39;s Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;The Company You’ll Join&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Carta is the connected platform and AI-native ecosystem for private capital. Built to replace fragmented tools with a single system of record, Carta brings together the software, services, and legal infrastructure that founders use to manage equity, fund managers use to run administration and reporting, and legal teams use to close transactions. Trusted by 55,000 companies and 1.8M+ equity holders in 160+ countries, and 10,000 funds and SPVs representing $250B+ in assets under management, Carta is transforming how private capital operates. Recognized by Fortune, Forbes, Fast Company, Inc. and Great Places to Work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information about our offices and culture, check out our &lt;a href=&quot;https://carta.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Carta careers page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team You’ll Work With&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Finance Systems Administrator role will report to and work closely with the Finance Systems Senior Manager as well as partner with stakeholders across the Company in finance, accounting engineering, and business systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Problems You’ll Solve&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Carta, we&#39;re transforming how private capital operates — connecting the software, services, and legal infrastructure that founders, fund managers, and legal teams depend on. We believe the problems we solve today unlock the opportunities of tomorrow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Finance Systems Developer role will proactively support the AI-driven development, implementation, and maintenance of Carta’s enterprise finance systems with a primary focus on NetSuite, Zuora, and related peripheral systems. This role will demonstrate strong influence and communications skills to collaborate internally with Finance, AP, AR and IT teams. The position will act as an advisor to the organization on system efficiency and effectiveness. The position will be the primary internal system admin and support contact for all finance systems in the Europe region including NetSuite, Zuora, Stripe, Zip, and others . This role will also collaborate with US counterparts to support the Middle East and APAC regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Other responsibilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the adoption of AI, automation, and emerging technologies to transform accounting processes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Estimate, design, implement, and maintain configurations and customizations of Finance Systems to meet the evolving needs of the finance team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with internal users and stakeholders, assisting with data analysis, business process mapping, reporting needs and continuous improvement initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain proper system access for user roles ensuring compliance with segregation of duties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide internal, ongoing system/technical support to Finance users, including training with a focus on superior customer service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor end user usage of business systems and track performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide front line support with regards to all aspects of business facing applications and troubleshooting to diagnose, isolate and resolve issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, document and implement policies, procedures and guidelines to ensure data integrity, system integrity and security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for the change management and release process of NetSuite, Zuora, Stripe, and other finance applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide quality and timely communication regarding system status&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain up-to-date knowledge of system functionality, customization and integration&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support onboarding of additional business units and acquired subsidiaries onto Suite Billing, Zuora Billing and related quote-to-cash systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A successful candidate for this position will demonstrate the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to integrate AI tools to optimize/redesign workflows and drive measurable impact (e.g., efficiency gains, quality improvements)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ongoing AI skill development (e.g., prompt/context engineering, Claude Plugin/Skills) and staying current with emerging AI technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in Finance System administration, configuration, and third-party integrations in complex environments with a focus on NetSuite and Zuora&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with roles, permissions, page layouts, custom objects, SuiteScripts, workflows, reports, and dashboards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in SQL, CSV imports, user provisioning, role definitions, analytics, JavaScript(JS) and script scheduling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong background in data analytics, reporting, and database management (SQL and NetSuite preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with revenue recognition principles and financial reporting concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of business processes&amp;nbsp; (O2C &amp;amp; P2P), system requirements, and financial reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of the hire-to-retire process and system access management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in project management, system implementation, and integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills with attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently with minimal guidance while collaborating across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at managing multiple stakeholders and maintaining professionalism under pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred but Not Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NetSuite and/or Zuora certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Disclosures:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and are committed to providing a positive interview experience for every candidate. If accommodations due to a disability or medical condition are needed, please connect with the talent partner via email.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carta uses E-Verify in the United States for employment authorization. See the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.e-verify.gov/about-e-verify/what-is-e-verify&quot;&gt;E-Verify&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;Department&quot;&gt;Department of Justice&lt;/a&gt; websites for more details.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For information on our data privacy policies, see&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://carta.com/privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://carta.com/privacy/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Privacy&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://carta.com/privacy/candidate/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://carta.com/privacy/candidate/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;CA Candidate Privacy&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://carta.com/legal/br/brazil-pay-transparency/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://carta.com/legal/br/brazil-pay-transparency/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Brazil Transparency Report&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note that all official communications from us will come from an ----- or ----- domain. Report any contact from unapproved domains to -----
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson, part of WPP, is the global communications leader built to create value for clients through reputation. With highly specialized teams, industry-leading technologies and breakthrough creative, we help brands and businesses redefine reputation as a competitive advantage so they can lead today and into the future. When you work at Burson, you are part of a global community of lifelong learners who thrive at the edge of innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP (LSE/NYSE: WPP) is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;WPP.com&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/&quot;&gt;bursonglobal.com&lt;/a&gt; and follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/burson/posts/?feedView=all&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/burson.global/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More about the role:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;This role offers the opportunity to develop under the guidance of some of the best in the industry and gain first-hand experience working on high-profile international brands.&amp;nbsp;The experience of the&amp;nbsp;20+ team&amp;nbsp;enables us to deliver&amp;nbsp;integrated communications, from corporate, B2B and consumer communications, to digital &amp;amp; social, influencers, analyst relations, content&amp;nbsp;marketing&amp;nbsp;and public affairs. We understand technology ecosystems, consumer and business audiences, and the power of the influencer.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having a passion for technology is essential for this role as you will be working with several of the world’s leading technology brands.&amp;nbsp;We believe that technology has the power to enhance human experience and performance as we enter a new era of intelligence. Whether&amp;nbsp;it’s&amp;nbsp;the latest enterprise software or the hottest consumer device, as we progress into a new era defined by the&amp;nbsp;advancements in AI,&amp;nbsp;it’s&amp;nbsp;crucial we continue to&amp;nbsp;tell human-first stories.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The team is looking to recruit&amp;nbsp;an&amp;nbsp;Account Executive to work with some of its leading global technology brands&amp;nbsp;(opportunities to work for B2B and consumer). The role involves working on media relations, network&amp;nbsp;coordination&amp;nbsp;and account management&amp;nbsp;to reach primarily&amp;nbsp;B2B&amp;nbsp;audiences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting&amp;nbsp;on day-to-day media liaison, developing solid media&amp;nbsp;relationships&amp;nbsp;and managing media requests&amp;nbsp;and product reviews&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing&amp;nbsp;press materials,&amp;nbsp;from press releases and blogs&amp;nbsp;to Q&amp;amp;As and briefing documents,&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;a high level&amp;nbsp;of attention to detail&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handling&amp;nbsp;junior client relationships, developing a strong rapport with your day-to-day contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overseeing the creation of&amp;nbsp;coverage and activity reports for clients&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing&amp;nbsp;press briefings,&amp;nbsp;product launches,&amp;nbsp;conferences&amp;nbsp;and similar events for clients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attending and contributing ideas in internal brainstorms, contributing to generating creative ideas in response to client briefs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitoring and keeping abreast of relevant industry news&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;build an understanding of industry trends, competitive landscape and how they&amp;nbsp;impact&amp;nbsp;clients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience that contributes to success:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A positive and proactive attitude to seeking out opportunities to add value to clients and teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A fan of technology&amp;nbsp;that&amp;nbsp;enhances human progress,&amp;nbsp;with an understanding of the consumer&amp;nbsp;technology market,&amp;nbsp;who&amp;nbsp;is excited by&amp;nbsp;its future within society and business&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the technology&amp;nbsp;and/or telecoms sectors – ideally both,&amp;nbsp;but technology&amp;nbsp;experience is&amp;nbsp;a must&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A&amp;nbsp;media hound and storyteller who loves to craft compelling pitches and knows how to sell them to business,&amp;nbsp;trade&amp;nbsp;and national media&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A global outlook, with the ability to transfer skills across both UK and global client work&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organisational skills and the ability to tightly manage relationships with international Burson offices&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail and an appreciation of time management&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Burson UK was named Cannes Lions Agency of the year 2026!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-CY1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You belong at Burson:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is for Burson to be the leading ‘academy company’ for creative communications professionals and emerging leaders. We provide a dynamic environment where ambitious colleagues come to elevate their skills, expand their networks, and ultimately, produce the best solutions for today’s leading brands. Our commitment to your growth is reflected in our robust benefits and people programs, which include professional development opportunities, mentorship programs with industry leaders, a vibrant and inclusive company culture fostering collaboration and innovation and packages designed to reward and retain top talent. We invest in our people because we believe their success is our success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Burson, we’re an agency of learn-it-alls. We recognize that the things we do best, creativity and communications, require a level of nuanced understanding. That’s why it’s imperative for us to hire extraordinarily talented people of all backgrounds and identities. Without that we can’t do the essential work of inspiring bold ideas, fostering constructive dialogue, cultivating meaningful experiences, and driving innovation and creativity for our partners. Your unique point of view—your talent—is what makes you a #BursonPerson, and it’s how we deliver exceptional results for our clients, together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button below, this will send any information you add below to Burson. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy. &lt;/a&gt;California residents should read our  &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice. &lt;/a&gt;This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;WHAT MAKES US EPIC?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the core of Epic’s success are talented, passionate people. Epic prides itself on creating a collaborative, welcoming, and creative environment. Whether it’s building award-winning games or crafting engine technology that enables others to make visually stunning interactive experiences, we’re always innovating.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Being Epic means being a part of a team that continually strives to do right by our community and users. We’re constantly innovating to raise the bar of engine and game development.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;PRODUCTION&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whether it’s driving a vision from start to finish or collaborating with teams to inspire and deliver projects of Epic quality, Epic’s production teams take pride in consistently delivering world-class products and experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Epic&#39;s third-party content group brings the world&#39;s best-known entertainment and gaming IP into Fortnite as creator-enabled experiences built with Unreal Editor for Fortnite (UEFN), funding and shipping a growing slate of licensed and partner titles through external studios and vendors while operating the live platform where that content is discovered and grows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the program scales with more titles, larger partnerships and major launches ahead, this role will be the production spine of that growth, leading production across the licensed IP slate end to end, coordinating delivery with internal development and platform teams, managing production relationships with licensors and external studios, and overseeing live operations once titles launch. Working alongside design, art, PM and engineering leads, you will own launch readiness, budgets, vendor contracts and capacity plans while building and leading a production team that can scale with the slate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shipping and launch readiness: Own launch readiness per title, chairing weekly status across all workstreams (creator tools, island production, publishing and access, discovery placement, IP and content moderation, brand compliance, creator-facing UX, monetisation, documentation, marketing and QA), assigning owners, chasing actions and holding the quality bar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner production management: Be the production face to our licensor partners, aligning on brand guidelines and content review while carrying decisions between partners, legal, business development, and the development team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform liveops: Own the live operating rhythm of the platform, including release cadence, events, merchandising, discovery and monetisation health, and the feedback loop from live metrics back into the slate and roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production team leadership: Build and run the production organisation with clear ownership, real delegation, and team ceremonies that hold up as the slate scales across UK and US timezones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Budget, vendors and capacity: Own vendor statements of work, budget management and annual planning, capacity and staffing plans, and org design in partnership with discipline directors, while providing senior leadership with a high-level view of people, projects, and spend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Roadmap and planning: Own the production view of the roadmap across the whole organisation, keeping priorities, sequencing and resourcing aligned across teams, disciplines and partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI adoption and process change: Lead the charge through a revolutionary period in game development, helping the team adopt AI where it makes a real difference, and evolve our production practices as the technology matures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience shipping games or live services from inside a first-party or internal development organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing multiple external partners in parallel (licensors, publishers or studios), including publishing production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading live operations for a platform or live service at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience owning multi-million dollar budgets, vendor management and capacity planning, with the ability to present and defend them at the executive level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to establish production methodologies and standards that drive adoption across teams and the broader organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong people leader who builds effective teams, structures, and empowers others through delegation, while being able to grow a production organisation and protect team health as the slate scales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calm, low-ego and empathetic leader who builds trust across teams, executives and external partners, navigating ambiguity and complex challenges with clarity, sound judgment and strong communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong strategic judgment, with the ability to see the bigger picture, navigate competing priorities, and make thoughtful trade-offs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for user-generated content and creator communities is a strong advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable collaborating closely with teams and partners across the UK and US time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;EPIC JOB + EPIC BENEFITS = EPIC LIFE&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-userformat=&quot;{&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:13201,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:0},&amp;quot;7&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:[{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:13421772}},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;:3},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;4&amp;quot;:1}]},&amp;quot;10&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;11&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;12&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;15&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Roboto&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;16&amp;quot;:10}&quot;&gt;We pay 100% for benefits except for PMI (for dependents). Our current benefits package includes pension, private medical insurance, health care cash plan, dental insurance, disability and life insurance, critical illness, cycle to work scheme, flu shots, health checks, and meals. We also offer a robust mental well-being program through Modern Health, which provides free therapy and coaching for employees &amp;amp; dependents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;ABOUT US&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Epic Games​ ​is a leading interactive entertainment company. For over 30 years we&#39;ve been making award-winning games and engine technology that empowers others to make visually stunning games and 3D content that bring environments to life like never before. Epic&#39;s award-winning Unreal Engine technology not only provides game developers the ability to build high-fidelity, interactive experiences for PC, console, mobile, and VR, it is also a tool being embraced by content creators across a variety of industries such as media and entertainment, automotive, and architectural design. As we continue to build our Engine technology and develop remarkable games, we strive to build teams of world-class talent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Like what you hear? Come be a part of something Epic!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Epic Games deeply values diverse teams and an inclusive work culture, and we are proud to be an Equal Opportunity employer. Learn more about our Equal Employment Opportunity (EEO) Policy &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.epicgames.com/site/en-US/eeo-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note to Recruitment Agencies: &lt;/strong&gt;Epic does not accept any unsolicited resumes or approaches from any unauthorized third party (including recruitment or placement agencies) (i.e., a third party with whom we do not have a negotiated and validly executed agreement). We will not pay any fees to any unauthorized third party. Further details on these matters can be found &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.epicgames.com/note-to-recruitment-agencies&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Payoneer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2005, Payoneer is the global financial platform that removes friction from doing business across borders, with a mission to connect the world’s underserved businesses to a rising global economy. We’re a community with over 2,500 colleagues all over the world, working to serve customers, and partners in over 190 countries and territories.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By taking the complexity out of the financial workflows–including everything from global payments and compliance to multi-currency and workforce management, to providing working capital and business intelligence–we give businesses the tools they need to work efficiently worldwide and grow with confidence.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Role Summary&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Account Executive, you will own the full sales cycle for UK and EU SMB customers—from prospecting and pipeline generation through closing and activation. This is a hunter role focused on building pipeline, driving revenue, and consistently achieving quota.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Prospect and identify new SMB opportunities across assigned territories&lt;br&gt;• Build and manage a healthy pipeline through self-generated and SDR-qualified opportunities&lt;br&gt;• Conduct discovery, sales conversations, negotiations, and close deals end-to-end&lt;br&gt;• Manage objections, pricing discussions, and compliance requirements&lt;br&gt;• Drive early customer activation and time-to-value post-close&lt;br&gt;• Maintain accurate Salesforce data, forecasting, and deal hygiene&lt;br&gt;• Partner with SDRs, Operations, KYC, Compliance, and Customer Success&lt;br&gt;• Share market insights and contribute to sales playbooks and GTM initiatives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who You Are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• 4–5 years of experience in B2B Sales, Business Development, or Account Executive roles&lt;br&gt;• Proven track record of prospecting, closing, and achieving revenue targets&lt;br&gt;• Strong discovery, negotiation, and consultative selling skills&lt;br&gt;• Comfortable owning a territory and independently building pipeline&lt;br&gt;• Data-driven, CRM proficient, and comfortable using AI tools for prospecting and productivity&lt;br&gt;• Self-starter with strong organisation skills and a results-driven mindset&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience in fintech, payments, or B2B SaaS&lt;br&gt;• Knowledge of payments, FX, cash management, or financial operations&lt;br&gt;• Experience with multi-product selling and upsell/cross-sell&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Payoneer Ways of Working&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Act as our customer’s partner on the inside&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Learning what they need and creating what will help them go further.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Do it. Own it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Being fearlessly accountable in everything we do.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Continuously improve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Always striving for a higher standard than our last.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Build each other up&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Helping each other grow, as professionals and people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;If this sounds like a business, a community, and a mission you want to be part of, apply today.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to providing a diverse and inclusive workplace. Payoneer is an equal opportunity employer, and all qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment no matter your race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, disability status, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law. If you require reasonable accommodation at any stage of the hiring process, please speak to the recruiter managing the role for any adjustments. Decisions about requests for reasonable accommodation are made on a case-by-case basis.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;Opportunity &amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Director, you will lead on the development and delivery of strategic communications plans and provide senior-level advice to a broad range of clients in the foundations and non-profit sector. You will develop and land regular and proactive ideas for clients, advising on critical issues impacting some of the world’s most influential businesses and playing a leading role as day-to-day point of contact for your clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also develop strategies to approach and cultivate new business targets using a strong internal network that includes talent from across Brunswick’s entire offering, as well as your own external network.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will ensure the smooth running of teams by establishing clear roles, managing performance, and ensuring that all key stakeholders and client needs are being covered by the team. You will work closely with Partners on all aspects of client management, including account finances, fee negotiation, and adviser meetings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significantly contribute to the development and enhancement of Brunswick’s Foundations and Non-Profits practice in the UK, Europe, Africa, and globally; by deepening our expertise and building a world-class practice that will deliver outstanding work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand and articulate the issues and challenges facing philanthropy; working with clients and colleagues to translate these issues into meaningful programmes which align with and ultimately enhance the respective client’s wider business strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with clients; partnering with them and helping them define and articulate their position across a range of audiences and stakeholder groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive at least one major global client account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster ‘big idea’ generation, innovation and activation across the sector, driving colleagues and teams to bring ideas to life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive new business and prospecting; work closely with Brunswick colleagues to define and deliver a business strategy which makes use of internal networks and marketing opportunities to deliver “more for more”.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clear sight of the operational effectiveness of client accounts and teams, staying close on quality assurance and open to being “hands-on” with client work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead by example to move the business forward and to support the ongoing development of colleagues and mentees. Inspire, develop, and actively mentor colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively represent Brunswick’s Foundations and Non-Profits practice externally, and alongside other key colleagues within the Partnership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong track record either working in an advisory role within a global corporate or charitable foundation, multilateral organisation, NGO, or government or consulting experience advising philanthropic clients. Agency experience is preferred and advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years’ relevant professional experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the philanthropic and international development landscape, with first-hand experience of handling highly topical issues, and an extensive network from which to draw intelligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of the interplay between business, politics, and society, particularly as it relates to this sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of corporate positioning, and how to develop strategies and advocacy campaigns that can translate into programs with real sustained impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate effectively in a commercial, self-starting, and fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience advising senior leaders with efficacy and diplomacy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to connect with and leverage the skills and expertise of colleagues, to deliver the best possible advice, campaigns and programs to clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong verbal and written communicator with high EQ levels and an engaging presentation style.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A global perspective and experience working with international teams or organisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A balance of creative and analytical thinking, bringing rigor, accuracy, and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A natural team-worker who prefers to work in a collegiate way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whether you are joining a client facing team, a core services team, or starting out on your professional career journey, joining Brunswick unlocks a range of exceptional employee benefits to support your financial future, health and wellness, family and community and continuous professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;About Brunswick&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Brunswick is a global advisory firm. We help companies tackle high-stakes issues, navigate complex stakeholder relationships, and deliver high-impact outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our clients value our ability to anticipate, shape, and respond to the key players and forces in the financial and investment arena, regulatory and geopolitical universe, NGO community, workforce and beyond. They rely on us for deep experience, fresh perspectives and original thinking. So, in Brunswick you will find an exceptional range of experience and talent with a rich mix of backgrounds. From the beginning, we have prioritized attracting, developing, and retaining the best professionals in the industry, united by a culture of inclusivity, excellence, and intellectual curiosity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 1987 in London, the firm has organically grown to 27 offices in 18 countries across the Americas, Europe, Middle East, Africa, Asia and Australia. We operate as a “one-firm firm” with no individual profit centers. This allows us to assemble fully integrated, bespoke teams for each client, able to draw on the full resources of Brunswick anywhere in the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Brunswick is an equal opportunity employer. &amp;nbsp;All qualified applicants will be considered without regard to race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, disability, pregnancy, genetic information, or any other status protected by applicable law. Please&amp;nbsp;read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.brunswickgroup.com/app/uploads/Group-Privacy-Notice-for-Employees_April-2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Global Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; to understand how your data is managed.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role..&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced Analytics Engineer to join our data team to enhance our data-platform. This role will develop advanced analytics features into our transformations layer, optimise performance, and work with data engineers to ensure scalability and robustness.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Candidates for the role will have proven expertise in developing complex and performant SQL data models, with a deep understanding of dbt Core or dbt Cloud and Snowflake. The ideal candidate will have experience managing semantic layer based BI tools, such as Omni or Looker.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities..&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Develop advanced and performant SQL transformations in dbt to support complex analytics and reporting needs, ensuring optimised performance in handling large-scale data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Optimise sql codebase for Snowflake credit spend and dbt build times, tune materialisations and incremental models, and report against build KPIs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Set up and manage dbt projects to ensure that the codebase is stable, scalable, and maintainable, adhering to best practices for long-term success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Administer and manage dbt Cloud (Fusion), including scheduling and job monitoring.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with data engineering teams to ensure our transformation layer integrates seamlessly with our ingestion layer, enabling end-to-end analytics pipelines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Implement and manage data observability processes and tools to monitor and ensure data quality, accuracy, and reliability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Administer our semantic layer in Omni (Omni.co) to ensure transformed business data and governed metrics are available for end-users.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Manage our GitHub repository, ensuring version control best practices, implementation of automated testing workflows, and seamless collaboration between teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Contribute to the development of master data management documentation and coding standards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience..&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Expertise in advanced SQL and data modelling techniques utilising dbt, with a strong emphasis on performant and optimised transformations for complex analytics and reporting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with Snowflake, including familiarity with its SQL dialect, performance tuning features and AI functions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience administering dbt Cloud, setting up scalable and maintainable projects, and scheduling workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience working with semantic layers for BI tooling, including defining metrics and relationships, ensuring data availability, user access and performance. Omni or Looker strongly preferred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Knowledge of data observability tools and processes to monitor data quality and identify anomalies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience managing GitHub repositories, including version control, automated testing workflows, and fostering team collaboration.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to collaborate with data engineering teams to build new data pipelines and integrate transformation layers seamlessly with ingestion layers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Experience..&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Use of AI for coding workflows. Claude Code preferred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AI context for semantic layers, especially in Omni. Curate AI context, field descriptions and sample queries in the semantic layer so AI assistants answer questions accurately.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience in the hospitality industry and familiarity with hospitality-specific data and KPIs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Soho House offers competitive compensation packages that feature global benefits and perks. Whether you’re seeking entry-level employment or a new opportunity to expand your profession, we offer training to develop the technical and managerial skills necessary to grow your career.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Annual Every House Membership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;50% off Food &amp;amp; Drink, 7 days a week&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Staff Room Rates&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Private Health and Dental Care&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Weekly Pay&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Life Assurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Up to 50% Staff Discount on Cowshed &amp;amp; Soho Home&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;In Office Dog Policy on Fridays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Season Ticket Loan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Christmas Office Closure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;In conjunction with Soho Impact, take 2 days paid a year to support a charity of your choice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Free Counselling Sessions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Cookhouse &amp;amp; House Tonic: Our Cookhouse &amp;amp; House Tonic programmes offer unique food and drink trainings, events and opportunities to inspire and educate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Continuous training to develop yourself personally and professionally&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Exclusive access to our benefits platform with hundreds of discounts on shopping, gym memberships, holidays, insurance and much more&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Team Events: From fitness sessions to cinema screenings and art classes, each month we hold a series of fun events which you can sign up to.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
