&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a hands-on Fullstack Web Developer to join our Web Apps team, in our Zürich office. In this role you will have the opportunity to drive development of new features, have a say in architecture and design decisions and have real impact across all the team’s projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The web apps team plays a central role at Auterion and owns the systems that add connectivity and remote interfaces for fleet management and operations. Our services are responsible for ingesting and analyzing flight telemetry data, managing and updating the fleet as well as integrating with other systems across the stack.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is someone who’s a self-starter, can work independently, can work with ambiguity, can take decisions on their own and not be afraid to drive and push towards getting the project across the finish line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership and drive the development of new features across all the team’s web based projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver clean, readable and maintainable code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate services between edge devices and our centralized services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle new feature discovery, prototyping and investigations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist the Customer Success team in debugging and resolving customer issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and analyze user usage patterns and other statistics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Push initiatives to clean up, upgrade, and refactor existing services to reduce technical debt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and improve integrations with 3rd party services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in a Fullstack web development or similar role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency with the Node.js&amp;nbsp; ecosystem, development and tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency with the Typescript ecosystem, development and tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency with modern SPAs (Vue.js ecosystem preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience with Postgres/SQL (queries, transactions, views, indexes, triggers) as well as ORM systems (Prisma)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience with Docker and container orchestration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience with CI/CD pipelines (GoCD and GH Actions)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with monitoring and observability tools (Datadog, Grafana)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python proficiency is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CH/EU citizenship required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Car parking&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and wellbeing support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Switzerland on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Welcome to Planet. We believe in using space to help life on Earth.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet designs, builds, and operates the largest constellation of imaging satellites in history. This constellation delivers an unprecedented dataset of empirical information via a revolutionary cloud-based platform to authoritative figures in commercial, environmental, and humanitarian sectors. We are both a space company and data company all rolled into one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customers and users across the globe use Planet&#39;s data to develop new technologies, drive revenue, power research, and solve our world’s toughest obstacles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we control every component of hardware design, manufacturing, data processing, and software engineering, our office is a truly inspiring mix of experts from a variety of domains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a people-centric approach toward culture and community and we strive to iterate in a way that puts our team members first and prepares our company for growth. Join Planet and be a part of our mission to change the way people see the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet is a global company with employees working remotely world wide and joining us from offices in San Francisco, Washington DC, Germany, Austria, Slovenia, and The Netherlands.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced engineering leader to become our Senior Director of Engineering for Civil Government and Commercial. In this role, you will lead the engineering strategy, execution, and team development for a rapidly growing organization of 70+ engineers spanning multiple global Planet offices. You will oversee the development, scaling, and delivery of our critical existing solutions, including Area Monitoring Service (AMS) for EU Common Agricultural Policy (CAP) compliance, Disaster and Wildfire solutions, Copernicus Data Space Ecosystem (CDSE), and a portfolio of Derived Data Products. You will also drive our &quot;zero to one&quot; product discovery, partnering closely with Product Management, Design, and Science teams to incubate, architect, and launch new, emerging solutions built on top of Planet’s high-frequency imagery and derived data products. AI is central to how Planet builds solutions, and you will make it a primary way your teams discover, build, and deliver for customers. This position is vital to delivering innovative applications to civil governments and commercial customers worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full-time, hybrid role which will require you to work from our Berlin, Haarlem, or Ljubljana office 3 days per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact You’ll Own:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor, and scale a global engineering organization of 70+ engineers, managers, and directors across multiple geographies and time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set a high bar for performance and accountability. Define measurable outcomes for every product and team, surface risks early and directly, and make the hard calls on people and priorities when results fall short.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the day-to-day engineering execution and delivery for existing flagship products, ensuring reliability and performance for AMS,&amp;nbsp; Disaster and Wildfire solutions, and the derived data portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion and lead &quot;zero to one&quot; engineering discovery, building the technical foundation and prototypes for new emerging commercial and civil government products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner on a daily basis with Product Management, Design, and GTM teams to define product direction, prioritize feature development, and align technical strategy with business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure systems are scalable, reliable, and secure for government and enterprise use, guiding architectural decisions and engineering best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align your team&#39;s daily output with Planet’s mission of using space to help life on earth, directly enabling governments and businesses to make critical, timely decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of relevant software engineering work experience, including 8+ years of supervisory or leadership experience managing multiple layers of engineering management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and scaling distributed engineering teams of 50+ employees across multiple geographic locations and time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on engagement with AI tools in your own work, and experience leading engineering teams through AI adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of &quot;zero to one&quot; product development, including the technical discovery, architecture, and successful launch of new software solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in building and delivering geospatial platforms, data analytics solutions, or enterprise SaaS products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering tailored solutions to individual customers, meeting or exceeding their expectations and integrating new building blocks back into the solution commons.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A growth mindset. You experiment, learn quickly, and change course when the evidence says to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to collaborate with cross-functional partners to translate complex business and user requirements into actionable technical roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience overseeing operational reliability, cloud infrastructure, and software deployment lifecycles for enterprise-grade applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to drive software delivery metrics, maintain high operational availability/SLAs, and foster rigorous engineering practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to recruit, mentor, and retain engineering talent at all levels while fostering an inclusive team culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear and effective written and verbal communication skills for engaging with both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You Stand Out:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Success building large scale civil government solutions leveraging forward deployed engineering.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the unique regulatory, compliance, and security requirements of government technology solutions globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building sovereign systems for governments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Deadline:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;11:45p / 23:45 CET on the date stated below. Applications are reviewed on a rolling basis. This posting may be removed earlier than projected if a suitable pool of applications has been received. For this reason, we recommend applying as soon as you are able to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits While Working at Planet:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;These offerings are dependent on employment type and geographical location, based upon applicable law or company policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid time off including vacation, holidays and company-wide days off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Wellness Program&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly Phone and Internet Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition Reimbursement and access to LinkedIn Learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volunteering Paid Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The expected starting gross salary range for this role is listed below. Individual placement within this range is determined objectively based on gender-neutral criteria such as your skills, qualifications, and professional experience. This position may also be eligible for discretionary bonuses and/or equity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Netherlands Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€120.100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€150.100 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, we will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why we care so much about Belonging.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We’re dedicated to helping the whole Planet, and to do that we must strive to represent all of it within each of our offices and on all of our teams. That’s why Planet is guided by an ultimate north star of Belonging—dreaming big as we approach our ongoing work.&amp;nbsp; If this job intrigues you, but you’re thinking you might not have all the qualifications, please... do apply!&amp;nbsp; At Planet, we are looking for well-rounded people from around the world who can contribute to more ways than just what is listed in this job description.&amp;nbsp; We don’t just fill positions, we aspire to fulfill people’s careers, most excited about folks who are motivated by our underlying humanitarian efforts.&amp;nbsp; We are a few orbits around the sun before we get to where we want to be, so we hope you’re excited to come along for the ride.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EEO statement: &lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Planet is committed to building a community where everyone belongs and we invite people from all backgrounds to apply. Planet is an equal opportunity employer, and committed to providing employment opportunities regardless of race, religious creed, color, national origin, ancestry, physical disability, mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, pregnancy, childbirth and breastfeeding, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other protected classification, in accordance with applicable federal, state, and local laws. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12.pdf&quot;&gt;Know Your Rights.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Planet is an inclusive community and we know that everyone has their own needs. If you have a disability or special need that requires accommodation during the hiring process, please reach out to ----- or contact your recruiter with your request. Your message will be confidential and we will be happy to assist you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;: By clicking &quot;Apply Now&quot; at the top of this job posting, I acknowledge that I have read the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.planet.com/privacy/#california&quot;&gt;Planet Data Privacy Notice for California Staff Members and Applicants&lt;/a&gt;, and hereby consent to the collection, processing, use, and storage of my personal information as described therein.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy (European Applicants):&lt;/strong&gt; By clicking &quot;Apply Now&quot; at the top of this job posting, I acknowledge that I have read the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.planet.com/privacy/&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice GDPR Planet Labs Europe&lt;/a&gt;, and hereby consent to the collection, processing, use, and storage of my personal information as described therein.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI in Our Interviewing Process&lt;/strong&gt;: Planet is committed to providing an exceptional interview experience for all candidates. We currently use &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.metaview.ai/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Metaview&lt;/a&gt; to better focus on candidates and less on trying to capture notes. As such, with the candidate&#39;s consent, select interviews may be recorded and include a &quot;Planet AI Notetaker&quot; for transcription and summarization purposes. Should an interview involve use of AI interview technologies, the candidate will receive notification and have the ability to opt out both in advance and/or real-time. Opting out will not affect one&#39;s candidacy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate AI Policy&lt;/strong&gt;: Planet embraces Artificial Intelligence (AI) tools, and we encourage its responsible use. We understand that candidates may use various resources, including AI tools, to &lt;em&gt;prepare&lt;/em&gt; for interviews and assessments. However, &lt;em&gt;during any live interview stage or when actively completing assessments for this position, the use of AI tools—e.g. Large Language Models (LLMs), deep fake technology, etc.—is strictly prohibited unless explicitly prompted by an interviewer or assessment instructions&lt;/em&gt;. If you are unsure about acceptable use, please contact your recruiter for clarification. If an AI tool or similar technology is desired as an accommodation, please contact ----- with your request for assistance. Your message will be confidential, and we will be happy to assist you. Violation of this policy may result in disqualification of your application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;In a nutshell&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Picnic, we&#39;re revolutionising the way people buy groceries with our affordable and sustainable grocery service. In the Personalization team, you’ll build the experimentation platform that lets Picnic try new ideas safely and at scale: from which promotions to highlight to which emails to send. Your work lets business teams run experiments and control the customer experience themselves, without needing an engineer for every change. It’s a product that is foundational to our business, and it directly improves how customers shop every day. &lt;br&gt;We use React, React Native and TypeScript across the board, together with&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.picnic.nl/faster-features-happier-customers-introducing-the-platform-that-transformed-our-grocery-app-b38e57a85531&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;our server-driven UI framework&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; and we’re working towards a single platform for mobile and web.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think like a product owner.&lt;/strong&gt; You don’t just implement requirements, you question them. Together with product owners and designers, you shape specifications for new features, discuss trade-offs, push back when something doesn’t add up, and help build a long-term vision for where the platform should go.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build bridges.&lt;/strong&gt; You work with cross-functional teams across the whole business: the business teams who rely on the platform, fellow engineers, and the other consumer-facing teams whose features run through it. You make it easy for others to succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive things forward.&lt;/strong&gt; You don’t wait for someone to hand you the next task. You spot what could be better, in the codebase, the platform or how the team works, and you take the lead on fixing it. You’ll take on increasingly challenging projects with full ownership of your contributions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Tech:&lt;/strong&gt; React, React Native, TypeScript and RxJS, Redux, Styled Components, Jest, Storybook&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want ownership, real influence on product direction, and to see your work reach millions of customers, you’ll feel at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;We’re looking for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of building and shipping frontend applications end-to-end. You’ve taken products from idea to millions of users, and you’ve stayed around to make them better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong conceptual thinker. You thrive in ambiguity and lead the way to the right solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharp judgement on trade-offs. You know when to build it right and when to ship it now, and you make that call yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real curiosity about the customer. You care whether your work changes how people shop, not just whether the code is clean.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, structured communicator. You collaborate effectively with product, design, backend, analytics, and frontend teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine motivation to build consumer and e-commerce experiences used by millions, with willingness to work from&lt;strong class=&quot;text-green1 list-item-text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Picnic’s Amsterdam office-first environment&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Picnic Perks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✍🏼Every expert was once a beginner!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get plenty of opportunities to challenge yourself and grow, including the Picnic Tech Academy, Lunch &amp;amp; Learn sessions, and tailored soft skills training. We also offer free professional weekly language courses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💡Make a difference&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work in an awesome startup environment with the freedom to drive your own projects and create a visible impact. Our fully electric vehicles and sustainable business model mean you’ll also be contributing to making the world a better place!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🫱🏼‍🫲🏾Teamwork makes the dream work&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With more than 80 nationalities across 3 countries, you’ll be part of a diverse company with plenty of cool stuff to get involved with, from board game evenings to after-work drinks to our company ski trip and more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍎You are what you eat&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get freshly prepared, healthy lunches and snacks (with plenty of vegetarian, vegan, and halal options). Coffee snob? Don’t worry, our amazing Picnic barista has you covered.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚴🏽Stay healthy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mental health is important. As well as having the option to speak with Picnic colleagues who act as confidential advisors, our collaboration with OpenUp gives you easy access to professional psychologists, along with workshops and materials.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There are plenty of sports communities and events to get involved with, from tennis to yoga, to climbing!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔋Attractive package&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer competitive compensation and a pension plan that looks out for your future self, as well as 25 vacation days per year, so you can recharge your batteries&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌍Benefits for expats&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It can be daunting starting a new job AND moving to a new country. That’s why we offer lots of support for our many expat colleagues, if you want to find our relocation benefits, see&lt;a href=&quot;https://jobs.picnic.app/en/relocation&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

Ben jij die vakkundige monteur die direct zijn weg vindt in de werkplaats? Bij Technison zijn we gespecialiseerd in het leveren van hoogwaardige machines en installaties voor de glastuinbouw. Met jouw passie voor techniek bouw je onze machines in de werkplaats vanaf tekening op en zorg jij ervoor dat elk systeem technisch perfect gemonteerd de deur uit gaat.
Taken
Als Mechanisch Monteur bij Technison ben jij een onmisbare schakel. Omdat je de nodige vlieguren hebt gemaakt, draai je je hand niet om voor complexe samenstellingen. Je werkt in een hecht team, maar kunt ook uitstekend zelfstandig uit de voeten om alles op rolletjes te laten lopen.
Jouw takenpakket is uitdagend en breed:

Lassen, zagen en boren van machineonderdelen;
Het volledig en nauwkeurig assembleren van onze machines;
Testdraaien en technisch controleren of alles perfect functioneert;
Het snel en effectief oplossen van storingen;
Incidenteel assisteren bij installaties op locatie bij de klant.

Heb je ook ervaring met elektra? Dat is een grote pré! We bieden je de ruimte om ook de elektra achter onze machines te verzorgen.
Vereisten
We zoeken iemand die direct waarde toevoegt aan ons team. Daarom vragen wij:

Een afgeronde technische opleiding (minimaal MBO Mechatronica of Elektrotechniek) —maar werkervaring vinden we minstens zo belangrijk;
Aantoonbare ervaring in de machinebouw of een vergelijkbare technische productieomgeving;
Je werkt precies, ziet het werk liggen en hebt een proactieve werkhouding.

Benefits
Werken bij Technison betekent werken in een dynamische en creatieve omgeving waar vakmanschap wordt gewaardeerd.

Salaris: tussen de €2.300,- en €4.000,- bruto per maand (o.b.v. 38 uur), passend bij jouwervaring;
Vrije tijd: 25 vakantiedagen én 13 ADV-dagen;
Extra's: 13e maand, 8% vakantiegeld, leuke borrels en uitjes met je collega's en een goedereiskostenvergoeding vanaf 10 km;
Zekerheid: een veelzijdige functie met uitzicht op een vast contract.

Heb jij de ervaring die wij zoeken? Aarzel dan niet en reageer direct via de sollicitatieknop met jecv. Heb je nog vragen over de functie? Neem contact op met onze recruiter Marjolein viade sollicitatieknop of 0657431478. Een appje sturen kan natuurlijk ook!Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Buyer domain&#39;s Data Science teams build and iterate on our most critical ML systems—like ranking, retrieval, and recommendations—that serve millions of users. As our ambition and the complexity of these models grow, we are scaling our MLOps capabilities to match:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are hiring an MLOps Engineer to solve this. This is a high-impact &quot;bridge&quot; role, not to build new platforms, but to be the expert user of our existing platforms (GCP/Vertex AI, Vespa, Triton). Your mission is to take our Data Science team&#39;s work, rectify the current ad-hoc solutions, and build the robust, automated, and high-quality &quot;path-to-production&quot; our advanced models require.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Also by joining Vinted, you’ll become part of an active community of engineers who are keen on sharing knowledge, organizing learning workshops and so much more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Productionise ML models: &lt;/strong&gt;be responsible for migrating all existing model training code from experimental or proof-of-concept stages to robust and automated pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build continuous training (CT) pipelines: &lt;/strong&gt;design, build, and maintain automated workflows for data preparation, model training, and batch scoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automate model serving &amp;amp; integration: &lt;/strong&gt;package and deploy traditional ML models (e.g., in ONNX format) to our existing serving infrastructure, primarily Vespa and/or Triton.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Close the deployment loop: &lt;/strong&gt;automate model deployments where they are still manual. For example, building a GitHub Action that deploys a new model to Vespa, triggered by a webhook from a successful Vertex AI training pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the missing quality gates: &lt;/strong&gt;build the automated quality and evaluation gates that our pipelines lack today. This includes:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Establish and uphold ML Model Lifecycle Standards: &lt;/strong&gt;Take ownership of and continuously improve the standards, quality, and governance of the complete ML model lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are looking for an &quot;ML-literate&quot; Software Engineer, not a Data Scientist. You are a builder and an automator with a strong service mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must-have technical skills: deep expertise in GCP/Vertex AI (or equivalents like SageMaker), Kubernetes, and Docker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automation expertise: proven experience building robust CI/CD and automation pipelines (e.g., GitHub Actions, Jenkins, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ML-Literate: you understand ML workflows and concepts (training, evaluation, inference) well enough to debug pipelines and build meaningful quality gates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Soft skills: a strong &quot;service mindset,&quot; excellent communication, and the ability to act as a bridge between the highly technical worlds of Data Science and Infrastructure. You are pragmatic and driven to get high-quality work into production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus Points: familiarity with ML serving platforms like Vespa search engine or NVIDIA Triton and model formats like ONNX.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to learn and master new technologies and concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We value pragmatism, big-picture thinking, curiosity, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A daily lunch allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company bike leasing scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly budget for a flexible benefits platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from Home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collective Defined Contribution Pension plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An NS mobility card&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hybrid model, with 2 recommended office days a week, gives you and your team the flexibility to decide if and when you want to work from home, and when to catch up in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€89.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€121.400 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Axon and be a Force for Good.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Axon, we’re on a mission to Protect Life. We’re explorers, pursuing society’s most critical safety and justice issues with our ecosystem of devices and cloud software. Like our products, we work better together. We connect with candor and care, seeking out diverse perspectives from our customers, communities and each other.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Life at Axon is fast-paced, challenging and meaningful. Here, you’ll take ownership and drive real change. Constantly grow as you work hard for a mission that matters at a company where you matter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: Amsterdam, Netherlands OR Germany - Remote&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel: &lt;/strong&gt;up to 40% within DACH, Benelux, Nordics (an other European countries as needed)&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to:&lt;/strong&gt; Director, Professional Services, EMEA&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Technical Project Manager, you’ll lead high-visibility projects, directly contributing to the development and implementation of solutions that truly make a difference. In this role, you’ll tackle complex challenges, working with some of the most advanced technologies in the industry, including cloud and on-prem platforms, and mission-critical systems. You’ll have the opportunity to collaborate with brilliant minds across professional services, sales, engineering, product, and customer teams to deliver solutions that save lives and enhance public trust.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Axon, we’re driven by a powerful mission: to protect life, capture truth, and accelerate justice. We’re growing rapidly, and this is your chance to make a lasting impact at a company where innovation meets purpose.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program &amp;amp; Project Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage all aspects of complex enterprise-grade product deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee project milestones, resource planning, scope, timeline, and risk management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage cross-functional stakeholders to ensure alignment, transparency, and on-time delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensures project milestones and deadlines are met and associated documentation supports customer acceptance for purposes of revenue recognition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support pre-sales scoping and post-sales implementation handoff.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operates with a sense of urgency, accuracy, and detail-orientation, while maintaining consistent lines of communication with all teams involved in each project&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain customer confidence, especially in high-pressure situations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remain organized and focused on removing obstacles through creativity and adaptation to rapidly changing circumstances&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the relationship with 3rd party integrator and the client throughout the length of the contract&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Professional Services, Product Managers, and Engineers to align program execution with business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a liaison between customers and internal teams to manage change requests, solution feasibility, and roadmap alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify process inefficiencies and propose improvements to increase deployment speed, quality, and customer satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to internal SOPs, implementation playbooks, and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in both German and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;European citizenship is required in order to work with sensitive Government data, willing to undergo a security check&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience leading and delivering highly complex programs, with demonstrated success in technical program management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of managing enterprise-level software deployments, infrastructure projects, or large-scale enterprise application programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in delivering complex projects involving cross-functional teams, including sales, engineering, and product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mastery of program/project management tools and methodologies to track, report, and deliver on objectives. (PMP, PRINCE2, SCRUM)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience gathering requirements, optimizing workflows, and facilitating change management within teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with software configurations and coding experience (particularly JSON) preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced communication and presentation skills, with the ability to distill technical concepts for diverse audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in guiding client and internal teams through ambiguity, driving alignment, and executing on shared goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Don’t meet every single requirement? That&#39;s ok. At Axon, we Aim Far. We think big with a long-term view because we want to reinvent the world to be a safer, better place. We are also committed to building diverse teams that reflect the communities we serve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Studies have shown that women and people of color are less likely to apply to jobs unless they check every box in the job description. If you’re excited about this role and our mission to Protect Life but your experience doesn’t align perfectly with every qualification listed here, we encourage you to apply anyways. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Important Notes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The above job description is not intended as, nor should it be construed as, exhaustive of all duties, responsibilities, skills, efforts, or working conditions associated with this job. The job description may change or be supplemented at any time in accordance with business needs and conditions.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Some roles may also require legal eligibility to work in a firearms environment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We collect personal information from applicants to evaluate candidates for employment. You may request access, deletion, or exercise other CCPA rights at&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot; ----- ----- via our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://privacyportal.onetrust.com/webform/0efc1702-9321-4119-bc9d-a06c3a1d3e4e/ca57cc26-a159-4193-9f6e-58ffe3fd2509&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://privacyportal.onetrust.com/webform/0efc1702-9321-4119-bc9d-a06c3a1d3e4e/ca57cc26-a159-4193-9f6e-58ffe3fd2509&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Axon Privacy Web Form&lt;/a&gt;. For more information, please see the Your California Privacy Rights section of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.axon.com/candidateprivacypolicy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.axon.com/candidateprivacypolicy&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Axon’s mission is to Protect Life and is committed to the well-being and safety of its employees as well as Axon’s impact on the environment. All Axon employees must be aware of and committed to the appropriate environmental, health, and safety regulations, policies, and procedures. Axon employees are empowered to report safety concerns as they arise and activities potentially impacting the environment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer that promotes justice, advances equity, values diversity and fosters inclusion. We’re committed to hiring the best talent — regardless of race, creed, color, ancestry, religion, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship status, marital status, disability, gender identity, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable laws, regulations and ordinances — and empowering all of our employees so they can do their best work. If you have a disability or special need that requires assistance or accommodation during the application or the recruiting process, please email &lt;a ---------- &lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;Please note that this email address is for accommodation purposes only. Axon will not respond to inquiries for other purposes.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Phishing alert:&amp;nbsp; Axon will never ask you to pay for any part of the hiring process, including training, equipment, or background checks. We do not make job offers via text message, WhatsApp, or instant messaging platforms without a formal interview process.&amp;nbsp; All legitimate job openings are listed on our official careers page at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.axon.com/careers&quot;&gt;https://www.axon.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;. &amp;nbsp;If you receive a suspicious offer or outreach from an email address that is not ----- or if you are asked for sensitive personal information (bank details, Social Security Number) prematurely, please ignore the message and report it to &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verve has created a more efficient and privacy-focused way to buy and monetize advertising. Verve is an ecosystem of demand and supply technologies fusing data, media, and technology together to deliver results and growth to both advertisers and publishers–no matter the screen or location, no matter who, what, or where a customer is. With offices across the globe and with an eye on servicing forward-thinking advertising customers, Verve’s solutions are trusted by more than 90 of the United States’ top 100 advertisers, 4,000 publishers globally, and the world’s top demand-side platforms. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://verve.com/&quot;&gt;verve.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are currently searching for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Working Student (Werkstudent) HR Operations&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team in Germany and support our HR Operations team across the full employee lifecycle. This role gives you hands-on insight into German HR administration, payroll and labor law, and the chance to contribute to HR projects in an international environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support onboarding and offboarding processes, from preparing welcome documents and system set-up to exit paperwork.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and update staff records in our HR system (HiBob) and the digital personnel file&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare employment contracts, contract amendments, employment confirmations, reference letters and other certificates using our templates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help collate monthly payroll input (starters, leavers, salary changes, bonuses) for German payroll and prepare it for review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track key dates such as probation periods, contract end dates and work permit/visa expiries, and keep documentation audit-ready.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support communication with external partners and vendors, such as our payroll provider, tax advisors and benefits providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support HR projects, including process improvements, HiBob optimization and Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits administration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently enrolled as a student at a German university (Bachelor’s or Master’s) in Human Resources, Business Administration, Psychology, Law or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Availability of 16–20 hours per week during the semester for at least 6 months (more hours possible during semester breaks).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First practical experience in HR, e.g. through an internship or previous working student role, is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interest in HR processes and German labor law.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident with MS Office or Google Workspace, especially Google Sheets; experience with HR systems (e.g. HiBob) is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent German and very good English, both spoken and written.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized and detail-oriented, with a discreet approach to confidential employee data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on, proactive mindset and eagerness to learn in a fast-paced, global environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Just a few of the benefits waiting for you at Verve:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support your long-term financial security with our &lt;strong&gt;Allianz&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Corporate Pension Scheme&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pick what matters most to you in our &lt;strong&gt;Personalized Benefits Platform&lt;/strong&gt;, with a budget of €100/month: mobility support (BVG/HVV), internet allowance, daycare subsidy, &lt;strong&gt;Urban Sports Club&lt;/strong&gt; membership, personal development, and shopping vouchers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support your mental well-being with our&lt;strong&gt; Nilo Health Workplace Mental Health Solution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Boost your professional knowledge with our annual&lt;strong&gt; training budget &amp;amp; internal webinars,&lt;/strong&gt; and level up your language skills through our &lt;strong&gt;German/English classes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recharge with &lt;strong&gt;27 paid vacation days + 3 Wellness days&lt;/strong&gt; throughout the year, in addition to the public holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;… and even more reasons to join us!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;Verve provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you are a California resident subject to the California Consumer Privacy Act, &lt;a href=&quot;https://verve.com/california-applicant-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;If you are located in the EU or UK visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot; href=&quot;https://verve.com/applicant-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position: Account Specialist&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Account Specialist &lt;/strong&gt;position is a remote, work-from-home role, as are all positions at Acceleration Partners (a structure central to our culture and vision to change the work/life paradigm). Some travel may be required for client meetings, internal meetings, conferences, and other events. &lt;strong&gt;Please note: &lt;/strong&gt;This position requires verbal and written fluency in German.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;As an &lt;strong&gt;Account Specialist&lt;/strong&gt;, you will provide white glove service to diverse brands investing in influencer marketing campaigns. This role is particularly focused on campaign execution, including but not limited to driving influencer recruitment, managing influencer partnerships, and owning campaign deliverables, tracking, and reporting. The Account Specialist will also drive strategy by analyzing campaign performance, identifying success areas and/or challenge areas, and proactively implementing strategic measures to continuously optimize programs towards goals and objectives.&lt;br&gt;The successful candidate will have strong experience in developing and managing successful, KPI-driven influencer marketing campaigns for consumer products and/or services companies. They will have working knowledge of the overall partner marketing landscape, including affiliate, and the ability to both develop comprehensive strategy as well as capably execute. The successful candidate will be a self-starter that can confidently plug in to any challenging situation with ease and can balance competing priorities well. The Account Specialist must be flexible, willing and able to pivot quickly, and excited to operate successfully in an “intrapreneurial” situation. This person will also have a history of working well with their peers, quickly establishing relationships easily and leading through influence.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’ll work closely with your manager and peers to maximize program effectiveness and create opportunities for growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Top 5 Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;INFLUENCER RECRUITMENT, NEGOTIATING &amp;amp; ONBOARDING –&lt;/strong&gt;Sources new partnership opportunities and creates influencer casting lists. Diligently vets opportunities to ensure brand alignment, authenticity and relevancy prior to presenting to client for approval. Conducts outreach to approved partners and skillfully garners their engagement and participation in the campaign, negotiating when necessary. Supports influencers through campaign onboarding by developing and providing resources to streamline processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;INFLUENCER PARTNERSHIPS MANAGEMENT &lt;/strong&gt;– Crafts program-wide influencer communications and vital creator resources. Guides influencers on content strategy and creation. Works with influencers to develop content timelines and ensures influencers stay on track with the schedules discussed. Collects content drafts and leads the content review process, including screening to ensure FTC guidelines are met. Closely works with influencers to adjust content strategy as needed, troubleshooting any signs of poor performance to optimize campaign towards goals and objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AUDITING, REPORTING &amp;amp; ANALYSIS &lt;/strong&gt;– Accountable for auditing program content to ensure compliance with FTC regulations and brand guidelines. Ensures content is tracked accurately and regularly shared with client, along with placement insights, partner insights, and campaign pace towards KPI goals. Performs robust analysis of influencer campaigns using both social analytics and conversion metrics to identify performance trends and areas of opportunity. Proactively provides actionable recommendations to client backed by data and continuously refines strategy to drive growth at scale. Supports team in creation of customized strategy plans, detailed campaign performance summaries and comprehensive hindsight presentations that are delivered to clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CLIENT SERVICE &amp;amp; COMMUNICATION&lt;/strong&gt;- Consistently provides superior client service and escalates issues or key risks as appropriate. Works to ensure client develops trust in our team by delivering client outputs and communications in the AP way, consistently maintaining quality, accuracy, and precision. Develops and nurtures excellent relationships, supports team in promoting very high client satisfaction and retention rates, and an average 8.5 client rating.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PORTFOLIO MANAGEMENT&lt;/strong&gt;- Own and manage client tasks with minimal supervision, ensuring deadlines are met and tasks are completed accurately. Manages multiple campaigns with solid organizational skills and the ability to focus on and prioritize tasks based on client objectives, flagging any potential delays and keeping the team informed. Has full grasp of each client’s scope of work, delivering what is due under terms; maintains ability to identify new opportunities to drive client success while conjunctively identifying possible goal misalignments, getting to the root of an issue, and working with their team to bring solutions to resolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BY 3 MONTHS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Account Specialist is contributing across a portfolio of influencer programs, collaborating with their team closely to ensure strong alignment with the campaign strategy in place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are working with key client contacts to ensure brand alignment with recruitment efforts and content creation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have become familiar with AP’s tools and solutions and are equipped to conduct casting for prospective influencers, execute content timelines with influencers, audit content, and ensure performance is tracked and measured.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By 6 MONTHS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are owning execution of the day-to-day operations of multiple influencer programs with little guidance from your team, including reporting, processing applications, recruiting and casting creators, and crafting partner communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenging client or team situations are being managed with guidance from managers and directors collaborating closely to bring a solutions-oriented approach to these situations proactively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are regularly analyzing client data and strategically leveraging insights to optimize campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Client accounts are being handled effectively and strategically, without dropping any balls, and clients are aware of and pleased with this outcome. Clients are being serviced profitably with AP targets, client KPI’s being met, and an average 8.5 client rating is being upheld across campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will regularly present new campaign ideas to managers and demonstrate a clear understanding of program performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By 1 YEAR:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will troubleshoot and resolve account and creator issues independently, providing valuable insights and actionable recommendations to clients and internal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be an integral part of each program, developing new ideas and improving processes to create efficiencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will take on new account responsibilities with support from your manager and serve as a thought leader within the team, contributing to relationship-building and firm development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualities of the Ideal Candidate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has a strong internal motivation to get the job done and done well&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Only provides superior results and unsurpassed customer service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exhilarated by managing change and comfortable with ambiguity and moving targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about the digital marketing industry and how influencer relates to the greater digital landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensures that influencer strategies and tactics have measurable results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has incredible attention to detail and is capable of multi-tasking and coordinating several projects at once&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translates data and insights into actionable next steps for clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong with data analysis, is easily able to pinpoint issues and opportunities within a data set&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritizes competing objectives and manages time with skill&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Displays accountability, always meeting deadlines and keeping commitments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in a fast-paced environment and enjoys bringing order to chaos&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Likes to share and collaborate with peers in a remote environment&lt;/li&gt;
