&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Value Engineering is responsible for our largest Fortune 500 customers and owns their transformation journey by working on the very frontier of what’s possible with data and AI on the Celons Platform. Partnering closely with the Sales team, Value Engineering is responsible for ensuring that the Celonis Platform is deployed to tackle the most strategic business challenges, fits into the right place in our customers’ technology stack and most importantly generates strong ROI through deep and broad deployments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt; As a Value Engineer, you will spearhead AI and data-driven business transformation by contributing to your customer’s end-to-end value journey using the Celonis Context Model. Working alongside Lead and Principal VEs, you will combine technical execution with consulting and project management. As an AI-fluent operator, your core mandate is to orchestrate complex roadmaps and execute targeted transformation initiatives that improve how these businesses operate across their ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value Selling &amp;amp; Realization:&lt;/strong&gt; Uncover the real issues by peeling back layers of organizational complexity. Own the Outcome from first discovery through realized ROI for your process areas. Tell the Value Story by crafting powerful executive narratives and leading business value workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Cultivate powerful executive sponsorship across core business units to champion transformation programs. Co-own change management with customer leaders and design CoE roadmaps that build self-sufficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Steer Global Transformations across complex workstreams. Own and implement AI-driven account planning and AI-assisted project management. Automate executive governance (QBRs, SteerCos) with minimal manual friction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform &amp;amp; AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as an AI-fluent operator, utilizing AI tools for rapid technical outputs while partnering with Applied Value Engineers for deep-dive solution builds. Champion platform adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale Value &amp;amp; Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Build a strategic expansion roadmap embedding Celonis as a strategic platform to drive adoption. Provide feedback to R&amp;amp;D based on evolving customer use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of experience taking ownership of complex workstreams, process areas, and customer relationships in Value Engineering, Consulting, or Pre-Sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Technical &amp;amp; Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid background in enterprise IT and business software (e.g., SAP, Workday, Salesforce, Oracle). You operate primarily as an AI-fluent operator, utilizing AI copilots to generate outputs and automations, avoiding heavy manual coding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builder Mentality:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable setting your own direction within an account team. Driven to &lt;em&gt;live for customer value&lt;/em&gt;, proactively hunting and ideating for highest-impact solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement &amp;amp; Value Realization:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven expertise in executing process improvements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Program &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated expertise orchestrating multi-region or business unit transformation programs. Expert at mobilizing VP/Director-level sponsorship. Flawless English communication with commanding executive presence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain &amp;amp; Industry:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of the Finance/Supply Chain domains. You stay continuously updated on business-critical use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Degree:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineering, Computer Science, Mathematics, Business Analytics,&amp;nbsp; comparable technical degree or a Business/Economics degree paired with a technical minor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Switzerland on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot; data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;DIE ROLLE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Für unsere Kunden aus dem Banken- und Versicherungsumfeld suchen wir eine:n erfahrene:n (Senior) Consultant / Business Analyst mit Fokus auf Kundenprozesse und CRM. Du gestaltest gemeinsam mit Fachbereichen, IT und Projektteams, wie Finanzinstitute ihre Kundinnen und Kunden über den gesamten Lebenszyklus betreuen: vom Onboarding über die laufende Kundenbeziehung bis zum Offboarding.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Du arbeitest an der Schnittstelle von Business, Technologie und Daten. Du analysierst bestehende Prozesse und Systeme, übersetzt fachliche Anforderungen in klare Spezifikationen und begleitest die Umsetzung in CRM- und Client-Lifecycle-Management-Lösungen. Dabei denkst du dich schnell in neue Themen und Kundenorganisationen ein und bringst Projekte proaktiv voran.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DEIN CAPCO-ALLTAG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Du analysierst Kundenprozesse entlang des Client Lifecycle, z. B. Onboarding, KYC, Stammdatenpflege, Kundenbetreuung und Offboarding, und identifizierst Verbesserungs- und Automatisierungspotenziale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Du erhebst, strukturierst und priorisierst fachliche und technische Anforderungen und übersetzt sie in Use Cases, User Stories und Spezifikationen.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Du modellierst Ist- und Soll-Prozesse mit BPMN sowie Daten- und Systemzusammenhänge mit UML und schaffst so eine gemeinsame Sprache für Fachbereich und IT.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Du begleitest die Einführung, Weiterentwicklung und Integration von CRM-Lösungen (z. B. Salesforce, Microsoft Dynamics 365), von der Konzeption über Test und Abnahme bis zum Go-live.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Du moderierst Workshops mit Stakeholdern aus Business, IT und Operations, zeigst Optionen und Abhängigkeiten auf und bereitest Entscheidungsvorlagen für das Management vor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Du stellst die Nachvollziehbarkeit von den Geschäftszielen über die Anforderungen bis zur umgesetzten Lösung sicher.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Als Senior übernimmst du Verantwortung für Teilprojekte oder Workstreams und gibst dein Wissen an jüngere Kolleginnen und Kollegen weiter.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DEIN CAPCO-FIT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Mindestens 3 Jahre Beratungserfahrung, idealerweise in einer Management- oder IT-Beratung mit Fokus auf Financial Services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Mindestens 3 Jahre Erfahrung mit CRM-Themen und -Tools, insbesondere in Projekten zur Einführung, Weiterentwicklung oder Integration von CRM-Systemen.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Fundierte Branchenkenntnisse im Banken- oder Versicherungsumfeld, vor allem rund um Kundenprozesse und Client Lifecycle Management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Solide Methodenkompetenz in der Business-Analyse: Anforderungsmanagement, Prozessmodellierung mit BPMN und UML sowie Erfahrung mit agilen und klassischen Projektmethoden.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Nachweisbare Projekterfahrung an der Schnittstelle zwischen Fachbereich und IT.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Schnelle Auffassungsgabe: Du arbeitest dich zügig in neue Themen, Systeme und Kundenumfelder ein und lieferst früh Mehrwert.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Du bist motiviert, proaktiv und lösungsorientiert, übernimmst Verantwortung und überzeugst durch klare, strukturierte Kommunikation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Verhandlungssichere Deutschkenntnisse (C1/C2) sind ein Muss, sehr gute Englischkenntnisse runden dein Profil ab.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BONUSPUNKTE FÜR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Erfahrung mit regulatorischen Anforderungen im Kundenumfeld, z. B. KYC/AML, MiFID II bzw. FIDLEG oder Datenschutz (DSG/DSGVO).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Erfahrung mit angrenzenden Themen wie Customer Data Management, Omnichannel, Marketing Automation oder Customer Experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Zertifizierungen in Business-Analyse oder CRM (z. B. IREB CPRE, CBAP, Salesforce-Zertifizierungen).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Erfahrung in agilen Setups (Scrum, SAFe) als Business Analyst oder Product Owner.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4172&quot; data-end=&quot;4196&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4172&quot; data-end=&quot;4194&quot;&gt;Inklusion bei Capco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4198&quot; data-end=&quot;4732&quot;&gt;Wir setzen uns für einen barrierefreien und zugänglichen Bewerbungsprozess ein. Wenn Du in irgendeiner Phase Unterstützung oder Anpassungen benötigst, lass es uns bitte wissen – wir helfen gerne weiter. Wir schätzen unterschiedliche Perspektiven und Hintergründe. Bei Capco glauben wir daran, dass Individualität eine Stärke ist. Unsere #BeYourselfAtWork-Kultur fördert Vielfalt und Zusammenarbeit – und prägt, wie wir täglich mit unseren Kundinnen und Kunden sowie miteinander arbeiten.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Summit:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Summit Therapeutics Inc. is a biopharmaceutical oncology company with a mission focused on improving quality of life, increasing potential duration of life, and resolving serious unmet medical needs. At Summit, we believe in building a team of world class professionals who are passionate about this mission, and it is our people who drive this mission to reality. Summit’s core values include integrity, passion for excellence, purposeful urgency, collaboration, and our commitment to people. Our employees are truly the heart and soul of our culture, and they are invaluable in shaping our journey toward excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Summit’s team is inspired to touch and help change lives through Summit’s clinical studies in the field of oncology. Summit has multiple global Phase 3 clinical studies, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Non-small Cell Lung Cancer (NSCLC)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HARMONi: Phase 3 clinical study which was intended to evaluate ivonescimab combined with chemotherapy compared to placebo plus chemotherapy in patients with EGFR-mutated, locally advanced or metastatic non-squamous NSCLC who were previously treated with a 3rd generation EGFR TKI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HARMONi-3: Phase 3 clinical study which is intended to evaluate ivonescimab combined with chemotherapy compared to pembrolizumab combined with chemotherapy in patients with first-line metastatic NSCLC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HARMONi-7: Phase 3 clinical study which is intended to evaluate ivonescimab monotherapy compared to pembrolizumab monotherapy in patients with first-line metastatic NSCLC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Colorectal Cancer (CRC)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HARMONi-GI3: Phase 3 clinical study intended to evaluate ivonescimab in combination with chemotherapy compared with bevacizumab plus chemotherapy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ivonescimab is an investigational therapy not presently approved by any regulatory authority other than China’s National Medical Products Administration (NMPA). Summit is headquartered in Miami, Florida, and has additional offices in California, New Jersey, the UK, and Ireland.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Overview of Role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Senior Specialist, QA will provide operational leadership and quality oversight for the review, approval and release-readiness of clinical and commercial product batches.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The role is responsible for ensuring that batch documentation is complete, accurate, traceable, and compliant with applicable GMP requirements, approved procedures and regulatory commitments before submission to QA for final disposition or QP certification. The person will coordinate batch-release activities across Quality, Manufacturing, Supply Chain, Regulatory Affairs and external manufacturing partners, ensuring that issues are identified, escalated and resolved in a timely manner. The position will also lead process improvements, support inspection readiness and promote high standards of data integrity and Good Documentation Practice across the batch-release process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;11&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Batch Review and Release Readiness&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;o&quot; data-font=&quot;Courier New&quot; data-listid=&quot;11&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1080,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[9675],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;o&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Coordinate the end-to-end QA review of executed batch manufacturing, packaging, testing and release documentation for IMP and Commercial biological batch records.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
