&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DIVERSITY, EQUITY &amp;amp; INCLUSION:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;FREE NOW is an equal opportunity employer and we consider qualified applicants regardless of race, religion, national origin, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability or age. &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We want you to grow and evolve, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dOUL_n8pSGQ&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;bring your true self to work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT FREENOW:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are Freenow, the European taxi app with the broadest multi-mobility offering, available in 9 markets and over 180 cities. Our app gives millions of passengers the freedom to move with a wide choice of services including taxis, private hire vehicles, carsharing, car rental, e-scooters, e-bikes, e-mopeds and public transport. Headquartered in Hamburg and led by our CEO Thomas Zimmermann, we are on a mission to make urban mobility more efficient, sustainable and inclusive. Since July 2025 we have been part of Lyft, a global mobility platform connecting riders and drivers for billions of rides across North America and Europe. Together we are building a more caring and connected world, creating new opportunities for innovation, growth and impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;From Fivetran’s founding until now, our mission has remained the same: to make access to data as simple and reliable as electricity. With Fivetran, customer data arrives in their warehouses, canonical and ready to query, with no engineering or maintenance required. We’re proud that more organizations continue to leverage our technology every day to become truly data-driven.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fivetran and dbt Labs are bringing together two industry-leading companies with a shared mission: helping organizations unlock the full value of their data.Together, we’re delivering the data infrastructure layer that helps organizations move, transform, and trust their data — from the moment data moves, through every transformation, to the context teams and AI systems rely on.Fivetran helps organizations automate data movement across the systems, clouds, engines, and tools they rely on. dbt Labs pioneered analytics engineering, helping teams transform data into reliable, governed insights. Together, we support thousands of organizations as they build a trusted foundation for analytics, AI, and better business decisions.As we bring our teams and technology together, we’re building on the strengths of both companies while continuing to deliver the products and experiences our customers know and trust. It’s an exciting time to join us: we’re creating a company with the scale, talent, and technology to help more organizations put their data to work with greater speed, confidence, and impact.During this transition period, you may see references to both Fivetran and dbt Labs throughout our recruiting process as we integrate our teams, systems, and career sites.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an Account Executive, Enterprise who will be responsible for generating new business pipeline and expansion and closing new customers in the Enterprise segment (Top Accounts in Germany). This includes identifying specific projects where Fivetran + dbt Labs can add value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full-time, remote position based out of Germany.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate new business qualified opportunities by working with Tech Partners, SI Partners, XDRs, going direct outbound on named accounts in territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively pitch the value proposition of Fivetran’s Database replication capabilities along with the Fivetran platform at-large&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage 90-180 day sales cycles with multiple stakeholders and departments to land in an enterprise organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate responsible deals and manage the procurement process with legal, deal desk, and deal champions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop trusted relationships with internal stakeholders and senior decision makers at large organizations who will evangelize Fivetran throughout their company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As part of our commitment to setting new hires up for success, all new sales team members attend a one-week, in person Revenue Bootcamp during their second week at Fivetran. This bootcamp, held at one of our designated company locations, requires travel and is a mandatory part of the onboarding process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of 8 years&#39; experience in new business sales, demonstrating a track record of success in selling to enterprise-level organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have the vision to succeed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan the vision by a strategy through territory and account planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive pipeline generation with ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Land customers as soon as possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sell services to help offload onboarding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in sales within the Data industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capable of effectively utilising both inside and outside sales approaches to secure deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated proficiency in generating new business-qualified opportunities across diverse channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-LA1#LI-REMOTE&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Perks and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% employer-paid medical insurance&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Generous paid time away from work, including paid vacation or flexible/unlimited vacation depending on role and country, plus paid sick time, inclusive parental leave, paid holidays, including a year-end Global Week of Rest, and volunteer days off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RSU stock grants*&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development and training opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company virtual happy hours, free food, and fun team-building activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly cell phone stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to an innovative mental health support platform that offers personalized care and resources in areas such as: therapy, coaching, and self-guided mindfulness exercises for all covered employees and their covered dependents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;May vary by country and worker type - please reach out to your recruiter for more information&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CdawUwjo1Q1B7ghZJ_owdmmHB8VtqhBu?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about Fivetran&#39;s Benefits by Region.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;We’re honored to be &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;valued at over $5.6 billion&lt;/a&gt;, but more importantly, we’re proud of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;core values of Get Stuck In, Do the Right Thing, and One Team, One Dream&lt;/a&gt;. Read about us in&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Forbes&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;Fivetran brings together high-quality talent across the globe to make data access as easy and reliable as electricity for our customers. We value and recognize that our customers benefit from having innovative teams made of people from many backgrounds, experiences, and identities. Fivetran promotes diversity, equity, inclusion &amp;amp; belonging through attracting, recruiting, developing, and retaining a diverse workforce, not only because it is the right thing to do, but because it helps us build a world-class company to better serve our customers, our people and our communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about Fivetran’s culture and what it’s like to be part of the team, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xlhtp4dGh8o&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; and enjoy our video.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about our candidate privacy policy, you can &lt;a href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/candidate-privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;read our statement here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to ensuring that all candidates have an equal opportunity to participate in our interview process. If you require accommodations at any stage of the process due to a disability, medical condition, or any other circumstance, please don&#39;t hesitate to submit your request by filling out this &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/V7k3t4u9j523XkEt6&quot;&gt;form&lt;/a&gt;. We will work with you to provide reasonable accommodations to facilitate your participation and ensure a fair and accessible interview experience. Your request and any information provided will be kept confidential and will not impact your candidacy. We look forward to hearing from you and accommodating your needs to the best of our ability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;The role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re building Nebius Token Factory, an AI inference platform for high-performance, cost-efficient workloads at scale, serving both developers and managed enterprise customers. As a Senior/Principal Product Manager, Inference Platform, you’ll join a team of PMs under the Inference Platform lead and own a core platform stream end to end, from strategy and roadmap to launch and adoption. The scope evolves quickly with the market (new models, modalities, hardware and customer needs), with a strong emphasis on scalability and reliability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;572&quot; data-local-id=&quot;798c65502881&quot;&gt;Own the roadmap and outcomes for a part of the inference platform, aligning several cross-functional engineering teams across public API, routing, performance, reliability and enterprise enablement features.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;783&quot; data-local-id=&quot;15c328d33459&quot;&gt;Work with engineering and research to make inference more scalable, reliable and cost-efficient, and turn that into capabilities customers can depend on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;940&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9761873c098b&quot;&gt;Stay close to customers through research, interviews and hands-on PoCs, especially in managed enterprise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1049&quot; data-local-id=&quot;63a94cd52700&quot;&gt;Track the market: open-source models, inference economics, and how businesses actually apply AI. Turn what you see into product bets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;We expect you to have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1198&quot; data-local-id=&quot;635cc91c8e1f&quot;&gt;Experience shipping technical platform products, with the seniority to lead work across multiple engineering teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1317&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7f50a2944594&quot;&gt;Real technical depth in how AI inference works, including model serving, distributed systems and production infrastructure. You think problems through yourself rather than relying on engineers to define them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1529&quot; data-local-id=&quot;31410d89334a&quot;&gt;Strong communication and expectations management across engineering, research, sales, support and leadership. You write crisp PRDs, RFCs and release notes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1688&quot; data-local-id=&quot;eb3a4d3203ac&quot;&gt;B2B/enterprise experience with technical buyers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1740&quot; data-local-id=&quot;cbb4752491c6&quot;&gt;Comfort with ambiguity and shifting scope.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and innovative culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work on impactful AI projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International environment and talented teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s it like to work at Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fast moving&amp;nbsp;- Bold thinking&amp;nbsp;- Constant growth&amp;nbsp;- Meaningful impact&amp;nbsp;- Trust and real ownership&amp;nbsp;- Opportunity to shape the future of AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is an equal opportunity employer. We are committed to fostering an inclusive and diverse workplace and to providing equal employment opportunities in all aspects of employment. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, ancestry, age, disability, genetic information, marital status, veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must be authorized to work in the country in which they apply and will be required to provide proof of employment eligibility as a condition of hire.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need accommodations during the application process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pure Storage is seeking a Strategic Accounts Account Executive to accelerate growth of the Portworx platform across Strategic Telco accounts in EMEA. You will own a small number of named Telco customers and prospects, build and execute multi year account plans, and drive platform adoption with a focus on business outcomes such as resilience, risk reduction, faster application delivery, and operational efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with cross functional teams across Pure and Portworx, including Systems Engineering, Customer Experience, Marketing, Partner teams, Product, and field leadership. This is a high impact individual contributor role with a strong emphasis on strategic planning, disciplined execution, and customer intimacy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and grow a portfolio of named Strategic Telco accounts, delivering against annual and multi year revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute account plans that map buying centres, application priorities, Kubernetes roadmaps, and transformation programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop executive relationships across CIO, CTO, CISO, Head of Infrastructure, Platform Engineering, SRE, and Application leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex sales cycles from discovery through close, including security, risk, procurement, architecture review, and legal processes common in Telco.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position Portworx around measurable outcomes: application resilience, ransomware recovery, data protection, regulatory compliance, cloud portability, and modernisation at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate account teams and partner ecosystems, including GSIs, cloud providers, and regional partners, to drive pipeline creation and deal execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run a rigorous, value based sales process tailored to cloud native software, with accurate forecasting and strong hygiene in Salesforce and forecasting tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Customer Experience to expand adoption post sale, identify expansion triggers, and build customer advocacy within the Telco community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of competitive dynamics in Kubernetes data services, backup and recovery, and container storage, using insights to sharpen strategy and messaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Portworx in customer meetings and relevant industry events, with a field first mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven enterprise software sales experience, with a track record of closing and expanding high value, multi stakeholder deals in large organisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience selling into Telco, with an understanding of procurement, governance, risk, and security requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grasp of cloud native concepts and the Kubernetes ecosystem, plus the ability to credibly engage architects and platform teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to both technical and executive stakeholders, translating technical capabilities into business value and risk outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disciplined pipeline generation, qualification, deal management, and forecasting, with strong operational habits in SFDC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working in a matrixed environment, influencing cross functional teams without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and programme management skills, with clear account planning and stakeholder alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A customer first mindset and a bias for action, with resilience and curiosity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT FROM US:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: We celebrate those who think critically, like a challenge, and aspire to be trailblazers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: We give you the space and support to grow along with us and to contribute to something meaningful. We have been named Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in Technology™, Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in the Bay Area™, and certified as a Great Place to Work®!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: We build each other up and set aside ego for the greater good.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And because we understand the value of bringing your full and best self to work, we offer a variety of perks to manage a healthy balance, including flexible time off, wellness resources, and company-sponsored team events. Check out &lt;a href=&quot;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/&quot;&gt;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/ &lt;/a&gt;for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ACCOMMODATIONS AND ACCESSIBILITY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates with disabilities may request accommodations for all aspects of our hiring process. For more on this, contact us at &lt;a ---------- if you’re invited to an interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR COMMITMENT TO A STRONG AND INCLUSIVE TEAM:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re forging a future where everyone finds their rightful place and where every voice matters. Where uniqueness isn’t just accepted but embraced. That’s why we are committed to fostering the growth and development of every person, cultivating a sense of community through our Employee Resource Groups and advocating for inclusive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, sexual stereotypes, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or any other characteristic legally protected by the laws of the jurisdiction in which you are being considered for hire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us and bring your best.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring your bold.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure and simple.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Report To:&lt;/strong&gt; Consulting Delivery manager&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Status:&lt;/strong&gt; Full Time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; Up to £110,000 + Benefits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who is ControlPlane?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ControlPlane is a London-headquartered consultancy specialising in cloud-native, Kubernetes, and open-source security solutions. Our expertise lies in helping organisations adopt and secure complex cloud infrastructures by implementing security measures that are &quot;secure-by-design&quot; and &quot;secure-by-default.&quot; This engineering excellence drives ControlPlane deep into cybersecurity, providing services like zero-trust architectures, threat modeling, supply chain security, and platform engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are acclaimed for our work in highly regulated industries, such as finance, healthcare, and national infrastructure. We help clients consume next-generation and open-source projects safely and securely. In addition to consulting, we are active contributors to the open-source community supporting projects like Flux CD, OpenBao, and FINOS AI Readiness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For in a Cloud Native Consultant&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for cloud native engineers and consultants at all levels to represent the technical and cultural values of ControlPlane, leading our customers by example in the complex and fast-changing world of cloud native technology. You will perform a mix of client consulting, working on internal labs projects, and contributing to Open Source projects on ControlPlane’s behalf.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a remote position, but we invite you to spend time in person at our London office: this is optional and we aim to be entirely flexible to your needs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of the engineering team we may ask you to be involved in pre-sales or business development activities to support the ongoing growth of our organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role, Responsibilities and Requirements of Our Cloud Native Consultant&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring (Essential):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience and a deep understanding of Kubernetes using GKE, EKS or OpenShift&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with one or more cloud providers and Infrastructure as Code tools and practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with GitOps tooling such as FluxCD or ArgoCD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Development experience with Golang, Python, or Java&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of CI/CD best practices and a range of build tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud security awareness and a desire to build hardened systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer facing/Consulting experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring (Desirable):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SPIFFE/SPIRE&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Hashicorp Vault/OpenBao&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Zero Trust Architectures, tools and practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ControlPlane is a dynamic, cutting-edge and passionate business to work for. Our employees are at the heart of our business, which means we care about our culture, our people and their progression.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alongside this, as a colleague you will have the following benefits:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous and competitive salary + Bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;33 days of paid holiday, including paid leave for the standard 8 UK Bank Holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical and Dental Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An individual training budget for personal development, including but not limited to:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conferences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training (books, courses, coaching, as well as internal training which is of course included beyond budget)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for technical practitioners who can work with our clients and the team to deliver these projects and help establish ControlPlane as a world-class technical thought leader.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe our peers are equally as important as the technology we use. We’re looking for people of the highest personal calibre, quietly confident, with a good work ethic, keenness to learn, emotional maturity and respect, who know that “we” is more than “me”, and who embrace human diversity of all kinds. As we grow you will help us to build a company culture of which we can all be proud. If you espouse these values, we want you!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NOTE FOR RECRUITMENT AGENCIES:&lt;/strong&gt; Please do not call or email our team speculatively; we do not accept unsolicited CVs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-redactor-style-cache=&quot;user-select: auto;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Report To:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Delivery Manager&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Remote and/or London (right to work in UK or EU required)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Status:&lt;/strong&gt; Full Time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; Up to £85,000 + Benefits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who is ControlPlane?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ControlPlane is a London headquartered consultancy specialising in cloud-native, Kubernetes, and open source solutions. Our expertise lies in helping organisations adopt and secure complex cloud infrastructures by implementing security measures that are &quot;secure-by-design&quot; and &quot;secure-by-default.&quot; This engineering excellence has driven ControlPlane deeper into cybersecurity providing services like threat modelling, penetration testing, and supply chain security to ensure robust protection against cyberattacks in containerised and cloud-native environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are acclaimed for our contributions to securing highly regulated industries, such as finance, healthcare, and national infrastructure. We help businesses improve their security posture through services like DevSecOps consulting, zero-trust architectures, and platform engineering. ControlPlane also focuses on advancing best practices in the Kubernetes ecosystem, offering specialised training and community engagement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our clients range from multinational banks to tech giants and public clouds, where we assist with both security and operational needs. In addition to consulting, we are active in the open source community, supporting projects like Flux CD and providing security tools for Kubernetes environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over the coming years you’ll see us retain our focus on solving difficult problems for clients with intense security controls using pragmatic, real world solutions. Taking our extensive R&amp;amp;D to help organisations consume next generation and open source projects safely and securely - that might be extending our work with FINOS AI Readiness or the overhaul of open source supply chain security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For in a Cloud Native Security Consultant&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for Cloud Native Security consultants to represent the technical and cultural values of ControlPlane, leading our customers by example in the complex and fast-changing world of cloud native technology. You will perform a mix of client consulting, working on internal labs projects, and contributing to Open Source projects on ControlPlane’s behalf.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There is no perfect candidate for this role. As we look to extend our cloud native security team we welcome engineers and architects with a diverse range of capabilities, experiences and backgrounds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are SANS authors (SEC584) and believe strongly in team learning and collaboration. Candidates with an aptitude to learn are preferred, and we provide full training for the newest cloud technologies that our customers rely on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a unique job role within a successful start-up company where you will have the chance to make a positive impact, learn, grow and work with great colleagues who consistently challenge the status quo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Roles, Responsibilities and Requirements of Our Cloud Native Security Consultant:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Threat Modelling and Cloud Native Security architectures (AWS, GCP, Azure)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kubernetes and container experience (some of EKS, GKE, AKS, OpenShift, and container runtimes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of software supply chain security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DevSecOps principles and Engineering practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CI/CD experience, automating security tests, and hardening pipelines&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of security tooling from enterprise tools such as Aqua, Prisma, Sysdig, Lacework, etc to Open Source tools such as falco, kube-hunter, and kube-bench.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge and experience using hardening guides, compliance and risk management standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;A desire to learn, or experience with:&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CLI tooling in any of the above technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Golang or Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Terraform and cloud infrastructure best practices (IaC, regulated systems)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Benefits&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ControlPlane is a dynamic, cutting edge and passionate business for which to work. Our employees are the heart of our business, which means we care about our company culture and our employees’ wellbeing and progression. Alongside this, as our colleague you will have the following benefits:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous and competitive salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;33 days of paid holiday, including paid leave for the standard 8 UK Bank Holidays&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An individual training budget for personal development, including but not limited to:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conferences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training (books, courses, coaching, as well as internal training which is of course included beyond budget)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe our peers are equally as important as the technology we use. We’re looking for people of the highest personal calibre, quietly confident, with a good work ethic, keenness to learn, emotional maturity and respect, who know that “we” is more than “me”, and who embrace human diversity of all kinds. As we grow you will help us to build a company culture of which we can all be proud. If you espouse these values, we want you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NOTE FOR RECRUITMENT AGENCIES:&lt;/strong&gt; Please do not call or email our team speculatively, we do not accept unsolicited CVs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Every Identity, from AI to Human&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Identity is the key to unlocking the potential of AI. Okta secures AI by building the trusted, neutral infrastructure that enables organizations to safely embrace this new era. This work requires a relentless drive to solve complex challenges with real-world stakes. We are looking for builders and owners who operate with speed and urgency and execute with excellence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to do career-defining work. We&#39;re all in on this mission. If you are too, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Okta: The World’s Identity Company™&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Okta &amp;amp; The TAM Team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Okta is the leader in Identity management and The World’s Identity Company™. Our mission is to build a more secure world by providing a neutral, powerful, and extensible platform that puts identity at the heart of the modern tech stack—securing customers, employees, partners, and AI agents. Two-thirds of the Fortune 100 trust Okta to power their identity journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Technical Account Management (TAM) team is a global group of Okta product experts dedicated to driving long-term customer success. As a Senior TAM within our Strategic Workforce Identity segment, you will serve as the premier technical advisor and advocate for some of our largest enterprise customers (across Financial Services, Healthcare, Public Sector, and more), helping them elevate their technical maturity and maximize their Okta investment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;1. Strategic Customer Partnership &amp;amp; Influence&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trusted Advisor: Build deep, executive-level relationships, serving as the primary technical point of contact for customer identity owners and IT leadership (up to CxO).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Roadmapping: Architect tailored technical success plans aligned with customer business objectives to drive platform adoption and secure Okta against competitive displacement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adoption &amp;amp; Expansion: Guide customers in expanding their Okta footprint across critical Workforce solutions, continuously improving their overall security posture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;2. Complex Problem Resolution &amp;amp; Advocacy&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Escalation Lead: Independently manage and resolve highly complex customer technical escalations, collaborating with Customer Success Managers (CSMs) as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Risk Mitigation: Proactively identify technical roadblocks, design robust mitigation plans, and drive them to resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Advocacy: Champion customer needs internally by collaborating with Okta Engineering, Product, and Support teams to influence product direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;3. Thought Leadership &amp;amp; Team Enablement&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge Sharing: Deliver workshops, best practice sessions, and vertical-specific insights to enhance customer security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Asset Creation: Author repeatable technical strategies and assets to level up the global TAM organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentorship: Actively mentor and develop peer TAMs to upskill technical capabilities across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Workforce Identity Solutions You Will Support&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will provide deep technical guidance across Okta&#39;s comprehensive Workforce Identity lifecycle:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IAM: SSO, Adaptive MFA, Device Access, API Access Management, Secure Partner Access, Access Gateway, and Universal Directory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IGA: Lifecycle Management and Okta Identity Governance (OIG).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PAM: Privileged Access Management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ITDR: Identity Security Posture Management and Identity Threat Protection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring to the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Education&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of related professional IT experience (or 6+ years with a Master’s degree).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience as a TAM, Technical Consultant, Solution Architect, or Product Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience working with Identity &amp;amp; Access Management (IAM) solutions or related security technologies is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education: BA/BS/MS in Computer Science, IT, or a related discipline (or equivalent experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certifications: Okta Certified, CISSP, or equivalent certifications are highly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Technical Mastery (Workforce Identity Focus)&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Okta Architecture: Extensive hands-on proficiency mapping Okta feature sets to complex enterprise architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Federation Protocols: Strong understanding of modern identity protocols (SAML 2.0, OAuth, OpenID Connect, WS-Fed).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid Environments: Experience integrating legacy/non-standard applications that do not support modern federation protocols.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lifecycle &amp;amp; Provisioning: Deep knowledge of lifecycle management, automated provisioning, and integrations (e.g., SCIM, Okta Workflows, HR-driven provisioning, Active Directory).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SaaS Ecosystems: Familiarity deploying and securing key SaaS platforms (O365, Salesforce, Workday, Box).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Code Proficiency: Ability to read and modify existing quickstarts, code samples, or scripts to match customer requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Leadership&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive Presence: Exceptional communication skills with a proven ability to translate highly technical concepts into clear business outcomes for CxO-level audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Boundary Setting: Skilled at managing expectations, tracking portfolio health metrics, and setting healthy boundaries with internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;xt0psk2 x1ghz6dp x1717udv x1wty727 x4gjf66 x15eiy0f x1lziwak x15472z4 x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1s688f x14rh7hd xdj266r&quot; data-d-component=&quot;text&quot; data-d-inline=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;Location&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;Language&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;Requirements:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;This&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;is&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;hybrid&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;role,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;open&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;to&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;candidates&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;based&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;London,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;Munich,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;Paris,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;or&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;Warsaw.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;Fluency&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;both&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;German&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;English&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;is&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;mandatory.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-MM1&lt;br&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;br&gt;P26230_3599521&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Okta Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://rewards.okta.com&quot;&gt;Supporting Your Well-Being&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/okta-for-good/&quot;&gt;Driving Social Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/talent-connection-community/&quot;&gt;Developing Talent and Fostering Connection + Community&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are intentional about connection. Our global community, spanning over 20 offices worldwide, is united by a drive to innovate. Your journey begins with an immersive, in-person onboarding experience designed to accelerate your impact and connect you to our mission and team from day one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Okta is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, ancestry, marital status, age, physical or mental disability, or status as a protected veteran. We also consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and convictions records, consistent with applicable laws.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If reasonable accommodation is needed to complete any part of the job application, interview process, or onboarding please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1EfiEYZrIyhA2X4Fijk0R3RKYOzNoS3wtvyM4nhbZnXE/edit&quot;&gt;use this Form&lt;/a&gt; to request an accommodation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Notice for New York City Applicants &amp;amp; Employees: Okta may use Automated Employment Decision Tools (AEDT), as defined by New York City Local Law 144, that use artificial intelligence, machine learning, or other automated processes to assist in our recruitment and hiring process. In accordance with NYC Local Law 144, if you are an applicant or employee residing in New York City, please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://talent.okta.com/new-york-city-aedt-notice.html&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to view our full NYC AEDT Notice.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h1&gt;Localization Operations Specialist (Contractor)&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Level:&lt;/strong&gt; Mid-level contractor&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Localization&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; London / Remote or Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OpenTable’s Localization team helps make our products, content and customer experiences work naturally across global markets. As a Localization Operations Specialist, you will support the daily localization operation end to end, making sure content moves smoothly from intake to delivery, issues are resolved quickly and workflows continue to improve as we scale internationally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on generalist role for someone who can move comfortably between project coordination, localization technology, integrations, strings management and troubleshooting. You will work with Product, Engineering, Design, Marketing, CRM, Support, external language partners and other teams across OpenTable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage localization requests from scoping and preparation through translation, review, QA and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate priorities, deadlines, dependencies, stakeholders and external language resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate and improve localization workflows across tools and integrations, including systems such as Figma, Braze and similar platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate issues such as missing strings, failed syncs, incorrect statuses, formatting problems, placeholders and duplicate content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with product strings, keys, resource files, locales, branches, versions and context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support AI-enabled localization workflows, including AI translation, content generation, post-editing, quality checks and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify recurring problems and turn them into better documentation, templates, automation or processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in localization operations, localization project coordination, translation technology or content operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical understanding of the localization lifecycle from source preparation through delivery and QA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using a translation management system, localization platform or related content workflow tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of product strings and localization concepts such as keys, placeholders, resource files, locales, branches and versions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing multiple projects, stakeholders and deadlines in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong troubleshooting and problem-solving skills, with the ability to investigate unclear or technical issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with integrations, connectors, APIs, imports/exports or system-to-system handoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication skills and strong attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, curious and solution-oriented mindset; you look for ways to make work simpler, faster and more reliable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with evolving processes, new tools and changing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Plus to have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Phrase or another modern translation management platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Figma, Braze, GitHub, Jira, CMS platforms or customer communication systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with LLMs, AI translation, machine translation post-editing, quality estimation, prompt design or AI features in localization tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic technical fluency with JSON, CSV, XML, HTML, resource files or API documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting product, UX, marketing, CRM, support, SEO or multimedia localization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with language service providers, linguists or vendor delivery teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with internationalization topics such as pluralization, text expansion, date and number formats, currencies and locale-specific requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using spreadsheets, dashboards or reporting to monitor localization performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is a strong fit for a localization “jack of all trades”: someone operationally dependable, technically curious, comfortable getting into the detail and relentless about finding a workable solution. The scope reflects OpenTable’s move toward more integrated, automated and AI-enabled localization operations as international demand grows.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Zscaler (NASDAQ: ZS) accelerates digital transformation so customers can be more agile, efficient, resilient, and secure. The Zscaler Zero Trust Exchange platform protects thousands of customers from cyberattacks and data loss by securely connecting users, devices, and applications in any location. Distributed across 200+ public data centers globally and thousands of private sites at the edge, the SASE-based Zero Trust Exchange is the world’s largest in-line cloud security platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the future of work is Human + AI and are building an AI-native enterprise where human potential is amplified by machine intelligence to solve the world’s hardest security challenges. Driven by deep customer obsession, we are committed to the mission, outcome, and to each other. We bring these commitments to life through three core behaviors: ownership and collaboration, trust through outcomes and impact, and a challenge culture with ongoing feedback. Ready to make an impact at the company pioneering security transformation in the AI era? Join us at Zscaler.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Staff Backend Developer to join our Threat Intelligence team. This is a remote role based anywhere in the UK, reporting to the Sr. Director, Threat Intelligence in the Threat Intelligence department. In this critical role, you will design, implement, and maintain high-performance backend systems. You will collaborate closely with our malware reverse engineering team to build a sophisticated platform that enhances Zscaler’s core threat detection capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable data pipelines and design systems that ingest, process, and index large volumes of documents and data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take the lead on improving development best practices across the team, championing standards for code reviews, testing, observability, and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and address performance bottlenecks to ensure the overall efficiency and reliability of the applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop robust, reliable backend APIs and services by creating, testing, and measuring backend workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are (Success Profile)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in ambiguity. You&#39;re comfortable building the path as you walk it. You thrive in a dynamic environment, seeing ambiguity not as a hindrance, but as the raw material to build something meaningful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a problem-solver. You seek out challenges because you are energized by finding solutions, knowing that solving the hard problems delivers the biggest impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a positive force. You approach hard problems with constructive energy and a &#39;can-do&#39; spirit that is contagious, inspiring your team to stay focused on the solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a pragmatic builder. You are obsessed with creating, iterating, and shipping. You aren&#39;t afraid to roll up your sleeves and build the first version yourself, balancing the drive for technical excellence with the need to deliver value to users quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You lead with integrity. You do the right thing, even when it’s hard. You hold yourself and others to a high standard of accountability and build trust by matching your words with consistent, transparent action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking for (Minimum Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foundational understanding of AI/ML technologies and experience leveraging, securing, or positioning AI-driven solutions to optimize outcomes within your functional domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience as a backend developer or in a similar professional role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Python, PostgreSQL, Redis, and distributed task queue systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of backend databases, data storage, and RESTful API design and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in relational database design, implementation, SQL query optimization, and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Will Make You Stand Out (Preferred Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to leverage AI technologies and LLM workflows to automate backend data processing and enhance threat detection systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience building engineering solutions for malware automation and threat detection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in Django internals, containerization with Kubernetes, and full-text search engines like Elasticsearch, Meilisearch, or Typesense.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-REMOTE #LI-MM8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;At Zscaler, we are committed to building a team that reflects the communities we serve and the customers we work with. We foster an inclusive environment that values all backgrounds and perspectives, emphasizing collaboration and belonging. Join us in our mission to make doing business seamless and secure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Benefits program is one of the most important ways we support our employees. Zscaler proudly offers comprehensive and inclusive benefits to meet the diverse needs of our employees and their families throughout their life stages, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various health plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off plans for vacation and sick time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-office perks, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Learn more about Zscaler&#39;s hybrid working model and benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.zscaler.com/candidate-resource-hub&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this role, you adhere to applicable laws, regulations, and Zscaler policies, including those related to security and privacy standards and guidelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing equal employment opportunities to all individuals. We strive to create a workplace where employees are treated with respect and have the chance to succeed. All qualified applicants will be considered for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy or related medical conditions), age, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, genetic information, disability status, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws. &lt;em&gt;See more information by clicking on the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Know Your Rights: Workplace Discrimination is Illegal &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;link.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pay Transparency&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler complies with all applicable federal, state, and local pay transparency rules.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing reasonable support (called accommodations or adjustments) in our recruiting processes for candidates who are differently abled, have long term conditions, mental health conditions or sincerely held religious beliefs, or who are neurodivergent or require pregnancy-related support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Welcome to Planet. We believe in using space to help life on Earth.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet designs, builds, and operates the largest constellation of imaging satellites in history. This constellation delivers an unprecedented dataset of empirical information via a revolutionary cloud-based platform to authoritative figures in commercial, environmental, and humanitarian sectors. We are both a space company and data company all rolled into one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customers and users across the globe use Planet&#39;s data to develop new technologies, drive revenue, power research, and solve our world’s toughest obstacles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we control every component of hardware design, manufacturing, data processing, and software engineering, our office is a truly inspiring mix of experts from a variety of domains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a people-centric approach toward culture and community and we strive to iterate in a way that puts our team members first and prepares our company for growth. Join Planet and be a part of our mission to change the way people see the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet is a global company with employees working remotely world wide and joining us from offices in San Francisco, Washington DC, Germany, Austria, Slovenia, and The Netherlands.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director of Sales, Europe will be responsible for leading our regional sales organization, driving Planet’s Go-To-Market (GTM) strategy, and accelerating revenue growth across national security, defense, and government sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a people manager and business leader, you will own the regional revenue target, drive executive alignment, and establish disciplined pipeline governance to ensure forecast predictability. You will be responsible for building, mentoring, and coaching a team of direct reports—fostering a culture of accountability, operational excellence, and continuous professional development. In addition to team development, you will architect large-scale strategic programs, lead high-stakes commercial negotiations, and scale partner ecosystems to penetrate priority markets. Above all, you will leverage your leadership experience to elevate Planet’s market presence across NATO and the Nordics in alignment with our mission to see change and change the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is an accomplished sales leader with deep defense domain expertise and a track record of managing high-performing teams across Alliance structures and Northern European markets. You will bring an established executive network spanning NATO HQ, allied Defense Ministries, Armed Forces Commands, Intelligence Agencies, and key European Prime Contractors/System Integrators. Combining strategic commercial acumen with an understanding of collective defense and national security priorities, you will position Planet as a trusted capability provider for mission-critical operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;This is a full-time, remote position based in the United Kingdom or Germany. If located near an office, you are expected to work from that office 3 days per week.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact You’ll Own:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Strategic Revenue Growth: Own and execute a result-oriented Go-To-Market (GTM) strategy to build, negotiate, and close high-value, complex deals across sovereign defense and government sectors, consistently hitting or exceeding regional quota targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecast Governance &amp;amp; Predictability: Maintain rigorous pipeline hygiene (Salesforce.com) and deliver accurate, data-driven revenue forecasts to executive leadership through disciplined deal inspection and pipeline management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capture Strategy &amp;amp; Value Messaging: Engineer tailored capture strategies and high-impact executive narratives that align with agency-level priorities, resonate with key decision-makers, and win competitive procurements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage, Coach &amp;amp; Empower: Build, mentor, and scale a high-performing sales team, establishing a culture of accountability, operational excellence, and continuous professional development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Methodology Alignment: Train and inspect direct reports on core sales methodologies and capture frameworks (e.g., MEDDPICC, Shipley), coaching them on deal qualification, stakeholder mapping, and win strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Talent Bench &amp;amp; Scaling: Proactively recruit, onboard, and retain elite commercial and defense-domain talent to build a solid talent bench as the regional footprint expands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Matrix Alignment: Orchestrate seamless collaboration across internal matrix teams including Government Affairs, Product, Engineering, and Field Marketing to align corporate capabilities with regional market opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Post-Sales Win Alignment: Partner closely with Pre-Sales/Solutions Engineering to secure technical wins, and collaborate with Post-Sales teams to ensure flawless customer onboarding, retention, and long-term expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deal Cadence &amp;amp; Executive Escalation: Communicate deal velocity transparently across internal business units, mobilizing executive sponsorship and cross-functional support when needed to de-risk complex pursuits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of relevant work experience and 6+ years supervisory / leadership experience, with a track record of driving revenue growth, building high-performing teams, and consistently exceeding multi-million-dollar individual and team quotas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to recruit, mentor, and retain top-tier talent, instilling a high-accountability culture and coaching direct reports through complex, multi-year deal cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience establishing pipeline discipline, accurate revenue forecasting, and thorough deal inspection using Salesforce.com and modern sales methodologies (e.g., MEDDPICC).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive background navigating complex government, NATO, and defense procurement frameworks (e.g., NCI Agency, FMS/DCS, national MoD acquisition bodies) across Northern Europe and Allied Command structures, with a focus on key Nordic nations (Sweden, Finland, Norway, Denmark).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An established, C-level network across Defense Ministries, Intelligence Agencies, Allied Commands, and European Defense Primes / System Integrators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of how commercial technology and advanced data feeds support Allied posture, sovereign defense, intelligence, and ISR missions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Success collaborating across internal matrixed teams (Government Affairs, Product, Engineering, Legal) to align corporate capabilities with regional opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strategic, self-directed leader with commercial judgment, adept at leading teams through dynamic, high-growth, or startup-like market environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d; background-color: #f8f8f8;&quot;&gt;Professional working proficiency in English, the language of the company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You Stand Out:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of progressive sales leadership and enterprise business development experience within the defense, national security, or government technology sectors, with a track record of building high-performing teams and consistently exceeding revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operational understanding of NATO defense priorities, Nordic security dynamics, joint acquisition processes, and agency decision-making across Allied Ministries of Defense and Tier-1 Defense Primes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing complex, multi-year deal cycles, with the ability to lead sales teams through disciplined capture frameworks, pipeline governance, and accurate revenue forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional proficiency in a Nordic language (Swedish, Finnish, Norwegian, Danish) is a plus for engaging senior government ministers, military command leadership, and internal executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Deadline:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;11:45p / 23:45 CET on the date stated below. Applications are reviewed on a rolling basis. This posting may be removed earlier than projected if a suitable pool of applications has been received. For this reason, we recommend applying as soon as you are able to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Export Control Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Planet Labs Germany GmbH is authorized to receive U.S. export-controlled information at Planet under an export license issued by the Bureau of Industry and Security. This position requires access to U.S. and German/EU export-controlled information, and as such, employment (or hiring of a contractor) is contingent upon the candidate’s ability to access all applicable export-controlled information without additional export licensing being required by German, EU, or U.S. authorities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits While Working at Planet:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;These offerings are dependent on employment type and geographical location, based upon applicable law or company policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid time off including vacation, holidays and company-wide days off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Wellness Program&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly Phone and Internet Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition Reimbursement and access to LinkedIn Learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volunteering Paid Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The expected starting gross salary range for this role is listed below. Individual placement within this range is determined objectively based on gender-neutral criteria such as your skills, qualifications, and professional experience. This position may also be eligible for discretionary bonuses and/or equity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to the salary range listed below, this role is also eligible to receive commission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;sub&gt;#LI-REMOTE&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;United Kingdom Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£93,500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£116,850 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, we will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why we care so much about Belonging.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We’re dedicated to helping the whole Planet, and to do that we must strive to represent all of it within each of our offices and on all of our teams. That’s why Planet is guided by an ultimate north star of Belonging—dreaming big as we approach our ongoing work.&amp;nbsp; If this job intrigues you, but you’re thinking you might not have all the qualifications, please... do apply!&amp;nbsp; At Planet, we are looking for well-rounded people from around the world who can contribute to more ways than just what is listed in this job description.&amp;nbsp; We don’t just fill positions, we aspire to fulfill people’s careers, most excited about folks who are motivated by our underlying humanitarian efforts.&amp;nbsp; We are a few orbits around the sun before we get to where we want to be, so we hope you’re excited to come along for the ride.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EEO statement: &lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Planet is committed to building a community where everyone belongs and we invite people from all backgrounds to apply. Planet is an equal opportunity employer, and committed to providing employment opportunities regardless of race, religious creed, color, national origin, ancestry, physical disability, mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, pregnancy, childbirth and breastfeeding, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other protected classification, in accordance with applicable federal, state, and local laws. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12.pdf&quot;&gt;Know Your Rights.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Planet is an inclusive community and we know that everyone has their own needs. If you have a disability or special need that requires accommodation during the hiring process, please reach out to ----- or contact your recruiter with your request. Your message will be confidential and we will be happy to assist you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;: By clicking &quot;Apply Now&quot; at the top of this job posting, I acknowledge that I have read the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.planet.com/privacy/#california&quot;&gt;Planet Data Privacy Notice for California Staff Members and Applicants&lt;/a&gt;, and hereby consent to the collection, processing, use, and storage of my personal information as described therein.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy (European Applicants):&lt;/strong&gt; By clicking &quot;Apply Now&quot; at the top of this job posting, I acknowledge that I have read the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.planet.com/privacy/&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice GDPR Planet Labs Europe&lt;/a&gt;, and hereby consent to the collection, processing, use, and storage of my personal information as described therein.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI in Our Interviewing Process&lt;/strong&gt;: Planet is committed to providing an exceptional interview experience for all candidates. We currently use &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.metaview.ai/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Metaview&lt;/a&gt; to better focus on candidates and less on trying to capture notes. As such, with the candidate&#39;s consent, select interviews may be recorded and include a &quot;Planet AI Notetaker&quot; for transcription and summarization purposes. Should an interview involve use of AI interview technologies, the candidate will receive notification and have the ability to opt out both in advance and/or real-time. Opting out will not affect one&#39;s candidacy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate AI Policy&lt;/strong&gt;: Planet embraces Artificial Intelligence (AI) tools, and we encourage its responsible use. We understand that candidates may use various resources, including AI tools, to &lt;em&gt;prepare&lt;/em&gt; for interviews and assessments. However, &lt;em&gt;during any live interview stage or when actively completing assessments for this position, the use of AI tools—e.g. Large Language Models (LLMs), deep fake technology, etc.—is strictly prohibited unless explicitly prompted by an interviewer or assessment instructions&lt;/em&gt;. If you are unsure about acceptable use, please contact your recruiter for clarification. If an AI tool or similar technology is desired as an accommodation, please contact ----- with your request for assistance. Your message will be confidential, and we will be happy to assist you. Violation of this policy may result in disqualification of your application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Upsun&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Upsun is the cloud application platform humans and robots love. It’s built for hybrid teams, where AI agents write and test code and people focus on the problems that really matter. Developers, DevOps engineers, and platform teams use Upsun to build, ship, and scale with confidence, without wrestling with backend infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Upsun Dispatch, our newest offering, brings that same idea to the whole team. It’s the platform for governed collaboration between AI agents and cross-functional humans. Agents handle the volume in isolated sandboxes. People make the decisions that matter, with every approval and every cost on the record.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We give you your time back. You get:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Predictable performance, even at scale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Secure, compliant environments by default&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Real-time observability and profiling built in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Cloning, configuration, and provisioning in seconds&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AI-ready features that plug directly into your stack&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The name says it all. “Up” stands for uptime, reliability, and acceleration. “Sun” reflects our follow-the-sun support: a 24x7, globally distributed team keeping the lights on while you rest. We believe software should power brighter solutions and greater innovation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Upsunners are a remote, global team, and we thrive in a multicultural one. We’re committed to open source and an open, welcoming environment, and our people span the whole experience spectrum. What ties us together is curiosity, a thirst for knowledge, and an eagerness for new ideas and cultures. We believe we can build anything together when the environment frees you to do your best work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our values:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;🌿 We make a positive impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;✨ We aim for the stars.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;💚 We care for each other.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact of a Director, Product-Led Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As Director, PLG, you’ll lead the strategy, execution, and commercial success of Upsun’s product-led revenue engine. Upsun is expanding its portfolio with &lt;strong&gt;Upsun Dispatch&lt;/strong&gt;, a strategic new offer that joins Upsun Cloud, and this role will turn that expansion into measurable growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Reporting directly to the Chief Marketing Officer, you will own the revenue target for product-led experiences, building a scalable engine across developer recruitment, freemium conversion, and customer retention. Working at the intersection of Marketing, Product Management, and Engineering, you will bridge technical platform capabilities with market-driven execution to scale Upsun’s global footprint.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to expect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own product-led revenue:&lt;/strong&gt; Be accountable for ARR from self-serve experiences, from first signup through conversion, expansion, and retention.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive growth goals:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and execute PLG programs to achieve clear top-line ARR milestones and hit aggressive user acquisition targets with specific focus in Europe and North America.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect growth and product:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with the Head of Growth (Marketing), Head of User Acquisition and Conversion (Marketing)&amp;nbsp; and Upsun Dispatch Product Managers (Product/Engineering) to translate product strategy into measurable customer and business outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimize the funnel:&lt;/strong&gt; Define in-product monetization levers, optimize self-service funnels, and partner with Sales to refine Product-Led Sales (PLS) handoffs for enterprise accounts.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build tight feedback loops:&lt;/strong&gt; Analyze intent data, user behavior, and churn metrics to continuously iterate on user onboarding, NPS, and lifetime value.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PLG and growth leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; A track record as a Senior Product Manager or Director with growth and commercial revenue responsibilities at a developer-focused, SaaS, or cloud platform company driven primarily by a PLG model.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic judgment:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to turn complex developer platform capabilities into intuitive self-service user experiences that drive clear, measurable business value.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional execution:&lt;/strong&gt; A record of leading cross-functional growth initiatives across Marketing, Product Management, and Engineering.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-driven approach:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on depth in growth analytics, conversion funnels, freemium-to-paid activation, and retention.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Developer and AI fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Practical understanding of modern developer workflows, cloud infrastructure, and how AI-assisted development tools are reshaping user expectations.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dual-funnel experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Running both self-serve funnels (PLG) and enterprise sales handoffs (PLS).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform background:&lt;/strong&gt; Cloud infrastructure, PaaS, DevOps, or developer platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global scale: &lt;/strong&gt;Scaling product-led revenue across remote-first, international teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where we hire&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At Upsun, remote work isn&#39;t just a trend - it&#39;s our foundation. The freedom of remote work with the support of a diverse, global team has been our successful model for over a decade. Our culture celebrates flexibility and collaboration, and while we have team members in over 30 countries around the globe, we are currently focused on hiring for this role in &lt;strong&gt;Canada, France, Germany, Spain, the United Kingdom, and the United States&lt;/strong&gt;. Although we’re unable to provide visa sponsorship at this time, we welcome applications from all qualified candidates who are legally authorized to work in these countries.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we hire&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We know that a great hire won’t meet every requirement that we’ve outlined. If you can see yourself elevating the team, we want to hear your story. Few of us would be here had we not taken a chance.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You can expect &lt;strong&gt;5 interviews on Google Meet&lt;/strong&gt; to follow the order below. Should you successfully move through the entire process you will have the opportunity to meet with a variety of Upsunners. Our goal is to ensure you can make the most informed decision on whether this role, and our culture aligns with what you’re looking for in your future working environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;45 Minutes with Talent Acquisition&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;60 Minutes with Hiring Manager (Chief Marketing Officer)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;60 Minutes with Team (IC)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;60 Minutes with Team (Head of Growth)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;45 Minutes with Executive (CFO)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;All roles require background checks.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;💡 &lt;strong&gt;A product you can believe in&lt;/strong&gt; - Join us in transforming how businesses build and manage web applications, driven making a positive impact as a proud &lt;strong&gt;B Corp&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🏆 An Award-Winning Workplace&lt;/strong&gt; - We’ve been recognized by Forbes’ Top 30 Companies for Remote Jobs and France’s Best Workplaces for Women.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;🗣️ &lt;strong&gt;A culture that values your voice &lt;/strong&gt;- Join a flexible, open, and inclusive work environment where your voice is encouraged, and your ideas shape our growth and evolution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;A global team &lt;/strong&gt;- Collaborate with colleagues from diverse backgrounds across the world, embracing different perspectives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎉 &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and perks&lt;/strong&gt; - Make the most of what matters to you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏝 Flexible PTO&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🩺 Comprehensive healthcare coverage (UK, Canada, France, Spain, USA)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📈 Company stock options&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 Professional development budget&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💻 Office equipment budget&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💆‍♀️ Wellness budget&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧳 Annual team gatherings&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👶 Inclusive parental leave&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✈️ Remote work travel program&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align: justify; line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You belong here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At Upsun, we celebrate diversity in all its forms and are committed to fostering an inclusive, equitable, and supportive workplace where everyone can thrive. We embrace and value different perspectives, backgrounds, and experiences, because they make us stronger as a team. Whoever you are, wherever you&#39;re from, and whatever path you&#39;ve taken, you are welcome here. We encourage you to bring your whole self to work, connect with others, and share your passion. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you need accommodations at any stage of our hiring process, please let us know. We&#39;re here to ensure an accessible and comfortable experience for you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lunar Sales:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Celonis Lunar Sales is a fast-track, 2-year development programme designed for ambitious professionals who want to accelerate their career at the intersection of AI, enterprise technology, and strategic sales.&amp;nbsp; If you have experience solving complex problems in a client-facing role, in management or strategy consulting or a leading industry strategy function and you are ready to bring that expertise into enterprise sales, this is your launchpad.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Program immerses you in every stage of the customer sales journey, supported by motivating leaders who will help accelerate your growth beyond expectations. If you&#39;re an innovative thinker who thrives on overcoming challenges, our Top Talent Sales Program will provide strategic significance, arming you with the knowledge and tools to address complex problems, create meaningful change and excel as an Account Executive.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Onboarding Period of 1-3 months with the whole Lunar Cohort one-site at the Celonis Munich Office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fast-track your growth in enterprise sales through our exclusive top talent program. You will gain hands-on experience selling AI-driven business transformation, build relationships with industry leaders across Celonis verticals, including Automotive, Manufacturing, Banking, FSI,&amp;nbsp; Life Sciences, Consumer Goods, Retail, Energy and Public Sector and develop the leadership skills needed to drive real change for enterprise customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The program focuses on three key pillars&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Strategic Business Development &amp;amp; Executive Relationship Building&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take full ownership of generating your own pipeline through cold outreach, persona identification, and first meetings, driving directly towards concrete KPI and revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with C-suite executives (CEO, CFO, COO, CDO/CIO) to address challenges and align with their strategic objectives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Tailored Solutions &amp;amp; Strategic Alignment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position Celonis Context Model and AI capabilities to address critical business needs, delivering measurable impact and expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align strategies with clients&#39; long-term business goals to maximize platform adoption and success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Leadership &amp;amp; Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a highly collaborative cohort of peers featuring a great team who can tackle challenges together, a strong performance culture, and continuous shared learning experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate cross-functional teams, including Value Engineers, Service Consultants, Marketing, BDRs, and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner directly with a senior Account Executive in a dedicated 1:1 mentorship model to accelerate your professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the strategic and operational business needs of your target accounts and effectively communicate how Celonis and its AI-powered Process Intelligence Platform, will meet those to create real opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for delivering revenue in your allocated account patch by creating new business opportunities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify key stakeholder personas, cultivate strategic relationships, and build an internal network of champions to drive customer success and account expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage cross Line-of-Business at C-level and below within your target organizations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become proficient in driving the sales process, following a structured, staged, programmatic flow through prospect, initial call, qualify, pitch to close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Value Engineering or personally conduct comprehensive presentations and demonstrations tailored to specific use cases, including Celonis AI, Process Intelligence Graph and industry-specific solutions, showcasing the value of our platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forge strong partnerships, particularly with leading consulting firms, tech partners, and the Big4.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with your team, which includes business development representatives, value engineers, partner managers, and marketing specialists, to ensure seamless collaboration and success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current on AI trends, process automation, and digital transformation to position Celonis as the intelligent backbone of enterprise operations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Track Record in Client-Facing Roles: &lt;/strong&gt;You bring 2–3 years of professional experience from a top-tier management consultancy, corporate strategy/transformation function, or leading enterprise technology company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Academic Foundation: &lt;/strong&gt;You studied Business Economics, Engineering, Informatics, or a related discipline. A Master&#39;s degree is preferred, but exceptional graduates with solid foundational knowledge are encouraged to apply.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Drive &amp;amp; Career Acceleration: &lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re ready to accelerate your career in sales. You have a genuine interest in applying your professional experience to a dynamic sales environment and are excited to build expertise in enterprise software solutions and client success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Acumen &amp;amp; Process Intelligence Expertise: &lt;/strong&gt;You have a sharp ability to quickly understand how companies operate, identify inefficiencies, and recognize where Process Intelligence and AI unlock real value and drive transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Forward Mindset: &lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re genuinely curious about AI and emerging technologies, driven to deepen your business acumen, and passionate about understanding business processes and KPIs—particularly in Finance, Supply Chain, or operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Edge:&lt;/strong&gt; You bring familiarity or hands-on experience in Manufacturing, Automotive, Consumer Goods, Retail, Financial Services, Telecommunications, or Utilities. This foundation helps you quickly grasp client contexts and add immediate value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;: You communicate complex, strategic ideas with clarity and confidence in Business English.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Independent Thinker&lt;/strong&gt;: You bring a forward-thinking mindset with analytical capabilities. You think strategically, operate independently, and are comfortable owning challenges and driving solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GumGum is The Mindset Company™ transforming advertising. We’re an advertising technology company delivering results by matching brands with people in the right mindset in the moments that matter. Our platform is powered by the Mindset Graph™, our AI-driven data engine that processes billions of real-time contextual, creative, environmental, and historical signals to match every ad with the most receptive audience. The result is advertising that drives meaningful outcomes for advertisers and publishers, and is more relevant for consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We were founded in 2008 and are headquartered in Santa Monica, California, operating in over 19 markets across North America, Europe, Japan, and Australia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our principles guide our work every day and are as follows:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-Obsessed:&lt;/strong&gt; We’re focused on advertising solutions that solve needs and drive success for clients and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make it Happen:&lt;/strong&gt; We have a bias for action and take ownership to deliver results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Always Innovate:&lt;/strong&gt; We push boundaries with creativity and technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foster Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt; We ensure colleagues feel included, supported, and empowered to thrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To be a part of The Mindset Company™ transforming advertising, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.gumgum.com/careers&quot;&gt;www.gumgum.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Based in Manchester, the Digital Director, Regional UK is an autonomous individual contributor responsible for prospecting, negotiating, and closing advertising sales across the North of England. Reporting to the Regional Sales Lead and supported by a cross-functional pre-sales team, the role focuses on managing a large book of business, developing strategic relationships within large and mid-sized agencies, and upselling GumGum’s product portfolio. The Director leverages deep digital media expertise to independently solve complex client challenges, translate client feedback into internal product insights, and drive consistent regional revenue growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Achieve&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive regional UK revenue by managing a book of business and closing new business across large and mid-sized agencies in the North of England.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate a high volume of prospecting activity, including cold outreach, pitch presentations, RFPs, and tailored sales solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Upsell existing brand and agency clients on both established and new GumGum advertising products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate and expand strategic relationships across client-direct brands, media agency contacts, and holding company teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with Account Managers, Client Strategists, and pre-sales teams to ensure sold proposals are executed accurately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate market and client insights back to internal product teams to help refine and adapt platform offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exercise independent judgment and discretion to solve client challenges and select optimal ad solutions with minimal managerial oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of digital advertising sales experience with a proven track record of meeting or exceeding targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience managing a large book of business, backed by an established network of regional brand and agency contacts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of the digital media and advertising landscape; programmatic background preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Salesforce for activity tracking, client logging, and pipeline reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working proficiency in Google Suite, Microsoft PowerPoint, Excel, and Word.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation, relationship-building, and interpersonal communication skills across all client hierarchy levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated, highly proactive, and extraverted approach with an eagerness to entertain clients and adapt to evolving strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn about our benefits &amp;amp; perks package at &lt;a href=&quot;https://gumgum.com/benefits&quot;&gt;gumgum.com/benefits&lt;/a&gt;. If you&#39;d like additional information, your recruiter can share more specifics during the hiring process!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;Note: This position offers the opportunity for remote work or &#39;work from home&#39; as there isn&#39;t a nearby office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Awards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2025 &amp;amp; 2026 Digiday Media Awards Europe Best Contextual Targeting Offering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2025 AdExchanger Awards AI Innovators, Technology &amp;amp; Service Provider, Finalist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2025 MARKETECH APAC Marketing Technology Awards Silver Winner for Best Contextual Advertising Tech Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re always learning and evolving as a company, and we continue to take thoughtful steps to support our people and strengthen our culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Follow Us on Social&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Instagram: @gumgum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;LinkedIn: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/gumgum/&quot;&gt;https://www.linkedin.com/company/gumgum/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;YouTube: @GumGumInc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;TikTok: @itsgumgum&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Beware of recruitment scams.&lt;/strong&gt; GumGum recruits only for active roles on our careers page, accepts applications through Greenhouse, and communicates only via LinkedIn or ----- / ----- email addresses. We never use chat apps, ask you to register on other recruiting sites, or request financial information, payments or purchases. &lt;a href=&quot;https://gumgum.com/contact&quot;&gt;Verify suspicious outreach&lt;/a&gt; before sharing personal information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the Team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Infrastructure teams build the foundation that engineers at Wolt, Deliveroo, and DoorDash build on: the compute, cloud, and networking capabilities that enable Engineering teams to develop, deploy, and run services at global scale. The EU Compute team has a specific focus on provisioning, scaling, and the efficient operation of GPU infrastructure for AI and ML workloads. This is an emerging space with plenty of greenfield opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Staff Engineer to be a hands-on technical leader for this infrastructure work that crosses team and brand boundaries. You&#39;ll set direction for the platform, turn complex problems into deliverable plans, write and review production code, and help other engineers make sound decisions. It&#39;s an exciting time to join: we&#39;re building a global platform and the choices made now will shape how engineers across the company ship for years.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll own some of the hardest infrastructure problems in the company and make the platform easier to operate and safer to build on. We’re determined to build great platform products and user experiences, and you’ll be pivotal in making this reality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Day-to-day in this role you’ll:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set technical direction for shared AWS and Kubernetes infrastructure, balancing reliability, security, developer experience, and cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead substantial initiatives from design through rollout and operation, coordinating dependencies and decisions across Wolt, Deliveroo and DoorDash, focusing on workloads targeting GPUs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve Kubernetes clusters, cloud networking, identity, and infrastructure provisioning to support growing and varied workloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reusable Terraform patterns and self-service tooling that help teams provision infrastructure safely and consistently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve deployment and operational practices, including GitOps, observability, capacity planning, incident response and recovery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use production signals and developer feedback to find platform friction, choose where to invest and measure whether changes actually help.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with supporting the platform, with deep focus on GPU infrastructure, as well as broad focus on compute in general.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gracefully sunset legacy infrastructure and tooling, and create strategies to reduce toil.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers through design reviews, implementation and incidents, raising the quality of infrastructure work across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our humble expectations&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience building and operating Kubernetes and AWS infrastructure in production. Familiarity with GPU workloads and orchestration is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software engineering skills: you use Go, Python or a similar language to build maintainable tools and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with infrastructure as code (we use Terraform) and with designing systems that other engineering teams depend on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of leading complex technical work across teams, including architectural decisions, delivery, and operational follow-through. You have the breadth to collaborate and design across team and domain boundaries, and the depth to have hands-on impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong judgment on trade-offs in distributed systems, networking, security, reliability, and cloud cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication, and the ability to bring people together around a practical technical direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scope and influence.&lt;/strong&gt; Shape infrastructure used globally, while staying close to the engineering. Your work will help product teams ship services with greater ease and confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real problems at global scale.&lt;/strong&gt; Multi-cluster Kubernetes, AI / ML workloads, cloud networking, GitOps, and progressive delivery across a global company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autonomy and ownership.&lt;/strong&gt; Set direction and see it through from design to operation, with the backing of a global engineering organisation spanning Europe and the US.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth.&lt;/strong&gt; Room to expand your scope, whether through deeper technical leadership or broader cross-domain influence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Great people.&lt;/strong&gt; Work with talented engineers and leaders in a diverse, international environment, mentoring and learning from others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/GoL541_xj9w&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DoorDash, Deliveroo, and Wolt will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about our legitimate recruiting process at &lt;span class=&quot;_80om1qgj _1e0c1nu9&quot; data-testid=&quot;smart-link-draggable-inline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;loader-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_1yt4x7n9 _2rko1ssi _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz13af _1rkwglyw _4cvx1w55 _19itia51 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b18uv _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehiw5lj _1j5pglyw _1di615s3&quot; href=&quot;https://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-resolved-view&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-icon-and-title&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw&quot;&gt;Recruitment Scam Awareness - DoorDash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; .&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IonQ:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2F&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=IonQ%2C+Inc&amp;amp;index=7&amp;amp;md5=0818ffbedc6dbad8c4d1611ac94c2a0f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;IonQ, Inc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;. [NYSE: IONQ] is the world’s leading quantum platform and merchant supplier - delivering integrated quantum solutions across computing, networking, sensing, and security. IonQ’s newest generation of quantum computers, the IonQ Tempo, is the latest in a line of cutting-edge systems that have been helping customers and partners including &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=Amazon+Web+Services%2C&amp;amp;index=8&amp;amp;md5=a7f94ee9b71a392dca3cd6c413722e51&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Amazon Web Services, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=and&amp;amp;index=9&amp;amp;md5=2bed627b388878763f41ffe0e4edb16c&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;and &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AstraZeneca&amp;amp;index=10&amp;amp;md5=757c1f2c2ec94cf3982700106122164f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AstraZeneca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt; achieve 20x performance results and accelerate innovation in drug discovery, materials science, financial modeling, logistics, cybersecurity, and defense. In 2025, the company achieved 99.99% two-qubit gate fidelity, &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-achieves-landmark-result-setting-new-world-record-in-quantum-computing&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=setting+a+world+record+in+quantum+computing+performance&amp;amp;index=11&amp;amp;md5=32e9cb88afbd439026a352666cc72c91&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;setting a world record in quantum computing performance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headquartered in College Park, Maryland, IonQ has operations in California, Colorado, Massachusetts, Tennessee, Washington, Italy, South Korea, Sweden, Switzerland, Canada, and the United Kingdom. Our quantum computing services are available through all major cloud providers, while we also meet the needs of networking and sensing customers across land, sea, air, and space. IonQ is making quantum platforms more accessible and impactful than ever before. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;System Software builds the software that runs IonQ&#39;s quantum computers: the runtime, orchestration, quantum tools, controllers and transport software that sit between the Quantum Operating System and the hardware. It is where a next-generation system either comes together or doesn&#39;t.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Staff Technical Programme Manager to lead delivery across this stack. You&#39;ll report to the Group Program Manager, Software in our Programme Management Office and be matrixed to the VP, Software for day-to-day work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work across five engineering teams (runtime, orchestration, quantum tools, controllers and transport) and the interfaces between them and their cross-functional stakeholders, serving several next-generation system programmes at once, with hardware being co-developed alongside the software and teams in both Oxford and the US. Those programmes draw on the same engineers, so the central problem of this role is making sure that capacity is spent by decision, not by default.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We run a centralised PMO model. This role will not own engineering headcount or define product but it will make the programme around those things run. It carries real ownership of delivery: the plan, the trade-offs put in front of decision-makers, and the honesty of the status. In this role you will interface with everyone from technical software engineers to a wide range of the most senior stakeholders. You will also coordinate with your fellow programme managers, across Science, Infrastructure and broader Software teams, making sure all plans are shared and coordinated, rather than operating in silos.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Turning a research-grade quantum system into a dependable product is a problem nobody has finished solving, and the delivery standard you&#39;ll work within is being built now. If writing the first version of the plan sounds like the interesting part, we should talk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role you will own the end-to-end delivery of the Systems Software roadmap across several concurrent programmes including managing dependencies between hardware, science and systems integration teams. You will partner closely with engineering leadership, the engineering teams run the day to day planning and boards, you will provide the direction that creates incremental milestones that ship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will identify risks and blockers early and work with the teams to resolve them. You will also run intake and triage, so requests reach the right team with the right priority and engineers can stay focused on planned work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key responsibilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Make contention visible: when two programmes need the same team in the same quarter, bring it to the right decision-maker with the options and a recommendation before it becomes a slip.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Keep the systems of record honest. Requirements, plans, schedules and Jira drift apart; you&#39;ll close the gap and automate the checking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Make invisible work visible: on-call load, sustaining work and technical debt tracked as rigorously as feature delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Surface risks early, before you have a full solution or complete alignment. We&#39;d rather hear it messy and on time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Run intake and triage so requests reach the right team, with priority set by the people who own it, and engineers stay on planned work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work hand in hand with the Quantum Systems Infrastructure and Science TPMs in Oxford and the Software TPMs in the US: shared processes where teams meet, and no duplicated ceremonies, boards or reports.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Write concise, plain-English status on progress, risks and decisions for programme directors, engineering leaders and senior leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help shape how IonQ runs software delivery across sites, working with the Group Program Manager, Software on the shared delivery standard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will have significant experience running technical programmes across several software teams, ideally in systems, embedded, compiler or platform software. You can discuss scope and trade-offs directly with engineering leads, read and reason about code, and re-plan when a timeline is no longer realistic. You will have a track record of leading teams through genuine ambiguity, writing the first version of the plan when there isn&#39;t one, not just executing a defined one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can break broad problems down into specific, assignable actions, and you have designed a team&#39;s operating cadence before. No quantum background is needed. Experience of software that works closely with hardware, for example in labs, robotics, aerospace or scientific instruments, would be beneficial.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’d be a great fit with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A habit of turning diffuse problems into specific, minimal, assignable asks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Technical fluency to engage engineering leads directly on scope and trade-offs, and comfort reading and reasoning about code.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Willingness to re-baseline against reality rather than defend dates that have stopped being true, and the judgement to tell a target that motivates from one that just generates fiction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with software that works closely with hardware: labs, robotics, aerospace, scientific instruments or similar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A chase-without-nagging, escalate-without-drama style, and a clear sense of the difference between a risk and a noise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI as a core part of how you work, for example agent-driven tracking, reconciliation or reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clear, concise written and verbal communication with both technical and senior stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Additional desirable skills include capacity and staffing modelling, designing operating cadences and experience leading work across sites and time zones. Experience working with programmes and systems such as Jira, Confluence and GitHub, with a preference for lightweight processes, is also helpful.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation will vary based on individual factors such as education, qualifications, and experience of the final candidate(s), specific office location, and calibration against relevant market data and internal team equity. Posted base salary figures are subject to change as new market data becomes available. Our benefits include comprehensive medical, dental, and vision plans, matching 401(k), unlimited PTO and paid holidays, parental/adoption leave, legal insurance, and a home technology stipend. Details of participation in these benefit plans will be provided when a candidate receives an offer of employment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At IonQ, we believe in fair treatment, access, opportunity, and advancement for all while striving to identify and eliminate barriers. We empower employees to thrive by fostering a culture of autonomy, productivity, and respect. We are dedicated to creating an environment where individuals can feel welcomed, respected, supported, and valued.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to equity and justice. We welcome different voices and viewpoints and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, ancestry, physical and/or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law. We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;The position you are applying for will require access to technology that is subject to U.S. export control and government contract restrictions.&amp;nbsp; Employment with IonQ is contingent on either verifying “U.S. Person” (e.g., U.S. citizen, U.S. national, U.S. permanent resident, or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum) status for export controls and government contracts work, obtaining any necessary license, and/or confirming the availability of a license exception under U.S. export controls.&amp;nbsp; Please note that in the absence of confirming you are a U.S. Person for export control and government contracts work purposes, IonQ may choose not to apply for a license or decline to use a license exception (if available) for you to access export-controlled technology that may require authorization, and similarly, you may not qualify for government contracts work that requires U.S. Persons, and IonQ may decline to proceed with your application on those bases alone.&amp;nbsp; Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Non-Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Due to applicable export control laws and regulations, candidates must be a U.S. citizen or national, U.S. permanent resident (i.e., current Green Card holder), or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum. Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in being a part of our team and mission, we encourage you to apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IonQ:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2F&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=IonQ%2C+Inc&amp;amp;index=7&amp;amp;md5=0818ffbedc6dbad8c4d1611ac94c2a0f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;IonQ, Inc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;. [NYSE: IONQ] is the world’s leading quantum platform and merchant supplier - delivering integrated quantum solutions across computing, networking, sensing, and security. IonQ’s newest generation of quantum computers, the IonQ Tempo, is the latest in a line of cutting-edge systems that have been helping customers and partners including &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=Amazon+Web+Services%2C&amp;amp;index=8&amp;amp;md5=a7f94ee9b71a392dca3cd6c413722e51&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Amazon Web Services, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=and&amp;amp;index=9&amp;amp;md5=2bed627b388878763f41ffe0e4edb16c&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;and &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AstraZeneca&amp;amp;index=10&amp;amp;md5=757c1f2c2ec94cf3982700106122164f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AstraZeneca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt; achieve 20x performance results and accelerate innovation in drug discovery, materials science, financial modeling, logistics, cybersecurity, and defense. In 2025, the company achieved 99.99% two-qubit gate fidelity, &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-achieves-landmark-result-setting-new-world-record-in-quantum-computing&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=setting+a+world+record+in+quantum+computing+performance&amp;amp;index=11&amp;amp;md5=32e9cb88afbd439026a352666cc72c91&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;setting a world record in quantum computing performance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headquartered in College Park, Maryland, IonQ has operations in California, Colorado, Massachusetts, Tennessee, Washington, Italy, South Korea, Sweden, Switzerland, Canada, and the United Kingdom. Our quantum computing services are available through all major cloud providers, while we also meet the needs of networking and sensing customers across land, sea, air, and space. IonQ is making quantum platforms more accessible and impactful than ever before. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; This role will work onsite at our office located in Oxford, England (UK).&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job ID:&lt;/strong&gt; 1948&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Receiving Inspector to join our Quality team. As a Senior Receiving Inspector, you’ll be part of a cross-functional team whose mission is to lead IonQ on its journey to build the world’s best quantum computers to solve the world’s most complex problems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will make sure that incoming, in-process and finished components meet their mechanical, electrical and PCBA specifications.&amp;nbsp;You will also own the inspection side of the Material Review Board process, from handling and containing nonconforming material, through the inspection actions the board assigns, to verifying, closing and tracking nonconformance records once the Quality Engineer has given the disposition. As the senior technical resource for inspection, you will allocate the daily inspection work and guide less experienced inspectors. The ideal candidate combines technical expertise with the integrity to hold quality standards under production pressure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Day to day, you will inspect incoming parts, in-process production and finished goods against approved specifications, drawings and purchase order requirements, deciding the inspection method and sequence with little instruction. You will interpret drawing callouts and datum structures to GD&amp;amp;T and ASME Y14.5, turn them into inspection plans and acceptance criteria, apply statistical sampling plans and use the right metrology instruments, including programming and running CMM, OMM or vision systems. You will support the calibration schedule, remove out of tolerance equipment from service and keep the inspection area to the local 5S procedure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When something is wrong, you will control it. You will identify, tag, segregate and quarantine nonconforming material with correct lot and serial traceability to ISO 9001 and AS9100, sweep stock and work in progress to contain every affected lot, write the nonconformance record and present the inspection evidence at the Material Review Board. You will carry out the actions the board assigns, verify scrap disposal so nothing returns to the supply chain, and feed inspection data to the Quality Engineer for root cause analysis and supplier corrective action. You will also support internal, customer and regulatory audits, and keep to the quality management system, export control and customer contract requirements for controlled material and data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key responsibilities include:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading daily inspection of incoming, in-process and finished goods, including allocating the workload and verifying other inspectors&#39; results and records before release&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Writing nonconformance records, presenting inspection evidence at the Material Review Board and completing assigned actions such as screening, sorting and rework verification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verifying and closing nonconformance records against the Quality Engineer&#39;s disposition, and keeping the MRB log and ageing report up to date&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drafting and releasing inspection procedures and work instructions, and reporting metrics such as first pass yield, defect Pareto, NCR ageing and inspection turnaround&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with engineering, manufacturing, supply chain and suppliers on source inspection, first article inspection and quality problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will bring six or more years of related experience in a regulated manufacturing environment, including proven PCBA inspection to IPC-A-610 and experience of aerospace inspection processes and standards. You will have hands-on experience of controlling nonconforming product and of the Material Review Board process, and of using a Quality Management System or ERP nonconformance module to raise, track and close records and actions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;You read and interpret complex technical drawings with a thorough understanding of datum structures to ASME Y14.5, and you are expert with layout tools such as surface plates, height gauges, indicators, callipers, micrometers, gauge blocks and thread gauges. You have allocated work to, trained and guided less experienced inspectors, and you are confident with standard office software for data analysis and documentation. The role involves lifting up to 18 kg and standing for long periods, with strict adherence to safety and PPE requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’d be a great fit with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication at every level, from management to engineers and physicists, when resolving complex quality issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of root cause analysis methods such as 5 Why, Ishikawa or 8D&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of first article inspection to AS9102 and of source inspection at supplier sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An ASQ Certified Quality Inspector or Certified Quality Technician qualification, or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A quality first, self-starting approach, with precision under pressure and a willingness to support other quality functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation will vary based on individual factors such as education, qualifications, and experience of the final candidate(s), specific office location, and calibration against relevant market data and internal team equity. Posted base salary figures are subject to change as new market data becomes available. Our benefits include comprehensive medical, dental, and vision plans, matching 401(k), unlimited PTO and paid holidays, parental/adoption leave, legal insurance, and a home technology stipend. Details of participation in these benefit plans will be provided when a candidate receives an offer of employment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At IonQ, we believe in fair treatment, access, opportunity, and advancement for all while striving to identify and eliminate barriers. We empower employees to thrive by fostering a culture of autonomy, productivity, and respect. We are dedicated to creating an environment where individuals can feel welcomed, respected, supported, and valued.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to equity and justice. We welcome different voices and viewpoints and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, ancestry, physical and/or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law. We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;The position you are applying for will require access to technology that is subject to U.S. export control and government contract restrictions.&amp;nbsp; Employment with IonQ is contingent on either verifying “U.S. Person” (e.g., U.S. citizen, U.S. national, U.S. permanent resident, or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum) status for export controls and government contracts work, obtaining any necessary license, and/or confirming the availability of a license exception under U.S. export controls.&amp;nbsp; Please note that in the absence of confirming you are a U.S. Person for export control and government contracts work purposes, IonQ may choose not to apply for a license or decline to use a license exception (if available) for you to access export-controlled technology that may require authorization, and similarly, you may not qualify for government contracts work that requires U.S. Persons, and IonQ may decline to proceed with your application on those bases alone.&amp;nbsp; Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Non-Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Due to applicable export control laws and regulations, candidates must be a U.S. citizen or national, U.S. permanent resident (i.e., current Green Card holder), or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum. Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in being a part of our team and mission, we encourage you to apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Manager - Retrieval | Storage, Peripherals &amp;amp; Retrieval | Hybrid Working | Hatfield&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are Ocado Group and we&#39;re bringing world-class automation to online grocery. Our Ocado Smart Platform (OSP) combines cutting-edge robotics, AI and IoT within our advanced CFCs (Customer Fulfilment Centres). We&#39;ve mastered the single pick, transforming online delivery for our global partners. Join us and be part of a team pushing the boundaries of retail technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Storage, Peripherals &amp;amp; Retrieval is the product area behind the automated systems at the heart of Ocado&#39;s automated warehouses: the grid, the peripherals and the bots that run on it. Our mission is to develop the world&#39;s leading ASRS: highly cost-competitive, reliable, easy to launch and support and suitable for diverse global use cases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Senior Product Manager for Retrieval, you will own the product strategy and roadmap for our bot, battery and charger fleet. Retrieval is the core driver of grid movement - bots transport stock and customer orders between grid locations, stations and ports, meaning every customer order depends on their availability, reliability and cost-effectiveness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Operating at the intersection of hardware, firmware, wireless and cloud software, you will lead a critical product domain where even a small change to a bot scales across every operational site globally. You will collaborate closely with mechanical, mechatronics, firmware, wireless and cloud engineering teams, as well as manufacturing and field support teams, driving complex problem-solving and cross-domain alignment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Vision &amp;amp; Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Shape and execute the product vision for complex initiatives across the bot, battery and charger domain, balancing short- and long-term goals to lower Capex, Opex and lead time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial &amp;amp; Data Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Define key domain metrics connected directly to business outcomes. Manage financial rationale, balance KPI impacts and make informed Build vs. Buy decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execution &amp;amp; Problem Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead discovery and problem-solving across cross-functional teams, setting high standards for scoping, requirements and data-driven hypothesis testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Adoption &amp;amp; Scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Build adoption metrics into domain capabilities, monitor usage across customer segments and collaborate with Solutions, Partner Growth and Partner Success teams to drive global rollout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management &amp;amp; Evangelism:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage relationships across engineering crafts, leadership levels and external partners. Articulate complex technical decisions clearly and build strong buy-in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Expertise &amp;amp; Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the recognized go-to expert for Retrieval, providing strategic guidance, mentoring surrounding PMs and stepping into leadership moments for the Product Director when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Substantial, battle-tested product management experience owning end-to-end product lifecycles for complex engineering products shipped at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of leading product discovery, setting product strategy in uncertain environments and making high-impact strategic trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience building product roadmaps alongside Design and Engineering peers, owning the business case and ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to collaborate effectively across Engineering, UX, Data, delivery teams and external partners or clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organizational skills with the ability to manage competing priorities in a fast-paced environment and deliver on commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with products that combine hardware and software (e.g., robotics, connected devices or industrial automation).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring or coaching other Product Managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in supporting our people with meaningful, flexible benefits that prioritise well-being and work-life balance. Here’s a snapshot of what you can expect:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time to recharge:&lt;/strong&gt; 25 days annual leave (rising to 27 after 5 years), plus the option to buy more - and 30 days a year to work from anywhere in the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; wellbeing:&lt;/strong&gt; Private Medical Insurance from your first month, wellbeing support through specialist apps and EAP, plus Income Protection and Life Assurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Family-first policies:&lt;/strong&gt; 22 weeks paid maternity/primary carer leave and 6 weeks paid paternity leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial support:&lt;/strong&gt; Pension with employer matching up to 7%, share schemes (Sharesave &amp;amp; BAYE) and interest-free loans for train tickets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commuter perks:&lt;/strong&gt; Cycle to Work Scheme, Car salary sacrifice and free shuttle buses to/from Hatfield and Welwyn Garden City stations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exclusive discounts:&lt;/strong&gt; 15% off at Ocado.com with free delivery (starting in your first month) and up to 70% off at our Company Shop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be bold, be unique, be brilliant, be you. We are looking for individuality and we value diversity. We are an equal opportunities employer and we are committed to treating all applicants and employees fairly and equally. We are committed to making reasonable adjustments to provide a positive, barrier-free recruitment process and supportive work environment. If you have any support or access requirements, we encourage you to advise us at the time of application.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-KS1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Senior Data Analyst, Marketplace&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(126, 140, 141); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Prolific&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Prolific is not just another player in the AI space – we are the architects of the human data infrastructure that&#39;s reshaping the landscape of AI development. In a world where foundational AI technologies are increasingly commoditised, it&#39;s the quality and diversity of human-generated data that truly differentiates products and models.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;T&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;he role&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;As Prolific scales, maintaining a healthy and sustainable marketplace will be critical to our ability to meet growing demand for high-quality human data. We are looking for a Senior Data Analyst to help us understand how well our marketplace is working, identify where supply and demand are not connecting effectively, and measure whether product and algorithmic improvements are delivering better outcomes. You will work closely with Product, Engineering and Operations teams, using data to answer important marketplace questions and support better product decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(126, 140, 141); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;What you’ll bring to the role&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Analytics Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong SQL skills and experience analysing complex datasets. Python experience for analysis and experimentation is beneficial.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketplace or Product Analytics:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience working with marketplace, product or operational data and using metrics to understand user and business behaviour.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketplace Metrics:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to work with measures such as supply and demand, fill rate, time-to-fill, availability, quality and concentration to understand marketplace performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experimentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience analysing A/B tests or other experiments, including defining success metrics, interpreting results and communicating findings.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to turn product or marketplace questions into measurable hypotheses and structured analysis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Curiosity:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable exploring data to understand why something is happening, rather than only reporting what happened.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Awareness:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to understand how marketplace performance affects customer experience and wider business outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable working with Product, Engineering and Operations teams and contributing analytical thinking to cross-functional work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to translate&amp;nbsp;analysis into simple, actionable insights for both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Help define, monitor and improve the metrics we use to understand &lt;strong&gt;marketplace health&lt;/strong&gt;, including supply-demand balance, fulfilment, quality and concentration.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Analyse marketplace performance and investigate changes in metrics such as fill rate, time-to-fill, participant availability and quality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Work with product and engineering teams to define success metrics and measure the impact of product and algorithmic improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Analyse experiments to understand whether changes to matching, ranking, recommendation or other marketplace experiences are improving outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Build and maintain dashboards and reporting that make marketplace performance visible and actionable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Use SQL and other analytical tools to investigate marketplace behaviour, identify trends and surface opportunities or problems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Explore how marketplace outcomes differ across customers, participants, use cases and segments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Communicate findings clearly and help teams make data-informed product and operational decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(126, 140, 141); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Why Prolific is a great place to work&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We&#39;ve built a unique platform that connects researchers and companies with a global pool of participants, enabling the collection of high-quality, ethically sourced human behavioural data and feedback. This data is the cornerstone of developing more accurate, nuanced, and aligned AI systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We believe that the next leap in AI capabilities won&#39;t come solely from scaling existing models but from integrating diverse human perspectives and behaviours into AI development. By providing this crucial human data infrastructure, Prolific is positioning itself at the forefront of the next wave of AI innovation – one that reflects the breath and the best of humanity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Working for us will place you at the forefront of AI innovation, providing access to our unique human data platform and opportunities for groundbreaking research. Join us to enjoy a competitive salary, benefits, and remote working within our impactful, mission-driven culture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(126, 140, 141); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Links to more information on Prolific&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/prolific/dbc97f2b3ff24f1bb6fa834a2c9c3283?v=4f874e88e46a4f54afd8bf62f1db19ed&amp;amp;p=9f2c1de05dfa43338d48c20362bfead1&amp;amp;pm=c&quot;&gt;Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/prolific/dbc97f2b3ff24f1bb6fa834a2c9c3283?v=4f874e88e46a4f54afd8bf62f1db19ed&quot;&gt;External Handbook&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.prolific.com/&quot;&gt;Website&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@JoinProlific&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(126, 140, 141); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Privacy Statement&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;By submitting your application, you agree that Prolific may collect your personal data for recruiting and global organisation planning. Prolific&#39;s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/prolific/Policy-Privacy-Notice-for-Candidates-f94a136a67544388b4888bc436451b57&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; explains what personal information Prolific may process, where Prolific may process your personal information, its purposes for processing your personal information, and the rights you can exercise over Prolific use of your personal information.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;ClinChoice is a global full-service CRO committed to professional growth and a quality-driven “one-team” culture. We are seeking a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;361&quot; data-end=&quot;397&quot;&gt;Senior Statistician&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to join our in-house team and support projects across a diverse client portfolio, including pharmaceutical, biotechnology, medical device, and consumer health companies of varying sizes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are seeking a highly skilled&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;361&quot; data-end=&quot;397&quot;&gt;Senior Statistician&lt;/strong&gt; to to join our biometrics team. This is a full-time permanent opportunity with &lt;strong&gt;REMOTE.&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot; data-start=&quot;329&quot; data-end=&quot;692&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Join our team: you can be part of making a difference in peoples&#39; lives and experience a fulfilling and rewarding career!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Job Responsibilities&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Responsible for protocol development including study design, sample size calculation, randomization, and statistical analysis plan for assigned studies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Provide statistical oversight to studies and assure adequate quality and consistency with project requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Responsible for assuring that data for statistical analyses are complete, accurate, and consistent.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Responsible for statistical analysis plans and the accuracy and timeliness of statistical input into reports or decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Responsible for the validity of the analysis and exploring alternative analysis strategies as needed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrates extensive understanding of statistical concepts and methodologies. Recognizes and corrects flaws in scientific reasoning and statistical interpretation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Responsible for accuracy and consistency of statistical tables, figures, and data listings, accuracy of report text, and consistency between summary tables in the body of reports and the corresponding source tables and listings.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Responsible for the statistical methods section of the reports. Identifies and corrects common flaws in the interpretation of results, inconsistency in presentation or inference, adherence to the report guidelines, and ensures project-wide consistency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Effectively mentor peers with regard to statistical methodology and provide appropriate training to less experienced statisticians.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Manage activities of statisticians across projects by appropriately coordinating assignments and reviewing work so that projects are delivered on time with high quality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;MS or PhD in Statistics, Biostatistics, or related field. &amp;nbsp;PhD with 3-4 years of experience or MS with 5-7 years of experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;There are no specific therapeutic area requirements; however, experience in Oncology, Rare Disease, or Neuroscience would be advantageous.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong oral and written communication skills, with the ability to effectively communicate internally and with clients.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated understanding and insight in statistics, drug development process, and relevant FDA regulations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Pharmaceutical, CRO, or related industry experience with clinical trials, including interaction with Regulatory Agencies, especially the FDA.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Application Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Once you have submitted your CV, you will receive an acknowledgment that we received it. If you have the requirements we need, you will be invited for a phone interview as the first step.&amp;nbsp; Unfortunately, due to the number of applications we receive, we cannot reply to everyone individually if you are not successful.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who will you be working for?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About ClinChoice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;ClinChoice is a global full-service CRO specializing in clinical development and functional solutions for pharmaceutical, biotechnology, medical device, and consumer health companies. We have over 28 years of proven high-quality delivery and results across all our services, with over 4,000 professionals in more than 20 countries across the Americas, Europe, and Asia-Pacific.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Company Ethos&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our mission drives our culture: to contribute to a healthier and safer world by accelerating the development and commercialization of innovative drugs and devices. Our employees are the most valuable company asset and they are the fulcrum around which all ClinChoice activities are built and close management and training is the core instrument to develop and maintain highly-qualified personnel. The continuous training keeps the resources qualified in terms of competence and expertise and gives all personnel the clear tools needed to manage both internal and client processes with the same methodology.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; The success of these core values is evidenced by our below-industry-average turnover rates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;ClinChoice is an equal-opportunity employer. We have based our success on attracting, developing, and promoting talent guided by diversity and inclusivity. Our employees come from very diverse backgrounds: gender, race, beliefs, and ethnicities. We recognize this is our strength and celebrate it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-TT1 #LI-Remote #Senior#permanent&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;ClinChoice is a global full-service CRO committed to professional growth and a quality-driven “one-team” culture. We are seeking a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;361&quot; data-end=&quot;397&quot;&gt;Principal Statistician&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to join our in-house team and support projects across a diverse client portfolio, including pharmaceutical, biotechnology, medical device, and consumer health companies of varying sizes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We are seeking a highly skilled&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;361&quot; data-end=&quot;397&quot;&gt;Principal Statistician&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to lead statistical activities for clinical trials. This role requires hands-on statistical expertise, strong communication skills, and the ability to independently lead projects while collaborating closely with cross-functional teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot; data-start=&quot;329&quot; data-end=&quot;692&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Join our team: you can be part of making a difference in peoples&#39; lives and experience a fulfilling and rewarding career!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot; data-start=&quot;329&quot; data-end=&quot;692&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot; data-start=&quot;694&quot; data-end=&quot;720&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;721&quot; data-end=&quot;1606&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot; data-start=&quot;721&quot; data-end=&quot;833&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;723&quot; data-end=&quot;833&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Lead and provide statistical support for clinical studies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot; data-start=&quot;834&quot; data-end=&quot;940&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;836&quot; data-end=&quot;940&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Act as the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;847&quot; data-end=&quot;868&quot;&gt;lead statistician&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;on assigned studies, overseeing statistical strategy and deliverables&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot; data-start=&quot;941&quot; data-end=&quot;1136&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;943&quot; data-end=&quot;998&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Author and review key statistical documents, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1001&quot; data-end=&quot;1136&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot; data-start=&quot;1001&quot; data-end=&quot;1038&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1003&quot; data-end=&quot;1038&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Statistical Analysis Plans (SAPs)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot; data-start=&quot;1041&quot; data-end=&quot;1083&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1043&quot; data-end=&quot;1083&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Analysis Database Specifications (ADS)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot; data-start=&quot;1086&quot; data-end=&quot;1136&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1088&quot; data-end=&quot;1136&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Statistical sections of clinical study reports&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot; data-start=&quot;1137&quot; data-end=&quot;1233&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1139&quot; data-end=&quot;1233&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Review and interpret analysis outputs, ensuring accuracy, quality, and regulatory compliance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot; data-start=&quot;1234&quot; data-end=&quot;1342&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1236&quot; data-end=&quot;1342&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams including Clinical, Programming, Data Management, and Regulatory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot; data-start=&quot;1343&quot; data-end=&quot;1414&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1345&quot; data-end=&quot;1414&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Provide guidance and oversight to statistical programmers as needed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot; data-start=&quot;1415&quot; data-end=&quot;1528&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1417&quot; data-end=&quot;1528&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Communicate statistical concepts, results, and risks clearly to both technical and non-technical stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot; data-start=&quot;1529&quot; data-end=&quot;1606&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1531&quot; data-end=&quot;1606&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Ensure adherence to regulatory standards (FDA, ICH, GCP) and company SOPs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot; data-start=&quot;1608&quot; data-end=&quot;1637&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1638&quot; data-end=&quot;2205&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot; data-start=&quot;1638&quot; data-end=&quot;1700&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1640&quot; data-end=&quot;1700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;MS or PhD in Statistics, Biostatistics, or a related field&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot; data-start=&quot;1638&quot; data-end=&quot;1700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;There are no specific therapeutic area requirements; however, experience in Oncology, Rare Disease, or Neuroscience would be advantageous.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot; data-start=&quot;1638&quot; data-end=&quot;1700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong oral and written communication skills, with the ability to effectively communicate internally and with clients.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot; data-start=&quot;1638&quot; data-end=&quot;1700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated understanding and insight in statistics, drug development process, and relevant FDA regulations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot; data-start=&quot;1638&quot; data-end=&quot;1700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Pharmaceutical, CRO, or related industry experience with clinical trials, including interaction with Regulatory Agencies, especially the FDA.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Application Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Once you have submitted your CV, you will receive an acknowledgement that we received it. If you have the requirements we need, you will be invited for phone interview as the first step.&amp;nbsp; Unfortunately, due to the number of applications we receive, we cannot reply to everyone individually if you are not successful.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who will you be working for?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About ClinChoice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;ClinChoice is a global full-service CRO specializing in clinical development and functional solutions for pharmaceutical, biotechnology, medical device, and consumer health companies. We have over 28 years of proven high-quality delivery and results across all our services, with over 4,000 professionals in more than 20 countries across the Americas, Europe, and Asia-Pacific.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Company Ethos&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our mission drives our culture: to contribute to a healthier and safer world by accelerating the development and commercialization of innovative drugs and devices. Our employees are the most valuable company asset and they are the fulcrum around which all ClinChoice activities are built and close management and training is the core instrument to develop and maintain highly-qualified personnel. The continuous training keeps the resources qualified in terms of competence and expertise and gives all personnel the clear tools needed to manage both internal and client processes with the same methodology.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; The success of these core values is evidenced by our below industry average turnover rates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;ClinChoice is an equal opportunity employer. We have based our success on attracting, developing, and promoting talent guided by diversity and inclusivity. Our employees come from very diverse backgrounds: gender, race, beliefs, and ethnicities. We recognize this is our strength and celebrate it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot; data-start=&quot;329&quot; data-end=&quot;692&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI-TT1 #LI-Remote #LI-Principal #Permanent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;KnowBe4 empowers the modern workforce to make smarter security decisions every day. Trusted by more than 70,000 organizations worldwide, KnowBe4 is the pioneer of digital workforce security, securing both AI agents and humans. The KnowBe4 Platform provides attack simulation and training, collaboration security, and agent security powered by AIDA (Artificial Intelligence Defense Agents) and a proprietary Risk Score. The platform leverages 15-years of behavioral data to combat advanced threats including social engineering, prompt injection, and shadow AI. By securing humans and agents, KnowBe4 leads the industry in workforce trust and defense.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;To learn more about our team and office culture in England (UK), visit the following links.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Careers Page:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.knowbe4.com/careers/locations/york&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.knowbe4.com/careers/locations/york&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;https://www.knowbe4.com/careers/locations/york&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Glassdoor:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.glassdoor.com/Location/KnowBe4-York-Location-EI_IE969384.0,7_IL.8,12_IC3297365.htm&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.glassdoor.com/Location/KnowBe4-York-Location-EI_IE969384.0,7_IL.8,12_IC3297365.htm&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;https://www.glassdoor.com/Location/KnowBe4-York-Location-EI_IE969384.0,7_IL.8,12_IC3297365.htm&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/knowbe4/life/uk/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/knowbe4/life/uk/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;https://www.linkedin.com/company/knowbe4/life/uk/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Cybersecurity Threat Analyst works in the KnowBe4 Threat Research Lab, and is responsible for creating solutions and models to detect threats in KnowBe4’s target markets and products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;To learn more about the product this position deals with - click here: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.egress.com/products&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.egress.com/products&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;https://www.egress.com/products&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyzes threat data and implements technical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovate and create extensions to detection paradigms in end to end fashion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reviewing, understanding and reverse engineering phishing attacks and technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding and implementing broader attack vectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing detection algorithms (python, c#) and extracting identifying features of phishing emails.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding human behaviour and communications, and how they can be exploited by attackers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using machine learning to identify broader phishing trends and how to protect against them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Statistics, Mathematics, Data Science, Physics or a related quantitative field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong working knowledge of SQL for data extraction and manipulation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to write clean, efficient code. Proficiency in Python or C#&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with standard ML algorithms (e.g., linear/logistic regression, decision trees, random forests) and libraries like Scikit-Learn or TensorFlow/PyTorch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience in being able to quickly learn and adapt to new areas of technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to think outside the box and/or think maliciously to deliver creative solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Fantastic Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;We offer company-wide bonuses based on monthly sales targets, employee referral bonuses, adoption assistance, tuition reimbursement, certification reimbursement, and certification completion bonuses - all in a modern, high-tech, and fun work environment. For more details about our benefits in each office location, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.knowbe4.com/careers/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://www.knowbe4.com/careers/benefits&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1727463125306000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3gDeHkHPZYOcR3fRjLcL4_&quot;&gt;www.knowbe4.com/careers/benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Note: An applicant assessment and background check may be part of your hiring procedure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individuals seeking employment at KnowBe4 are considered without prejudice to race, color, religion, national origin, age, sex, marital status, ancestry, physical or mental disability, veteran status, gender identity, sexual orientation or any other characteristic protected under applicable federal, state, or local law. If you require reasonable accommodation in completing this application, interviewing, completing any pre-employment testing, or otherwise participating in the employee selection process, please visit www.knowbe4.com/careers/request-accommodation.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;No recruitment agencies, please.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qui sommes-nous ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact 3000 est la &lt;strong&gt;division Créative &amp;amp; Data&lt;/strong&gt; du groupe Artefact. Notre singularité réside dans notre capacité à marier l&#39;audace créative avec la rigueur de la &lt;strong&gt;science des données et de l&#39;Intelligence Artificielle&lt;/strong&gt;. Nous ne faisons pas que de la publicité ; nous concevons l&#39;esthétique et l&#39;exécution d&#39;&lt;strong&gt;expériences digitales et de campagnes data-driven&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous sommes l&#39;agence de référence pour les marques qui cherchent à faire évoluer leur communication sur tous les supports numériques. Notre expertise couvre la conception visuelle de campagnes d&#39;envergure, d&#39;activations d&#39;&lt;strong&gt;IA générative&lt;/strong&gt;, de contenus sociaux impactants et de dispositifs &lt;strong&gt;web immersifs&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partenaire d&#39;innovation pour des clients majeurs tels que&lt;strong&gt; Groupe ADP, WWF, Robertet, Pierre&amp;amp;Vacances, TF1+, TotalEnergies&lt;/strong&gt;, nous avons reçu de nombreuses récompenses pour notre créativité et notre innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Les missions que nous proposons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au sein de l’agence, vous accompagnez les Directeurs Artistiques dans la mise en production des campagnes : votre rôle est de transformer les concepts en livrables impeccables, déclinés sur l&#39;ensemble des formats digitaux, avec un vrai souci du détail et du craft.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Décliner et produire les kits créatifs sur tous les formats : bannières display &lt;strong&gt;statiques et animées&lt;/strong&gt;, formats social, habillages web, en respectant les chartes et les intentions créatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer l&#39;exécution graphique et le craft des livrables (typographie, couleur, composition, finition pixel perfect), dans une logique de qualité et de cohérence multi-formats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produire des contenus animés simples : déclinaisons motion de bannières et de stories à partir de maquettes et de storyboards existants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apporter votre regard et participer à la direction artistique de certains projets : recherche de références, planches d&#39;intentions, moodboards, propositions de key visuals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Être force de proposition sur les outils de production, y compris l&#39;IA générative, pour gagner en efficacité et en qualité d&#39;exécution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Le profil que nous recherchons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Étudiant/étudiante en fin d&#39;études d&#39;une école de Design Graphique, de Création Publicitaire ou d&#39;Arts Appliqués, vous disposez idéalement d&#39;une première expérience en agence ou en studio sur des productions digitales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solide culture visuelle et graphique, sens du détail et réelle exigence sur le craft (typographie, couleur, composition, finition).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Goût pour la production et la déclinaison : vous aimez voir vos livrables aboutis et déployés proprement sur tous les formats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maîtrise indispensable de la Suite Adobe (Photoshop, Illustrator) et de Figma.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maîtrise du Motion Design (Adobe After Effects) attendue, ou forte appétence pour l&#39;animation de bannières et de formats sociaux.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosité pour les nouvelles technologies et les outils de création par IA générative (Midjourney, Higgsfield, Kling, etc.) : un vrai plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rigueur, organisation et capacité à gérer plusieurs livrables en parallèle dans le respect des délais.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi nous rejoindre :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Artefact 3000 est l&#39;agence où il faut être : venez développer votre savoir-faire dans une agence de publicité technophile qui monte, qui monte…&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Progression : chaque jour offre de nouveaux défis et de nouvelles occasions d&#39;apprendre, sur des marques fortes et des projets variés.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culture : rejoignez la meilleure équipe que vous puissiez imaginer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process de recrutement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1er entretien : Farouk, Directeur Artistique&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2e entretien : Clara, Talent Specialist Acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Artefact, nous recrutons nos collaborateurs uniquement en fonction de nos besoins et des qualités propres de chaque candidat. Nous assurons le développement de leurs compétences professionnelles et de leurs responsabilités sans discrimination d’aucune sorte, notamment de croyances, de genre, d’âge, de situation d&#39;handicap, d’origine ethnique, d’orientation sexuelle, d’appartenance à une organisation politique, religieuse, syndicale ou à une minorité.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qui sommes-nous?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact 3000 est la &lt;strong&gt;division Créative &amp;amp; Data&lt;/strong&gt; du groupe Artefact. Notre singularité réside dans notre capacité à marier l&#39;audace créative avec la rigueur de la &lt;strong&gt;science des données et de l&#39;Intelligence Artificielle&lt;/strong&gt;. Nous ne faisons pas que de la publicité ; nous concevons l&#39;esthétique et l&#39;exécution d&#39;&lt;strong&gt;expériences digitales et de campagnes data-driven&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous sommes l&#39;agence de référence pour les marques qui cherchent à faire évoluer leur communication sur tous les supports numériques. Notre expertise couvre la conception visuelle de campagnes d&#39;envergure, d&#39;activations d&#39;&lt;strong&gt;IA générative&lt;/strong&gt;, de contenus sociaux impactants et de dispositifs &lt;strong&gt;web immersifs&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partenaire d&#39;innovation pour des clients majeurs tels que&lt;strong&gt; Groupe ADP, WWF, Robertet, Pierre&amp;amp;Vacances, TF1+, TotalEnergies&lt;/strong&gt;, nous avons reçu de nombreuses récompenses pour notre créativité et notre innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Les missions que nous proposons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mener des recherches utilisateurs, analyser le marché et l&#39;environnement de nos clients (audit, benchmark, analyse de données, entretiens utilisateurs, tests, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concevoir et animer des ateliers pour générer des idées et aligner les parties prenantes (idéation, tri de cartes, crazy eights, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concevoir des parcours utilisateurs (arborescence, wireframes, user flows) et produire les livrables UX (wireframes HD ou SD selon le besoin)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exploitez des outils de vibe-coding et des workflows AI-oriented, prototyper des interfaces engageantes et intuitives (maquettes basse et haute fidélité)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborer avec des profils variés (métier, PM, PO, développeurs, créatifs, experts IA, data scientists) pour assurer la cohérence et la qualité des livrables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Définir et suivre des KPIs pertinents pour mesurer la performance des expériences conçues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Le profil que nous recherchons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Formation &amp;amp; expérience :&lt;/strong&gt; vous êtes issu(e) d&#39;une formation supérieure en design, UX ou technologies digitales (Bac+3 à Bac+5) et vous justifiez d&#39;une &lt;strong&gt;première expérience d&#39;au moins 2 ans&lt;/strong&gt; sur un poste similaire (en agence ou chez l&#39;annonceur).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture IA &amp;amp; tech :&lt;/strong&gt; vous êtes un(e) passionné(e) d&#39;innovation. Vous avez une &lt;strong&gt;forte appétence pour les workflows IA&lt;/strong&gt; et vous utilisez déjà activement des outils d&#39;IA générative et de vibe-coding dans vos processus de travail quotidiens pour gagner en impact et en rapidité.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autonomie &amp;amp; &quot;High Agency&quot; :&lt;/strong&gt; vous faites preuve d&#39;&lt;strong&gt;autonomie&lt;/strong&gt; et d&#39;une forte capacité d&#39;initiative. Vous savez cadrer vos sujets et avancer avec assurance, même dans des environnements agiles et en constante évolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Esprit d&#39;équipe &amp;amp; collaboration :&lt;/strong&gt; vous adorez croiser les disciplines. Travailler main dans la main avec des créatifs, des développeurs, mais aussi des data scientists et des experts en IA est une source d&#39;inspiration pour vous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rigueur &amp;amp; centricité utilisateur :&lt;/strong&gt; Vous maîtrisez la palette des méthodologies de recherche et de conception UX. Vous savez transformer des parcours ou des concepts complexes en expériences fluides, mémorables et mesurables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi nous rejoindre :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Artefact 3000 est l’agence où il faut être : venez développer votre créativité dans une agence de publicité technophile qui monte qui monte...&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Progression : chaque jour offre de nouveaux défis et de nouvelles opportunités d&#39;apprendre.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culture : rejoignez la meilleure équipe que vous puissiez imaginer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fourchette de salaire : de 46 000€ à 50 000€ brut / an selon profil&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process de recrutement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1er entretien : Directeur de création &amp;amp; Directrice Planning Stratégique&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2eme entretien : Talent Specialist Acquisition&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cas pratique&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3eme entretien : AI Creative Tech&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;optionnel 4e entretien : Partner&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Artefact, nous recrutons nos collaborateurs uniquement en fonction de nos besoins et des qualités propres de chaque candidat. Nous assurons le développement de leurs compétences professionnelles et de leurs responsabilités sans discrimination d’aucune sorte, notamment de croyances, de genre, d’âge, de situation d&#39;handicap, d’origine ethnique, d’orientation sexuelle, d’appartenance à une organisation politique, religieuse, syndicale ou à une minorité.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qui sommes-nous?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact est une nouvelle génération de société spécialisée dans le conseil en data et en marketing digital data-driven, dont les 2500 employés répartis sur 27 pays ont pour mission de transformer les données de nos clients en impact business tangible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La société est née en France en 2014 et à connu une croissance forte, sur son métier historique, le conseil data marketing, mais aussi progressivement sur tous les cas d’usages data appliqués à l’entreprise. Artefact est soutenu par des investisseurs de premier plan (Cinven), européens, et qui visent à bâtir un leader mondial dans son secteur.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Le département Digital &amp;amp; Data Marketing d’Artefact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au sein des bureaux parisiens, l’équipe Digital &amp;amp; Data Marketing d’Artefact France est composée de 70 consultants dont le rôle est de construire les stratégies digital marketing les plus adaptées aux enjeux de nos clients, de les déployer et d’en mesurer la performance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En fonction des besoins des clients, nous aurons un rôle de conseil (stratégie, diagnostic de performance, modèle opérationnel, feuille de route, …) et/ou un rôle de mise en oeuvre avec les opérations de campagne et le déploiement de mesure du ROI (attribution/incrémentalité/MMM)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ces projets s’appuient sur une expertise complète des canaux marketing et des plateformes en Paid Social, Paid Search, Programmatique, Retail media, mais aussi sur une expertise avancée et en plein développement du GEO.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qui recherchons-nous ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dans ce contexte, nous recherchons pour accompagner notre croissance un(e) consultant(e) digital &amp;amp; data marketing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsabilités principales&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Le/La consultant(e) digital &amp;amp; data marketing pilote, avec une large autonomie, des projets complets de bout en bout. Localisé dans des équipes chez le client ou dans nos bureaux parisiens, il/elle sera supervisé/e par un n+1 (manager, directeur, partner) et il/elle sera amené(e) à possiblement encadrer les consultants juniors.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pilotage d’un ou plusieurs streams projet&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer le delivery d’une mission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifier les points de blocage et identifier des pistes de résolutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fournir des feedbacks constructifs aux membres plus juniors de l&#39;équipe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production des livrables de mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produire de manière autonome des présentations (benchmarks, études de cas/marché, workshops decks, sections steerco) en collaboration horizontale avec les équipes d’experts (Paid Social, Paid Search, …)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rédiger des storylines (messages clés, contenu, stratégie média / d’activation / marketing...)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Préparer et animer les interviews et workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conduite de la relation client&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Construire une relation de confiance avec les clients en garantissant une qualité de livrables best-in class&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Démontrer de l&#39;assurance dans les situations d’appel d’offres&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifier de potentielles opportunités business&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez 2 à 3 ans d&#39;expérience professionnelle dans un cabinet de conseil ou agence digital &amp;amp; data marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez un profil avec une culture ‘business’ x ‘data’ x ‘marketing’&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous êtes curieux(se) et passionné(e) par les sujets liés à la data, au marketing, et à l’évolution technologique.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez un état d&#39;esprit analytique et aimez résoudre des problèmes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous maîtrisez : Suite Google/Pack Office, outils de workshop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une expérience avec les outils digitaux sera appréciée : Google Analytics, Google Ads, Meta Business Manager, TikTok Ads, etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une excellente communication (écrite / orale) en &lt;strong&gt;Français&lt;/strong&gt; et en &lt;strong&gt;Anglais&lt;/strong&gt; est obligatoire.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Package de rémunération : 45K fixe à 50K fixe (selon profil) + 4K de variable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process de recrutement :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HR&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entretien fit, Manager Conseil&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entretien avec étude de cas en direct avec un Directeur Conseil&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entretien final, Partner&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion et diversité :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Artefact, nous sommes convaincus que la diversité des parcours, des expériences et des perspectives fait la richesse de nos équipes. Nous nous engageons à offrir un environnement inclusif et des opportunités équitables, où chacune et chacun peut évoluer et exprimer pleinement son potentiel. Nos recrutements reposent sur les compétences, le potentiel et l&#39;adéquation avec le rôle.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Cato Networks is the converged network and security cloud for the AI era.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;As AI reshapes cybersecurity, enterprises face a dual challenge: unlocking AI’s potential while defending against AI-driven attacks. Cato addresses both through a unified, cloud-native platform, providing the visibility and context to prioritize risks and stop threats in real time across users, applications, data, and AI agents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Join us as we scale: take on ambitious technological challenges and shape the next generation of enterprise security at a company trusted by thousands of organizations worldwide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Regional Sales Director who shares our enthusiasm for cybersecurity and SaaS innovation. If you&#39;re ready to take on the challenge of selling cutting-edge solutions to organisations within a defined territory, we’d love to have you on our team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Sales in Your Territory: &lt;/strong&gt;Own the sales cycle within your assigned region, from prospecting to closing, securing deals with mid-to-large accounts and building lasting relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engage with Decision-Makers: &lt;/strong&gt;Connect with key decision-makers (CIOs, CISOs, CTOs) and align our cybersecurity and SaaS solutions with their business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Focus: &lt;/strong&gt;Position our solutions as integral to customers&#39; long-term success and become a trusted advisor within your territory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage Sales Cycles: &lt;/strong&gt;Navigate sales cycles of varying lengths, managing multiple stakeholders and maintaining momentum throughout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage Data: &lt;/strong&gt;Use sales intelligence, win-loss analysis, and pipeline metrics to refine strategies for ongoing success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate &amp;amp; Share Knowledge: &lt;/strong&gt;Work alongside the sales team, sharing insights and best practices to drive success within the territory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner for Growth: &lt;/strong&gt;Develop relationships with local MSSPs, VARs, and other strategic partners to expand market reach and bring solutions to more organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay Informed: &lt;/strong&gt;Stay ahead of industry trends and help position our solutions as leaders in the market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;: 5-10 years of experience in territory sales within cybersecurity, SaaS, or related industries, with proven success in managing sales cycles and engaging with decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Success&lt;/strong&gt;: A demonstrated history of consistently meeting or exceeding sales quotas and driving revenue growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Knowledge&lt;/strong&gt;: Strong understanding of cybersecurity, SaaS, or networking solutions, with awareness of current market trends and competitive positioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relationship-Driven&lt;/strong&gt;: Ability to build long-term, trust-based relationships with key stakeholders and decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative&lt;/strong&gt;: Experience working with partners, MSSPs, VARs, and other strategic collaborators to drive sales and expand business opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-JW1&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Banyan Software is the best permanent home for software businesses that serve specialized industries, their employees, and their customers. With a buy-grow-and-hold-for-life approach and a permanent capital base, Banyan acquires and grows companies worldwide, honoring founder legacies and helping portfolio companies modernize through shared AI expertise and operational discipline. Founded in 2016, Banyan operates more than 120 portfolio companies across North and South America, Europe, and APAC, and has appeared on the Inc. 5000 list for six consecutive years. The Banyan Software Foundation, endowed with $100 million in Banyan stock, leverages technology to build a greener and more equitable world.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Directeur / Directrice M&amp;amp;A - France (H/F)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil du poste&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que leader de terrain au sein de l&#39;équipe M&amp;amp;A, le Directeur ou la Directrice pilote plusieurs acquisitions par an, de l&#39;évaluation initiale à l&#39;intégration post-closing. Il ou elle rencontre les propriétaires d&#39;entreprises afin d&#39;évaluer leur adéquation aux critères d&#39;acquisition de la société et d&#39;en déterminer la valorisation. Après l&#39;acquisition, il ou elle est responsable de la stratégie et des principales améliorations opérationnelles. En lien étroit avec l&#39;équipe d&#39;origination, les operating partners et l&#39;équipe finance, il ou elle dirige et développe la fonction M&amp;amp;A au sein de son vertical, en apportant un leadership et une direction à l&#39;équipe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Localisation: Paris, France&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsabilités&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rencontrer les propriétaires d&#39;éditeurs de logiciels et partager la proposition de valeur de la société : être le meilleur port d&#39;attache permanent pour les entreprises acquises.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Piloter plusieurs processus d&#39;acquisition par an, de la lettre d&#39;intention (LOI) jusqu&#39;au closing, en collaborant avec les propriétaires d&#39;entreprises sur les enjeux clés et les obstacles rencontrés, afin d&#39;assurer la réussite des opérations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyser les données financières et élaborer des modèles de valorisation financière.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diriger les travaux de due diligence afin d’identifier les principaux risques et opportunités des entreprises cibles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gérer efficacement les ressources internes et les prestataires externes selon les besoins (techniques, comptables, juridiques).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gérer l&#39;intégration post-acquisition, en mettant en œuvre les meilleures pratiques de la société en matière de gestion d&#39;éditeurs de logiciels et en capitalisant sur les opportunités identifiées lors de la due diligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entretenir les relations avec les intermédiaires et les banquiers d&#39;affaires afin de soutenir les efforts de développement commercial.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Constituer une équipe M&amp;amp;A pour accompagner le développement d&#39;un vertical spécialisé.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications requises&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expérience avérée en tant que leader M&amp;amp;A, avec un volume significatif de transactions buy-side réalisées dans le secteur des logiciels et de la technologie en France.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacité et volonté d&#39;influencer stratégiquement la direction, de développer l&#39;équipe et de faire croître la région, tout en étant à l&#39;aise pour s&#39;impliquer directement et opérationnellement dans les transactions, en tant que premier profil d&#39;exécution de la région.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une qualification CA/CPA et/ou un MBA constitue un atout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacité à évaluer rapidement les principaux risques et opportunités d&#39;une entreprise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacité à négocier et à exécuter des acquisitions avec des propriétaires et dirigeants d&#39;entreprises.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culture financière et capacité à construire des présentations destinées aux comités de direction et aux conseils d&#39;administration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maîtrise professionnelle de l&#39;anglais et du français, à l&#39;écrit comme à l&#39;oral.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous ne disposons pas encore de bureau physique en France, celui-ci sera situé à Paris. Nous recherchons des personnes à l&#39;aise avec un fonctionnement hybride, idéalement 2 à 3 jours ou plus par semaine sur site.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Director of M&amp;amp;A - France&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Profile:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a front-line leader on the M&amp;amp;A team, the Director leads multiple acquisitions per year from early-stage evaluation through to post-closing integration, meeting with business owners to evaluate alignment with the company’s acquisition criteria and to determine prospective company valuations. Post-acquisition, the Director will be responsible for strategy and key operational improvements.&amp;nbsp; Working closely with the origination team, operating partners, and finance team, the Director will be expected to lead and grow the M&amp;amp;A function within their industry vertical, providing senior leadership and direction to the team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Paris, France&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet with software owners and share the company’s value proposition of being the best permanent home for the acquired business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead multiple acquisition processes per year, from LOI through closing, collaborating with business owners on key issues and roadblocks to ensure successful closings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse financial data and prepare financial valuation models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead diligence efforts to surface key risks and opportunities in target businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively manage internal resources and external vendors as needed (e.g., tech, accounting, legal).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage post-acquisition integration, implementing the company’s best practices for running software companies and capitalising on the opportunities surfaced during diligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nurture relationships with business brokers and bankers to aid business development efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build an M&amp;amp;A team to support the development of a specialised vertical.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications for success:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience as an M&amp;amp;A leader having executed a volume of buy side transactions in the software and technology sector in France.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability and willingness to strategically influence leadership, grow the team and develop the region, while also being comfortable &#39;rolling up your sleeves&#39; in transactions as the first execution headcount in the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CA/CPA and/or MBA is an asset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to quickly evaluate key risks and opportunities in a business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to negotiate and execute acquisitions with business owners/executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial literacy and the ability to build presentations for executive- and board-level audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business-level written and spoken fluency in English and French&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;While we don&#39;t have a physical office in France yet, it will be in Paris, and we will be looking for people comfortable working there in a hybrid capacity, ideally 2-3+ days a week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Diversity, Equity, Inclusion &amp;amp; Equal Employment Opportunity at Banyan: Banyan affirms that inequality is detrimental to our Global Teams, associates, our Operating Companies, and the communities we serve. As a collective, our goal is to impact lasting change through our actions. Together, we unite for equality and equity. Banyan is committed to equal employment opportunities regardless of any protected characteristic, including race, color, genetic information, creed, national origin, religion, sex, affectional or sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, lawful alien status, ancestry, age, marital status, or protected veteran status and will not discriminate against anyone on the basis of a disability. We support an inclusive workplace where associates excel based on personal merit, qualifications, experience, ability, and job performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please Note&lt;/strong&gt;: Banyan Software does not accept unsolicited resumes or applications submitted via email, LinkedIn, or other direct channels. All candidates must apply through our official Careers site to be considered for employment. Applications submitted outside of our applicant tracking system will not be reviewed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Banyan Software may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to assist in screening and/or assessing applicants during the recruitment process. All hiring decisions are made by our team. Personal information submitted through your application will be collected and used for recruitment purposes in accordance with applicable privacy laws. Contact us at any time with questions about our process or to request accommodation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Beware of Recruitment Scams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have been made aware of individuals fraudulently posing as members of our Talent Acquisition team and extending fake job offers. These scams may involve requests for personal information or payment for equipment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protect yourself by following these steps:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verify that all communications from our recruiting team come from an ----- email address.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remember, employers will &lt;strong&gt;never&lt;/strong&gt; request payment or banking information during the hiring process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you receive a suspicious message, &lt;strong&gt;do not respond&lt;/strong&gt; — instead, forward it to &lt;a ---------- and/or report it to the platform where you received it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your safety and security are important to us. Thank you for staying vigilant.&lt;/p&gt;
