&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:3044533,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:460,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:260,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;41&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Consumer Packaged Goods (CPG)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:3044533,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:460,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:260,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;42&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Retail&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:3044533,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:460,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:260,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;43&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Pharmaceuticals &amp;amp; Life Sciences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:3044533,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:460,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:260,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;44&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Manufacturing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:3044533,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:460,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:260,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;45&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Financial Services&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:3044533,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:460,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:260,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;46&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Government and Public Services&lt;/span&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Prior experience as an embedded or forward-deployed architect within a client environment, and exposure to regulated industries would be desired.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What a career at Baringa will give you&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;Putting&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(208, 0, 111);&quot;&gt;People&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;First.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Baringa is a People First company and wellbeing is at the forefront of our culture. We recognise the importance of work-life balance and flexible working and provide our staff amazing benefits. Some of these benefits include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;33&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Generous Annual Leave Policy:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; We recognise everyone needs a well-deserved break. We provide our employees with 5 weeks of annual leave, fully available at the start of each year. In addition to this, we have introduced our 5-Year Recharge benefit which allows all employees an additional 2 weeks of paid leave after 5 years continuous service.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1320,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;33&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Flexible Working:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; We know that the ‘ideal’ work-life balance will vary from person to person and change at different stages of our working lives. To accommodate this, we have implemented a hybrid working policy and introduced more flexibility around taking unpaid leave.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1320,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;33&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Corporate Responsibility Days:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; Our world is important to us, so all our employees get 3 every year to help social and environmental causes and increase our impact on the communities that mean the most to us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1320,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;33&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Wellbeing Fund:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; We want to encourage all employees to take charge and prioritise their own wellbeing. We’ve introduced our annual People Fund to support this by offering every individual a fund to support and manage their wellbeing through an activity of their choice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1320,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;33&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;5&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Profit Share Scheme:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; All employees participate in the Baringa Group Profit Share Scheme so everyone has a stake in the company’s success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1320,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We are proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer. We believe that creating an environment where everyone feels a sense of belonging is central to our culture and that diversity is paramount to driving creativity, innovation, and value for our clients and for our people.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;An award-winning workplace&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You can be a part of our ‘Great Place to Work’ – with our commitment to women and well-being in the workplace for all. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/en/impact/awards/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Click here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; to see some of our recent awards and how we’ve achieved this.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Using business as a force for good.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We maintain high standards of environmental performance and transparency, which can be seen through our commitment to Net Zero with our SBTI-verified Scope 1, 2 and 3 emissions reduction targets and our support of the Better Business Act. We report our progress publicly and ensure that we are also externally assessed and scored through organisations like CDP and EcoVadis - helping us to continually identify where we can improve.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We have a long legacy of supporting the communities in which we work, and offer a variety of ways to contribute, by putting people first and creating impact that lasts. Our Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR) agenda is about giving back to the communities in which we live and work by sharing our skills, talent and time. In essence, we aim to empower and encourage everyone in the firm to contribute to the things we care about, and support registered charities and organisations with a clear social or environmental purpose to increase the positive impact they can have.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(208, 0, 111); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Join us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;All applications received will be reviewed by a member of our Talent Acquisition team. We never rely solely on automated screening or AI tools to make hiring decisions. Your application will be considered for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, nationality, disability, age, faith or social background. We do not filter applications by university background and encourage those who have taken alternative educational and career paths to apply. We would like to actively encourage applications from those who identify with less represented and minority groups. We operate an inclusive recruitment process, ensuring reasonable adjustments where needed. Please contact a member of our Recruitment Team to discuss further.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(208, 0, 111); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Baringa Privacy Notices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For UK &amp;amp; EU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Your personal data will be retained by Baringa for up to two years, in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-004-ukrpn---uk-recruitment-privacy-notice-pdf.pdf&quot;&gt;UK Recruitment Privacy Notice / &lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-005-eurpn---eu-recruitment-privacy-notice-pdf.pdf&quot;&gt;EU Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;, to evaluate your application and meet our legal and reporting obligations. In line with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), you have the right to request access to, rectification, or erasure (subject to legal limitations) of your personal data. For more information, please contact us at &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For the USA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Your personal data may be retained by Baringa for up to two years, as outlined in our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-007-nerpn-amer--apac-recruitment-privacy-notice-word.pdf&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Notice (AMER &amp;amp; APAC)&lt;/a&gt;, to support the recruitment process and internal reporting requirements. Where applicable, and in accordance with relevant federal and state laws, you may have the right to request access to or correction of your personal information. For further details, please contact &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For Australia &amp;amp; Singapore&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Your personal data will be retained by Baringa for up to two years, in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-007-nerpn-amer--apac-recruitment-privacy-notice-word.pdf&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Notice (AMER &amp;amp; APAC)&lt;/a&gt;, to assess your application and meet applicable reporting and legal obligations. In line with the Australian Privacy Act and Singapore’s Personal Data Protection Act (PDPA), you may have rights to access, correct, or request limited deletion of your personal data. For more information, please contact us at &lt;a ----------Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;About Baringa&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Baringa is a global consulting firm that partners with leaders to drive change and create value. With deep industry expertise, and enabled by advanced technology, the firm helps clients to deliver with greater confidence and certainty. With over 2,000 people across the UK, Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, the firm combines global insight with local understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The firm works across energy and resources, financial services, government and public sector, consumer products and retail, pharmaceuticals and life sciences, manufacturing, and technology, media and telecoms, with capabilities spanning strategy, transformation and operational excellence – all powered by advanced technology, data, AI and digital innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clients value Baringa’s collaborative approach and the way its teams integrate seamlessly – all working with a shared understanding of what matters most. The firm is known for its kind, curious experts who listen closely and care deeply about client success as they help clients transform energy markets, modernise financial platforms, expand telecoms and digital networks through advanced data analytics, enable digital services in government, and unlock growth in consumer sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Certified as a&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Great Place to Work &lt;/em&gt;around the world, Baringa has been recognised by the &lt;em&gt;Financial Times &lt;/em&gt;in 22 categories of its UK Leading Management Consultants rankings, and by &lt;em&gt;Forbes &lt;/em&gt;for four consecutive years as one of the World’s Best Management Consulting Firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our Technology practice are looking for an experienced Architecture Manager to join the team.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In Technology, we help clients define, drive and deliver technology-led change. We have deep experience in the strategy, design, delivery and assurance of large-scale transformation across financial services, energy, commodities, utilities, telecoms and government. Our people become trusted advisors, independent of any technology provider, and deliver real value for our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI is changing how organisations work, compete and invest, and it’s changing architecture with it. Our clients need architects who can cut through the hype, turn ambition into practical action and create value without losing control of cost, risk or complexity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In our Architecture practice we bring the right balance of innovation, pace and control to technology-enabled change. We work on our clients’ most complex and highest-return challenges. Commodity or ivory-tower architecture isn’t where we play.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Manager, you’ll lead architecture work, use AI to raise the pace and quality of what we deliver, and play an active part in growing our business. You’ll spot opportunities, shape compelling work and build relationships that last well beyond a single engagement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead architecture that delivers real value&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll lead architecture work that turns strategy into practical change. That means owning architecture engagements and workstreams, shaping target architectures and roadmaps, and helping clients make better decisions about where to invest, what to simplify and how to manage risk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead engagements with clear ownership of scope, quality, outcomes and client relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help organisations improve their architecture functions, operating models and governance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate complex ideas clearly, from delivery teams through to CTOs and CIOs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help clients navigate AI-enabled change&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll help clients move from interest in AI to safe, valuable adoption. We’ll look to you to cut through the noise, design for change and make sure AI-enabled solutions have the foundations they need: data, integration, security, identity, governance and clear ownership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape AI-ready architectures that balance innovation, pace and control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help clients move beyond disconnected pilots to reusable services, governed delivery and measurable value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools to speed up research, analysis, option development and architecture artefacts, with strong quality assurance throughout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create and convert commercial opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll play an active part in growing our business. That means spotting where we can help, shaping work that clients value and building the confidence to convert good conversations into deliverable opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualify opportunities through delivery, market insight and trusted relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape proposals, statements of work, team shapes and commercial models with discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build architecture propositions that match our growth priorities and the challenges our clients face&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead people and build our capability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll help build the kind of team people want to work in and clients want to work with. You’ll coach others, share what works and help us turn individual expertise into reusable capability across the practice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead mixed Baringa and client teams with clear expectations and a strong coaching mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach colleagues on effective and responsible use of AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help grow the practice through training, thought leadership, reusable assets and recruitment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Your skills and experience&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading architecture work within complex technology-enabled change, with a strong delivery focus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in both enterprise and solution architecture, translating strategy into deliverable target architectures and roadmaps, and designing and assuring solutions to achieve it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Broad experience across architecture domains (business, application, integration, data, infrastructure and security), with deep expertise in at least one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud experience across XaaS offerings, with knowledge of cloud-native services and how to use them in cloud and hybrid solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A practical understanding of AI and the architecture considerations needed to adopt it safely and at scale. Hands-on AI design experience is a bonus, not a must&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to proposals, bids or account growth, and the commercial awareness to shape work that is valuable and deliverable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to take ownership of projects and teams, sell work and deliver results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, with the ability to explain the complex in simple terms, concisely and with clarity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing stakeholders from C-suite through to engineering, and a desire to build lasting relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative style, real curiosity and a genuine interest in helping others grow&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What a career at Baringa will give you&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;Putting&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(208, 0, 111);&quot;&gt;People&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;First.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Baringa is a People First company and wellbeing is at the forefront of our culture. We recognise the importance of work-life balance and flexible working and provide our staff amazing benefits. Some of these benefits include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;33&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Generous Annual Leave Policy:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; We recognise everyone needs a well-deserved break. We provide our employees with 5 weeks of annual leave, fully available at the start of each year. In addition to this, we have introduced our 5-Year Recharge benefit which allows all employees an additional 2 weeks of paid leave after 5 years continuous service.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1320,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;33&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Flexible Working:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; We know that the ‘ideal’ work-life balance will vary from person to person and change at different stages of our working lives. To accommodate this, we have implemented a hybrid working policy and introduced more flexibility around taking unpaid leave.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1320,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;33&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Corporate Responsibility Days:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; Our world is important to us, so all our employees get 3 every year to help social and environmental causes and increase our impact on the communities that mean the most to us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1320,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;33&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Wellbeing Fund:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; We want to encourage all employees to take charge and prioritise their own wellbeing. We’ve introduced our annual People Fund to support this by offering every individual a fund to support and manage their wellbeing through an activity of their choice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1320,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;33&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;5&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Profit Share Scheme:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; All employees participate in the Baringa Group Profit Share Scheme so everyone has a stake in the company’s success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1320,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We are proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer. We believe that creating an environment where everyone feels a sense of belonging is central to our culture and that diversity is paramount to driving creativity, innovation, and value for our clients and for our people.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;An award-winning workplace&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You can be a part of our ‘Great Place to Work’ – with our commitment to women and well-being in the workplace for all. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/en/impact/awards/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Click here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; to see some of our recent awards and how we’ve achieved this.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Using business as a force for good.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We maintain high standards of environmental performance and transparency, which can be seen through our commitment to Net Zero with our SBTI-verified Scope 1, 2 and 3 emissions reduction targets and our support of the Better Business Act. We report our progress publicly and ensure that we are also externally assessed and scored through organisations like CDP and EcoVadis - helping us to continually identify where we can improve.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We have a long legacy of supporting the communities in which we work, and offer a variety of ways to contribute, by putting people first and creating impact that lasts. Our Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR) agenda is about giving back to the communities in which we live and work by sharing our skills, talent and time. In essence, we aim to empower and encourage everyone in the firm to contribute to the things we care about, and support registered charities and organisations with a clear social or environmental purpose to increase the positive impact they can have.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(208, 0, 111); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Join us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;All applications received will be reviewed by a member of our Talent Acquisition team. We never rely solely on automated screening or AI tools to make hiring decisions. Your application will be considered for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, nationality, disability, age, faith or social background. We do not filter applications by university background and encourage those who have taken alternative educational and career paths to apply. We would like to actively encourage applications from those who identify with less represented and minority groups. We operate an inclusive recruitment process, ensuring reasonable adjustments where needed. Please contact a member of our Recruitment Team to discuss further.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(208, 0, 111); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Baringa Privacy Notices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For UK &amp;amp; EU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Your personal data will be retained by Baringa for up to two years, in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-004-ukrpn---uk-recruitment-privacy-notice-pdf.pdf&quot;&gt;UK Recruitment Privacy Notice / &lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-005-eurpn---eu-recruitment-privacy-notice-pdf.pdf&quot;&gt;EU Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;, to evaluate your application and meet our legal and reporting obligations. In line with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), you have the right to request access to, rectification, or erasure (subject to legal limitations) of your personal data. For more information, please contact us at &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For the USA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Your personal data may be retained by Baringa for up to two years, as outlined in our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-007-nerpn-amer--apac-recruitment-privacy-notice-word.pdf&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Notice (AMER &amp;amp; APAC)&lt;/a&gt;, to support the recruitment process and internal reporting requirements. Where applicable, and in accordance with relevant federal and state laws, you may have the right to request access to or correction of your personal information. For further details, please contact &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For Australia &amp;amp; Singapore&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Your personal data will be retained by Baringa for up to two years, in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-007-nerpn-amer--apac-recruitment-privacy-notice-word.pdf&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Notice (AMER &amp;amp; APAC)&lt;/a&gt;, to assess your application and meet applicable reporting and legal obligations. In line with the Australian Privacy Act and Singapore’s Personal Data Protection Act (PDPA), you may have rights to access, correct, or request limited deletion of your personal data. For more information, please contact us at &lt;a ----------Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;The UK Operations Team is responsible for delivering Waymo service across UK cities. This role works closely with Product, Operations Partnerships, Engineering, Global Operations, Ops Planning, Finance, Safety, Policy and business partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;We are seeking a confident, decisive, and results-oriented leader to join our team as a Supply Operations Manager. This role demands an individual who thrives in fast-paced, dynamic environments, excels at managing cross-functional teams, and is committed to driving operational success and market excellence for our autonomous ride-hailing service. You&#39;ll foster strong partnerships, champion continuous improvement, and leverage data analytics to monitor market health, identify trends, and implement proactive strategies to balance demand and supply, ultimately driving innovation and long-term success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;In this hybrid role, you will report to the &lt;strong&gt;Country Lead within the European Market Operations Team.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Leadership (Partner Support/Management): Strategic and decisive leadership to manage and optimize daily partner operations, fostering a high-performance culture emphasizing collaboration and accountability, escalating product issues while supporting partner multi-facility operations (partner results) to ensure strict adherence to all safety, compliance, and regulatory protocols.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercialization: Primary liaison to support internal stakeholders in expanding the market by providing guidance and expertise, communicating with all stakeholders to ensure alignment, monitoring progress, identifying potential issues, and developing contingency plans to ensure the success and sustainability of the market scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supply &amp;amp; Demand Planning: Manage Supply &amp;amp; Demand Planning by ensuring that staffing levels align with operational needs and in-service supply.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous Improvement: Must be continuously monitoring and improving processes, systems, and performance metrics to drive efficiency and productivity, and reduce costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-Lead Market Expansion: Strategically expand the market by executing innovative initiatives with partners, leveraging data insights, and applying critical thinking to identify opportunities and resolve challenges effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build Collaborative Partnerships: Build and maintain strong partnerships across the company and with partners, ensuring alignment with organizational standards, goals, and a shared commitment to success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Sustainable Outcomes: Serve as a trusted leader with a continuous improvement mindset, consistently monitoring and enhancing processes, systems, and performance metrics to drive operational excellence, strengthen stakeholder alignment, and deliver measurable, sustainable results, all while boosting efficiency, productivity, and reducing costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maximize Market Profitability: Manage departmental budgets, identifying and implementing cost-saving initiatives, and monitoring key performance indicators to effectively allocate resources and ensure all operational initiatives align with financial parameters and organizational goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in operations management, preferably managing daily operations in a fast-paced environment in fleet management, transportation, or logistics, with a deep understanding of safety.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree, or in lieu of a degree, an additional 6+ years of work experience in a combination of program management, business operations, strategy consulting, planning, or equivalent fields.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent leadership skills, including the ability to motivate &amp;amp; lead by influence partner teams, develop and execute strategies, and drive performance improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to deal with multiple conflicting priorities and stakeholder issues while driving towards pragmatic decisions/actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills to identify and address performance issues proactively, preferably using data analytics tools and reporting software to track key metrics and performance trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and presentation skills showcasing an ability to influence people to contribute to continuous improvement of operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Ride-Hail &amp;amp; Transportation: Direct experience in the ride-hailing or broader transportation industry is a significant plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-Driven Decision Making: Proficiency in leveraging data analytics and reporting tools to monitor market health and inform strategic decisions is essential. Experience with SQL and data mining is highly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operational Management Experience: A background in general operations management, vendor management in addition to the minimum requirements, would be beneficial.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous Improvement Mindset: A demonstrated history of identifying and implementing process improvements to increase efficiency and reduce costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic &amp;amp; Decisive Leadership: The ability to provide clear, strategic leadership and make quick decisions in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The expected base salary range for this full-time position is listed below. Actual starting pay will be based on job-related factors, including exact work location, experience, relevant training and education, and skill level.&amp;nbsp; Waymo employees are also eligible to participate in Waymo’s discretionary annual bonus program, equity incentive plan, and generous Company benefits program, subject to eligibility requirements. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£92,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£96,500 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Europe Operations team is accountable for service delivery and eliminating supply blockers to meet demand, working closely with technical program managers, facility engineers, and site operations leaders dedicated to building and sustaining the world&#39;s most advanced autonomous fleet infrastructure. We&amp;nbsp; bridge physical engineering, power grid delivery, and software tooling to ensure Waymo&#39;s fleet operates safely, efficiently and continuously at global scale.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this hybrid role, you will report to the &lt;strong&gt;Director of Operations, Head of Europe Operations&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate European Site &amp;amp; Infrastructure Enablement: Lead the end-to-end multi-country program execution for new facility bring-up, high-voltage EV charging grid interconnections, and tech deployment across European hubs, ensuring infrastructure resilience and readiness for multi-market autonomous fleet operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Scalable Automation &amp;amp; Process Architecture: Standardize depot workflows across European facilities enabling scale &amp;amp; fleet growth, using continuous improvement principles, tracking mitigations, and removing blockers for scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complex Program Management: Establish and enforce a unified framework for rider-only operations, driving decisions to unlock all types of infra required to deliver service, including parking, charging, pit-stops, service centers and testing locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive Vendor &amp;amp; Strategic Supplier Governance: Establish strategic new and existing partner frameworks and requirements across Europe to deliver high-performing SLA adherence, CapEx efficiencies, and continuous service delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build High-Impact Cross-Functional Alignment: Serve as the strategic bridge between Facilities, Engineering and Product leadership and local European field teams, aligning international program goals with technical roadmap requirements and regional operational realities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize Multi-Country CapEx/OpEx Portfolios: Lead multi-million Euro infrastructure and technology budgets, establishing resource allocation models, cost-efficiency benchmarks, and financial governance to ensure European market expansion meets strategic financial targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience leading complex programs, technology operations, or infra-structure/industrial program management across multiple facilities, including multi-country European expansion in transportation or other operating fields/automated logistics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record as a senior technical, program management or strategy involving infrastructure, real estate bring-up, or large-scale technical operations across European regulatory jurisdictions (e.g., UK, Germany, Spain, France).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced expertise in data-driven operations management, using large sets of data to drive decision making, business intelligence, and advanced metrics to track multi-site throughput, charger utilization rates, and operational resilience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience developing and executing multi-facility Business Continuity Plans (BCP) and crisis recovery frameworks across high-demand critical facilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Engineering, Supply Chain, Business Operations, or equivalent practical experience (Master&#39;s/MBA or Six Sigma Black Belt preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and executive stakeholder management skills with proven ability to influence matrixed cross-functional teams and external regulatory/utility entities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel within the EU up to 40% of the time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomous Mobility &amp;amp; EV Infrastructure Domain Expertise: Deep familiarity with AV fleet operations, or ride-hailing support systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Border Regulatory Leadership: Hands-on experience navigating EU/UK transportation frameworks, municipal zoning, and high-voltage electrical grid interconnections with national utility providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International Program Scaling: Demonstrated success scaling operational footprints from initial pilot programs to multi-city commercial operations across diverse language and legal environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Systems Engineering &amp;amp; Automation Integration: Experience specifying, deploying, and validating programmatic software tools and automation systems inside physical depot environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in European Languages: Professional fluency in German, Spanish, French or other western European languages in addition to English is a strong advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lean/Six Sigma Certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The expected base salary range for this full-time position is listed below. Actual starting pay will be based on job-related factors, including exact work location, experience, relevant training and education, and skill level.&amp;nbsp; Waymo employees are also eligible to participate in Waymo’s discretionary annual bonus program, equity incentive plan, and generous Company benefits program, subject to eligibility requirements. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£118,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£124,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message skipProofing&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Production&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message skipProofing&quot;&gt;We are WPP Production - the unified global production company that brings together all of WPP&#39;s content producers, studios and craft experts into one connected organisation. We combine world-class human craft with next generation technology to originate, design, and deliver multi-channel content systems at scale. Built for borderless collaboration and powered by deep craft expertise, we are the production engine designed for today&#39;s always on, AI driven marketing world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&amp;nbsp;in a single company –&amp;nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&amp;nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__http://wpp.com/__;!!JboVxjCXSME!N9KGoZIn5nCC-uOWhEdE-ChrrJuf6TgkLzNNkLaW9BExJsVqZZ_hMSmGbARJ0tdBOnKYM7kEbv5L3ncUpg7-6uEPNdY$&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;6ded86b6-cde3-4e48-958d-34727f881edd&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Hybrid working model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HEX brings together creative talent, emerging technology and industry-leading partners to turn innovation into scalable solutions for our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Programme Director to lead the end-to-end delivery of a complex, high-profile programme at the intersection of creative production, AI and emerging technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will translate strategic objectives into an integrated delivery plan, bring multiple workstreams together and ensure the programme delivers against its commitments. You’ll take ownership of programme governance, dependencies, risks and decisions, providing the clarity and control needed to navigate complexity and maintain momentum.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working across senior leadership, technology partners, clients and multidisciplinary delivery teams, you’ll connect the bigger picture with the detail of execution, ensuring everyone is aligned on what needs to happen, when and why.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the programme&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the integrated programme plan, translating objectives into clear workstreams, milestones, deliverables and success measures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish effective governance, clear accountability and a consistent approach to programme reporting and decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain oversight of the critical path, dependencies and delivery commitments, ensuring activity across workstreams comes together to achieve the overall programme objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide a clear view of programme health, progress and emerging issues, giving leadership the information needed to make timely, informed decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead delivery across multiple workstreams, aligning teams on priorities, milestones and interdependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate risks, resolve blockers and drive action on issues before they impact delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage changes to scope, timelines and deliverables, assessing their implications and ensuring trade-offs are agreed and understood.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge assumptions, address competing priorities and keep teams focused on the outcomes that matter most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold workstream leads accountable for commitments, following through on actions and intervening where delivery is at risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Align clients and stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with senior stakeholders across WPP, technology partners and client organisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create alignment across teams with different priorities, ensuring clear ownership, timely decisions and a shared understanding of programme objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead programme reviews and executive reporting, communicating progress, risks, decisions and required actions with clarity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the central point of coordination for programme delivery, connecting stakeholders and ensuring commitments translate into action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver measurable outcomes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain oversight of performance against programme objectives, milestones, budgets and agreed commercial commitments, working with the relevant commercial and finance leads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track success measures that demonstrate client adoption, business impact and value delivered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify emerging delivery or commercial risks, making their implications visible and driving appropriate action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use performance data and programme insight to inform decisions, address underperformance and improve outcomes throughout the programme lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience leading complex programmes involving multiple workstreams, interdependent deliverables and senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of translating strategic objectives into executable plans and delivering against challenging commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programme management expertise across integrated planning, governance, critical path management, risk, dependencies and change control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The judgement to anticipate problems, navigate ambiguity and make effective decisions when priorities or delivery conditions change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The confidence to challenge constructively, influence senior stakeholders and hold teams accountable across matrixed organisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial awareness, including an understanding of budgets, forecasts and performance against agreed commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, with the ability to turn complex information into clear decisions, recommendations and executive-level reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, collaborative approach, combining attention to detail with a clear focus on overall programme objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in creative production, digital transformation, AI-enabled programmes or technology partnerships would be advantageous.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear, integrated programme plan that connects workstreams, milestones, dependencies and outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Predictable, well-controlled delivery, with risks anticipated, blockers resolved and commitments actively managed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear accountability across workstreams and strong alignment between clients, partners and delivery teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Timely, informed decision-making supported by transparent reporting and a reliable view of programme performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measurable client outcomes, with clear evidence of adoption, business impact and value delivered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A programme that meets its objectives while adapting effectively as priorities and requirements evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-RH1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why work here:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;At WPP Production, you’ll help shape the future of content production at a truly global scale. We bring together world-class talent, cutting-edge studios, and advanced technology to solve some of the most complex creative and production challenges in the industry. You’ll work in a collaborative, borderless environment where craft excellence is valued, innovation is encouraged, and AI and next-generation tools are used to amplify not replace human creativity. With access to diverse projects, global career opportunities, and the backing of WPP’s unmatched network, this is a place where you can grow your skills, make real impact, and create work that performs for every audience, across every channel, at every moment. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion and Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;WPP is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers. &lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on legitimate interest as a legal basis for processing personal information under the GDPR for purposes of recruitment and applications for employment. When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button at the bottom of this page, this will send all the information you have added to WPP Production. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our Privacy&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hogarthww.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;st&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hogarth.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;atement&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please contact &lt;a ----- ----- if you need the job advert or form in another format.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_8220454926977230902gmail-docs-internal-guid-9a9f34f4-7fff-014a-c97c-98ca90610a47&quot;&gt;Algolia is the retrieval intelligence layer that turns intent into trusted, decision-grade outcomes. Powering more than 1.7 trillion queries a year for over 18,000 customers with millisecond latency and 99.999% reliability, we are the recognized leader for Search and Product Discovery by top industry analyst firms. The Algolia platform turns a company&#39;s products, content, and business rules into data that humans, applications and AI agents can act upon. The result is trusted customer experiences with stronger conversions for measurable business impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Algolia’s Engineering team builds the core infrastructure and product features that power real-time search and discovery for thousands of customers around the world. This includes backend services, frontend components, site reliability, and ML-powered capabilities. The team is distributed, collaborative, and committed to technical excellence and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an &lt;strong&gt;Engineering Director&lt;/strong&gt;, you will lead multiple teams or a critical product area, working closely with Engineering Managers, Product, and Design to deliver scalable, reliable, and high-impact solutions. You will play a key role in translating company strategy into execution, while building strong, autonomous teams and fostering engineering excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role Will Consist Of:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading a &lt;strong&gt;group of engineering teams (via Engineering Managers and Senior ICs)&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring alignment with product and company priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates strong AI leadership within the engineering organization by fostering a culture of &lt;strong&gt;continuous improvement&lt;/strong&gt; and proactively evaluating and applying emerging AI technologies to enhance productivity, efficiency, and organizational performance across the broader technology function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning &lt;strong&gt;delivery, execution, and operational excellence&lt;/strong&gt; for a defined product or platform area&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering closely with &lt;strong&gt;Product, Design, and cross-functional stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt; to shape roadmaps and ensure successful delivery of customer value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving &lt;strong&gt;engineering best practices&lt;/strong&gt; across system design, scalability, reliability, and performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being a member of Algolia’s senior technology leadership team, with significant contributions to &lt;strong&gt;engineering excellence&lt;/strong&gt; and the &lt;strong&gt;high performance&lt;/strong&gt; of the global technology organization, extending beyond the immediate area of responsibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting and coaching &lt;strong&gt;Engineering Managers&lt;/strong&gt;, helping them grow as leaders and build high-performing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to &lt;strong&gt;organizational planning&lt;/strong&gt;, including headcount, team structure, and quarterly/annual planning cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring a strong culture of &lt;strong&gt;ownership, accountability, and continuous improvement&lt;/strong&gt; within your organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acting as a &lt;strong&gt;bridge between strategy and execution&lt;/strong&gt;, translating high-level goals into clear team-level priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serves as a trusted advisor to the CTO and SVP Engineering, providing &lt;strong&gt;strategic guidance&lt;/strong&gt; on engineering leadership, organizational effectiveness, and cross-functional management initiatives across the technology organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Might Be a Fit If You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8–12+ years of engineering experience&lt;/strong&gt;, including &lt;strong&gt;3–5+ years managing multiple teams or managing through managers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience delivering &lt;strong&gt;complex, cross-functional projects&lt;/strong&gt; in a fast-paced, high-growth environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical background with experience in &lt;strong&gt;distributed systems, APIs, and scalable infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to &lt;strong&gt;lead through others&lt;/strong&gt;, empowering managers and senior engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills with the ability to &lt;strong&gt;align diverse stakeholders and drive clarity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating in &lt;strong&gt;distributed or global engineering environments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in &lt;strong&gt;developer tools, infrastructure, or data platforms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;product-led growth (PLG)&lt;/strong&gt; environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong&gt;AI/ML-powered products or platforms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Algolia does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex, age, national origin, military status, veteran status, disability status, sexual orientation, gender identity, genetic information, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The annual base salary compensation range for this role reflects market pay data within this location. The exact compensation offered for this role may vary depending on specific location and job-related knowledge, technical skills, and experience; and is only one part of our Total Rewards philosophy to compensate and recognize employees for their work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£160,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£200,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FLEXIBLE WORKPLACE STRATEGY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Algolia’s flexible workplace model is designed to empower all Algolians to fulfill our mission to power search and discovery with ease. We place an emphasis on an individual’s impact, contribution, and output, over their physical location. Algolia is a high-trust environment and many of our team members have the autonomy to choose where they want to work and when.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a global presence with offices in Paris, NYC, London, Sydney and Bucharest, however we also offer many of our team members the option to work remotely either as fully remote or hybrid-remote employees.&lt;strong&gt; Positions listed as &quot;Remote&quot; are only available for remote work within the specified country. Positions listed within a specific city are only available in that location - depending on the role it may be available with either a hybrid-remote or in-office schedule.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE’RE LOOKING FOR SOMEONE WHO CAN LIVE OUR VALUES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GRIT&lt;/strong&gt; - Problem-solving and perseverance capability in an ever-changing and growing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TRUST &lt;/strong&gt;- Willingness to trust our co-workers and to take ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CANDOR&lt;/strong&gt; - Ability to receive and give constructive feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CARE&lt;/strong&gt; - Genuine care about other team members, our clients and the decisions we make in the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HUMILITY&lt;/strong&gt; - Aptitude for learning from others, putting ego aside.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for talented, passionate people to help build the world’s best search and discovery technology. We value autonomy, diversity, and collaboration. We’re committed to creating an inclusive workplace where everyone is respected and supported—regardless of race, age, ancestry, religion, sex, gender identity, sexual orientation, marital status, color, veteran status, disability, or socioeconomic background.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IMPORTANT NOTICE FOR CANDIDATES - Recruitment Fraud Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve recently seen an increase in recruitment scams targeting job seekers. To help protect yourself, please keep the following in mind:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our open positions may appear on third-party job boards, but the &lt;strong&gt;best way to apply safely&lt;/strong&gt; is directly through our &lt;strong&gt;careers page&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All genuine communication from Algolia will come from an ----- email address. If you receive an email from someone claiming to work at Algolia who does not have an ----- email address, please do not respond or share any personal information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’ll &lt;strong&gt;never ask for payments, purchases, or financial details&lt;/strong&gt; during the hiring process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;READY TO APPLY?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you share our values and our enthusiasm for building the world’s best search &amp;amp; discovery technology, we’d love to review your application!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;NaturalMotion is an award-winning UK game studio dedicated to crafting world-class mobile experiences. Alongside our continued live-service development on CSR Racing 2 (#1 drag racing series of all time), our team is stepping into its next chapter with an ambitious, unannounced project. Honoured for eight consecutive years as a GamesIndustry.biz Best Place to Work in the UK winner and named a Top 50 UK Game Maker in 2025 and 2026, we offer a collaborative studio culture backed by the global reach of Zynga and Take-Two Interactive.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Server &amp;amp; Infrastructure Engineer &lt;/strong&gt;to join our server engineering team. In this role, you will work on core backend systems and backend services, contributing directly to live services and build systems with minimal supervision. You will help manage and expand our infrastructure, automated CI/CD pipelines, and development tools while collaborating closely with technical leads to build reliable, high-performing server environments. You will have a passion for large-scale high-availability systems, a devotion to software craftsmanship, an unwavering commitment to quality, and the desire to have their work seen by tens of millions of people worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We embrace a hybrid work environment. Within this role, you would work 2 days per week in our London office and the remaining days at home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Server &amp;amp; Infrastructure Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Complete multi-day backend engineering tasks with minimal guidance. Design, deploy, and support scalable server architectures and cloud infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DevOps &amp;amp; Pipeline Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Build, maintain, and optimise robust CI/CD workflows and automated deployment pipelines across cloud environments and build platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture &amp;amp; Planning:&lt;/strong&gt; Participate in technical planning, architectural brainstorming, and technical cost/complexity estimation for multi-week efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Efficiency &amp;amp; Quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively identify workflow bottlenecks and drive initiatives to improve overall engineering team productivity, tooling, and code quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Participate in internal tech talks, share best practices, and maintain collaborative peer relationships across engineering squads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programming Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated proficiency in &lt;strong&gt;Python, Go and C#&lt;/strong&gt; for backend services, automation scripts, and custom tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud Infrastructure &amp;amp; IaC:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience provisioning and managing &lt;strong&gt;AWS&lt;/strong&gt; infrastructure using &lt;strong&gt;Terraform&lt;/strong&gt; (Infrastructure as Code).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build &amp;amp; Platform Systems:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience configuring and managing automated orchestration/build platforms (e.g., &lt;strong&gt;Unreal Horde&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Jenkins&lt;/strong&gt;, or &lt;strong&gt;TeamCity&lt;/strong&gt;), preferably with &lt;strong&gt;Game Engines (Unreal Engine, Unity, etc.)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Source Control Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong working knowledge of version control systems and workflow strategies (&lt;strong&gt;GitHub&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Perforce/Helix Core&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Git-flow&lt;/strong&gt;, branch management).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to manage moderate-to-complex technical tasks independently, break down project deliverables, and communicate status accurately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience writing server-side logic and managing database dependencies for live applications or multiplayer services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked in, or has a strong interest in the gaming industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in infrastructure deployment and monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in mentoring junior team members or interns, framing task deconstruction, and conducting technical interviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with containerisation (&lt;strong&gt;Docker, Kubernetes&lt;/strong&gt;) and infrastructure security best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer You:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and discretionary annual bonus scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days holiday, plus bank holidays &amp;amp; 2 paid personal days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6 months fully paid maternity/adoption leave and 16 weeks fully paid paternity leave (eligibility criteria applies)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan, with a double matching employer contribution&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical &amp;amp; dental insurance and healthcare cash plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life insurance, personal accident insurance and income protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and neurodiversity support programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company Employee Stock Purchase Plan (eligibility criteria applies)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fitness reimbursement plan, worth £600 per annum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly happy hours, seasonal parties and monthly social events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual rail season ticket advance and cycle to work scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are proud to be an equal opportunity employer, which means we are committed to creating and celebrating diverse thoughts, cultures, and backgrounds throughout our organization.&amp;nbsp; Employment with us is based on substantive ability, objective qualifications, and work ethic – not an individual’s race, creed, color, religion, sex or gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin or ancestry, alienage or citizenship status, physical or mental disability, pregnancy, age, genetic information, veteran status, marital status, status as a victim of domestic violence or sex offenses, reproductive health decision, or any other characteristics protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an equal opportunity employer, we are committed to providing the necessary support and accommodation to qualified individuals with disabilities, health conditions, or impairments (subject to any local qualifying requirements) to ensure their full participation in the job application or interview process. Please contact us at ----- to request any accommodations or for support related to your application for an open position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware that Zynga does not conduct job interviews or make job offers over third-party messaging apps such as Telegram, WhatsApp, or others.&amp;nbsp; Zynga also does not engage in any financial exchanges during the recruitment or onboarding process, and will never ask a candidate for their personal or financial information over an app or other unofficial chat channel.&amp;nbsp; Any attempt to do so may be the result of a scamp or phishing attack, and you should not engage.&amp;nbsp; Zynga’s&amp;nbsp; in-house recruitment team will only contact individuals through their official Company email addresses (i.e., via a zynga.com, take2games.com, naturalmotion.com, smallgiantgames.com, themavens.com, gram.gs email domain). &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;Teneo is looking for a highly skilled, dynamic and driven communications professional to join its growing Strategic Sports Advisory team in London.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Director, you will be responsible for developing communications strategy and providing senior-led advice to clients. Directors work hand in hand with senior members of the firm to manage client engagements and deliver best-in-class service.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Teneo’s Strategic Sports Advisory team works with sports organisations, their investors and their partners to manage existential reputational issues. We work with some of the biggest names in global sport on briefs ranging from proactive communications strategies, M&amp;amp;A and media relations; through to political &amp;amp; regulatory engagement, crisis &amp;amp; issues management, and sport-specific matters such as player welfare.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and manage communications strategies and campaigns on behalf of global sports clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide strategic counsel to senor executives, boards and leadership teams on complex reputational, commercial and stakeholder issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate emerging risks and opportunities across the sports, political, regulatory and investment landscape, translating these into actionable client advice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive and contribute to business development strategy and outreach, including proposal development, network building and pitch participation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify growth opportunities within existing accounts and support new client acquisition through thought leadership, proposal development and relationship building&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage client relationships day-to-day and act as point person to create and execute on communications initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise clients on engagement with media, governing bodies, investors, commercial partners, governments, regulators and other key stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold responsibility for setting strategy and workloads for core account team and delivering high quality client service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as role model for Teneo’s values, ensuring alignment across teams and business strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build cross-functional relationships, fostering collaboration across Teneo to enhance team and business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years’ experience, either within consultancy or in-house in the field of strategic communications, or through an adjacent role within the sports ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth knowledge of the global business of sport sector and the trends driving investment into Sports, Media &amp;amp; Entertainment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of working internationally, including with clients based in North America and the Middle East&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead cross-border engagements and collaborate effectively across international teams and markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of investment landscape and communications around M&amp;amp;A preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of macroeconomic, political and regulatory environments to inform strategic advice to clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of contributing to business development and expanding client relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive presence, with the ability to influence and build trusted relationships with senior leaders and external stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to think creatively, approach communications from new angles, and manage both up and down the organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written and verbal communications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work from Teneo’s office in London a minimum of three days per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Can Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary (depending on experience)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;28 days holiday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual salary review&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension (with company contribution: 5% of annual salary)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity and paternity leave (depending on length of service) and shared parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Group Income protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to work schemes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Season ticket loans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular social, cultural and charitable activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Teneo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Teneo is the global CEO advisory firm. We partner with our clients globally to do great things for a better future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drawing upon our global team and expansive network of senior advisors, we provide advisory services across our five business segments on a stand-alone or fully integrated basis to help our clients solve complex business challenges. Our clients include a significant number of the Fortune 100 and FTSE 100, as well as other corporations, financial institutions, and organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our full range of advisory services includes strategic communications, investor relations, financial transactions and restructuring, management consulting, physical and cyber risk, organizational design, board and executive search, geopolitics and government affairs, corporate governance, ESG and DE&amp;amp;I.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The firm has more than 2,000 employees located in 50+ offices around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;ZoomInfo is where careers accelerate. We move fast, think boldly, and empower you to do the best work of your life. You’ll be surrounded by teammates who care deeply, challenge each other, and celebrate wins. With tools that amplify your impact and a culture that backs your ambition, you won’t just contribute. You’ll make things happen fast.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a detail-oriented and analytical Contracts Administrator to join our dynamic team. This role is responsible for managing the complete contract lifecycle from quote to cash, ensuring compliance, and driving process improvements. The ideal candidate will serve as a key liaison between sales, legal, and finance teams while maintaining high standards of accuracy and efficiency in contract management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Queue Management &amp;amp; Operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and prioritize Approvals, Closing, and Help Chat queues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide backup support for Trials, Cases, and Auto Renewals queues as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own assigned escalations and ensure timely resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support JIRA ticket management in collaboration with Business Technology team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contract Management &amp;amp; Processing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute quote-to-cash (Q2C) processes and ensure accurate data entry into Salesforce (SFDC)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and approve quotes for accuracy and compliance with company policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess signed DocuSign documents for opportunity closure and provisioning requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and customize quotes &amp;amp; contracts based on sales team specifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Address sales representatives&#39; contract and provisioning concerns with strategic recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compliance &amp;amp; Risk Management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor compliance with company policies and industry regulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and assess contract-related risks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all contract terms align with legal and business requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stakeholder Collaboration &amp;amp; Support&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate effectively with Contracts team members, Sales, Legal, and Finance departments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze and resolve internal stakeholder requests independently and professionally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide expert guidance on contract management best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support team audits and compliance initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Process Improvement &amp;amp; Analytics&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities for process improvement and provide actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, own, and maintain Salesforce reports with custom conditions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate analytical reports to support business decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to developing and implementing contract management best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure effective resource utilization and flag system errors/bugs through ServiceNow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Training &amp;amp; Knowledge Management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train new hires and facilitate knowledge transfer within the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain training documentation and materials for internal use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide ongoing training and guidance on contract management best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support ad hoc projects as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in contract administration, sales operations, or related role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Salesforce (SFDC) with report building capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with DocuSign and contract management systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented with strong organizational abilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and manage multiple priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Microsoft Office Suite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Business Administration or related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with JIRA and ServiceNow ticketing systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in training and documentation development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with quote-to-cash (Q2C) or Deal Desk related processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in process improvement initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ZoomInfo (NASDAQ: GTM), the all-in-one AI GTM platform, enables sales, marketing, and customer success teams to execute their go-to-market strategy with confidence. Powered by the industry&#39;s most comprehensive B2B data, including more than 100 million companies, 500 million contacts, and billions of signals, ZoomInfo delivers the intelligence, automation, and integrations that modern revenue teams need to identify, engage, and convert their best buyers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ZoomInfo is committed to protecting your privacy when you apply for jobs with us. Please review our Job Applicant &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1yiG-k0YX_sW10PiJk_xliDc3W-veJCrK/view?usp=drive_link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; for more details on how we handle your personal information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ZoomInfo may use a software-based assessment as part of the recruitment process. More information about this tool, including the results of the most recent bias audit, is available &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.zoominfo.com/legal/nyc-local-law-144-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ZoomInfo is proud to be an equal opportunity employer, hiring based on qualifications, merit, and business needs, and does not discriminate based on protected status. We welcome all applicants and are committed to providing equal employment opportunities regardless of sex, race, age, color, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity, marital status, disability status, religion, protected military or veteran status, medical condition, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law. We also consider qualified candidates with criminal histories in accordance with legal requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For Massachusetts Applicants: It is unlawful in Massachusetts to require or administer a lie detector test as a condition of employment or continued employment. An employer who violates this law shall be subject to criminal penalties and civil liability. ZoomInfo does not administer lie detector tests to applicants in any location.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a global creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce to create connected brands&amp;nbsp;that drive growth. Guided by a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Human First&lt;/strong&gt; philosophy, VML is known for its innovative work for brands and consistently ranks among the world’s leading creative companies, including the WARC Creative 100.&amp;nbsp;VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d4b7d1c3-8ad6-4b6d-ab45-d3cb5a3aebe1&quot;&gt;www.vml.com &lt;/a&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;a3ef68bf-16fb-4ebc-9ca9-406007d6cefc&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;VML Consulting recrute un·e Senior Manager MarTech – Sales oriented&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Levallois-Perret | Hybride présentiel - télétravail&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Désormais intégré au réseau WPP,&amp;nbsp;VML Consulting (anciennement Velvet Consulting) est un cabinet conseil spécialisé dans la transformation de l’expérience client. Nous accompagnons nos clients dans leurs projets Data, Marketing &amp;amp; Technology pour leur permettre d’activer pleinement la valeur de leurs données.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Au-delà de VML Consulting, VML Enterprise Solutions réunit les expertises technologiques et data de VML pour accompagner les plus grands défis business. Avec plus de 10 000 experts dans 40+ bureaux à travers le monde, nous combinons conseil, expérience client, commerce et transformation technologique. Les équipes de VML Entreprise Solutions interviennent en IA, ingénierie, data, automatisation et déploiement de plateformes, en partenariat avec les leaders du marché : Adobe, Salesforce, Google, Microsoft, Braze, pour ne citer qu’eux. VML est ainsi le&amp;nbsp;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-fontsize=&quot;12&quot;&gt;ème&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;intégrateur d’Adobe et le&amp;nbsp;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-fontsize=&quot;12&quot;&gt;ème&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; intégrateur de Salesforce dans le monde. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Dans le cadre de notre croissance, nous recrutons&amp;nbsp;un·e&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Senior&amp;nbsp;Manager&amp;nbsp;MarTech&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;capable&amp;nbsp;d’accompagner nos clients dans le déploiement, la migration ou les évolutions de solutions&amp;nbsp;MarTech,&amp;nbsp;tout en jouant un rôle actif dans le&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;développement&amp;nbsp;commercial.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Votre&amp;nbsp;mission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Développer&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;porter&amp;nbsp;le go to-market&amp;nbsp;de&amp;nbsp;nos&amp;nbsp;offres&amp;nbsp;MarTech&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Contribuer activement à la transversalité des offres Tech x Data x CX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Piloter des projets/programmes&amp;nbsp;MarTech&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;à fort impact business, de la stratégie au déploiement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Être un&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;acteur clé de l’avant-vente&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;: qualification des enjeux clients, construction des propositions de valeur, définition des architectures, chiffrages et soutenances.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Porter&amp;nbsp;et incarner&amp;nbsp;la relation client&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; : créer une&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;relation de confiance avec les décideurs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;et contribuer au&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;développement et à la fidélisation des comptes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;(upsell, cross-sell).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Construire&amp;nbsp;des&amp;nbsp;feuilles de route&amp;nbsp;MarTech&amp;nbsp;: priorisation, business case, ROI.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Manager et faire grandir des équipes&amp;nbsp;de consultants, dans une logique de performance et de transmission.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Votre&amp;nbsp;profil&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;10 à 15 ans&amp;nbsp;d’expérience en&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;cabinet de conseil ou agence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Solide expertise&amp;nbsp;MarTech&amp;nbsp;: prioritairement&amp;nbsp;Imagino,&amp;nbsp;Adobe&amp;nbsp;(Campaign,&amp;nbsp;AEP,…), Salesforce&amp;nbsp;(Marketing Cloud / Data Cloud),&amp;nbsp;Reelevant,&amp;nbsp;Braze,&amp;nbsp;Bloomreach, solutions de&amp;nbsp;loyalty&amp;nbsp;(Comarch,&amp;nbsp;Maxxing,&amp;nbsp;Talon.one,…)&amp;nbsp;ou&amp;nbsp;équivalent.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Double culture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;tech &amp;amp; business&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, à l’aise avec les environnements CRM, CDP, data et intégration.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Appétence forte pour les&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;sujets commerciaux, l’avant-vente et les échanges&amp;nbsp;avec les&amp;nbsp;C-levels&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Apport d’un réseau de Grands Comptes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Anglais courant.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Pourquoi nous rejoindre ?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Pour faire de la&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;MarTech,&amp;nbsp;qui génère de la valeur business mesurable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Pour évoluer dans un environnement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;international&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;,&amp;nbsp;avec un réseau d’experts tech &amp;amp; data partout dans le monde, et&amp;nbsp;au contact des leaders du marché.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Pour conjuguer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;expertise, management et développement commercial&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Envie de combiner&amp;nbsp;MarTech, innovation&amp;nbsp;et croissance business ?&amp;nbsp;Parlons-en !&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;#LI-EMEA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office an average of four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to VML. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a global creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce to create connected brands&amp;nbsp;that drive growth. Guided by a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Human First&lt;/strong&gt; philosophy, VML is known for its innovative work for brands and consistently ranks among the world’s leading creative companies, including the WARC Creative 100.&amp;nbsp;VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d4b7d1c3-8ad6-4b6d-ab45-d3cb5a3aebe1&quot;&gt;www.vml.com &lt;/a&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;a3ef68bf-16fb-4ebc-9ca9-406007d6cefc&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Nous recrutons, pour renforcer nos équipes Sales, un.e Head of B2B &amp;amp; Energy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Missions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que Head of B2B &amp;amp; Energy, vous portez le développement de VML Consulting sur les marchés B2B et sur le secteur de l’énergie (énergéticiens, utilities, acteurs de la transition énergétique et de la mobilité). Vous incarnez une posture de vente “architecte” : comprendre des enjeux clients transverses – commerciaux, opérationnels, data, technologiques, réglementaires – et y répondre en orchestrant des équipes pluridisciplinaires. Comme l’ensemble de l’équipe de Business Développement, vous reposez sur un profil hybride dont les 2 piliers sont d’être :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsable de bout en bout du parcours d’avant-vente et de vente de nos offres et de nos &lt;em&gt;capabilities &lt;/em&gt;auprès de clients et prospects,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consultant ou directeur de mission, mobilisant une compréhension fine des enjeux B2B et énergie pour structurer des réponses transverses et activer les bonnes expertises (métier, data, technologique, créative) au sein de VML Consulting et du réseau WPP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cette hybridation, couplée à une posture “architecte”, est la clé du succès : être à la fois expert de la vente complexe, capable de lire des enjeux clients transverses, et en maîtrise des pans complets du métier du conseil et de l’agence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dimension Business :&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Définit et déploie la stratégie de go-to-market de VML Consulting sur les marchés B2B et le secteur de l’énergie, afin d’en faire l’acteur le plus attractif, singulier et impactant,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Construit et anime un plan de comptes ciblé (énergéticiens, utilities, grands comptes B2B) pour maintenir une intensité relationnelle élevée auprès des décideurs, défendre notre positionnement et détecter les opportunités de croissance,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pilote, en posture d’architecte, la construction de propositions adressant des enjeux transverses : cadre la problématique client, structure la réponse et orchestre les Business Units et expertises (data, conseil, technologie, créatif) nécessaires à sa conversion,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Met en œuvre, en continue, l’excellence du parcours de vente via les processus et les outils internes à des fins de visibilité, de pilotage et d’animation globale de la démarche commerciale en interne,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sécurise et défend les intérêts économique et contractuel de VML Consulting dans le cadre de la vente et après celle-ci,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assure un suivi régulier des prestations et des relations avec les clients donneur d’ordres et les opérationnels pour s’assurer de l’adéquation de la prestation avec le besoin, et identifier des opportunités de suite ou d’extension de la mission,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribue au thought leadership de VML Consulting sur les enjeux B2B et énergie (transition énergétique, décarbonation, expérience client B2B, data), via des prises de parole valorisant nos convictions et nos réussites dans une logique de ROI business,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Construit et fait vivre un patrimoine de connaissances sur les marchés B2B et le secteur de l’énergie (acteurs, enjeux réglementaires, dynamiques de marché) afin d’accélérer et de fluidifier l’action commerciale,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incarne, diffuse et fait vivre l’excellence commerciale en interne, en particulier auprès de la communauté managériale pour l’inspirer, la faire progresser et développer ses appétences et son niveau d’impact business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dimension Conseil :&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Réalise, seul ou en équipe, des missions de conseil sur les sujets B2B et énergie, afin de maintenir un haut niveau de crédibilité et de légitimité dans la dimension Business,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pilote des missions de conseil, sur l’ensemble des composantes&amp;nbsp;: qualité des livrables, respects des plannings et des engagements, tenue de l’équilibre budgétaire,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fait évoluer son savoir-faire et ses connaissances via une veille continue sur les sujets qui comptent pour nos clients et prospects, mais aussi des formations et sa curiosité,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maîtrise et met en œuvre toute la chaîne de production d’une mission de la prise de commande au recouvrement, pour assurer performance opérationnelle complète,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage des équipes pluridisciplinaires de consultants dans le cadre des missions, et assure une coordination et une information continue de sa hiérarchie pour permettre un feedback constructif et le développement des compétences,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Garantit la capitalisation du savoir et des livrables sur ses missions, et partage des retours d’expérience autant que de besoin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil recherché&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous justifiez de 7 à 15 ans d’expérience, dont un parcours significatif en cabinet de conseil (stratégie, transformation ou conseil opérationnel). Une expérience des marchés B2B et/ou du secteur de l’énergie (énergéticiens, utilities, transition énergétique) est un atout déterminant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre métier consistant à vendre et réaliser des missions mobilisant une grande diversité de compétences (data, conseil, créatif, technologique), vous avez développé une véritable appétence pour la vente “architecte” : savoir lire des enjeux clients transverses et y répondre en mobilisant des équipes pluridisciplinaires.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous pouvez justifier de contributions ou de succès significatifs dans le cadre d’initiatives business, au-delà d’en comprendre la logique ou les bonnes pratiques.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Votre capacité à nouer des relations de grande qualité avec des décideurs – Directions Générales, Directions Commerciales et B2B, Directions Marketing, Directions de la Transition Énergétique, Directions des Opérations ou DSI – fait de vous un acteur à l’aise et performant, de la découverte du besoin à la conclusion d’un deal équilibrant les intérêts du client et de VML Consulting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Les enjeux des marchés B2B et du secteur de l’énergie vous passionnent, et vous savez vous appuyer sur vos expériences pour bâtir un discours solide en avant-vente comme en mission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Votre rigueur et votre curiosité font de vous un acteur à la fois à l’aise dans la logique de développement business sur des clients existants que sur de la conquête opportuniste, ou en relai d’un partenaire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La maîtrise de l’anglais, à l’oral comme à l’écrit, est indispensable : vous adressez des clients et des interlocuteurs internationaux de manière totalement autonome.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tous nos postes sont ouverts aux personnes en situation de handicap.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi nous rejoindre ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Intégrer VML Consulting, c’est choisir d’évoluer dans un environnement dynamique, humain et innovant, propice au développement de chacun, à la réalisation de missions enrichissantes et aux évolutions de carrière. Nous rejoindre, c’est participer à une aventure collective au service de l’épanouissement personnel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous menons à bien notre projet d’entreprise sans sacrifier nos valeurs :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un positionnement clair&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Le respect de chacun&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;L’engagement auprès de nos clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;L’épanouissement professionnel et l’entente entre collaborateurs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous partagez ces valeurs, rejoignez-nous !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-EMEA&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office an average of four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to VML. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a global creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce to create connected brands&amp;nbsp;that drive growth. Guided by a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Human First&lt;/strong&gt; philosophy, VML is known for its innovative work for brands and consistently ranks among the world’s leading creative companies, including the WARC Creative 100.&amp;nbsp;VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d4b7d1c3-8ad6-4b6d-ab45-d3cb5a3aebe1&quot;&gt;www.vml.com &lt;/a&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;a3ef68bf-16fb-4ebc-9ca9-406007d6cefc&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qui sommes-nous ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML Consulting (anciennement Velvet Consulting) est un cabinet de conseil spécialisé dans la transformation de l’expérience client. Nous accompagnons nos clients dans leurs projets Data, Marketing &amp;amp; Technology pour leur permettre d’activer pleinement la valeur de leurs données.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au-delà de VML Consulting, VML Enterprise Solutions réunit les expertises technologiques et data de VML pour accompagner les plus grands défis business. Avec plus de 10 000 experts dans 40+ bureaux à travers le monde, nous combinons conseil, expérience client, commerce et transformation technologique. Les équipes de VML Entreprise Solutions interviennent en IA, ingénierie, data, automatisation et déploiement de plateformes, en partenariat avec les leaders du marché : Adobe, Salesforce, Google, Microsoft, Braze, pour ne citer qu’eux. VML est ainsi le 3ème intégrateur de Salesforce dans le monde.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Le pôle MarTech de la BU Technology &amp;amp; Digital de VML Consulting recrute pour accompagner de grands acteurs (retail, banque, assurance, luxe,..) dans l’implémentation et l’optimisation de leurs plateformes marketing et CRM. Nous recherchons un.e Consultant.e Développeur MarTech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Ton rôle:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que Consultant·e Développeur.se MarTech, tu seras au cœur des projets d’intégration et de migration de solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tes missions :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développer et maintenir les flux de données entre plateformes marketing (Adobe Campaign, Salesforce Marketing Cloud, CDP, en particulier Imagino, CRM, outils internes…) et systèmes tiers via APIs et connecteurs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participer à la mise en œuvre technique des plateformes MarTech (configuration, scripts, intégrations).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyser, modéliser et optimiser les pipelines de données pour garantir la fiabilité et la performance des solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborer avec les équipes projet pour assurer la réussite des déploiements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monter progressivement en responsabilité vers un rôle de référent technique sur des projets MarTech complexes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Ton profil:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diplômé·e d’une école d’ingénieur ou équivalent bac+5 en Informatique.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 à 5 ans d’expérience professionnelle, avec une première expérience significative en développement ou intégration de solutions data/CRM/MarTech. Une connaissance de l’univers du conseil est un vrai plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maîtrise d’une ou plusieurs compétences techniques :&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Langages : HTML, SQL, JavaScript, Java, Python, ou équivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;APIsation et Web Services (REST, SOAP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bases de données relationnelles et manipulation de flux de données.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développeur.se, tu as des bases significatives en gestion de projets et un bon background sur tout ce qui touche à la data (qualité, flux,…).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es curieux·se des environnements CRM &amp;amp; Marketing Automation (Adobe Campaign, Salesforce Marketing Cloud, CDP, en particulier Imagino…).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu aimes travailler en équipe et résoudre des problématiques techniques variées&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es bon communicant, capable de parler aux métiers comme à l’IT, et de comprendre les enjeux business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu parles couramment anglais (clients internationaux, capacité à travailler au quotidien en anglais).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Ce que nous offrons&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;L’opportunité de monter en expertise sur des technologies MarTech de référence (Adobe, Salesforce, Imagino et autres CDP leaders du marché).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un environnement stimulant, au croisement de la tech, de la data et du marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un cabinet à taille humaine intégré dans un grand groupe (VML/ WPP), combinant agilité et perspectives internationales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un accompagnement de carrière personnalisé : certifications, formations, coaching technique.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une culture collaborative où chacun peut devenir force de proposition et évoluer rapidement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu te sens prêt.e à rejoindre l’aventure ? N’hésite pas, postule !&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office an average of four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
