&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Cambridge, UK | Full-time | Permanent | Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Salary: £75,000 to £95,000, DOE &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Riverlane’s&amp;nbsp;mission is to master quantum error correction (QEC) and unlock a new age of human progress. From advances in material and climate science, to complex chemistry simulation for new drug design, quantum computers will help humanity solve some of its most important challenges. But without QEC, the industry’s defining technical challenge, such breakthroughs can never be achieved.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Riverlane is the world leader in QEC technology. QEC is a complex problem that requires a range of skills,&amp;nbsp;talent&amp;nbsp;and passion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;Having raised more than $125M in funding to date to accelerate our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;cutting-edge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;R&amp;amp;D in quantum error correction (QEC), Riverlane partners with many of the world’s leading quantum hardware providers and government agencies to make fault-tolerant quantum computing a reality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;We’re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;making remarkable progress and growing fast. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an exceptional Senior Product Manager with a background in science or engineering and quantum computing or HPC experience to help define and grow an important part of Riverlane’s software product portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an early-stage, fast-moving area of our product roadmap: you’ll help shape its direction as much as run what already exists.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll sit right at the heart of this product area, working closely with users, partners and cross-functional teams to deeply understand real-world challenges and translate them into a compelling product direction. You’ll use a blend of user insight, product data and market context to cut through complexity and focus on what matters most.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll own and evolve the strategy and roadmap, bringing together engineering, research, business development and marketing around a shared vision, striking the balance between bold, long-term ambition and what’s realistically achievable today.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits close to the centre of Riverlane, working daily with colleagues across Engineering, Science and the PMO. We ask for three days a week in our Cambridge office to make that collaboration easy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role involves quarterly travel, less than 10% of your time, to conferences such as IEEE and to visit customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you will do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the strategy and roadmap for your product area, balancing user needs, stakeholder input and Riverlane’s strategic direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with customers, partners and internal teams to build a complete picture of market needs and the competitive landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use product usage data, market insight and competitive analysis to prioritise features and drive adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align stakeholders across the C-suite, research, engineering, business development and marketing, and identify new market opportunities for Riverlane&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support go-to-market execution and launch readiness with Marketing and Business Development, including external collateral and documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor delivery progress and adapt plans as new challenges or opportunities emerge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What we need&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in engineering or science (degree or equivalent experience)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years in B2B product management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a HPC or quantum computing, translating complex technical trade-offs into product decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High emotional intelligence, with strong active listening and critical thinking skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, cross-functional team player who can influence without authority and build trust across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ease with going technically deep, both internally and externally, to understand product capabilities and limitations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Someone who thrives in a fast-moving, ambiguous and rapidly evolving environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, presentation and documentation skills, with the ability to tailor your style to different audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive mindset: you spot opportunities for improvement and act on them independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel occasionally (roughly quarterly, under 10% of your time) for conferences and customer visits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Even better if you have…&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with both hardware and software product management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have worked in a startup environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What can you expect from us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;22&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A comprehensive benefits package that includes&amp;nbsp;an annual bonus plan,&amp;nbsp;private medical insurance, life insurance, and a&amp;nbsp;contributory pension scheme&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;22&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Equity, so that our team can share in the long-term success of Riverlane&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;22&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;28 days annual leave,&amp;nbsp;plus bank holidays and enhanced family leave&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;22&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A diverse work environment that brings together experts in many fields (including software and hardware development, quantum information theory,&amp;nbsp;physics&amp;nbsp;and maths) and over 20 different nationalities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;22&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;5&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A learning environment that encourages individual, team and company growth and&amp;nbsp;development, including a regular programme of learning events and training and conference budgets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;How to apply&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please upload a CV and covering letter by clicking &#39;Apply&#39;. Your covering letter should explain why you are applying for the job and what skills and experience you can bring to the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We review CVs as we receive them and interview as soon as we have applications that&amp;nbsp;look&amp;nbsp;like a good match. We do not use closing dates. So, please&amp;nbsp;apply as soon as possible to avoid&amp;nbsp;missing out on&amp;nbsp;this role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you have any queries, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a ----- data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span ----- data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Everyone is welcome at Riverlane. We are an equal opportunities employer and encourage applications from eligible and suitably qualified candidates regardless of age, disability, ethnicity, gender, gender reassignment, religion or belief, sexual orientation, marital or civil partnership status, or pregnancy and maternity/paternity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Women and other underrepresented groups may be less likely to apply for a role unless they meet all or&amp;nbsp;nearly all&amp;nbsp;of the requirements.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;If this applies to you, we still encourage you to apply - you may be a great fit, even if you&amp;nbsp;don’t&amp;nbsp;meet every single qualification.&amp;nbsp;We’d&amp;nbsp;love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you need any adjustments made to the application or selection process so you can do your best, please let us know. We will be happy to help.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;GDPR notice: Riverlane collects and processes personal data in accordance with applicable data protection laws. If you are a European Job Applicant see the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;OWA843b0309-1485-8922-978c-b4a29d28b8a6&quot; class=&quot;x_x_fui-Link x_x____1q1shib x_x_f2hkw1w x_x_f3rmtva x_x_f1ewtqcl x_x_fyind8e x_x_f1k6fduh x_x_f1w7gpdv x_x_fk6fouc x_x_fjoy568 x_x_figsok6 x_x_f1s184ao x_x_f1mk8lai x_x_fnbmjn9 x_x_f1o700av x_x_f13mvf36 x_x_f1cmlufx x_x_f9n3di6 x_x_f1ids18y x_x_f1tx3yz7 x_x_f1deo86v x_x_f1eh06m1 x_x_f1iescvh x_x_fhgqx19 x_x_f1olyrje x_x_f1p93eir x_x_f1nev41a x_x_f1h8hb77 x_x_f1lqvz6u x_x_f10aw75t x_x_fsle3fq x_x_f17ae5zn x_x_OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://riverlane.workable.com/gdpr_policy/v1?lang=en&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;1&quot;&gt;privacy notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for further details.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior NetSuite Administrator &amp;amp; Developer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Cambridge, UK | Full-time&amp;nbsp; | Permanent | Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Salary: £58,000 to £70,000 DOE &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Riverlane’s&amp;nbsp;mission is to master quantum error correction (QEC) and unlock a new age of human progress. From advances in material and climate science, to complex chemistry simulation for new drug design, quantum computers will help humanity solve some of its most important challenges. But without QEC, the industry’s defining technical challenge, such breakthroughs can never be achieved.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Riverlane is the world leader in QEC technology. QEC is a complex problem that requires a range of skills,&amp;nbsp;talent&amp;nbsp;and passion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;Having raised more than $125M in funding to date to accelerate our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;cutting-edge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;R&amp;amp;D in quantum error correction (QEC), Riverlane partners with many of the world’s leading quantum hardware providers and government agencies to make fault-tolerant quantum computing a reality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;We’re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;making remarkable progress and growing fast. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Riverlane is looking for an experienced NetSuite Administrator &amp;amp; Developer to define, develop and administer one of the business-critical systems that keeps the company running.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;This is a hands-on role combining day-to-day administration with development and continuous improvement. You&#39;ll keep our ERP platform stable, secure and well-configured, act as the senior escalation point for complex issues, and build the scripts, workflows and integrations that make NetSuite work harder for Finance, Operations and the wider business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About our NetSuite Environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are in the middle of a phased NetSuite implementation, and this role is central to owning and evolving the platform as it grows. You&#39;ll be joining as the environment is being stood up, giving you the opportunity to shape how it&#39;s run from the outset and ensure the environment has robust configuration, controls and data integrity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Phase 1: NetSuite OneWorld across multiple entities and currencies. Scope includes fixed assets, multi-book accounting, currency revaluation, intercompany eliminations, and consolidation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Phase 2: Expected to extend the platform with, Advanced Revenue Management for contract revenue recognition, and Inventory Management, including multi-location and serial-number tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Administration &amp;amp; Configuration&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the setup and configuration of NetSuite, including user roles, permissions, workflows and system preferences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep configurations aligned with business processes and compliance requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform routine maintenance, manage updates, and troubleshoot issues to ensure system stability and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the NetSuite subject matter expert, supporting the business, and provide training that helps end-users get the most from the platform in their daily work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain data accuracy, integrity and security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage segregation of duties within roles and permissions to support audit requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use sandbox environments and managing NetSuite&#39;s twice-yearly release updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Development &amp;amp; Automation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build and maintain custom scripts and workflows using SuiteScript, JavaScript and SuiteQL to automate tasks and improve efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and implement process enhancements using native system capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure delivered solutions are fit for purpose, tested and documented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage automations and integrations to enhance the usefulness of the ERP solution and productivity of Riverlane staff.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Insights&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and maintain dashboards and reports using native ERP reporting features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support data transformation and visualisation to inform operational and strategic decisions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security &amp;amp; Compliance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and enforce security policies that protect sensitive business data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage access controls and audit trails in line with standards such as ISO 27001 and Cyber Essentials.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Optimisation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead integration efforts between NetSuite and other business platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Finance, Operations and other teams to translate business needs into system solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the IT management team on change requests and projects, delivering on time with documented testing and support materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the wider IT team with general issues to build overall team capacity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep, hands-on expertise administering NetSuite — configuration, customisation, migrations, maintenance and troubleshooting — ideally with 3+ years in a comparable role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient scripting across SuiteScript, JavaScript and SuiteQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data transformation and reporting skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with financial data (required), and exposure to ERP implementations or phased rollouts (desirable).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NetSuite certifications (SuiteFoundation, Administrator, or SuiteCloud Developer) preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound understanding of data security, access control and compliance frameworks (ISO, Cyber Essentials).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and interpersonal skills, with the ability to work effectively with stakeholders at all levels, with the ability to translate finance requirements into NetSuite configuration and to work effectively across stakeholders (Finance, Operations) and technical teams (developers, integration partners).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A customer-first attitude, strong project-management discipline, and the ability to juggle multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated and able to work both independently and as part of a team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What can you expect from us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;22&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A comprehensive benefits package that includes&amp;nbsp;an annual bonus plan,&amp;nbsp;private medical insurance, life insurance, and a&amp;nbsp;contributory pension scheme&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;22&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Equity, so that our team can share in the long-term success of Riverlane &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;22&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;28 days annual leave, plus bank holidays and enhanced family leave&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;22&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;A diverse work environment that brings together experts in many fields (including software and hardware development, quantum information theory, physics and maths) and over 20 different nationalities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;22&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;A learning environment that encourages individual, team and company growth and development, including a regular programme of learning events and training and conference budgets&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;How to apply&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please upload a CV and covering letter by clicking &#39;Apply&#39;. Your covering letter should explain why you are applying for the job and what skills and experience you can bring to the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We review CVs as we receive them and interview as soon as we have applications that&amp;nbsp;look&amp;nbsp;like a good match. We do not use closing dates. So, please&amp;nbsp;apply as soon as possible to avoid&amp;nbsp;missing out on&amp;nbsp;this role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you have any queries, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a ----- data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span ----- data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Everyone is welcome at Riverlane. We are an equal opportunities employer and encourage applications from eligible and suitably qualified candidates regardless of age, disability, ethnicity, gender, gender reassignment, religion or belief, sexual orientation, marital or civil partnership status, or pregnancy and maternity/paternity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Women and other underrepresented groups may be less likely to apply for a role unless they meet all or&amp;nbsp;nearly all&amp;nbsp;of the requirements.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;If this applies to you, we still encourage you to apply - you may be a great fit, even if you&amp;nbsp;don’t&amp;nbsp;meet every single qualification.&amp;nbsp;We’d&amp;nbsp;love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you need any adjustments made to the application or selection process so you can do your best, please let us know. We will be happy to help.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;GDPR notice: Riverlane collects and processes personal data in accordance with applicable data protection laws. If you are a European Job Applicant see the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;OWA843b0309-1485-8922-978c-b4a29d28b8a6&quot; class=&quot;x_x_fui-Link x_x____1q1shib x_x_f2hkw1w x_x_f3rmtva x_x_f1ewtqcl x_x_fyind8e x_x_f1k6fduh x_x_f1w7gpdv x_x_fk6fouc x_x_fjoy568 x_x_figsok6 x_x_f1s184ao x_x_f1mk8lai x_x_fnbmjn9 x_x_f1o700av x_x_f13mvf36 x_x_f1cmlufx x_x_f9n3di6 x_x_f1ids18y x_x_f1tx3yz7 x_x_f1deo86v x_x_f1eh06m1 x_x_f1iescvh x_x_fhgqx19 x_x_f1olyrje x_x_f1p93eir x_x_f1nev41a x_x_f1h8hb77 x_x_f1lqvz6u x_x_f10aw75t x_x_fsle3fq x_x_f17ae5zn x_x_OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://riverlane.workable.com/gdpr_policy/v1?lang=en&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;1&quot;&gt;privacy notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; for further details.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Linux Administrator&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Cambridge, UK | Full-time | Permanent | Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Salary: £60,000 to £75,000 + Bonus + Equity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;T&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;he salary range for this role is broad, as we are able to consider varying levels of experience.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Any offer made will carefully take into account level of experience (including relevant industry experience), transferable relevant skills and previous relevant achievements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Riverlane’s&amp;nbsp;mission is to master quantum error correction (QEC) and unlock a new age of human progress. From advances in material and climate science, to complex chemistry simulation for new drug design, quantum computers will help humanity solve some of its most important challenges. But without QEC, the industry’s defining technical challenge, such breakthroughs can never be achieved.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Riverlane is the world leader in QEC technology. QEC is a complex problem that requires a range of skills,&amp;nbsp;talent&amp;nbsp;and passion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;Having raised more than $125M in funding to date to accelerate our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;cutting-edge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;R&amp;amp;D in quantum error correction (QEC), Riverlane partners with many of the world’s leading quantum hardware providers and government agencies to make fault-tolerant quantum computing a reality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;We’re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;making remarkable progress and growing fast. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Riverlane is looking for an experienced Linux administrator to own and grow our core computational infrastructure. This is a hands-on role combining day-to-day administration of our High-Performance Computing (HPC) environment with longer-term planning, automation, and improvement of our infrastructure estate.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll be the primary owner of our HPC cluster and core Linux infrastructure, working closely with IT management and wider Infrastructure Team to keep systems reliable today while building towards a more resilient, scalable environment for tomorrow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;HPC Cluster Administration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Administer and maintain the HPC cluster, including compute nodes, storage systems, and networking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and evolve cluster topology, compute node configuration, and hardware resource utilisation as the estate grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the deployment, configuration, and troubleshooting of HPC tooling, particularly Slurm — including queue structures and job scheduling policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor system performance and ensure high availability of HPC resources, using observability tools such as Prometheus; investigate anomalies and outages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess and maintain the network file storage solution for throughput, scalability, and latency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Business As Usual (BAU) Administration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain, patch, and troubleshoot core Linux infrastructure (RHEL).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as an escalation point for complex technical issues raised by the Riverlane team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide operational upkeep of core infrastructure, including servers, tooling, and licence managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain Synopsys EDA tooling, including licence server management, environment configuration, and performance optimisation for electronic design automation workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide sound technical support to users of the HPC environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve self-service capability for users, enabling routine tasks (e.g. restarting VNC sessions, resetting passwords) to be performed without engineering intervention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Automation &amp;amp; Enhancement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate routine tasks using scripting and infrastructure-as-code tools (Bash, Python, Ansible).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the Infrastructure Team to plan and implement improvements to HPC infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own work packages and deliver them within agreed sprint windows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain documentation for systems, processes, and configurations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate effectively with stakeholders on progress and delivered improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Security, Compliance &amp;amp; Resilience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure security and compliance across the HPC estate, including security hardening and lifecycle management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and develop the off-site backup strategy, ensuring data integrity, disaster recovery readiness, and compliance with data retention policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience administering and growing infrastructure in fast-paced engineering environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise Linux expertise: deep knowledge of Red Hat Enterprise Linux (RHEL) administration, security hardening, lifecycle management, and troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience configuring, scaling, tuning, and troubleshooting job schedulers (e.g. Slurm) and distributed compute environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of network file storage protocols and network optimisation for computational workloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient with container environments and virtualisation infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High proficiency with infrastructure automation tools (Ansible, Python, Bash) and infrastructure-as-code practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with backup and disaster recovery strategy and implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing licensed EDA or similar specialist software tooling (e.g. Synopsys) is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, with the ability to support both technical and non-technical users and translate complex issues into clear guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What can you expect from us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;22&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A comprehensive benefits package that includes&amp;nbsp;an annual bonus plan,&amp;nbsp;private medical insurance, life insurance, and a&amp;nbsp;contributory pension scheme&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;22&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Equity, so that our team can share in the long-term success of Riverlane &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;22&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;28 days annual leave, plus bank holidays and enhanced family leave&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;22&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;A diverse work environment that brings together experts in many fields (including software and hardware development, quantum information theory, physics and maths) and over 20 different nationalities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;22&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;A learning environment that encourages individual, team and company growth and development, including a regular programme of learning events and training and conference budgets&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;How to apply&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please upload a CV and covering letter by clicking &#39;Apply&#39;. Your covering letter should explain why you are applying for the job and what skills and experience you can bring to the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We review CVs as we receive them and interview as soon as we have applications that&amp;nbsp;look&amp;nbsp;like a good match. We do not use closing dates. So, please&amp;nbsp;apply as soon as possible to avoid&amp;nbsp;missing out on&amp;nbsp;this role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you have any queries, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a ----- data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span ----- data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Everyone is welcome at Riverlane. We are an equal opportunities employer and encourage applications from eligible and suitably qualified candidates regardless of age, disability, ethnicity, gender, gender reassignment, religion or belief, sexual orientation, marital or civil partnership status, or pregnancy and maternity/paternity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Women and other underrepresented groups may be less likely to apply for a role unless they meet all or&amp;nbsp;nearly all&amp;nbsp;of the requirements.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;If this applies to you, we still encourage you to apply - you may be a great fit, even if you&amp;nbsp;don’t&amp;nbsp;meet every single qualification.&amp;nbsp;We’d&amp;nbsp;love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you need any adjustments made to the application or selection process so you can do your best, please let us know. We will be happy to help.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;GDPR notice: Riverlane collects and processes personal data in accordance with applicable data protection laws. If you are a European Job Applicant see the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;OWA843b0309-1485-8922-978c-b4a29d28b8a6&quot; class=&quot;x_x_fui-Link x_x____1q1shib x_x_f2hkw1w x_x_f3rmtva x_x_f1ewtqcl x_x_fyind8e x_x_f1k6fduh x_x_f1w7gpdv x_x_fk6fouc x_x_fjoy568 x_x_figsok6 x_x_f1s184ao x_x_f1mk8lai x_x_fnbmjn9 x_x_f1o700av x_x_f13mvf36 x_x_f1cmlufx x_x_f9n3di6 x_x_f1ids18y x_x_f1tx3yz7 x_x_f1deo86v x_x_f1eh06m1 x_x_f1iescvh x_x_fhgqx19 x_x_f1olyrje x_x_f1p93eir x_x_f1nev41a x_x_f1h8hb77 x_x_f1lqvz6u x_x_f10aw75t x_x_fsle3fq x_x_f17ae5zn x_x_OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://riverlane.workable.com/gdpr_policy/v1?lang=en&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;1&quot;&gt;privacy notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; for further details.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior FPGA Engineer – Systems Team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cambridge, UK | Full-time | Permanent | Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary: £70,000 to £108,000, DOE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The salary range for this role is broad, as we are able to consider varying levels of experience.&amp;nbsp; Any offer made will carefully take into account level of experience (including relevant industry experience), transferable relevant skills and previous relevant achievements.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We will also consider part-time applications for this role. Please indicate your preferred working schedule in your cover letter.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Riverlane’s mission is to master quantum error correction (QEC) and unlock a new age of human progress. From advances in material and climate science, to complex chemistry simulation for new drug design, quantum computers will help humanity solve some of its most important challenges. But without QEC, the industry’s defining technical challenge, such breakthroughs can never be achieved.&amp;nbsp; Riverlane is the world leader in QEC technology. QEC is a complex problem that requires a range of skills, talent and passion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having raised more than $125M in funding to date to accelerate our cutting-edge R&amp;amp;D in quantum error correction (QEC), Riverlane partners with many of the world’s leading quantum hardware providers and government agencies to make fault-tolerant quantum computing a reality. We’re making remarkable progress and growing fast.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Systems Engineering bridges the gap between Riverlane and its customers. They act as the primary technical interface for our customers’ engineers to guide them through product integration and help with troubleshooting complex quantum systems. They are key to securing design wins and driving product development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an FPGA Engineer, you will configure our Deltaflow Hardware to connect Quantum Computers to provide low-latency, high throughput systems that perform complex operations in a predictable and guaranteed way.&amp;nbsp; You will use your knowledge and expertise to adapt the hardware to an ever-changing quantum control system to support scientists that are running quantum experiments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a fantastic opportunity to join Riverlane’s team, that is developing the world’s most advanced quantum error correcting algorithms.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;The Riverlane team is a mix of mathematicians, physicists and engineers, working together on a range of exciting and cutting-edge projects.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical pre-Sales:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Host Technical Workshops on Riverlane’s QEC Interface&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate Customers Control System and Data Communication requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integration On-Site: &lt;/strong&gt;End-to-End System Deployment:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Writing RTL to adapt to customers control systems and ensure data packets are received correctly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Riverlane’s Quantum Application Team to design experiments to test the system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benchmark and discover hardware latency limitations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Troubleshooting and Debugging: &lt;/strong&gt;Managing Customer Issues:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report issues and help replicate the setup with the QA team in Riverlane.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Writing script to debug and trace faults&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update verification environment and the test vectors based on data gathered from the experiments that were conducted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Advocacy: Voice of the Customer to Riverlane Product Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highlight the success, issues and trends on customer’s Quantum Systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feedback key features that will be needed to win current and next generation products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with state-of-the-art FPGA platforms (e.g. AMD/Xilinx MPSoCs/RFSoCs, Altera Stratix 7 or Stratix 10)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in writing SystemVerilog or VHDL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven professional experience in &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;at least one of&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; the following areas:&amp;nbsp;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implementation of modern classical decoders on FPGA e.g. LDPC, turbo-codes;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implementation of Ethernet and High-Speed Protocols&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implementation of customs protocols and standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven capability to test, debug and improve UVM Verification Environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good knowledge of Python and C++&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to convert product requirements into technical specifications to document and share your work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A curious nature and a passion for learning and continuous improvement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, with the ability to work both independently and collaboratively as part of a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Typically, our Senior FPGA Engineers have around 4–8 years of relevant experience, though this can vary by background.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Even better if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of working on scientific instrumentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PhD in a relevant subject&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good knowledge of quantum mechanics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What can you expect from us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A comprehensive benefits package that includes an annual bonus plan, private medical insurance, life insurance, and a contributory pension scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity, so that our team can share in the long-term success of Riverlane&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;28 days annual leave, plus bank holidays and enhanced family leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A diverse work environment that brings together experts in many fields (including software and hardware development, quantum information theory, physics and maths) and over 20 different nationalities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A learning environment that encourages individual, team and company growth and development, including a regular programme of learning events and training and conference budgets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to apply&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please upload a CV and covering letter by clicking &#39;Apply Now&#39;. Your covering letter should explain why you are applying for the job and what skills and experience you can bring to the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We review CVs as we receive them and interview as soon as we have applications that look like a good match. We do not use closing dates. So, please apply as soon as possible to avoid missing out on this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have any queries, please contact &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;#LI-KW1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Everyone is welcome at Riverlane. We are an equal opportunities employer and encourage applications from eligible and suitably qualified candidates regardless of age, disability, ethnicity, gender, gender reassignment, religion or belief, sexual orientation, marital or civil partnership status, or pregnancy and maternity/paternity.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Women and other underrepresented groups may be less likely to apply for a role unless they meet all or nearly all of the requirements. If this applies to you, we still encourage you to apply - you may be a great fit, even if you don’t meet every single qualification. We’d love to hear from you.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you need any adjustments made to the application or selection process so you can do your best, please let us know. We will be happy to help.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Cambridge, UK | Full-time or Part-time | Permanent (or Temporary) | Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Salary: £80,000 - £100,000 DOE &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The salary range for this role is broad, as we are able to consider varying levels of experience.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Any offer made will carefully take into account level of experience (including relevant industry experience), transferable relevant skills and previous relevant achievements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Riverlane’s&amp;nbsp;mission is to master quantum error correction (QEC) and unlock a new age of human progress. From advances in material and climate science, to complex chemistry simulation for new drug design, quantum computers will help humanity solve some of its most important challenges. But without QEC, the industry’s defining technical challenge, such breakthroughs can never be achieved.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Riverlane is the world leader in QEC technology. QEC is a complex problem that requires a range of skills,&amp;nbsp;talent&amp;nbsp;and passion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;Having raised more than $125M in funding to date to accelerate our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;cutting-edge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;R&amp;amp;D in quantum error correction (QEC), Riverlane partners with many of the world’s leading quantum hardware providers and government agencies to make fault-tolerant quantum computing a reality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;We’re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;making remarkable progress and growing fast. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Embedded Systems Software Engineer bridges the gap between Riverlane and its customers. They act as the primary technical interface for customer’s engineers and guide them through product integration and help with trouble shooting complex quantum systems.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As an Embedded Software Engineer on the Systems Team, you will configure our Deltaflow Hardware to connect to the Quantum Computer allowing it to provide a low-latency, high throughput system that performs complex operations in a predictable and guaranteed way. You will develop our software stack to work with customers quantum computers. You will ensure our customers can run quantum experiments, implement Riverlane’s quantum errors correction algorithm and debug any issues that arise.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is a fantastic opportunity to join a team that is developing the world’s most advanced quantum error correcting algorithms and QEC Hardware. The Riverlane team is a mix of mathematicians, physicists and engineers, working together on a range of exciting and cutting-edge QEC projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Pre / Post-Sales:&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-Host Technical Workshops on Riverlane’s QEC Stack and DeltaKit.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-Evaluate Customers Software and data communication systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integration On-Site: End-to-End System Deployment.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-Integrate our Software Stack into Customer’s Quantum Computer Systems.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-Work with Riverlane’s Quantum Application Team to design experiments to test the compiled software.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-Benchmark and discover system limitations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshooting and Debugging: Managing Customer Issues&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-Report issues and help replicate the setup with the QA team in Riverlane.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-Writing scripts to help debug the complete system&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-Update test environment and document the experiments that were conducted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Advocacy: Voice of the Customer to River Lane Product Team&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-Highlight the success, issues and trends on customer’s Quantum Systems&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-Feedback key features that will be needed to win current and next generation products&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-Create Dashboard that would allow better understanding of the complete quantum computing system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor&#39;s degree (or equivalent) in Computer Science, Electronic Engineering,&amp;nbsp;Physics, Math or a related discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great communication skills (written and verbal) and an ability to work with a diverse range of people are essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience of at least one Embedded Software programming language (C, C++, Python, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in SoC design, Embedded Systems Design, or Computer Architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with a scripting language, such as Python (preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Verilog, VHDL or System Verilog preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity to learn about new technologies, including quantum computing and error&amp;nbsp;correction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deep understanding of how hardware implements with software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with standard development practices, such as source control, continuous integration, unit testing, and standard debug methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work well within a team and independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring junior embedded Software Engineers (this is not a people manager role)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Even better if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on scientific instrumentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good knowledge of Quantum Mechanics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical pre / post sales, professional services or field application engineering experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What can you expect from us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
