&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;How to apply&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please upload a CV and covering letter by clicking &#39;Apply&#39;. Your covering letter should explain why you are applying for the job and what skills and experience you can bring to the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We review CVs as we receive them and interview as soon as we have applications that&amp;nbsp;look&amp;nbsp;like a good match. We do not use closing dates. So, please&amp;nbsp;apply as soon as possible to avoid&amp;nbsp;missing out on&amp;nbsp;this role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you need any adjustments made to the application or selection process so you can do your best, please let us know. We will be happy to help. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you have any queries, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a ----- data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span ----- data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;GDPR notice: Riverlane collects and processes personal data in accordance with applicable data protection laws. If you are a European Job Applicant see the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;OWA843b0309-1485-8922-978c-b4a29d28b8a6&quot; class=&quot;x_x_fui-Link x_x____1q1shib x_x_f2hkw1w x_x_f3rmtva x_x_f1ewtqcl x_x_fyind8e x_x_f1k6fduh x_x_f1w7gpdv x_x_fk6fouc x_x_fjoy568 x_x_figsok6 x_x_f1s184ao x_x_f1mk8lai x_x_fnbmjn9 x_x_f1o700av x_x_f13mvf36 x_x_f1cmlufx x_x_f9n3di6 x_x_f1ids18y x_x_f1tx3yz7 x_x_f1deo86v x_x_f1eh06m1 x_x_f1iescvh x_x_fhgqx19 x_x_f1olyrje x_x_f1p93eir x_x_f1nev41a x_x_f1h8hb77 x_x_f1lqvz6u x_x_f10aw75t x_x_fsle3fq x_x_f17ae5zn x_x_OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://riverlane.workable.com/gdpr_policy/v1?lang=en&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;1&quot;&gt;privacy notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for further details.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Cambridge, UK | Full-time | Permanent | Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Salary: £40,000.00&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Riverlane’s&amp;nbsp;mission is to master quantum error correction (QEC) and unlock a new age of human progress. From advances in material and climate science, to complex chemistry simulation for new drug design, quantum computers will help humanity solve some of its most important challenges. But without QEC, the industry’s defining technical challenge, such breakthroughs can never be achieved.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Riverlane is the world leader in QEC technology. QEC is a complex problem that requires a range of skills,&amp;nbsp;talent&amp;nbsp;and passion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;Having raised more than $125M in funding to date to accelerate our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;cutting-edge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;R&amp;amp;D in quantum error correction (QEC), Riverlane partners with many of the world’s leading quantum hardware providers and government agencies to make fault-tolerant quantum computing a reality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;We’re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;making remarkable progress and growing fast. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Riverlane’s Engineering Graduate Scheme is designed for graduates in Computer Science, Electronic Engineering, Engineering, Physics, Maths and related subjects who want to build a career in quantum computing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will join us as a permanent, full-time employee at our head office in Cambridge, UK. During your first 12 months, you will rotate through Engineering teams, gaining hands-on experience of different technical challenges and approaches to developing QEC technology. Your work throughout the scheme will focus on engineering, in close collaboration with research teams and learn how research is translated into working technology.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will have a dedicated supervisor to support you through your rotations and help you develop your technical and professional skills. You will take on meaningful work from the outset, while learning from experienced colleagues across our multidisciplinary team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You do not need a background in quantum computing. You will have the opportunity to learn about QEC as part of the scheme.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At the end of the programme year, you will move into an Engineering team or Engineering Research role to continue developing your career at Riverlane.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you will do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Design, develop and improve software or hardware tools used in quantum computing and QEC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Contribute to engineering projects from initial design through implementation, testing and improvement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Learn how to build and test complex products at the cutting edge of technology&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work with engineers and scientists from different disciplines to solve technical problems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;5&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Develop your engineering skills through hands-on work, feedback and support from your team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What we need&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;3 3 []&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A completed or in-progress Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Computer Science, Computer Systems Engineering, Electronic Engineering, Engineering, Physics, Mathematics or a related subject.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Graduation in 2026 or expected graduation in 2027.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Evidence of strong technical skills and creative problem-solving through academic work, research, personal projects or other relevant experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with at least one programming language, preferably C++ or Python.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong critical thinking and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clear written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ability to take initiative and work effectively as part of a team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An interest in applying your skills in an industrial setting and a strong desire to learn.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Important notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Engineering Graduate Scheme is the beginning of a permanent, full-time career at Riverlane. The 2027 intake will start in autumn 2027. The rotational element lasts for 12 months, after which graduates will move into an Engineering team or Engineering Research role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Deadline &amp;amp; Selection Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please submit your application by &lt;strong&gt;Friday 6 November 2026&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage 1: Remote technical challenges&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;These will be arranged individually, with seven days to complete them. All challenges must be completed by &lt;strong&gt;Monday 7 December 2026&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage 2: Assessment day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;An assessment day will be held at our headquarters in Cambridge, UK, on &lt;strong&gt;Thursday 14 January 2027&lt;/strong&gt;. Please keep this date available.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;How to apply &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please upload a CV and covering letter. Your covering letter should explain why you are applying for Riverlane’s Graduate Recruitment Scheme and what skills and experience you feel you can bring to the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What can you expect from us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Alongside a competitive salary, we offer private medical insurance, a health cash plan and life assurance, as well as many other benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You can also expect a diverse work environment that brings together experts in many fields (including software and hardware development, quantum information theory, physics and maths) and over 25 different nationalities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you have any queries, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a ----- data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span ----- data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt; Please do not send your applications to this email address, all applications should be submitted via our careers page.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Everyone is welcome at Riverlane. We are an equal opportunities employer and encourage applications from eligible and suitably qualified candidates regardless of age, disability, ethnicity, gender, gender reassignment, religion or belief, sexual orientation, marital or civil partnership status, or pregnancy and maternity/paternity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Women and other underrepresented groups may be less likely to apply for a role unless they meet all or&amp;nbsp;nearly all&amp;nbsp;of the requirements.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;If this applies to you, we still encourage you to apply - you may be a great fit, even if you&amp;nbsp;don’t&amp;nbsp;meet every single qualification.&amp;nbsp;We’d&amp;nbsp;love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you need any adjustments made to the application or selection process so you can do your best, please let us know. We will be happy to help.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;GDPR notice: Riverlane collects and processes personal data in accordance with applicable data protection laws. If you are a European Job Applicant see the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;OWA843b0309-1485-8922-978c-b4a29d28b8a6&quot; class=&quot;x_x_fui-Link x_x____1q1shib x_x_f2hkw1w x_x_f3rmtva x_x_f1ewtqcl x_x_fyind8e x_x_f1k6fduh x_x_f1w7gpdv x_x_fk6fouc x_x_fjoy568 x_x_figsok6 x_x_f1s184ao x_x_f1mk8lai x_x_fnbmjn9 x_x_f1o700av x_x_f13mvf36 x_x_f1cmlufx x_x_f9n3di6 x_x_f1ids18y x_x_f1tx3yz7 x_x_f1deo86v x_x_f1eh06m1 x_x_f1iescvh x_x_fhgqx19 x_x_f1olyrje x_x_f1p93eir x_x_f1nev41a x_x_f1h8hb77 x_x_f1lqvz6u x_x_f10aw75t x_x_fsle3fq x_x_f17ae5zn x_x_OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://riverlane.workable.com/gdpr_policy/v1?lang=en&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;1&quot;&gt;privacy notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for further details.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hi, we’re Phiture — the mobile growth consultancy working with the teams behind leading apps like Adobe, Headspace, and LEGO® 👋. We’re setting the standard for growth in the brave new digital world, and we need great people to join our global team!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT TO EXPECT:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join Phiture as a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Growth Consultant&lt;/strong&gt;, owning the day-to-day relationship, communication, and delivery for one of our largest and most demanding accounts. You&#39;ll act as one of the main points of contact for client communications, owning conversations and decisions directly with the client, orchestrating across PM, ASO, and Creative, while advising the Growth Lead on strategy and execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on, individual account-ownership role that requires both strong technical craftsmanship and genuine comfort leading client conversations. &lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll bring deep expertise in paid user acquisition for mobile apps, including GAC, Apple Ads, MMPs&lt;/strong&gt;, and attribution, and pair it with the confidence to represent the account&#39;s strategy directly to senior, demanding stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Paid UA Campaign Management&lt;/strong&gt;: Own the end-to-end strategy, setup, and continuous optimization of paid campaigns (Google App Campaigns, Apple Ads, Meta Ads and other UA channels as relevant) to scale user acquisition efficiently, proactively monitoring spend efficiency and creative performance, and independently investigating technical issues (tracking discrepancies, delivery problems, attribution mismatches) before escalating.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Client Relationship&lt;/strong&gt;: Own the client relationship end-to-end with day-to-day communication, deliverables (reports, proposals, strategic planning docs), and hands-on execution of the agreed strategy. Lead client meetings, educate clients beyond reporting, and communicate the real, accurate cause of any issue, including when it traces back to our own setup or execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead, Not Just Attend, Client Conversations&lt;/strong&gt;: Confidently drive client meetings, questioning client requests that don&#39;t hold up, proactively bringing recommendations rather than waiting to be asked, and representing the account&#39;s strategic direction directly to senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect PM to ASO and Creative&lt;/strong&gt;: Actively bring the organic and creative perspective into paid conversations (and vice versa) rather than staying within a single channel, by flagging cross-functional implications to the wider team without needing to be prompted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply App-Specific Paid Media Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;: Bring deep expertise in paid user acquisition specifically for mobile apps, SDKs and their implementation, SKAN&#39;s measurement restrictions and their implications for testing and attribution, and what an MMP does and why app marketers rely on one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyze Performance &amp;amp; Drive Recommendations&lt;/strong&gt;: Dive deep into monthly metrics, set targets, analyze trends, and independently identify areas of concern or opportunity, arriving with a point of view and a recommendation grounded in the numbers, translated into what it means for the client&#39;s business. Comfort reading dashboards in a tool like Looker Studio is expected.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guide Client POCs &amp;amp; Junior Team Members&lt;/strong&gt;: Guide Client POCs and junior team members as they build expertise, while retaining individual ownership of your own accounts. Given a problem, investigate it, propose a course of action, follow through, and close the loop with stakeholders without needing reminders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL NEED:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years of hands-on experience in paid user acquisition / performance marketing&lt;/strong&gt;, for mobile apps, with a track record of demonstrable results (efficiency gains, scaled spend, measurable campaign impact) you can speak to concretely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solid app-specific paid UA fluency&lt;/strong&gt;: including GAC, Meta Ads, Apple Ads, SDKs, SKAN, and MMP concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on attribution/MMP experience&lt;/strong&gt;: comfortable troubleshooting tracking and attribution issues directly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Genuine confidence leading client meetings&lt;/strong&gt;: with a track record of proactively driving conversations and pushing back on client asks when warranted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Independent data interpretation skills&lt;/strong&gt;: able to arrive at a point of view and recommendation grounded in the numbers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent in English, with excellent written and spoken client communication skills&lt;/strong&gt; and being able to simplify technical concepts for less growth-literate stakeholders without losing substance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A demonstrated track record of proactive ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: able to walk through a real past troubleshooting or client-management example.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;NICE TO HAVE:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with kids/family-audience apps or highly regulated/brand-sensitive clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with programmatic/DSP media buying is a big plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working alongside a dedicated data/attribution specialist: comfortable collaborating closely with a technical counterpart.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER YOU:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Remote Work&lt;/strong&gt; — Unlimited remote work within your home country (EMEA), plus up to 90 days per year internationally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generous Vacation Allowance&lt;/strong&gt; — Enjoy up to 30 days of paid vacation annually, plus extra days for special occasions (country-specific), so you can recharge and pursue your passions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quarterly Bonus Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt; — Boost your earnings through our quarterly bonus scheme, directly linked to our shared success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mental Wellness Prioritized&lt;/strong&gt; — Free, confidential mental health support from licensed therapists through our partnership with Oliva.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal Development Investment&lt;/strong&gt; — €1,000 annual personal growth budget and 10 dedicated learning hours each month, empowering your continuous growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working Hours&lt;/strong&gt; — Shape your workday around your lifestyle and productivity, choosing working patterns that best suit you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vibrant Berlin Office&lt;/strong&gt; — Enjoy a flexible, pet-friendly workspace at our spacious headquarters located in one of Berlin’s most vibrant neighborhoods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Team Connection&lt;/strong&gt; — Regular team-building events and a memorable annual all-expenses-paid company offsite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tailored Career Growth&lt;/strong&gt; — A personalized career roadmap and development plan designed to keep you advancing professionally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Home Office Allowance&lt;/strong&gt; — Monthly remote-work cash allowance to level up your home workspace or help cover internet costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Premium Onboarding Kit&lt;/strong&gt; — Branded Phiture gear and your very own MacBook from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thoughtful Celebrations&lt;/strong&gt; — Responsibly sourced birthday, anniversary, and seasonal gifts, because every milestone deserves recognition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We encourage all qualified individuals to apply, regardless of their age, gender identity, ethnicity, sexual orientation, disability status, or religion. We celebrate diversity and are excited about building teams that represent a variety of backgrounds, perspectives, and skills. All employment decisions are based on qualifications, merit, and business needs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qui sommes-nous ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Artefact est un cabinet de conseil international spécialisé en Data et Intelligence Artificielle, présent dans plus de 20 pays avec plus de 2 500 collaborateurs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous accompagnons nos clients dans leur transformation en combinant expertise technologique, conseil et connaissance métier, sur des enjeux allant de la stratégie Data &amp;amp; IA à la conception et au déploiement de solutions concrètes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nos équipes réunissent notamment des Business Consultants, Data Analysts, Data Scientists et Data Engineers, qui interviennent auprès de grands groupes internationaux dans des secteurs variés.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre ambition : mettre la Data et l’IA au service de problématiques business concrètes et créer un impact mesurable pour nos clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ton rôle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Au sein de l’équipe Talent Acquisition France et sous la responsabilité de la Head of Talent Acquisition, tu pilotes en autonomie le recrutement des équipes Strat Data d’Artefact, sur des profils allant de Junior à Manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partenaire des équipes opérationnelles, tu les accompagnes tout au long du processus afin de garantir des recrutements de qualité et une expérience candidat exigeante :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Piloter les recrutements de bout en bout&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recueillir et challenger les besoins auprès des managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Définir et mettre en œuvre l’approche de recrutement adaptée à chaque besoin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Piloter l’ensemble du processus : sourcing, qualification, entretiens RH, coordination des étapes d’évaluation et offre&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développer une approche proactive du sourcing et constituer des viviers de profils pertinents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accompagner les équipes opérationnelles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conseiller et challenger les managers tout au long du processus afin de garantir des décisions de recrutement objectives et cohérentes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Garantir la bonne application du processus et des méthodes d’évaluation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Veiller à une expérience de recrutement de qualité pour les candidatures et les équipes internes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribuer à l’amélioration continue&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifier les points de friction et contribuer à l’amélioration des processus et pratiques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Veiller à la qualité et à la fiabilité des données dans notre ATS (Greenhouse)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer aux projets et initiatives de l’équipe Talent Acquisition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ton profil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une expérience confirmée en recrutement, idéalement dans le conseil/ ESN&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une maîtrise du recrutement de bout en bout, avec une solide pratique du sourcing et de l’approche directe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une capacité à gérer et prioriser un périmètre de recrutement en autonomie&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une posture de business partner, avec la capacité de conseiller et challenger&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une bonne maîtrise des outils de recrutement et un bon niveau d’anglais.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rémunération : &lt;/strong&gt;jusqu’à 44K annuel selon profil.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi nous rejoindre ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formations continues et participation à des projets stratégiques d&#39;acquisition et de fidélisation des talents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Équipe dynamique, flexibilité télétravail, séminaires d&#39;équipe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Localisation Paris 9ème&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Étapes du recrutement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entretien avec Mélody, Head of Talent Acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entretien avec Laurie, DRH&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Artefact, nous recrutons nos collaborateurs uniquement en fonction de nos besoins et des qualités propres de chaque candidat. Nous assurons le développement de leurs compétences professionnelles et de leurs responsabilités sans discrimination d’aucune sorte, notamment de croyances, de genre, d’âge, de situation d&#39;handicap, d’origine ethnique, d’orientation sexuelle, d’appartenance à une organisation politique, religieuse, syndicale ou à une minorité.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qui sommes-nous ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact 3000 est la &lt;strong&gt;division Créative &amp;amp; Data&lt;/strong&gt; du groupe Artefact. Notre singularité réside dans notre capacité à marier l&#39;audace créative avec la rigueur de la &lt;strong&gt;science des données et de l&#39;Intelligence Artificielle&lt;/strong&gt;. Nous ne faisons pas que de la publicité ; nous concevons l&#39;esthétique et l&#39;exécution d&#39;&lt;strong&gt;expériences digitales et de campagnes data-driven&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous sommes l&#39;agence de référence pour les marques qui cherchent à faire évoluer leur communication sur tous les supports numériques. Notre expertise couvre la conception visuelle de campagnes d&#39;envergure, d&#39;activations d&#39;&lt;strong&gt;IA générative&lt;/strong&gt;, de contenus sociaux impactants et de dispositifs &lt;strong&gt;web immersifs&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partenaire d&#39;innovation pour des clients majeurs tels que&lt;strong&gt; Groupe ADP, WWF, Robertet, Pierre&amp;amp;Vacances, TF1+, TotalEnergies&lt;/strong&gt;, nous avons reçu de nombreuses récompenses pour notre créativité et notre innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Les missions que nous proposons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au sein de l’agence, vous accompagnez les Directeurs Artistiques dans la mise en production des campagnes : votre rôle est de transformer les concepts en livrables impeccables, déclinés sur l&#39;ensemble des formats digitaux, avec un vrai souci du détail et du craft.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Décliner et produire les kits créatifs sur tous les formats : bannières display &lt;strong&gt;statiques et animées&lt;/strong&gt;, formats social, habillages web, en respectant les chartes et les intentions créatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer l&#39;exécution graphique et le craft des livrables (typographie, couleur, composition, finition pixel perfect), dans une logique de qualité et de cohérence multi-formats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produire des contenus animés simples : déclinaisons motion de bannières et de stories à partir de maquettes et de storyboards existants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apporter votre regard et participer à la direction artistique de certains projets : recherche de références, planches d&#39;intentions, moodboards, propositions de key visuals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Être force de proposition sur les outils de production, y compris l&#39;IA générative, pour gagner en efficacité et en qualité d&#39;exécution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Le profil que nous recherchons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Étudiant/étudiante en fin d&#39;études d&#39;une école de Design Graphique, de Création Publicitaire ou d&#39;Arts Appliqués, vous disposez idéalement d&#39;une première expérience en agence ou en studio sur des productions digitales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solide culture visuelle et graphique, sens du détail et réelle exigence sur le craft (typographie, couleur, composition, finition).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Goût pour la production et la déclinaison : vous aimez voir vos livrables aboutis et déployés proprement sur tous les formats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maîtrise indispensable de la Suite Adobe (Photoshop, Illustrator) et de Figma.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maîtrise du Motion Design (Adobe After Effects) attendue, ou forte appétence pour l&#39;animation de bannières et de formats sociaux.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosité pour les nouvelles technologies et les outils de création par IA générative (Midjourney, Higgsfield, Kling, etc.) : un vrai plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rigueur, organisation et capacité à gérer plusieurs livrables en parallèle dans le respect des délais.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi nous rejoindre :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Artefact 3000 est l&#39;agence où il faut être : venez développer votre savoir-faire dans une agence de publicité technophile qui monte, qui monte…&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Progression : chaque jour offre de nouveaux défis et de nouvelles occasions d&#39;apprendre, sur des marques fortes et des projets variés.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culture : rejoignez la meilleure équipe que vous puissiez imaginer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process de recrutement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1er entretien : Farouk, Directeur Artistique&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2e entretien : Clara, Talent Specialist Acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Artefact, nous recrutons nos collaborateurs uniquement en fonction de nos besoins et des qualités propres de chaque candidat. Nous assurons le développement de leurs compétences professionnelles et de leurs responsabilités sans discrimination d’aucune sorte, notamment de croyances, de genre, d’âge, de situation d&#39;handicap, d’origine ethnique, d’orientation sexuelle, d’appartenance à une organisation politique, religieuse, syndicale ou à une minorité.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

