&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;All new joiners start their first day in our office to collect the equipment needed to work remotely. We&#39;ll also arrange for some of your team to come in to say hi, ensuring you&#39;re supported and have a positive first few days with Form3!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
