&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;613&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9897594f-2d1a-4d09-93b3-8fd80da363b0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e3a2c2e6-8648-48f2-aef9-187470cf33ec&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;653&quot; data-local-id=&quot;60cd0a76-aadb-44ad-96ed-a1f92b696179&quot;&gt;Management and delivery of IT infrastructure projects, change requests in data centers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;743&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5c2a2e3f-7fcf-46b6-a7b1-95f1651a601d&quot;&gt;Proactively identify and manage resolution of technical and operational issues&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;825&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f94b2944354f&quot;&gt;Managing risks and dependencies in live environments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;881&quot; data-local-id=&quot;68094a32-7f08-44d0-aae7-f93adfe06c32&quot;&gt;Maintain clear operational documentation, including plans, risk logs, and issue trackers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;974&quot; data-local-id=&quot;50f5d5a9-1751-442c-90de-b8b209886703&quot;&gt;Lead communication with all stakeholders: provide regular progress updates, escalate blockers, and manage expectations.&lt;/p&gt;
