&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1257&quot; data-local-id=&quot;26170b4aa5a1&quot;&gt;Engage directly with data center engineers, vendors, and operations teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1335&quot; data-local-id=&quot;af76dfff-7bc3-4cf4-aaa9-3d31d4bdae90&quot;&gt;Participate in related project tasks, including automation, process improvements, and design support as needed.&lt;/p&gt;
