&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2266&quot; data-local-id=&quot;54181dbdfa29&quot;&gt;Familiarity with structured project management or delivery frameworks (e.g., PRINCE2, PMI, Agile)&lt;/p&gt;
