&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Strategy &amp;amp; Operations Associate/ Senior Associate to join our New Country Launches team. This is a hands-on, high-impact role: you&#39;ll be on the ground (sometimes literally) building the operational backbone of new markets we&#39;re launching - and then helping those teams scale fast, without ever losing sight of the patient at the other end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone with 2-5 years of experience in high-growth start-ups, consulting, or operations, who&#39;s eager to take on cross-functional challenges and thrives on the ambiguity of &quot;there&#39;s no playbook yet - let&#39;s build one.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work closely with customer care, medical teams, commercial, product, and operational leadership to support design of new operational teams from the ground up, get them running smoothly, and scale them rapidly across new countries - all while ensuring exceptional care for our patients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the end-to-end setup of new operational teams in newly launched countries - from designing workflows and org structure to getting teams live and running.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with customer care, medical, commercial, and product teams to make sure every new market launches with the right processes, tools, and people in place from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data to spot bottlenecks, trends, and opportunities across new and scaling markets, and turn those insights into clear, actionable recommendations for leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement operational processes that let new country teams scale quickly without sacrificing quality or patient care.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own KPI tracking and performance reporting for newly launched markets, giving leadership real-time visibility into how each launch is progressing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build repeatable playbooks and frameworks from each launch so every subsequent country launch is faster and smoother than the last.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel occasionally to support teams in-market during critical launch phases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Who you are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-5 years of experience in consulting, start-up operations, generalist operations, or a similarly analytical and fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional analytical and problem-solving skills; you&#39;re comfortable working with data and using it to inform decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, with an ability to work across different teams and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter mentality with a bias to action—you’re proactive, resourceful, and don’t wait to be told what to do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in ambiguity and are excited to work in a rapidly evolving, mission-driven environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with occasional travel to support new country launches in-market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Looker, SQL or other data visualisation and analysis tools are a bonus but not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous stock option plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid role based in London Bridge 3 days a week with lunch once a week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness and gym benefit with WellHub&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days holidays, plus bank holidays, and generous parental leave &amp;amp; flexible working policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to Work and Electric Car salary sacrifice schemes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About ROLLER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ROLLER is not your average software-as-a-service company. With a global presence in over 30 countries, we&#39;re here to bring some excitement to the leisure and attractions industry and make a difference! Our mission is to help businesses operate smoothly and create fun and memorable guest experiences by providing seamless ticketing, point-of-sale, self-serve kiosks, memberships and digital waiver processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;But here&#39;s the best part: our team. We&#39;re a group of 300+ highly passionate, enthusiastic, and down-to-earth professionals located all around the world who are all working together to build something truly remarkable. We&#39;re aiming high and believe that the possibilities are endless. As we continue to grow globally, we&#39;re excited to write our success story and have fun along the way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We genuinely love what we do, and we&#39;re looking for like-minded people to join us on this amazing journey. If you&#39;re ready to be part of a dynamic team and make a real impact, come aboard, and let&#39;s create some unforgettable experiences together at ROLLER!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Solution Engineer owns the end-to-end pre-sales process at ROLLER, commercial and technical. You partner with Account Executives to qualify, progress, and earn new business, while simultaneously running the technical validation that gives prospects the confidence to buy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What sets a ROLLER SE apart is the combination. You carry the commercial rigour of a quota-carrying rep; MEDDICC discipline, value-based discovery, and business case ownership alongside the technical credibility to design and deliver compelling solutions. On the most complex deals, you&#39;ll have access to a Solution Architect as a force multiplier, which frees you to stay focused on the commercial motion where you create the most value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role you will support ROLLER&#39;s growth across the French market, engaging prospects and customers in French while collaborating with our wider EMEA and global teams in English.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion MEDDICC qualification across your pipeline: identifying Economic Buyers, mapping Decision Criteria and Process, surfacing Implicated Pain, and maintaining a clear, honest view of deal health at all times&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical &amp;amp; value based discovery with prospects, diagnosing operational and revenue pain points and connecting them explicitly to the value ROLLER delivers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical pre-sales process: running tailored product demonstrations, managing technical validation, and handling integration and configuration questions across the standard deal motion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In support with the AE, and our Business Value Consultant, present ROI-led business cases framed in the language of the Economic Buyer; revenue growth, cost reduction, and operational efficiency, not feature lists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own competitive positioning in live deals, handling objections and neutralising competitor narratives with confidence and evidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Account Executives on deal strategy, account planning, and executive engagement — presenting alongside them to C-suite stakeholders when the deal calls for it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage Solution Architects on your most complex, high-value opportunities. You&#39;ll brief them in, stay close to the commercial thread, and ensure technical depth doesn&#39;t slow the deal down&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to RFPs and RFIs, owning the commercial and functional positioning while leveraging SA support on technically deep sections&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Customer Success on expansion and upsell motions with existing customers, applying the same qualification and value-selling approach to growth as to new logo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clean pipeline and activity data in Salesforce, contributing to forecast accuracy and deal visibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed commercial insights; win patterns, loss reasons, and competitive intelligence back to Sales leadership to sharpen the overall motion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must be a C1 fluent French speaker.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent in English (written and verbal), with the ability to communicate confidently with internal teams and stakeholders across EMEA and globally.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel may be required up to 30%.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years in a Solution Engineer, Sales Engineer, or commercial pre-sales role within a SaaS company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep, practised familiarity with MEDDICC or an equivalent qualification methodology. You use it as a daily operating lens, not an occasional reference&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine commercial instinct: you think in business outcomes and ROI, and you can articulate ROLLER&#39;s value in terms that resonate with a CFO or Head of Operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical confidence to run demos, handle product and integration questions, and manage a standard technical evaluation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build and present business cases to economic buyers, including at the executive level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong discovery skills. You ask the questions that open up a deal, surface real pain, and expose the risks that could kill it later&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive and driven. You want to win, and you know how to build a case that does&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive presence and communication: credible in a boardroom, compelling on a screen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Salesforce as your CRM of record&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with value or solution selling frameworks (Command of the Message, Challenger, SCIPAB) is a strong advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in leisure, attractions, hospitality, or entertainment is a plus, but commercial instinct and methodology matter most&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with API concepts and standard integration patterns, enough to have an informed conversation without an SA in the room&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to ROLLER&#39;s product categories: ticketing, POS, memberships, waivers, self-serve kiosks, payments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with API integrations and API development tools such as Postman and Swagger&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in pre-sale (Solution Architecture, Solution Engineering, Sales) is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the leisure and attractions industry is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re tech-savvy and quick to learn new systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your time and resource management skills, combined with a sharp attention to detail, set you up for success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re genuine, grounded, and value authentic interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re self-motivated and thrive in an autonomous work environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know how to take ownership, manage multiple projects simultaneously, and effectively prioritize day-to-day tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable in fast-paced, evolving environments and adapt quickly to change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring a process-driven mindset with a focus on efficiency, scalability, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You get to work on a category-leading product that customers love in a fun, high-growth industry- check our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.capterra.com/p/164715/ROLLER/reviews/&quot;&gt;Capterra&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.g2.com/products/roller-software/reviews#reviews&quot;&gt;G2&lt;/a&gt; reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team member Assistance Program to proactively support our team&#39;s health and wellbeing - access to coaching, education modules, weekly webinars, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly flexible work environment with an All Access pass to WeWork depending on your location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with a driven, fun, and switched-on team that likes to raise the bar in all we do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Successful applicants will be required to complete a background check (including criminal history) prior to commencement of employment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-hybrid&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About ROLLER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ROLLER isn’t your average SaaS company. We operate globally across 30+ countries, powering millions of real-world experiences in the leisure and attractions industry. What we build doesn’t just live on a screen. It shows up in busy venues, peak weekends, and unforgettable moments for guests.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is simple but ambitious: help operators run better businesses while creating great guest experiences. That means solving complex, real-world problems across ticketing, point of sale, self-service, memberships, kiosks, and digital waivers, all at meaningful scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Just as importantly, it’s the people. We’re a team of 300+ smart, grounded, and genuinely passionate humans working across the globe. We care about quality, ownership, and doing work we’re proud of, without taking ourselves too seriously.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re growing fast, aiming high, and building something that matters. If you want to work on real problems, with real customers, alongside people who care deeply about their craft and impact, ROLLER is a great place to do it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You’ll Enjoy This Role!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Work that keeps venues trading -&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll own fiscal and regulatory compliance across Europe. If it’s wrong, a venue can’t legally trade, so getting it right matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤝&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Your squad owns it -&lt;/strong&gt; Squads are self-managing. The London squad owns localisation and compliance for Europe end to end, and you’ll work with your PM to decide what gets built, how it’s built and when it ships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌍&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Real scale, real consequences -&lt;/strong&gt; Thousands of requests per second across hundreds of containers, powering over 100 million guest experiences in 2025 alone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✨&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Help shape a growing team -&lt;/strong&gt; Be one of the first engineers in London, set how the squad works, and help new engineers get up to speed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why This Role Matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ROLLER is growing fast across Europe, and every new market brings its own rules on tax, invoicing, receipts and language. Our London squad makes sure venues in those markets can trade legally and run in their own language. Recent work includes fiscal compliance for markets like France, Germany and Austria, and AI-assisted translations across the platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join a small London squad reporting to a London based Tech Lead. Our HQ is in Australia, so most of your work with the wider team is async, with live time together every week or two. You’ll be comfortable owning your work, unblocking yourself and finding your own ways to stay connected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our backend runs on C#, .NET, T-SQL and AWS services including Lambda, API Gateway, DynamoDB, S3, SES and SQS. On the front end, we use Angular alongside our own design system and component library.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build and ship changes across backend services, APIs and the Angular interfaces venues use every day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build patterns for regional rules and compliance that we can extend to new markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own integrations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead integration-heavy work with third-party providers, like fiscal and certification partners: define the contract, handle the edge cases and plan for failure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with those providers when something needs chasing or clarifying&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own production&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with the SRE team to monitor system performance and proactively identify potential issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Triage compliance alerts and fix the root cause&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the bar&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share what you know through code reviews, pairing and honest feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with your PM to break vague regulatory requirements into small, shippable pieces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a high appetite for Technology and AI and a natural curiosity for how it can transform your work. You’re comfortable using AI tools to automate repetitive &#39;busy work,&#39; freeing you up to focus on high-impact work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid mid-level or senior experience building and shipping full-stack software in a SaaS product company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep backend experience in C# and .NET, and enough Angular or TypeScript to work across the stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of cloud patterns, application and database performance, with experience applying them to varying workflows and workloads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve built integrations with third-party systems where the details matter: payments, tax, invoicing, compliance or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can take a vague requirement, like a new country’s tax rules, and turn it into something shipped&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You do your best work async: you write things down clearly, unblock yourself and don’t need constant check-ins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bonus points for experience with European fiscal rules, or for speaking French or German. You don’t need to match every point.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe AI is a career-defining inflection point. ROLLER is a fast adopter of new technology like AI, and every team member is empowered to own their learning and use the latest tools to supercharge their impact. We’re looking for candidates with the proficiency and curiosity to embrace AI and technology, not just as a technical skill, but as a core competency to help us achieve big goals. Our engineers use Claude and other AI coding tools day to day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;You get to work on a category-leading product that customers love in a fun, high-growth industry - check our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.capterra.com/p/164715/ROLLER/reviews/&quot;&gt;Capterra&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.g2.com/products/roller-software/reviews#reviews&quot;&gt;G2&lt;/a&gt; reviews.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏥&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Private medical insurance through Vitality, plus dental cover.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💷&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Company pension.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🛡️&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Life insurance at 4x your base salary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💙&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Team member Assistance Program to proactively support our team’s health and wellbeing - access to coaching, education modules, weekly webinars, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍼&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;16 weeks paid Parental Leave for primary carers and 4 weeks paid Parental Leave for secondary carers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎉&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Engage in our ‘Vibe Tribe’ - led by our team members; you can contribute to company-wide initiatives directly. Regular events and social activities, fundraising &amp;amp; cause-related campaigns... you name it. We’re willing to make it happen!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💡&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Work with a driven, fun, and switched-on team that likes to raise the bar in all we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Go on, hit apply. Let’s build great tech together. If you’ve got questions, don’t be afraid to reach out to Reuben at -----
