As the Director of Marketing - EMEA at Gurobi Optimization, you will lead the execution of marketing strategies for EMEA, ensuring alignment with business objectives. You will oversee campaign development, brand positioning, demand generation, and cross-functional collaboration to drive pipeline growth, customer engagement, and brand awareness.&nbsp;
