What will you be doing? 




Develop and execute multi-channel marketing campaigns to enhance brand awareness, lead generation, and customer retention.&nbsp;&nbsp;






Align marketing initiatives with company-wide objectives and sales priorities to maximize impact.&nbsp;&nbsp;






Optimize digital marketing campaigns, including SEO, SEM, email marketing, and social media.&nbsp;






Drive lead-generation initiatives to support sales pipeline growth and business expansion.&nbsp;






Utilize data-driven insights to refine targeting, improve conversion rates, and maximize ROI.&nbsp;






Collaborate with sales leadership to optimize account-based marketing (ABM) strategies.&nbsp;






