Strong background in marketing analytics, automation tools (Marketo, HubSpot), and CRM platforms (Salesforce).&nbsp;






Experience leading marketing programs for SaaS or technology-focused businesses.&nbsp;&nbsp;






Bachelor’s degree in Marketing, Business, or a related field (MBA preferred).&nbsp;



