What other skills should you have?  



Proficient in using macOS and Microsoft 365.&nbsp;&nbsp;






Fluent in managing and utilizing Marketo, a marketing automation platform.&nbsp;&nbsp;






Comfortable with learning and utilizing Salesforce, a customer relationship management (CRM) platform.&nbsp;



