orm preliminary sizing of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW266577432 BCX0&quot;&gt;structural interfaces&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW266577432 BCX0&quot;&gt;, instrumentation layouts, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW266577432 BCX0&quot;&gt;actuator systems, mechanisms&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW266577432 BCX0&quot;&gt; and interface with the specialist departments (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW266577432 BCX0&quot;&gt;Launch Vehicle structures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW266577432 BCX0&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW266577432 BCX0&quot;&gt;AIT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW266577432 BCX0&quot;&gt;) to ensure compatibility and compliance with system constraints.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW266577432 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW39738089 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
