&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItem___g4pRX&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;TokenisedTypography-module__EzGiEkH0__v6-3-8 TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemValue___c0djd&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Senior Reporting Specialist to join our Finance team. The ideal candidate will bring deep expertise in accounting, financial reporting, and internal controls to support the Group Reporting team&#39;s consolidation, disclosure, and financial compliance. In addition, this role will play a critical part in the Group&#39;s key strategic finance initiatives by partnering closely with cross-functional teams and external professional advisors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItem___g4pRX&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;TokenisedTypography-module__EzGiEkH0__v6-3-8 TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7&quot;&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Reporting Specialist, you will be a key contributor to developing the Group&#39;s reporting framework and advancing major strategic finance initiatives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your main responsibilities will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Finance Project Support:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Full involvement in financial work related to major capital markets and strategic finance projects, including but not limited to audit working paper and materials preparation, financial data organization, external audit coordination, and due diligence responses&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• F&lt;strong&gt;inancial Report Preparation and Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Responsible for the preparation and analysis of monthly, quarterly, and annual financial statements, ensuring strict adherence to internationally recognized accounting standards (such as US GAAP, IFRS) and other relevant standards. In addition, you will be responsible for preparing and filing periodic Group financial reports as required by relevant regulatory authorities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;External Professional Liaison:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Deeply engage with and coordinate external auditors, tax advisors, and other advisor teams. Effectively communicate significant accounting matters to support the successful execution of the Group&#39;s major finance initiatives and ongoing compliance thereafter&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &lt;strong&gt;Group Accounting Policy and Accounting Standard Updates:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Streamline and harmonize the Group&#39;s accounting policies, assess the impact of accounting standard updates on the company&#39;s business and financial statements, and provide professional accounting treatment solutions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Consolidated Financial Statements and Business Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Responsible for or assist in the preparation of consolidated financial statements for the Group, with familiarity in financial statement conversions across different accounting standards. Participate in financial analysis and provide financial insights into company decision-making&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Special Accounting Matters Handling:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Prepare professional accounting memos for new business initiatives or significant accounting matters, and provide corresponding accounting treatment recommendations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Internal Control Optimization and Internal Control Audit&lt;/strong&gt;: Drive the continuous optimization and upgrade of the company&#39;s internal control systems, financial processes, and policies to enhance financial operational efficiency and compliance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItem___g4pRX&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;TokenisedTypography-module__EzGiEkH0__v6-3-8 TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7&quot;&gt;Your Profile&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or higher in Accounting, Financial Management, Economics, or a related financial discipline&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wirtschaftsprüfer, AICPA (American CPA), ACCA certificate, or other equivalent qualifications, with all examination sections passed&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years of audit experience from an international Big Four accounting firm, or relevant Group financial reporting experience at a multinational listed company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven experience in participating in listing or major capital markets audit projects, as well as establishing corporate internal control systems and supporting or conducting internal control audits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in financial roles within robotics or manufacturing companies is a plus&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fluent oral communication skills in English, and able to independently review and draft complex English audit and financial documents&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 TranslationField-module__aboutUsWrapper___WXJpq&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A dynamic high-tech company, combined with financial soundness and world-class investors.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Join an interdisciplinary, international team with 60+ different nationalities in a collaborative work environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lots of development opportunities as we continue to grow.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Challenging tasks and impactful projects alongside experts that enable professional and personal growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Corporate Benefits Program covering health, mobility, and learning for 100€ net per month.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Modern office facilities with a rooftop terrace overlooking Munich, free drinks &amp;amp; fruits, and regular company events contribute to a good working environment&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemValue___c0djd&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Robots SE&lt;/strong&gt; is an international high-tech company based in Munich, Germany with a production site in Kaufbeuren and more than &lt;strong&gt;3500&lt;/strong&gt; employees worldwide. Our mission is to bridge the gap between artificial intelligence and robotics by developing systems that combine state-of-the-art force-moment-sensing and world-leading image-processing technology. This unique combination of technologies allows us to provide user-friendly and affordable robotic solutions that enable intelligent precision assembly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is made possible by our employees, who bring out the best in each and every day with creativity and enthusiasm. Become part of this team and shape the future of robotics with us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud of our diversity and welcome your application regardless of gender and sexual identity, nationality, ethnicity, religion, age, or disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h4&gt;About the Role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Agile Robots, we build intelligent robotic systems that learn from high-quality real-world data. To keep our data collection site running at full capacity, we are looking for a Robot Service Engineer (m/f/d) who keeps our robots, teleoperation devices and recording systems operational every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will be the first technical contact on site. You will diagnose and fix hardware and software issues, maintain the robot fleet, and work closely with our R&amp;amp;D teams to resolve deeper technical problems quickly. Your work directly determines how much usable data the site can produce.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is ideal for someone with a hands-on technical mindset who enjoys troubleshooting, works systematically, and wants to grow with cutting-edge robotics and AI technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On-site Technical Support
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide daily first-line technical support for robots, teleoperation devices, cameras and data recording systems on site.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose and resolve hardware, software, network and calibration issues to minimize downtime.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support teleoperators and project coordinators with technical questions during data collection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintenance &amp;amp; System Setup
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Install, set up and calibrate robots and teleoperation workstations for new tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform preventive maintenance, replace parts and keep the robot fleet in working condition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain records of faults, repairs and spare parts usage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;R&amp;amp;D Collaboration &amp;amp; Issue Resolution
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate complex issues to R&amp;amp;D with clear reproduction steps, logs and data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test and deploy software updates, fixes and new features on site, and give feedback on results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify recurring problems and propose improvements to hardware, software and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Safety &amp;amp; Documentation
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure robots and equipment are operated in line with safety and operational guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and update troubleshooting guides, SOPs and setup instructions for the site team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Essential Skills&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree or vocational training in mechatronics, electrical engineering, robotics, computer science or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience troubleshooting electromechanical systems, robots or industrial equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic knowledge of Linux, command line tools and reading system logs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured, independent way of working with strong attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication skills in English; able to explain technical issues clearly to engineers and non-technical colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Beneficial Skills&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with robotic arms, ROS/ROS 2, or teleoperation systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scripting skills in Python or Bash.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of cameras, sensors, networking or data pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in field service, technical support or a production / lab environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 TranslationField-module__aboutUsWrapper___WXJpq&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A dynamic high-tech company, combined with financial soundness and world-class investors.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
