&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Twilio, we’re shaping the future of communications, all from the comfort of our homes. We deliver innovative solutions to&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://customers.twilio.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://customers.twilio.com/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;hundreds of thousands of businesses&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;and empower millions of developers worldwide to craft personalized customer experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our dedication to &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.twilio.com/en-us/blog/open-work&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.twilio.com/en-us/blog/open-work&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;remote-first work&lt;/a&gt;, and strong culture of connection and global inclusion means that no matter your location, you’re part of a vibrant team with diverse experiences making a global impact each day. As we continue to revolutionize how the world interacts, we’re acquiring new skills and experiences that make work feel truly rewarding. Your career at Twilio is in your hands.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring and how we work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use Artificial Intelligence (AI) to help make our hiring process efficient. That said, every hiring decision is made by real Twilions!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Also, while we are a remote-first company, you may be asked to report in person on an ad-hoc basis for team gatherings, functional off-sites or customer meetings.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;See yourself at Twilio&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join the team as Twilio’s next Strategic Account Executive.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is needed to sell into high value prospects and customers. This person will play a key role in further growing the business across EMEA with a particular focus on Southern Europe. The candidate will be responsible for managing fast growing customers in the region. Focused mainly on Product cross and up-sell and GP growth, as well as sourcing net new opportunities within a set of accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Servicing the fastest growing customers in the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growing our revenue and gross profit share of wallet within your key account list.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opening doors to the purchase of Twilio’s products and services - including voice, messaging, email, contact centre, account security software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintaining the highest levels of customer satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create pricing proposals, negotiating terms and managing the contract process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Selling solutions to a technical and business audience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building trust and mutual respect with technical customers and peers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thinking outside of the box and having extraordinary interpersonal and communication skills to make complex contractual, technical, and financial details sound simple.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balancing challenging priorities and handling multiple projects/deals at the same time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Twilio values diverse experiences from all kinds of industries, and we encourage everyone who meets the required qualifications to apply. If your career is just starting or hasn&#39;t followed a traditional path, don&#39;t let that stop you from considering Twilio. We are always looking for people who will bring something new to the table!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native or bilingual proficiency in both English and Hebrew&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of Account Management/Sales experience covering selling and closing complex technical solutions to a large customer base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;History of working with accounts ranging from large multinational enterprise customers to SMB.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success by achieving quota on a consistent basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of Account Management experience and a solid understanding of how to cross sell and upsell solutions within a mature customer base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solid understanding of financial reporting within a direct customer base - Revenue and Gross Profit tracking, Risk and Opportunity (net new business) cadence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally, you also have experience selling both to a business and technical audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience and understanding of working in the communications market is preferable.&amp;nbsp; Have sold or worked with Messaging, Voice Calling, Email, Account Security Verification.&amp;nbsp; Or have prior experience in a traditional telecommunications environment/business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The position will be based in the United Kingdom, Spain or Ireland&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We prioritize connection and opportunities to build relationships with our customers and each other. For this role, approximately 25%&amp;nbsp; travel is anticipated to help you connect in-person in a meaningful way.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at Twilio offers many benefits, including competitive pay, generous time off, ample parental and wellness leave, healthcare, a retirement savings program, and much more. Offerings vary by location.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Twilio thinks big. Do you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We like to solve problems, take initiative, pitch in when needed, and are always up for trying new things. That&#39;s why we seek out colleagues who embody our values — something we call &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.twilio.com/company/values&quot;&gt;Twilio Magic&lt;/a&gt;. Additionally, we empower employees to build &lt;a href=&quot;https://twilio.org/support-and-resources/impact-fund&quot;&gt;positive change in their communities&lt;/a&gt; by supporting their volunteering and donation efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;So, if you&#39;re ready to unleash your full potential, do your best work, and be the best version of yourself, apply now! If this role isn&#39;t what you&#39;re looking for, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.twilio.com/company/jobs#open-positions&quot;&gt;please consider other open positions.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay alert to recruitment fraud&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We care about your safety. Scammers sometimes impersonate Twilio recruiters through fake job postings, emails, websites, or messages. Please ensure you are engaging with an official @&lt;a href=&quot;http://twilio.com&quot;&gt;twilio.com&lt;/a&gt; email address. We will never ask for payment, gift cards, cryptocurrency, or banking information during the recruiting process. We do not make job offers without a formal interview process or conduct interviews exclusively through text-based messaging apps.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Twilio is proud to be an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/strong&gt; We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, reproductive health decisions, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, genetic information, political views or activity, or other applicable legally protected characteristics. We also consider qualified applicants with criminal histories, consistent with applicable federal, state and local law. Qualified applicants with arrest or conviction records will be considered for employment in accordance with the Los Angeles County Fair Chance Ordinance for Employers and the California Fair Chance Act. Additionally, Twilio participates in the E-Verify program in certain locations, as required by law.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Threecolts&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Threecolts is a software suite built for consumer brands, helping them recover revenue, operate more efficiently and grow across major retailers and marketplaces.&lt;br&gt;Our largest business, Margin Pro, helps brands recover money owed to them by retailers and marketplaces such as Amazon, Walmart and Target by managing disputes on their behalf. Alongside this, we’re building and scaling newer products, including AI Operator and Retail 365, while continuing to grow our portfolio of subscription products across our customer base.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a global team of 340 people across 33 teams, having grown through 24 acquisitions. We operate with a flat structure, giving people real ownership and the ability to move quickly. AI is embedded in how we work across the business, helping us increase speed, improve quality and operate at scale.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔥 Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll take ownership of features across Inventory Lab’s C# and .NET-based systems, delivering them from initial design through to production. You’ll design, develop, and maintain clean, scalable backend services, APIs, and application components using C# and the .NET ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work with modern .NET technologies, including ASP.NET and ASP.NET Core, to build and maintain reliable, high-performance web applications and services. You’ll focus on writing maintainable, well-tested code that supports the product’s evolving requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll develop and maintain front-end features using Vue.js and TypeScript, building responsive, intuitive, and maintainable user interfaces that integrate seamlessly with backend APIs. You’ll take ownership of full-stack features end to end, from designing backend services and data models to implementing front-end components, managing application state, and ensuring a consistent user experience. You’ll collaborate with Product, QA, and DevOps to deliver reliable, performant features across the entire application stack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll operate independently within a defined scope, making sound technical decisions and balancing delivery speed with long-term quality. You’ll actively improve existing systems, debug production issues, identify root causes, and implement durable fixes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll contribute to technical discussions, help evolve architecture within your domain, and raise engineering standards through thoughtful code reviews. Collaboration is key: you’ll work closely with Product, QA, and DevOps to deliver features and improvements that provide meaningful value to Inventory Lab customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;😊 About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6–8+ years of professional software engineering experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in &lt;strong&gt;C#&lt;/strong&gt; and experience building production-grade applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of the &lt;strong&gt;.NET platform&lt;/strong&gt;, including its runtime, libraries, and application development ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing web applications and backend services using &lt;strong&gt;ASP.NET and ASP.NET Core&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing modern web applications using Vue.js or React, including component-based architecture and reusable components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building responsive, accessible user interfaces and integrating front-end applications with REST APIs, and maintaining backend services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of system design, application architecture, and scalable software development patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with SQL databases, relational data models, and query optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with cloud infrastructure: AWS or Azure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience debugging production systems, investigating root causes, and resolving issues independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with Git, code reviews, automated testing, and collaborative development workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively within an existing codebase and improve code quality without over-engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💼 What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have a strong ownership mindset and consistently deliver high-quality work. You make pragmatic technical decisions, understanding when to prioritize speed and when to invest in scalability, reliability, and maintainability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You understand the practical application of C# and the .NET ecosystem, choosing appropriate frameworks and patterns to build reliable software. You’re comfortable working with existing systems, identifying opportunities for improvement, and delivering solutions that balance immediate business needs with long-term technical quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You thrive in a product-led environment and care about the customer impact of what you build. You communicate clearly, collaborate effectively across teams, and look for ways to improve both the product and engineering processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll support Inventory Lab, a product used by e-commerce sellers to manage inventory, listings, accounting, and operational workflows. The work will suit someone who enjoys solving practical product problems, improving system reliability, and building software that supports real customer use cases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⛳️ Compensation, Perks &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Salary: £ 110,000 per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;25 days PTO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Healthcare &amp;amp; Pension benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Opportunity to join company-wide offsites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Regular rate reviews and bonus opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Fully remote/hybrid working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Description:&lt;/strong&gt; Systemiq is a system-change company committed to achieving the Sustainable Development Goals and the Paris Agreement by transforming markets and business models across five key systems: nature and food, materials and circularity, energy, urban areas, and sustainable finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a certified B Corp, we combine strategic advisory with high-impact, on-the-ground work, partnering with business, finance, policymakers and civil society to deliver system change. With offices across Africa, Asia, Europe and the Americas, we are dedicated exclusively to sustainability-focused work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Strategy Associate, Materials &amp;amp; Circular Economy&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: London preferred. Amsterdam also possible&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Systemiq is looking for a Strategy Associate to join our Materials &amp;amp; Circular Economy team. This role is suited to someone who combines strong strategic thinking with the intellectual curiosity to tackle complex sustainability challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work on some of the most important questions facing companies, governments and wider society as they shift towards more circular and sustainable models. Projects can range from shaping corporate strategy and identifying new business opportunities to assessing value chains, developing policy recommendations and designing system-level interventions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone who can bring the core toolkit and pace of a strong strategy consultant: structured problem-solving, analytical rigour, clear communication and sound judgement. Strategy consulting experience is one route to demonstrating this. We are equally interested in candidates from other demanding analytical environments who can show the same quality of thinking and ability to turn complexity into clear recommendations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join small, senior-led project teams and take meaningful responsibility from the outset. You will structure problems, conduct analysis, develop insights and work directly with clients to translate those insights into practical strategic choices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structure complex problems:&lt;/strong&gt; break ambiguous questions into clear workstreams, hypotheses and analytical priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generate insights:&lt;/strong&gt; conduct rigorous qualitative and quantitative analysis, drawing conclusions from incomplete or complex information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape recommendations:&lt;/strong&gt; translate analysis into clear, concise and practical strategic recommendations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop client materials:&lt;/strong&gt; produce high-quality presentations, briefings and other client-ready outputs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engage with clients:&lt;/strong&gt; work directly with senior stakeholders across businesses, governments, foundations and non-governmental organisations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to project direction:&lt;/strong&gt; help shape project approaches, hypotheses and emerging strategic conclusions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build trusted relationships:&lt;/strong&gt; work effectively with clients, partners and stakeholders across multi-organisation initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be part of Systemiq&#39;s Materials &amp;amp; Circular Economy platform, led by Partner Ben Dixon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ben works across circular economy and energy topics and has advised organisations including the Ellen MacArthur Foundation, the United Nations International Resource Panel and multinational companies across packaging, chemicals and related sectors. He also leads Systemiq&#39;s work on plastics, focused on accelerating the transition towards a more circular and resource-efficient plastics system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Strategy and analytical capability&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for candidates who already demonstrate, or can quickly operate with, the core toolkit expected in strategy consulting. You should be able to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Structure complex and ambiguous problems into clear components, hypotheses and analytical questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply strong analytical judgement to qualitative and quantitative information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Synthesize complex material into concise insights and decision-relevant recommendations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Communicate clearly in writing and verbally, including through high-quality presentation materials.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work effectively at pace, managing changing priorities and imperfect information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Move comfortably between detailed analysis and the broader strategic question.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Experience and background&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will typically bring:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At least two years of experience in strategy consulting, advisory or another analytically demanding environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Evidence of strong performance and increasing responsibility in your previous roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience contributing to strategy, investment, commercial or other decision-focused work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong academic achievement, typically including a Master&#39;s degree or equivalent experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We particularly welcome candidates from strategy consulting, but relevant experience could also come from corporate strategy, investing, high-growth businesses, specialist advisory firms or other project-based environments where structured thinking and analytical rigour are central to the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Sector interest and understanding&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You do not need to be a specialist across every part of the Materials &amp;amp; Circular Economy agenda. You should, however, bring:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An understanding of, or demonstrated ability to learn, complex industrial and consumer value chains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exposure to sectors such as plastics, petrochemicals, chemicals, consumer goods, manufacturing, mobility, energy or waste management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A strong interest in sustainability, circular economy and the economic and strategic questions involved in system change.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Location&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;London is the preferred location for this role. We would also consider Amsterdam for candidates whose experience and capabilities are an especially strong match for the position.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;description__body&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;578&quot; data-end=&quot;603&quot;&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;603&quot; data-end=&quot;606&quot;&gt;At Systemiq, we absolutely believe diverse perspectives are essential to driving system change. We are committed to creating an inclusive workplace where people feel respected, supported and able to do their best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Click&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.systemiq.earth/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to view our Data Policy.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our leading SaaS-based Global Employment Platform™ enables clients to expand into over 180 countries quickly and efficiently, without the complexities of establishing local entities. At G-P, we’re dedicated to breaking down barriers to global business and creating opportunities for everyone, everywhere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our diverse, remote-first teams are essential to our success. We empower our Dream Team members with flexibility and resources, fostering an environment where innovation thrives and every contribution is valued and celebrated.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The work you do here will positively impact lives around the world. We stand by our promise: Opportunity Made Possible. In addition to competitive compensation and benefits, we invite you to join us in expanding your skills and helping to reshape the future of work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At G-P, we assist organizations in building exceptional global teams in days, not months—streamlining the hiring, onboarding, and management process to unlock growth potential for all.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Position:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;As the Sr. Director &amp;amp; Head of Architecture at G-P, you will be the visionary leader responsible for defining and executing the long-term technical strategy for our global products and AI platforms and influence technical decisions across the company. This is a high-impact, executive-level role that bridges the gap between complex engineering execution and high-level business objectives. You will oversee the evolution of our cloud-native ecosystem, ensuring our architecture is scalable, secure, and infused with cutting-edge AI/ML capabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Reporting directly to the Head of Engineering, you will lead a high-performing team of Architects. You will work in close lockstep with Product Management, Engineering to harmonize technology decisions across the organization, ensuring our investment in technology translates directly into market-leading customer experiences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strategic Technical Leadership: Define and strongly influence the execution of a target-state, AI-native architecture that supports both core software services and advanced AI Agentic behaviors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Architectural Governance: Establish global standards for architecture consistency, ensuring all platform components maximize reuse and align with the long-term technology roadmap.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;AI First thinking: Oversee the architectural design of complex AI systems, AI enablement strategies, data engineering, and governance controls. Ensure that these are integrated into a cohesive strategy and implementation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Customer Centricity: Everything we do is to serve our customers. Understanding the customers and the business is the only way to build strategies for it’s success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Team Management &amp;amp; Mentorship: Lead, scale, and mentor a multidisciplinary team of architects, fostering a culture of engineering excellence and continuous learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Security &amp;amp; Compliance: Define and create standards and governance mechanisms for software platform and infrastructure security to mitigate data breaches and ensure regulatory compliance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Technical Trade-offs: Act as a coach and decision maker with technical teams and business stakeholders, translating complex technical trade-offs when creating business impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Innovation &amp;amp; Research: Serve as the ultimate &quot;sounding board&quot; for introducing new technologies, 3rd-party integrations, and open-source solutions to keep the platform at the forefront of the industry.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Reliability &amp;amp; Performance: Ensure system and infrastructure architecture results in high reliability, low latency, and minimal outages as a primary measure of organizational success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Culture Builder: Help create a strong culture of innovation and technical excellence across the organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Are Looking For:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;15+ years of experience in software engineering and architecture, building products and platforms with at least 5 years in a senior leadership or directorial capacity managing Architecture teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Extensive Cloud Expertise: Proven track record of designing and deploying distributed, cloud-native architectures, especially AWS.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;AI First Product &amp;amp; Tech Strategies : Experience&amp;nbsp; with building AI Native products and technologies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strategic Communication: Demonstrated ability to gain buy-in for large-scale technical shifts from both executive leadership and hands-on engineering teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Change Management: Experience leading architectural digital transformations within a rapidly growing or &quot;unstructured&quot; corporate environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Financial Acumen: Ability to analyze technology trade-offs through the lens of Total Cost of Ownership (TCO) and ROI.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Education: Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related technical field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
