&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the SVP, Global Engineering and Infrastructure, the &lt;strong&gt;Senior Director of Health &amp;amp; Safety Operations Europe&lt;/strong&gt; serves as a strategic leader driving safety excellence across our European operations. You will champion the development and implementation of robust H&amp;amp;S strategies, ensuring full regulatory compliance while fostering a world-class safety culture. This role demands a visionary leader capable of influencing cross-functional teams and implementing industry-best practices to minimize risk and achieve ambitious safety performance goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and execute&lt;/strong&gt; the European H&amp;amp;S strategy, aligning safety milestones with broader business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cultivate &lt;/strong&gt;a &quot;Zero Incident&quot; organizational culture by architecting risk-reduction programs across all operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Safeguard &lt;/strong&gt;the business by ensuring rigorous compliance with local and international safety regulations and certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Standardize&lt;/strong&gt; safety processes across diverse sites using our newly developed, proprietary safety framework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner &lt;/strong&gt;with Supply Chain and Site Operations leadership to integrate safety into the heart of production practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage &lt;/strong&gt;data to track KPIs, providing senior leadership with actionable insights and performance reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead &lt;/strong&gt;high-stakes incident investigations, ensuring deep root-cause analysis and the execution of effective corrective actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act &lt;/strong&gt;as the primary representative for safety matters with regulatory bodies and external stakeholders across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrate&lt;/strong&gt; internal and external safety audits to ensure consistent best-practice standards across all regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor &lt;/strong&gt;and develop a high-performing team of safety experts, fostering professional growth and succession planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pioneer &lt;/strong&gt;the use of AI and emerging technologies as accelerators for continuous improvement and safety innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years of safety management experience, with at least 5 years in a high-impact leadership role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subject matter expertise in European safety regulations, multi-national frameworks, and compliance standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry background in FMCG, Logistics, Manufacturing, or Fulfillment preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of implementing scalable safety strategies across complex, international geographies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset with the ability to translate safety data into strategic business decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication skills, with the ability to influence and align diverse stakeholders at all levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A relentless passion for safety and a dedication to continuous operational improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership presence with a focus on empowering teams and maximizing individual potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the future of food:&lt;/strong&gt; Play a key role in transforming how millions of people eat as we grow into a global food solutions company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive transformational change:&lt;/strong&gt; Your decisions will have a direct and immediate impact, helping to shape strategy, scale teams, and redefine leadership in a rapidly evolving business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build a global brand:&lt;/strong&gt; Create deeper, more sustainable connections with our customers, putting them at the heart of every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefit from long-term wealth creation:&lt;/strong&gt; Your compensation is heavily weighted toward equity, directly aligning your personal success with the company&#39;s future through our Virtual Stock Option (VSO) and Restricted Stock Unit (RSU) plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thrive in a high-performance environment:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with ambitious, intellectually curious peers on a global scale, enjoying an environment built for empowerment and speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;SLSQ427R974&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2729&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to help solve the world&#39;s toughest problems with big data and AI? This is what we do every day at Databricks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Strategic Enterprise Account Executive, you will come with an informed and compelling point of view on the Big Data, Advanced Analytics, and AI space which will guide your successful strategy and together with both our teams and partners, allow you to provide exceptional value to our customers within the Media segment in France.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will provide the industry insight and business creativity required to design and develop unique use cases and solutions that differentiate Databricks within the Media segment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will co-develop a business plan, with your team and ecosystem partners, that accelerates existing customer success, identifies and acquires new opportunities and enables you to exceed quarterly/annual usage and booking goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will motivate a diverse team of big data and AI professionals to implement your business plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will lead your team, customers, and partners to identify impactful big data and AI use cases whilst proving their value on the Databricks Data Intelligence Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will support the broader big data and AI transformation goals of your customers through a combination of strategic partnerships, well-scoped professional services, training, and targeted Executive engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will build exceptional value with all engagements to guide successful negotiations to close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in direct sales of enterprise software platforms to large enterprises&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership of executive level relationships in your clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience of working with large complex regulated organisations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of the Data &amp;amp; AI space with technology sales experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Longevity with previous employers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quota over-achievement and significant growth when selling complex software and services to Enterprise accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience driving successful adoption of usage-based subscription services (SaaS) and co-selling with AWS, Azure and Google Cloud teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Methods for co-developing business cases and gaining support from C-level Executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with sales methodologies and process (e.g Territory and Account planning, MEDDPICC, Challenger Sales and Command of the Message)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing partnerships with &quot;champions&quot; and client teams to support execution of your territory plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing a clear partner strategy and implement it to achieve success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of consumption-based, land and expand sales models advantageous&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of how to identify important uses cases and buying centres to increase the impact of Databricks for clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent French and business English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FEQ128R35&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sr.Specialist Solutions Architect&amp;nbsp; - Platform Security and Cloud Infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Sr. Specialist Solutions Architect (SSA-SME), you will guide customers in building big data solutions on Databricks that span a large variety of use cases. These are customer-facing roles, working with and supporting the Solution Architects, requiring hands-on production experience with cloud infrastructure and big data technologies. SSAs help customers through the design and successful implementation of essential workloads while aligning their technical roadmap for expanding the usage of the Databricks Lakehouse Platform. As a deep go-to-expert reporting to the Specialist Field Engineering Manager, you will continue to strengthen your technical skills through mentorship, learning, and internal training programs to continuously consolidate the skills in your area of speciality.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Director, Field Engineering (Specialist).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical leadership to guide strategic customers to successful implementations on big data projects, ranging from architectural and security design to development and deployment best practices including automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect production-level workloads, including end-to-end pipeline load performance testing and optimisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical expertise in cloud infrastructure and security relating to our&amp;nbsp; Databricks Lakehouse Platform&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist Solution Architects with more advanced aspects of the technical sale including custom proof of concept content, workload sizing, and custom architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve community adoption (through tutorials, training, hackathons, conference presentations)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the Databricks Community and act as a technical SME.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pre-sales or post-sales experience working with external clients across a variety of industry markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as a Data Platform engineer designing, setting up, and maintaining production-grade big data systems (Spark)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing cloud infrastructure and services, in particular in AWS and Azure, applying best practices in cloud security and networking, including:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing, deploying, and maintaining cloud networks and connectivity (VPC/VNet design, routing, segmentation, private connectivity).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect production cloud networks for data and AI workloads, including segmentation and routing, data exfiltration prevention, and performance/reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identity &amp;amp; Access Management (e.g. role-based access control, using the principle of least privilege, integration with IdPs, etc)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with cloud infrastructure automation (e.g. Terraform or cloud-specific resource management tools like ARM, CloudFormation, etc).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting customers in designing and implementing a security lakehouse/security data platform on Databricks to augment SIEM, enable security analytics and threat hunting, and build advanced detections.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to design and extend highly performant, scalable, secure, and cost-effective cloud-based big data solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of development tools and best practices for engineers including CI/CD, unit and integration testing, plus automation and orchestration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production programming experience in one or more of the following languages - Python, Scala, SQL, or R&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Information Systems, Engineering, or equivalent work experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The role is located in Paris and requests travel up to 30% when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in French and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: Databricks Certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;gmail_default&quot; style=&quot;font-size: small;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Mozilla?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Mozilla Corporation is the non-profit-backed technology company that has shaped the internet for the better over the last 25 years. We make pioneering brands like Firefox, the privacy-minded web browser. Now, with more than 225 million people around the world using our products each month, we’re shaping the next 25 years of technology and helping to reclaim an internet built for people, not companies. Our work focuses on diverse areas including AI, social media, security and more. And we’re doing this while never losing our focus on our core mission – to make the internet better for people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The Mozilla Corporation is wholly owned by the non-profit 501(c) Mozilla Foundation. This means we aren’t beholden to any shareholders — only to our mission. Along with thousands of volunteer contributors and collaborators all over the world, Mozillians design, build and distribute &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;open-source&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; software that enables people to enjoy the internet on their terms. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;About this team and role:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced and versatile software engineer to work on the tools and systems that support Firefox engineering.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This is a broad software engineering role spanning internal engineering systems, developer tooling, workflow automation, and the infrastructure required to operate them. We are looking for an engineer with strong software development skills and meaningful experience deploying and operating production systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our Cloud Engineering teams provide shared platforms and foundational services, while engineering teams own the applications and services they run on them. A key part of this role is helping teams succeed in that model by solving difficult operational problems, establishing standards and patterns, and building tooling and automation that makes systems easier to operate. You will also contribute directly to the software, tools, and systems that support Firefox engineering.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You will work across projects and technical domains, joining teams or existing efforts when needed and independently taking on problems that require focused ownership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We build in the open. Open source is fundamental to how we work, and contributing back to the broader open-source ecosystem is an important part of the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Design, build, deploy, and operate software and systems supporting Firefox engineering.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Contribute to developer tooling, CI/CD, workflow automation, and AI-assisted development tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Own complex technical problems end-to-end across software, cloud, and operational layers, improving reliability, performance, observability, and cost efficiency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work with Firefox engineering, Cloud Engineering, IT, and other teams to solve problems that span technical and organizational boundaries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Use telemetry, metrics, and data analysis to investigate problems and guide engineering decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Contribute to architecture and technical strategy, identifying recurring problems and solutions that can be applied across teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Strong software engineering skills and substantial hands-on experience deploying and operating production systems are core requirements for this role. We do not expect you to be an expert in every technology or domain listed below.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Strong programming skills in languages such as Python or JavaScript/TypeScript. Experience with C++ or Rust is useful.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience building and deploying and operating production systems in cloud environments, including utilizing infrastructure as code such as Terraform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience across several areas such as CI/CD, containers and orchestration, networking, databases, observability, or developer tooling.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience using data, telemetry, and metrics to investigate technical problems and make decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with modern AI-assisted development tools and an understanding of their capabilities, limitations, and appropriate use.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;How you work:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You are comfortable jumping into unfamiliar systems and getting them into a sustainable state.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You enjoy moving across projects and technical domains, taking ownership of problems and looking for patterns that make the next one easier to solve.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You work effectively across disciplines and can translate between software, infrastructure, and operational concerns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You combine hands-on engineering with systems thinking and longer-term technical judgment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You communicate openly, consistently, and respectfully, and enjoy teaching and helping others build skills in unfamiliar technical areas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous performance-based bonus plans to all eligible employees - we share in our success as one team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Rich medical, dental, and vision coverage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous retirement contributions with 100% immediate vesting (regardless of whether you contribute)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Quarterly all-company wellness days where everyone takes a pause together&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Country specific holidays plus a day off for your birthday&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;One-time home office stipend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Annual professional development budget&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Quarterly well-being stipend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Considerable paid parental leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Employee referral bonus program&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
