&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @md:pt-2 @md:pb-[10px] @md:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Wir verfolgen die Vision, die Gesundheit aller zu verbessern. Dies spiegelt sich auch im Recruiting wider. Wir evaluieren Bewerbungen ausschließlich auf der Grundlage von Qualifikation und Motivation. Diskriminierung wird bei uns nicht toleriert.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @md:pt-2 @md:pb-[10px] @md:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Je diverser unser Team und die Ideen sind, desto mehr wird unser Produkt die Gesundheit unserer Nutzer:innen verbessern können. Deshalb laden wir Dich ein, Dich bei uns zu bewerben, unabhängig von Geschlecht, Religion, Alter, sexueller Orientierung, ethnischer Herkunft oder Behinderung.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @md:pt-2 @md:pb-[10px] @md:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Um Chancengleichheit zu gewährleisten, kannst Du in Deiner Bewerbung auf Angaben wie Fotos, Alter, etc. verzichten. Lass uns bitte wissen, welche Vorkehrungen wir treffen können, um Dich bestmöglich zu unterstützen. Wir freuen uns, mit Dir das Gesundheitswesen zu digitalisieren!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @md:pt-2 @md:pb-[10px] @md:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Alle bereitgestellten Informationen werden von Doctolib für das Bewerbungsmanagement verarbeitet. Für Details zur Datenverarbeitung klicke bitte &lt;a class=&quot;break-all font-semibold transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out hover:underline text-highlight hover:text-highlight-400 active:text-highlight-dark&quot; href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-DE&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;hier&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @md:pt-2 @md:pb-[10px] @md:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bei Fragen oder wenn Du Deine Rechte wahrnehmen möchtest, wende Dich bitte an hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT QUINCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quince is a destination for builders, creators, innovators, and operators who want to come together and challenge the status quo. Our mission is simple: make really high quality essentials for really low prices, fairly and sustainably. We deliver on that mission through a unique manufacturer-to-consumer (M2C) model eliminating the layers of traditional retail that add cost and result in consumers paying more than they need to. We find, build relationships with, and work directly with the manufacturing partners behind some of the world’s finest products. From there, our teams design smart, efficient operational processes&amp;nbsp; and build and deploy proprietary technology, AI, and analytics to help us scale fast.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What began with a small assortment of elevated basics has quickly grown into a cross-category brand spanning apparel, accessories, home goods, and more. Today, tens of millions of people across a growing number of countries come – and return – to Quince because they trust us to deliver.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR CULTURE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quince is a culture built for builders by builders. Our way of working starts with a blank sheet of paper. We question conventional thinking, use technology and data to uncover new opportunities, and move quickly to turn ideas into reality. We aren’t interested in replicating how others do retail. We’re building a better way – at a speed and scale unlike anything that’s been done before.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We dream big and chase the hard problems others shy away from. Rejecting long-held assumptions is part of our company&#39;s DNA.&amp;nbsp; Where conventional wisdom says you have to choose – soft or durable, speed or rigor, quality or price – we ask why that trade-off has to exist in the first place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our pace is fast and the bar is high because our customers expect a lot from us and we refuse to let them down. We believe the best results come from challenging ourselves, learning from one another, and building on each other&#39;s strengths.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Here, responsibility is not determined by role, tenure, or seniority. Every team member - no matter their level - has the opportunity to drive our business and shape our trajectory.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re someone who likes to imagine new possibilities and build better systems rather than plug-in to outdated ones, Quince is the place for you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Returns Manager to own end-to-end reverse logistics performance across our UK and EU operations. From forecasting incoming volume through grading, refunds, fraud prevention, and resale, you&#39;ll build a returns operation that&#39;s fast, accurate, and cost-efficient — while turning returned inventory back into recovered value. This is a hands-on role for someone who can dig into root causes, manage partners and carriers, and build the reporting to prove it&#39;s working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Returns Forecasting &amp;amp; Planning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain returns volume forecasting models across UK and EU markets, factoring in seasonality, backlog, promotions, and category-level return patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate forecasts into staffing, processing capacity, and warehouse space plans for returns operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor returns rate trends and flag volume shifts to inventory, finance, and merchandising teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Refunds&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee timely, accurate refund processing in line with UK and EU consumer rights regulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Audit warehouse/QRC staff on grading standards and quality checks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with customer service and finance to resolve refund discrepancies and disputes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track refund turnaround time against SLA and resolve bottlenecks in the refund workflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraud Detection &amp;amp; Prevention&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and refine fraud detection processes for returns abuse (wardrobing, serial returners, empty-box claims, item-not-as-described fraud)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with risk and customer service teams to develop fraud rules/flags and investigate high-risk cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance fraud prevention with customer experience, avoiding over-blocking of legitimate returns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Returns Root Cause &amp;amp; Logistics Feedback&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and categorize return reasons, with particular focus on logistics-driven returns (damaged in transit, wrong item shipped, late or failed delivery, packaging failure)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with warehouse, supply chain, and carrier teams to reduce logistics-driven returns through root cause analysis and corrective action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present return reason trends to leadership to inform packaging, product, and logistics improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Returns Resale &amp;amp; Recommerce&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage resale/recommerce channels for graded inventory (open-box, refurbished, clearance, secondary market and liquidation partners)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maximize recovery value on returned inventory while minimizing time-to-resale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage relationships with resale/liquidation partners and evaluate new recommerce channels across UK and EU markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reverse Logistics &amp;amp; Carrier Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate rates and service levels with carriers for return shipments across UK and EU markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage carrier performance for return pickups, label generation, and inbound transit times&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and roll out returns-specific shipping options (paperless returns, drop-off points, pickup services) to reduce cost and improve the customer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SLA &amp;amp; Performance Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and manage SLAs across the returns lifecycle — receipt to grading, grading to disposition, refund turnaround, and time-to-resale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor 3PL and warehouse partner performance against returns SLAs; escalate and resolve issues as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reporting and dashboards to track returns KPIs and turn data into actionable recommendations for leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional &amp;amp; Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with customer service, supply chain, finance, and merchandising to align returns operations with broader business goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure returns operations comply with UK and EU consumer protection, distance selling, and VAT/duty rules (including treatment of re-imported goods and refund-related VAT adjustments)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current on evolving returns-related regulation across UK and EU markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5–8+ years managing returns or reverse logistics operations in a high-volume ecommerce or retail environment, ideally across UK and EU markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building returns forecasting and capacity planning models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of UK and EU consumer rights, refund, and distance-selling regulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing or managing returns fraud detection and prevention programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record reducing logistics-driven returns through root cause analysis and cross-functional fixes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing return resale, refurbishment, or liquidation channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carrier negotiation experience for reverse logistics/return shipping&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong SLA and KPI management skills, with reporting experience (Excel, SQL, or BI tools)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with WMS/OMS returns modules&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent cross-functional communication and stakeholder management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in DTC, fashion/apparel, or other high-return-rate ecommerce categories&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with recommerce or liquidation platforms and partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating across multiple EU countries and languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in fraud/risk analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing reverse logistics SLAs with UK/EU carriers (e.g., Royal Mail, Evri, DPD, DHL, GLS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3319&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;WHY QUINCE?&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3352&quot;&gt;Joining Quince means being part of a mission-driven team reshaping retail. You will work alongside talented colleagues, tackle meaningful challenges, and contribute to building a more sustainable, accessible future for customers and partners alike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3604&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY &amp;amp; HIRING INTEGRITY&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3662&quot;&gt;Quince provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applications for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran or military status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4074&quot;&gt;Quince is committed to providing reasonable accommodations to qualified individuals with disabilities. If you need a reasonable accommodation to complete your application or to perform the essential functions of a role at Quince, please let us know by completing &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/DpJ11jHa1WbqfUWB9&quot;&gt;this accommodation form&lt;/a&gt;. We review all requests individually and will work with you to determine appropriate accommodations on a case-by-case basis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4428&quot;&gt;Employment is contingent upon successful completion of a background check. Quince will conduct background checks in compliance with applicable federal, state, and local laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4604&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Security Advisory: Beware of Frauds&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4641&quot;&gt;At Quince, we&#39;re dedicated to recruiting top talent who share our drive for innovation. To safeguard candidates, Quince emphasizes legitimate recruitment practices. Initial communication is primarily via official Quince email addresses and LinkedIn; beware of deviations. Personal data and sensitive information will not be solicited during the application phase. Interviews are conducted via phone, in person, or through the approved platforms Google Meets or Zoom—never via messaging apps or other calling services. Offers are merit-based, communicated verbally, and followed up in writing. If personal information is requested to initiate the hiring process, rest assured it will be through secure and protected means.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5364&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT QUINCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quince is a destination for builders, creators, innovators, and operators who want to come together and challenge the status quo. Our mission is simple: make really high quality essentials for really low prices, fairly and sustainably. We deliver on that mission through a unique manufacturer-to-consumer (M2C) model eliminating the layers of traditional retail that add cost and result in consumers paying more than they need to. We find, build relationships with, and work directly with the manufacturing partners behind some of the world’s finest products. From there, our teams design smart, efficient operational processes&amp;nbsp; and build and deploy proprietary technology, AI, and analytics to help us scale fast.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What began with a small assortment of elevated basics has quickly grown into a cross-category brand spanning apparel, accessories, home goods, and more. Today, tens of millions of people across a growing number of countries come – and return – to Quince because they trust us to deliver.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR CULTURE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quince is a culture built for builders by builders. Our way of working starts with a blank sheet of paper. We question conventional thinking, use technology and data to uncover new opportunities, and move quickly to turn ideas into reality. We aren’t interested in replicating how others do retail. We’re building a better way – at a speed and scale unlike anything that’s been done before.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We dream big and chase the hard problems others shy away from. Rejecting long-held assumptions is part of our company&#39;s DNA.&amp;nbsp; Where conventional wisdom says you have to choose – soft or durable, speed or rigor, quality or price – we ask why that trade-off has to exist in the first place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our pace is fast and the bar is high because our customers expect a lot from us and we refuse to let them down. We believe the best results come from challenging ourselves, learning from one another, and building on each other&#39;s strengths.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Here, responsibility is not determined by role, tenure, or seniority. Every team member - no matter their level - has the opportunity to drive our business and shape our trajectory.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re someone who likes to imagine new possibilities and build better systems rather than plug-in to outdated ones, Quince is the place for you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;THE ROLE &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2301&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6d5afd27-5970-45c1-b675-f5df64663cbf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;Senior Creative Strategist&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Sr. Creative Strategist for UK/EU is a performance-minded, market-savvy leader who bridges global creative output with the nuances of European consumer behaviour. This person excels at identifying what&#39;s working in the US market and translating it for UK and German/French audiences; while also building the infrastructure to test, learn and scale independently. This person is energized by solving complex business problems, making high-judgment decisions in ambiguous environments, and turning insights into scalable, revenue-driving creative strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role looks like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently identifying high-performing US creative and adapting it to drive customer acquisition and revenue growth in UK &amp;amp; DE/FR markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning the experimentation framework that enables the EU/UK team to move fast, document learnings, and scale winners while maintaining strong alignment with brand identity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serving as the primary creative liaison between UK &amp;amp; DE/FR market needs and the US creative and production teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improving win rates and spend efficiency through a rigorous, data-backed testing cadence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acting as a strategic partner to the Director of Paid Social UK &amp;amp; DE/FR and cross-functional brand, design, and marketing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leveraging data to inform strategic direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role is critical to establishing Paid Social as a core growth engine in the UK, Germany and France.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will be onsite 4-days a week based in London, Madrid, or Berlin.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2663&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e0c03b8d-8a8f-42ae-b3e9-26b5a2308ae6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Creative Adaptation &amp;amp; Briefing&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Audit US creative performance regularly to identify high-potential concepts for UK &amp;amp; DE/FR adaptation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brief the US creative team on market-specific adaptation needs; adjusting copy, tone, cultural references, pricing, and product focus for UK &amp;amp; DE/FR audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commission net-new creative concepts where US assets are insufficient or market-specific angles are required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clear, detailed high converting ad briefs for video, static, UGC, and other ad formats with UK &amp;amp; DE/FR market context embedded&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all adapted and net-new creative aligns with brand identity while resonating locally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide strategic feedback to designers and execute on feedback from leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Experimentation &amp;amp; Performance&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and own a structured experimentation framework for UK &amp;amp; DE/FR paid social; covering hypothesis formation, test design, documentation, and results reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritise and manage a live test pipeline across Meta (and other channels) to continuously improve creative performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse performance data in Meta Ads Manager, TikTok Ads Manager, and Looker; translate findings into clear strategic recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct consumer, competitor, and trend research specific to UK &amp;amp; DE/FR markets to inform creative direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify winning patterns and codify them into repeatable brief templates and creative playbooks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Cross-functional Collaboration&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the EU/UK creative point of contact for the US production and strategy teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Director of Paid Social EU/UK on channel strategy, creative priorities, and growth planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Brand, Design, and broader Marketing teams to align creative output across channels including affiliate, CRM, and PR&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2753&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9ae6a13b-2175-4a37-a4c2-5839b2f592ae&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2769&quot; data-local-id=&quot;46937c2f-d543-4fbd-b76c-3593c6541fb4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;Required:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of relevant creative and marketing experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Social and/or Direct Response experience required, with strong Meta expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience working across markets; ideally including UK and/or DACH, with an understanding of how to adapt creative for different audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical mindset with the ability to interpret data and make confident creative decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills; ability to write compelling briefs and copy across formats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing creative testing frameworks and reporting on results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills with the ability to juggle multiple briefs, markets, and workstreams simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working across Google Suite (Docs, Sheets, Slides, Gmail)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English required; German/French language skills a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a fast-paced, deadline-driven environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration skills across creative and marketing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3083&quot; data-local-id=&quot;dbaae2d5-3e8d-43bb-be8c-e1c7e3b63382&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;Preferred:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with TikTok, YouTube, Snapchat, or other paid platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience briefing and working with UGC creators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in DTC, fashion or e-commerce brands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3150&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;All posted ranges are reflective of base salary and may vary depending upon experience level and location. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Bonus and equity may also be provided for eligible roles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£92,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£101,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3319&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;WHY QUINCE?&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3352&quot;&gt;Joining Quince means being part of a mission-driven team reshaping retail. You will work alongside talented colleagues, tackle meaningful challenges, and contribute to building a more sustainable, accessible future for customers and partners alike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3604&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY &amp;amp; HIRING INTEGRITY&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3662&quot;&gt;Quince provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applications for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran or military status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4074&quot;&gt;Quince is committed to providing reasonable accommodations to qualified individuals with disabilities. If you need a reasonable accommodation to complete your application or to perform the essential functions of a role at Quince, please let us know by completing &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/DpJ11jHa1WbqfUWB9&quot;&gt;this accommodation form&lt;/a&gt;. We review all requests individually and will work with you to determine appropriate accommodations on a case-by-case basis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4428&quot;&gt;Employment is contingent upon successful completion of a background check. Quince will conduct background checks in compliance with applicable federal, state, and local laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4604&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Security Advisory: Beware of Frauds&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4641&quot;&gt;At Quince, we&#39;re dedicated to recruiting top talent who share our drive for innovation. To safeguard candidates, Quince emphasizes legitimate recruitment practices. Initial communication is primarily via official Quince email addresses and LinkedIn; beware of deviations. Personal data and sensitive information will not be solicited during the application phase. Interviews are conducted via phone, in person, or through the approved platforms Google Meets or Zoom—never via messaging apps or other calling services. Offers are merit-based, communicated verbally, and followed up in writing. If personal information is requested to initiate the hiring process, rest assured it will be through secure and protected means.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5364&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Firesprite is a visionary game development studio where immersive experiences meet unforgettable storytelling. We build showcase titles for PlayStation platforms as part of the PlayStation Studios family.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our innovative games take players on thrilling journeys, with memorable characters and captivating narratives. Our commitment to the core values of “We are Adaptable, We are Creators and We act as One” is a key driving force behind our culture.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Join the team who have created awarded winning experiences, now creating Until Dawn 2!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced, driven planner with a background in Cinematic Production for games. You will be overseeing the cinematic pipeline from data ingest through delivery of cinematics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are an expert in bringing together multi-disciplinary teams to make memorable, emotional, and cinematic experiences, with a strong understanding of Narrative, Cinematic Production and Post-Production pipelines within video games.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Principal Cinematic Producer you will work in partnership with the Production Director and other Lead Producers to develop and maintain the Cinematic workflow from concept to final delivery. Working collaboratively cross-discipline with designers, programmers, and audio teams to blur the lines between cinematics and gameplay to develop high-quality narrative gameplay experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is suitable for remote workers with occasional travel to the UK office and to UK based shoots when possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for the project management of the Cinematic pillar, overseeing multi-discipline Feature Teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for overall development strategy and roadmap of the Cinematic Pillar, ensuring cohesion with wider project goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountable for the discipline, consistency, efficiency and quality of output of the Cinematic Teams, including all the work produced for key milestones, alongside close collaboration with the Cinematic and Cinematography directors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establishes and maintains best practices for cinematic production, leading the charge on refining and maintaining cinematic backlogs and roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works with the Principal Producer responsible for shoots to ensure crystal clear communication of shoot deliverables, priorities, last minute changes and updates both to, and from, the shoot team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for maintaining scope/cap plans, driving realistic targets for the teams and working with the Production Director to maintain appropriate outsourcing levels based on accurate, well-maintained data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountable for the Risk Register for all Features Teams they oversee, effectively reports on risk, and works collaboratively with the Production Director and other Lead Producers to mitigate risk where possible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of two years of games industry experience in an internal development environment in a Cinematic Production leadership role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least one shipped PC and/or console title in a Senior Producer or Lead Producer role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has an excellent understanding of Cinematic pipelines and is able to create and maintain data driven and data informed timelines for cinematics production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to troubleshoot production challenges and devise creative solutions on the fly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to adjust plans and processes in response to new challenges, feedback or changes in scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competence in using industry-standard software (e.g., JIRA).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident uniting Leads and Directors across departments in the pursuit of pragmatic but quality minded solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience planning and working on motion capture shoots.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enthusiasm for the Medium: A genuine interest in video games and a commitment to creating engaging, immersive experiences for players.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certified Scrum Master (CSM).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience on multiple large scale, 150+ person AAA games through all phases of production from concept to release.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Firesprite is proud to be an equal opportunity employer, with a commitment to a culture of inclusion and mutual respect for all employees from every walk of life, reflecting the community we make games for.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;We welcome and encourage applications from all suitable applicants regardless of age, disability, sex, gender reassignment, sexual orientation, pregnancy and maternity, race, religion or belief and marriage and civil partnerships.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Motive empowers the people who run physical operations with tools to make their work safer, more productive, and more profitable. For the first time ever, safety, operations and finance teams can manage their drivers, vehicles, equipment, and fleet related spend in a single system. Combined with industry leading AI, the Motive platform gives you complete visibility and control, and significantly reduces manual workloads by automating and simplifying tasks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Motive serves nearly 100,000 customers – from Fortune 500 enterprises to small businesses – across a wide range of industries, including transportation and logistics, construction, energy, field service, manufacturing, agriculture, food and beverage, retail, and the public sector.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://gomotive.com&quot;&gt;gomotive.com&lt;/a&gt; to learn more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Red Team Security Engineer you will be a key member of the Product Security Team. You will be the primary Security partner for software and engineering teams focusing on evaluating security posture across the organization. The Red Team Engineer will be responsible for conducting adversary emulation and offensive security assessments across cloud environments while driving remediation efforts of issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and execute red team operations, adversary simulations, and targeted security assessments focused on cloud environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate the security of cloud infrastructure, identity architectures, CI/CD pipelines, containerized workloads, and cloud-native services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and validate attack paths involving IAM misconfigurations, overprivileged roles, secrets exposure, metadata abuse, insecure automation, and weaknesses in cloud service configurations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess detection and response coverage by exercising logging, alerting, monitoring, and incident response processes in partnership with blue team and detection engineering functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track emerging attacker techniques, cloud exploitation trends, and new abuse paths relevant to modern enterprise environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in offensive security, red teaming, penetration testing, and detection validation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with attacker tactics, techniques, and procedures, and the ability to map findings to frameworks such as MITRE ATT&amp;amp;CK.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to write concise, actionable reports and communicate complex technical issues to diverse stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant industry certifications such as OSCP, OSEP, GXPN, GPEN, or cloud security certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Creating a diverse and inclusive workplace is one of Motive&#39;s core values. We are an equal opportunity employer and welcome people of different backgrounds, experiences, abilities and perspectives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please review our Candidate Privacy Notice&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-link&quot; href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1X9AbvQHki8zZCyjDjip1g0NtdZHcykJc/view?usp=drive_link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;UK Candidate Privacy Notice &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1nqdWTJ7WJJikhj1Yhlo4jxDRA_6yXZbd/view&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_-8012333603671085849gmail-docs-internal-guid-8821a356-7fff-42cb-93df-e4c910033371&quot;&gt;The applicant must be authorized to receive and access those commodities and technologies controlled under U.S. Export Administration Regulations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;It is Motive&#39;s policy to require that employees be authorized to receive access to Motive products and technology.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Regarding US-based roles, depending on your role and primary work location, Motive Technologies, Inc. (“Employer”) discloses candidates may be required to execute a non-compete covenant with the Employer. This requirement does not apply to lawyers, interns, or employees working in CA, MN, MT, ND, OK, or where otherwise prohibited by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Non-compete covenant terms in all other jurisdictions will be subject to the applicable statutory requirements, including but not limited to, procedures, industry related prohibitions, or salary and compensation thresholds.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;All job postings are for existing vacancies. Please note; some interviews or new-hire training sessions may be held in person at one of our global offices.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Kargo creates powerful moments of connection between brands and consumers to build businesses. Every day, our dynamic teams work to radically raise the bar on what agentic AI, CTV, eCommerce, social, and mobile can do to deliver unique ad experiences across the world’s most premium platforms. Taking a Creative Science approach to all we do, we continuously innovate solutions that outperform industry benchmarks and client expectations. Kargo is growing rapidly and currently has offices in NYC, Chicago, LA, Dallas, Sydney, Auckland, London and Waterford, Ireland.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Hire&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Techies who want to build the future. Creatives who want to design it better. Communicators to win business. Collaborators to build it. Data pros who turn numbers into insights. Product builders who turn ideas into innovations. Anyone eager to be on a team that doesn’t stop to ask what’s next, because they’re already building it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Interactive Designer you&#39;ll report directly to the Associate Director of Commerce Ad Design, and work as part of their team, in some cases managing or working alongside Designers and Ad Design Interns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Daily To-Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design &amp;amp; animate visually stunning and cutting-edge advertising experiences for Kargo’s advertising campaigns spanning mobile, desktop, CTV, and social solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employ a user-centered design to create intuitive design solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research and maintain brand guidelines for clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Client Service Managers through internal brainstorms &amp;amp; discussions to bring big ideas to life on the mobile screen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adhere to Kargo’s ad unit best practice standards in all campaign output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively develop ongoing knowledge base of new technologies and products and identify needs and opportunities for additional advertising products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to product ideation with mocks &amp;amp; prototypes of innovative ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design &amp;amp; execute pre-sale ad campaign mocks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and participate client brainstorms &amp;amp; creative meetings when requested&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a subject-matter expert–own a specific function based on the current needs of the organization–you’ll be one of the go-to design resources for the New York team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a mentor and manager to lower level designers and help to promote their growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute on quick-turnaround design requests from other departments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years professional experience executing graphic design and/or motion graphics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Portfolio featuring user-centered design solutions; that may include mobile, social, branding, advertising, video and animation work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent visual design talent, with a pixel-level eye for detail&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
