&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a global creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce to create connected brands&amp;nbsp;that drive growth. Guided by a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Human First&lt;/strong&gt; philosophy, VML is known for its innovative work for brands and consistently ranks among the world’s leading creative companies, including the WARC Creative 100.&amp;nbsp;VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d4b7d1c3-8ad6-4b6d-ab45-d3cb5a3aebe1&quot;&gt;www.vml.com &lt;/a&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;a3ef68bf-16fb-4ebc-9ca9-406007d6cefc&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Senior Content Designer needed to join our Design Team on a permanent basis.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The opportunity&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a confident, creative and versatile Senior Content Designer to work on our client’s website experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Content Designer, you’ll be shaping experiences that are rewarding, personalised and effortless in every interaction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll find new opportunities and improve existing journeys, crafting intuitive and engaging solutions for major product initiatives, multi-step journeys, campaign activity and vehicle launches.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll weigh business objectives with user expectations, delivering content that exceeds both. And you’ll use language to engage, inform, guide and persuade.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;So, you’ll really need to know the value the right content can add to a customer journey. Plus, you’ll need a big appetite for using customer research, data and analytics and smart uses of AI to guide your design process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work mostly independently, with support from a Content Lead to provide direction, review your work and help navigate complex decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Major Initiatives &amp;amp; Launches: &lt;/strong&gt;Drive the end-to-end content design for flagship launches, multi-step customer flows, and complex campaign-driven journeys across digital platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be the Content Advocate in Early Discovery: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner early with product managers and UX leads in the concept phase, shaping product intent, defining information hierarchy, and solving UX problems with content before visuals are developed&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect Complex Journeys: &lt;/strong&gt;Design and structure multi-step content architecture, taxonomy, and navigation paths to ensure seamless transitions across complex digital touchpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evolve the Content Design System: &lt;/strong&gt;Define and document reusable content components, patterns, and copy standards within our design system to ensure long-term consistency across digital products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Establish Governance Frameworks: &lt;/strong&gt;Define clear content governance models, review processes, and quality frameworks so high standards and brand consistency are maintained post-launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Data-Informed Decisions&lt;/strong&gt;: Interrogate quantitative performance data (conversion, drop-off, engagement) and qualitative research to formulate hypotheses, test copy variations, and make evidence-based design iterations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foster Cross-Functional Alignment: &lt;/strong&gt;Work autonomously with cross-functional partners across Product, Engineering, Brand, Marketing, and Legal to align journey messaging with product requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ensure Accessibility &amp;amp; Inclusivity: &lt;/strong&gt;Ensure all multi-step flows and launch content comply with modern accessibility standards (WCAG), plain language requirements, and assistive technology needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage Modern Tooling: &lt;/strong&gt;Work hands-on in tools like Figma and FigJam to document user flows, wireframe content layouts, prototype copy in situ, and explore AI-assisted workflows to optimise efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we want from you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep Content Design Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record designing content for complex digital products, multi-step journeys, or major customer-facing campaign launches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Complex Journey &amp;amp; Architecture Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated capability in content architecture, information hierarchy, and structuring complicated user flows into clear, intuitive journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Early-Phase UX Advocacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience collaborating with product and design partners at the problem-framing stage, shaping the solution before high-fidelity design work starts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design Systems &amp;amp; Governance Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Practical experience developing, documenting, or applying content design system components, style guidelines, and governance processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Data Literacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable using analytics, conversion metrics, and user research findings to steer content decisions and evaluate performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Discipline Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Skilled at collaborating autonomously with stakeholders across product, marketing, and brand to align on goals and resolve conflicting priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Figma &amp;amp; Prototyping:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience working directly inside Figma and modern collaborative tools to prototype content alongside UX/UI designers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accessibility Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; A thorough working knowledge of digital accessibility, screen-reader compatibility, and inclusive language principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relevant Background:&lt;/strong&gt; A degree or equivalent hands-on experience in English, Communications, Human-Computer Interaction (HCI), UX Design, or a related field. Proof of user-centred decisions, testing or iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;If you know some of this, even better&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on major product rollouts or campaign launches within automotive, luxury, or high-volume e-commerce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Specialist training or certifications in Information Architecture or Content Strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience establishing content governance or editorial review workflows across large, multi-brand platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we can offer you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alongside the opportunity to work with some of the most exciting brands around the world, we’ll also prioritise your career development and help you grow your skills. We’ll empower you to make a difference, allow you to be yourself, and respect who you are.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Permanent only&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer a great benefits package including a discretionary bonus scheme, training opportunities, competitive pension, medical insurance, life assurance, social events, opportunities to buy and sell holidays, family friendly policies, discounts with hundreds of retailers and much more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our culture thrives on our core values, designed for impact-driven individuals: Heart, Brains and Courage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We lead with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Heart&lt;/strong&gt;, fostering empathy and trust where genuine connections and human-centric work flourish.&lt;br&gt;We empower your&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Brains&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;for innovation, valuing relentless curiosity and collaborative intelligence to solve complex challenges.&lt;br&gt;And we champion&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Courage&lt;/strong&gt;, inspiring you to speak up, embrace experimentation, and advocate for bold solutions that push our thinking to be better than yesterday.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;How we use AI in the recruitment process:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;To ensure more focused and engaging conversations, we&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;leverage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;AI in our recruitment process exclusively for secure, objective&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;note-taking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;, never for evaluative judgments. This allows our team to be fully present with you. You are always welcome to request a transcript of these notes or opt out of this feature at any time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Opting out will not&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;impact&amp;nbsp; the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;outcome of the interview process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;At&amp;nbsp; WPP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt; Enterprise Solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions designs, builds, and operates the growth systems that competitive businesses rely on. In a world where Al is reshaping how companies drive growth, we lead clients in business transformation and marketing modernisation, connecting strategy directly to execution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our 12,000 experts in engineering and platforms, commerce, consulting, content transformation, CRM, and CX, work within a unified global operating unit across 40+ markets. WPP Enterprise Solutions works alongside best-in-class partners including Adobe, AWS, Braze, Google, Microsoft, Salesforce, and Shopify, as well as innovators in AI, to deliver growth solutions tailored to the needs of our clients’ businesses. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We have received distinction as a leader in Commerce Services and CX Strategy Consulting by the Forrester Wave™&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;To find out more&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://enterprisesolutions.wpp.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;enterprisesolutions.wpp.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; and follow us on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/wpp-enterprise-solutions&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions is part of&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/wpp.com/__;!!IfJP2Nwhk5Z0yJ43lA!L_cfT4E3gsmmDY1lVQTB6ihlfPeBl9X4sMM2KI6iWZYexC2nCeZ9oxgP9qvgbrqxIBpx82rGb_mWqh5F0zKxq5_dP7Y$&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;WPP&lt;/a&gt;, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-EMEA #LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office an average of four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to VML. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Role Overview:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced Senior Data Engineer to design, develop and operate trusted, scalable data solutions that power decision-making and transformation across Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE). Working within Player Data Engineering, you will build reusable data pipelines, integration services and curated data products for business domains including Commerce, hardware, game play, products and services, and accounts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This is a hands-on senior individual contributor role. You will partner with engineering, platform, product and business teams. Take end-to-end ownership of complex solutions and raise engineering standards through technical leadership and mentoring. You will help create reliable, governed and AI-ready Player data foundations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Design, deliver and maintain Player data solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Design, build, test and maintain robust batch and near-real-time data pipelines and ETL/ELT workflows across Player data systems, APIs, Snowflake Db and cloud data environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Develop reusable, well-documented data models and domain-aligned data products, translating complex business logic into reliable engineering solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Lead technical design for assigned initiatives, evaluate trade-offs, and ensure solutions are scalable, secure, maintainable and cost-effective.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Own quality, reliability and operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Own solutions throughout the engineering lifecycle, from requirements and design through deployment, monitoring, incident resolution and continuous improvement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Implement automated testing, data validation, reconciliation, lineage, observability, alerting and operational runbooks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Apply engineering practices including version control, code review, CI/CD, infrastructure automation and appropriate change controls; improve performance and platform efficiency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Provide technical leadership and collaborate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Mentor engineers, lead technical reviews and contribute to shared patterns, coding standards and communities of practice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with TPM’s, business stakeholders, architects, security, governance, analytics and platform teams to clarify requirements, dependencies and data ownership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proactively identify delivery risks, technical debt and cross-team dependencies; communicate progress, options and recommendations clearly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Enable trusted data for analytics, planning, automation and AI use cases while respecting privacy, security and access controls.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1 style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Typically 5+ years of professional data engineering or software engineering experience, including ownership of complex production data solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience designing data pipelines and transformations using modern ETL/ELT tools and frameworks, such as dbt, Ab Initio or equivalent technologies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Solid experience with cloud data platforms and warehouses, particularly Snowflake; knowledge of data modelling, dimensional design and data product principles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with orchestration, Kubernetes, Git-based workflows, automated testing, CI/CD, monitoring and troubleshooting production data services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Understanding of data security, access management, data quality, governance and regulatory considerations in enterprise environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience leveraging AI coding assistants, agentic workflows, and AI-driven development tools to accelerate engineering productivity and improve code quality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with building or integrating AI agents into data engineering workflows would be a strong plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to influence technical decisions, mentor peers and communicate effectively with engineering and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a relevant discipline or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1 style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Desirable Experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong hands-on SQL and Python skills, with experience in distributed data processing using PySpark and/or Databricks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with AWS services, APIs, event-driven integration and infrastructure as code.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Exposure to AI/ML data preparation, data observability, metadata management and modern data governance practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience working with globally distributed teams and supporting cross-functional transformation programs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All persons will receive consideration for employment without regard to gender (including gender identity, gender expression and gender reassignment), race (including colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin), religion or belief, marital or civil partnership status, disability, age, sexual orientation, pregnancy, maternity or parental status, trade union membership or membership in any other legally protected category.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive environment, empower employees and embrace diversity. We encourage everyone to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is a Fair Chance employer and qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records will be considered for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Senior Business Intelligence Specialist to lead the development of high-impact&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;analytical solutions and cohesive data experiences that drive insight to action at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Operating at the intersection of business, analytics, and engineering, this role leads the translation of&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;complex data challenges into scalable, intuitive solutions. The Sr BI Specialist serves as a senior full stack&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BI developer and subject matter expert within a business domain, partnering closely with the BI&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manager, Central BI Team, and Data Engineering to set technical direction, mentor junior team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;members, and ensure solutions are designed and deployed in accordance with best practices and&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;enterprise standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytics Strategy &amp;amp; Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Partner with BI Managers to shape and drive the analytics vision, strategy, and roadmap;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;independently lead workstreams and influence prioritization in alignment with organizational&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Translate ambiguous business questions and problems into structured, scalable analytics&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Rapidly prototype analytics solutions to gather early stakeholder feedback and iterate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;efficiently, reducing time-to-insight; serve as a model for agile delivery practices across the&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Design &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Partner with Data Engineering to architect and implement end-to-end BI solutions — from&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;data ingestion and modeling to visualization — setting technical standards and design&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;patterns that scale across the team and enterprise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Build performant, maintainable dashboards and reports using modern BI tooling (e.g.,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DOMO, Tableau, Looker).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Own and optimize domain data models that underpin reliable, consistent reporting; conduct&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;peer reviews to ensure quality and maintainability across the team’s solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Standardization &amp;amp; Scalability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Proactively drive standardization of analytics solutions; lead initiatives with the Central BI&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Team to scale them into enterprise-wide capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Lead the development of reusable components, templates, and frameworks for the shared&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;analytics library, guide adoption across the BI team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Champion consistent KPI definitions and reporting standards within the business domain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Governance &amp;amp; Quality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Align on domain-specific data models and KPI definitions in close collaboration with the&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Central BI Team and business stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Work with the Central BI Team and Data Engineering to proactively identify, troubleshoot,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;and resolve data quality issues; lead root cause analyses and own remediation plans to&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;prevent recurrence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Ensure data lineage, documentation, and governance practices are created and maintained&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;for all owned solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Engagement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Act as a trusted analytics partner to business stakeholders, translating data insights into&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;clear, actionable narratives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Lead demos, training sessions, and enablement workshops; develop scalable self-service&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;programs to drive broad adoption of BI tools and solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Gather and synthesize stakeholder feedback to continuously improve analytics products;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;translate feedback into prioritized enhancements on the team roadmap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Information Systems, Statistics, Business Analytics, or&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;a related field (or equivalent practical experience).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• 8+ years of hands-on experience in Business Intelligence, Data Analytics, or a closely related&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;role, with demonstrated growth in scope and complexity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Demonstrated track record of delivering enterprise-scale analytics solutions that directly&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;influenced strategic business decisions and measurable outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Expert-level proficiency across one or more major BI platforms — DOMO, Tableau, Looker,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Expert level SQL skills — complex queries, window functions, CTEs, query optimization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience with cloud data platforms (e.g., Snowflake, Azure Synapse, BigQuery, Databricks).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Expertise in data modeling concepts: star/snowflake schemas, dimensional modeling,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;semantic layers, and performance tuning at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience with Python or R for data wrangling and exploratory analysis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Business Acumen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Strong ability to decompose complex business problems into clear analytics requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience defining and documenting KPIs and business metrics in collaboration with&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Proven ability to present data-driven insights to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Soft Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Strong communication skills — written, verbal, and visual storytelling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Comfortable navigating ambiguity and working iteratively with stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Strong cross-functional collaboration skills; experience working with a COE is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Self-starter with a continuous improvement mindset and attention to detail.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All persons will receive consideration for employment without regard to gender (including gender identity, gender expression and gender reassignment), race (including colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin), religion or belief, marital or civil partnership status, disability, age, sexual orientation, pregnancy, maternity or parental status, trade union membership or membership in any other legally protected category.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive environment, empower employees and embrace diversity. We encourage everyone to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is a Fair Chance employer and qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records will be considered for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;7pi8n-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;7pi8n-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Introduction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;7pi8n-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;8mbk-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Are you a recent or soon-to-be graduate in chemistry, physics, engineering or a related field, excited to put your scientific knowledge and curiosity to work on real-world business issues? Are you interested in&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;style_handle__4nndx style_hasReplacements__2Gq83 style_feminine__2TtJP&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;8mbk-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;understanding&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;8mbk-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; why some scientific breakthroughs change the world, while other promising technologies struggle to make it into everyday life? Are you fascinated by how things are made, how people use them and how we can shape a more sustainable future?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;5vjqq&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;deb83-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;deb83-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;deb83-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Do you enjoy exploring complex questions, making &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;style_handle__4nndx style_hasReplacements__2Gq83 style_feminine__2TtJP&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;deb83-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;connections&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;deb83-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; between ideas and working with others to find thoughtful, practical solutions? Would you like to help businesses &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;style_handle__4nndx style_hasReplacements__2Gq83 style_feminine__2TtJP&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;deb83-3-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;understand&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;deb83-4-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; not just what technology can do, but how it can make a meaningful difference?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;5vjqq&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;ep4de-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;ep4de-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;ep4de-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;If so, this could be a great role for you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;ep4de-0-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;5iecq-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;5iecq-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Who we are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;5vjqq&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;81njs-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;81njs-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;81njs-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;A key part of Cambridge Consultants, our Advisory team works with clients across Consumer, Energy &amp;amp; Industrial, Telecommunications, Biotech, Healthcare and Defence &amp;amp; Security. Our clients range from early start-ups to global organisations, all looking for ways to use emerging technologies to address &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;style_handle__4nndx style_hasReplacements__2Gq83 style_masculine__1PshY&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;81njs-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;challenges&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;81njs-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;, create new possibilities and make a positive impact in their markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;5vjqq&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;22qof-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;22qof-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;22qof-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Our role is to help them navigate uncertainty, explore opportunities and turn promising ideas into practical outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;5vjqq&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;4r1go-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;4r1go-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;4r1go-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;We provide research and insights to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;style_handle__4nndx style_hasReplacements__2Gq83 style_feminine__2TtJP&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;4r1go-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;4r1go-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; important business choices relating to deep tech. This includes go-to-market strategies, investment &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;style_handle__4nndx style_hasReplacements__2Gq83 style_feminine__2TtJP&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;4r1go-3-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;4r1go-4-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;, competitor &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;style_handle__4nndx style_hasReplacements__2Gq83 style_masculine__1PshY&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;4r1go-5-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;analysis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;4r1go-6-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;, market insights, technology road-mapping and strategic foresight. The technologies we explore span exciting developments in biotech, quantum sensing and computing, robotics and physical AI, among many others.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;4r1go-0-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;g8h9-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;g8h9-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Your role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;5vjqq&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;dvl0j-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;dvl0j-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;dvl0j-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;This role sits within the Research &amp;amp; Insights section of our Advisory group. We explore how emerging technologies and future trends might shape the choices businesses make today, helping our clients feel better equipped to navigate change and plan for the future.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;5vjqq&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;5g7ik-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;5g7ik-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;5g7ik-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;You might investigate what people will value in the next generation of products, explore how cleantech can be adopted at scale, or uncover where novel sensors could create new possibilities for businesses and their customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;5vjqq&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;20t3t-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;20t3t-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;20t3t-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;It&#39;s an opportunity to combine scientific thinking, creative exploration and commercial &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;style_handle__4nndx style_hasReplacements__2Gq83 style_feminine__2TtJP&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;20t3t-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;understanding&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;20t3t-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; to help answer questions that don&#39;t always have straightforward answers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;20t3t-0-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;3niis-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;3niis-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;5vjqq&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;eopss-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;eopss-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;eopss-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;With guidance and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;style_handle__4nndx style_hasReplacements__2Gq83 style_feminine__2TtJP&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;eopss-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;eopss-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; from our wider Advisory team, you will:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-ul&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;flc9u-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-reset public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;5vjqq&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;flc9u-0-0&quot;&gt;
