&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The Trade Desk does not accept unsolicited resumes from search firm recruiters. Fees will not be paid in the event a candidate submitted by a recruiter without an agreement in place is hired; such resumes will be deemed the sole property of The Trade Desk. The Trade Desk is an equal opportunity employer. All aspects of employment will be based on merit, competence, performance, and business needs. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, marital status, age, national origin, ancestry, physical or mental disability, medical condition, pregnancy, genetic information, gender, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, veteran status, or any other status protected under federal, state, or local law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Equal Opportunity Employer, The Trade Desk is committed to creating an inclusive hiring experience where everyone has the opportunity to thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please reach out to us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- ----- request an accommodation or discuss any accessibility needs you may require to access our Company Website or navigate any part of the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you contact us, please include your preferred contact details and specify the nature of your accommodation request or questions. Any information you share will be handled confidentially and will not impact our hiring decisions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Commerce is the global leader in licensed sports merchandise, operating a vertically integrated platform that designs, manufactures, and delivers officially licensed apparel, jerseys, headwear, and collectibles for major leagues, teams, and events worldwide. With more than 900 e-commerce sites and a global omnichannel presence across digital, in-venue, and retail, Fanatics Commerce reaches fans in over 180 countries and powers official fan experiences for many of the world&#39;s most iconic sports properties.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Fanatics, we bring our BOLD Leadership Principles to life every day - building championship teams, obsessing over fans, acting with entrepreneurial speed, and delivering with a determined and relentless mindset.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Director, Partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Commerce is the global leader in licensed sports merchandise, operating a vertically integrated platform that designs, manufactures, and delivers officially licensed apparel, jerseys, headwear, and collectibles for major leagues, teams, and events worldwide. With more than 900 e-commerce sites and a global omnichannel presence across digital, in-venue, and retail, Fanatics Commerce reaches fans in over 180 countries and powers official fan experiences for many of the world&#39;s most iconic sports properties.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Fanatics, we bring our BOLD Leadership Principles to life every day—building championship teams, obsessing over fans, acting with limitless entrepreneurial spirit, and delivering with a determined and relentless mindset.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we continue to scale our global platform, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Director, Partnerships&lt;/strong&gt; will play a critical role in growing and commercialising strategic football partnerships across global markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ROLE OVERVIEW&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director, Partnerships will lead and develop strategic relationships with key partners, including national federations, premier league, league 1, and championship clubs, as well as global governing bodies and football associations. Serving as the primary strategic contact, this role drives revenue growth, elevates brand presence, and delivers exceptional commercial value to partners&#39; retail businesses through cross-functional collaboration and senior-level relationship management. The Director, Partnerships delivers business and fan impact through BOLD leadership and execution excellence, leveraging data, automation, and AI-enabled insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HOW WILL YOU DRIVE IMPACT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success is measured by the ability to deliver results through BOLD capabilities and measurable outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fan &amp;amp; Customer Impact&lt;/strong&gt; (Obsessed with Fans)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Fanatics as the trusted face of the brand within the sports community, building advisor-level relationships with senior stakeholders to ensure mutual satisfaction and long-term partner retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Introduce innovative ideas and best practices that enhance partnership value and deepen fan engagement across digital, in-venue, and retail touchpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive revenue growth through partner activations and joint marketing initiatives that elevate the fan experience and strengthen commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and analyse performance metrics to continuously optimise financial returns for both Fanatics and its partners, keeping the fan at the centre of every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation &amp;amp; Problem Solving&lt;/strong&gt; (Limitless Entrepreneurial Spirit)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with industry trends, competitor activities, and developments in sports retail to proactively identify new commercialisation and renewal opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute forward-thinking strategies that grow and commercially enhance partnerships with associations, leagues, and clubs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage data and market analysis to identify emerging opportunities, solve complex challenges, and inform strategic direction across the partnership portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion a culture of continuous improvement by introducing best practices that push the boundaries of what partnership value can deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/strong&gt; (Determined &amp;amp; Relentless Mindset)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead strategic business reviews against contracts and business plans, presenting relevant performance data with internal teams to drive accountability and results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the full partnership lifecycle end-to-end, including onboarding, ongoing reviews, escalations, and relationship nurturing, ensuring every commitment is met on time and within plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify risks and opportunities within the portfolio and take decisive action to protect and grow the value of each partnership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold cross-functional teams accountable for delivering on partner goals, maintaining high standards of execution across all touchpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team &amp;amp; Leadership Impact&lt;/strong&gt; (Build Championship Teams)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with senior leadership, ecommerce, product development, licensing, new business, buying, marketing, and operations to align on launches and partner goals, ensuring seamless communication and delivery of commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive alignment across internal stakeholders to ensure the organisation is consistently positioned to meet and exceed partner expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee internal teams supporting the partnership portfolio, fostering a high-performance environment built on clarity, collaboration, and shared accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide strong, inspiring leadership that builds confidence, drives effective change, and develops talent within the partnerships function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a team culture grounded in BOLD principles, empowering individuals to take ownership, innovate, and deliver outstanding results for partners and fans alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; DIGITAL CAPABILITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building a future-ready organization. This role is expected to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply AI and technology to improve efficiency, quality, and outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data and digital tools to inform decisions and enhance performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate curiosity and adaptability in adopting new technologies and ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a culture of innovation and continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CAPABILITIES &amp;amp; EXPERIENCE YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in partnerships, account management, or business development, preferably within sports, sports retail, or ecommerce environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to manage senior client relationships with strong negotiation and strategic thinking skills, and a proven track record of driving revenue growth through strategic partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of football club operations, league structures, and fan engagement strategies, with the ability to operate credibly at the highest levels of the sports industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen with the ability to analyse complex data and market trends to inform strategy and optimise financial performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills with the ability to influence stakeholders at all levels, internally and externally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven project management capability, with the ability to manage multiple priorities simultaneously in a fast-paced, high-growth environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel internationally as required to support partner relationships and business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you do not meet all of the requirements for the role, but still have relevant partnerships or account management experience please do reach out.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Business, Marketing, Sports Management, or a related field; advanced degree preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Fanatics, we operate with a BOLD mindset—We Build Championship Teams, we&#39;re Obsessed with Fans, we embrace a Limitless Entrepreneurial Spirit, and we approach every challenge with a Determined &amp;amp; Relentless Mindset. If you&#39;re ready to contribute to a dynamic, fast-paced environment that thrives on collaboration and growth, we want you to be part of our team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WORK LOCATION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hybrid: The primary place of performance of this role is the Company&#39;s office located in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Paris&lt;/strong&gt;, subject to the Company&#39;s current hybrid work policy. This role currently requires in-office presence &lt;strong&gt;3 days per week&lt;/strong&gt; in Paris and frequent travel to the &lt;strong&gt;Manchester&lt;/strong&gt; Head office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Fanatics, we operate with a BOLD mindset—We Build Championship Teams, we&#39;re Obsessed with Fans, we embrace a Limitless Entrepreneurial Spirit, and we approach every challenge with a Determined &amp;amp; Relentless Mindset. If you&#39;re ready to contribute to a dynamic, fast-paced environment that thrives on collaboration and growth, we want you to be part of our team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Fanatics, we operate with a BOLD mindset - We Build Championship Teams, we’re Obsessed with Fans, we embrace a Limitless Entrepreneurial Spirit, and we approach every challenge with a Determined and Relentless Mindset. If you’re ready to contribute to a dynamic, fast-paced environment that thrives on collaboration and growth, we want you to be part of our team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;ABOUT US&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics Commerce is a leading designer, manufacturer, and seller of licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods. It operates a vertically-integrated platform of digital and physical capabilities for leading sports leagues, teams, colleges, and associations globally – as well as its flagship site, &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fanatics.com&quot;&gt;www.fanatics.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics Commerce has a broad range of online, sports venue, and vertical apparel partnerships worldwide, including comprehensive partnerships with leading leagues, teams, colleges, and sports organizations across the world—including the NFL, NBA, MLB, NHL, MLS, Formula 1, and Australian Football League (AFL); the Dallas Cowboys, Golden State Warriors, Paris Saint-Germain, Chelsea FC, and Tokyo Giants; the University of Notre Dame, University of Alabama, and University of Texas; the International Olympic Committee (IOC), England Rugby, and the Union of European Football Associations (UEFA).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Fanatics Commerce, we infuse our BOLD Leadership Principles in everything we do:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;· Build Championship Teams&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;· Obsessed with Fans&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;· Limitless Entrepreneurial Spirit&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;· Determined and Relentless Mindset&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a -----
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Come join the organization that is redefining security for the AI era. As one of the&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wiz.io/blog/100m-arr-in-18-months-wiz-becomes-the-fastest-growing-software-company-ever&quot;&gt; fastest-growing startups ever,&lt;/a&gt; we enable teams to secure cloud and AI applications by connecting code, cloud, and runtime into a single shared context. Trusted by security teams all over the world, we have a proven&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.g2.com/products/wiz-wiz/reviews&quot;&gt; track record of success&lt;/a&gt; and a culture that values world-class talent. Not to mention, we&#39;re now&lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.google.com/blog/products/identity-security/google-completes-acquisition-of-wiz&quot;&gt; powered by Google&lt;/a&gt;, meaning we offer our customers an AI-powered platform that harnesses Google’s Threat Intelligence and Security Operations to better detect, prevent, and respond to threats across all environments, allowing for further innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Wizards from all over the globe work together to protect the infrastructure of our customers, including over 65% of the Fortune 100, who trust us to scan and secure over 230 billion files daily. We’re honored to be a leading player in a massive and growing market, and we continue to look for exceptional Wizards who are eager to make a significant impact on our team. At Wiz, you’ll have the freedom to think creatively, dream big, and use your full range of skills to contribute to our momentous growth. Come join our team and help us create secure cloud environments that allow even the best companies to move faster, all while having some fun!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Business Value Consultant&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: Paris, France (remote / hybrid)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7 years of experience in management consulting, value consulting, or relevant roles, with a focus on driving business transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with quantitative analysis and financial modeling, including ROI, IRR, NPV, and payback concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with enterprise cloud economics and understanding of enterprise data management concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating with cross-functional partners across sales, sales engineering, pricing, business consulting and other key partners&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience communicating qualitative and quantitative business cases to stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in French language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel up to 20% or higher as required to support sales efforts and industry events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MBA degree.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Cloud Security or the Cloud Security industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to utilize AI frameworks for accelerated data synthesis and research, driving scale and efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We’re looking for a (Senior) Business Value Consultant to join us in articulating and spreading the impact and power of Wiz. Are you passionate about driving transformative business outcomes and shaping strategic initiatives? Are you skilled in translating complex technical solutions into compelling value propositions? In this role, you will represent the blend of front-line commercial execution and long-term strategic thinking, focusing on articulating the strategic and financial impact of Wiz to our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value Selling:&lt;/strong&gt; Create high-quality deliverables that communicate strategic agreement, present multi-year roadmaps, and document the full business case to justify action by developing compelling business case and ROI analyses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestration:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead and facilitate discovery sessions to understand customers&#39; current challenges and future business capabilities, identifying and prioritizing key business value drivers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate closely with sales teams to define account strategies, prioritize sales initiatives, and identify new opportunities based on value creation potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Success:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead strategic engagements with our customers, guiding them through the entire customer lifecycle, from strategic alignment to measuring realized value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deal Negotiation:&lt;/strong&gt; Assist in the development and delivery of commercial proposals and deal structures, providing insights to senior sales leaders to execute negotiation strategies effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thought Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide thought leadership, training, and consultative partnering with internal sales teams throughout and beyond the sales cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;Applicants must have the legal right to work in the country where the position is based,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;without the need for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;visa &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;sponsorship.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;This&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt; role does not offer&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;visa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;sponsorship&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wiz is an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, reproductive health decisions, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, genetic information, political views or activity, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you acknowledge that Wiz will process your personal data in accordance with &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wiz.io/legal/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Wiz&#39;s Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h3 class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;🧡 &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;About Alma&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;At Alma, we believe sustainable commerce depends on fair, well-balanced trade. Because finance plays a pivotal role in business, our mission is to put it back in its rightful place: serving merchants and consumers.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Our installment and deferred payment solutions help merchants boost sales by 20% or more, increase customer loyalty, and deliver a seamless shopping experience, without encouraging bad debt.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;As the buy now, pay later leader in France and active in 10 European countries, we&#39;ve empowered more than 25,000 merchants and 10 million consumers.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;With 380+ Almakers and more than €100M in ARR, Alma is scaling rapidly across Europe as a member of the Next40, and we&#39;re just getting started!&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;👐 &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll join a team made up of one manager, one team lead and five Account Performance Managers: Mathieu, Guillaume, Hugo, Gonzague and Alexandre.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;The team is responsible for supporting Alma&#39;s strategic merchants, helping them grow their business with Alma and ensuring that we continue to deliver value over time.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for our next Account Performance Manager to manage a portfolio of strategic accounts and play a key role in supporting our merchants&#39; business strategies.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;This is a permanent position based in Paris.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;💼 &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;As an Account Performance Manager, you&#39;ll manage a portfolio of approximately 200 strategic merchants, both online and offline. These merchants generate an average annual turnover of between €1M and €3M with Alma.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Most of your portfolio will be based in France, with some international accounts as Alma continues to expand across Europe.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Your role will be to understand each merchant&#39;s business, identify opportunities for growth, maximize the value of the partnership and anticipate any behavior that could lead to churn.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;SMB and Mid-Market accounts represent around 40% of Alma&#39;s margin, which makes your work critical to the company&#39;s success.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-lg text-foreground&quot;&gt;Your main responsibilities&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Drive merchant performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Build strong relationships with your portfolio through proactive outreach, including calls and emails. Use Alma&#39;s dashboards and performance data to identify opportunities and provide meaningful business insights.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Identify growth opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Analyze merchant activity and recommend initiatives such as:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Upselling Alma&#39;s solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Optimizing pricing and payment plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Expanding into new countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Activating additional networks or channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Increasing Alma&#39;s share of the merchant&#39;s payment activity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Improve the profitability of your portfolio&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Conduct business and financial analyses for merchants with low margins. Work with them to define and implement action plans that improve performance and help reach the expected margin target.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Prevent merchant churn&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Keep a close eye on merchant performance, market trends and competitor activity. Identify early warning signs and demonstrate Alma&#39;s value through relevant, data-driven recommendations.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Support Alma&#39;s international growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Work with French and international merchants and contribute to the development of best practices for managing strategic accounts across different markets.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Build smarter ways of working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Contribute to improving account management processes, reporting and automation so the team can scale its impact while maintaining a high level of service.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-lg text-foreground&quot;&gt;How success will be measured&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Your main objectives will be to:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Increase revenue through TPV growth and take-rate optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Reduce merchant churn by proactively demonstrating Alma&#39;s value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Maintain a strategic level of margin across your portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Increase the adoption and expansion of Alma&#39;s solutions among strategic merchants&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;🧰 &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;You will work with&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;You will use a combination of data, sales and collaboration tools, including:&amp;nbsp;Salesforce, Gong, Dust,&amp;nbsp;Performance dashboards and internal reporting tools.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;You will also work closely with teams across the organization, including Operations, Product, Sales, Risk, Finance and Marketing.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;🧩 &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-lg text-foreground&quot;&gt;To succeed in this role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You have at least three years of experience in account management, business development, sales or a similar client-facing role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You have experience managing strategic B2B accounts and advising clients on their business challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You have a strong interest in fintech and a genuine curiosity about payment products, financial performance and the broader payments ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You are comfortable analyzing business and financial data and turning insights into concrete recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You are autonomous, organized and able to manage a portfolio while prioritizing the actions with the greatest business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You are comfortable having challenging conversations with clients and turning them into constructive business opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You are fluent in French and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-lg text-foreground&quot;&gt;It will be a plus if you also&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Speak Spanish, Portuguese or German.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Have experience working with international clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Have worked in payments, fintech, SaaS or another fast-growing technology company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Have experience with pricing, margin optimization or financial analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Are comfortable working with data dashboards, CRM tools and sales intelligence platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Don&#39;t meet every single requirement? At Alma, we believe great hires come from diverse paths. If this role excites you, we encourage you to apply. We value potential, curiosity and the ability to grow as much as experience.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;🧘 &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;If you join Alma, you will have the opportunity to grow and make an impact on:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;A business that matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;SMB and Mid-Market merchants represent around 40% of Alma&#39;s margin. As an Account Performance Manager, you will have a direct impact on revenue, profitability and merchant retention.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Strategic, high-impact accounts&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll work with merchants generating significant volume with Alma and help shape their payment and business strategy.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;A broad range of skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;From business and financial analysis to negotiation, consulting and international account management, this role will help you develop a strong 360° skill set.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;A collaborative, cross-functional environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll work closely with Product, Sales, Operations, Risk, Finance and Marketing teams to solve merchant challenges and create long-term value.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;A team that pushes you forward&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll join a close-knit, high-performing team where feedback is direct, autonomy is real and the bar is high.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;🤑 &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Competitive salary&lt;/strong&gt; based on 12 months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Profit-sharing and employee savings plan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Health insurance:&lt;/strong&gt; 100% covered by Alma, including the family package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Disability insurance:&lt;/strong&gt; 100% covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Sport:&lt;/strong&gt; partnerships with Gymlib and ClassPass, or €30/month reimbursement for sports activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Maternity and paternity leave:&lt;/strong&gt; salary maintained at 100% during leave, with no seniority requirement. Return to work at a 4/5 schedule paid at 100% for eight weeks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Sustainable Mobility Package:&lt;/strong&gt; €544.80/year, excluding fully remote contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Meal vouchers:&lt;/strong&gt; €10/day, 50% covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Mental health:&lt;/strong&gt; free access to the MindDay platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Paid time off:&lt;/strong&gt; 25 days/year, plus additional paid leave for employees on executive contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Access to our &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development platform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Two weeks of full remote work possible per year during the summer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;🎯 &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Interview process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Video call with a Talent Acquisition team member&lt;/strong&gt; to discuss your background and motivation, and present the role and Alma.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Video call with your future manager&lt;/strong&gt; to discuss the role, the team, your experience and answer your questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Case study presentation with two or three team members&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally on site, to assess your practical knowledge and approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;One or two additional interviews tailored to the role&#39;s level&lt;/strong&gt; to further assess your skills and team fit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;🌍 &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Alma, we believe that diversity fuels innovation and makes our community stronger. We are committed to building a workplace where every person feels seen, respected and empowered to do their best work, whatever their gender, background, ethnicity, age, sexual orientation, religion, disability or lived experience.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;As an equal opportunity employer, we welcome applicants from all walks of life. All employment decisions are made based on qualifications, merit and business needs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h3&gt;🧡 About Alma&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Alma, we believe sustainable commerce depends on fair, well-balanced trade. Because finance plays a pivotal role in business, our mission is to put it back in its rightful place, serving merchants and consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our installment and deferred payment solutions help merchants boost sales by 20% or more, increase customer loyalty, and deliver a seamless shopping experience, without encouraging bad debt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the buy now pay later leader in France and active in 10 European countries, we&#39;ve empowered more than 25,000 merchants and 10 million consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With 380+ Almakers and €100M+ ARR, Alma is scaling rapidly across Europe as a member of the Next40, and we&#39;re just getting started!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;👐 About the team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Growth is part of the Revenue team. We build Alma&#39;s merchant acquisition engine: which merchants we target, how we find, identify and qualify them, how fast a qualified merchant reaches the right salesperson and, with lifecycle, how we convert, activate and retain them, in France and in our international markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We work AI-native, by design.&lt;/strong&gt; Everyone in Growth works in Claude Code with a shared library of skills and connectors, a common repository that holds our workflow spec, our decision log and our merchant context, and a simple delivery lifecycle (Research → Spec → Plan → Build) where each stage ends with a human decision. Claude does the legwork; a person decides. Correctness comes from automated verification (tests, adversarial agent review, live validation), and every production change goes through a pull request with a named reviewer from DevX or SRE.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are rebuilding our GTM system&lt;/strong&gt; around five layers: market definition, signals, data &amp;amp; enrichment, decision &amp;amp; routing, and activation. As part of it, we are moving our merchant lifecycle off HubSpot to a modern customer engagement platform. Braze leads, &lt;a href=&quot;http://Customer.io&quot;&gt;Customer.io&lt;/a&gt; is in the running, and we want your view. You will lead that migration and the lifecycle programme built on top of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will join a team of 6&lt;/strong&gt; with a Growth Ops, a Growth Engineer, a Paid Acquisition Manager, a Senior GTM Engineer (hiring) and an Experimentation &amp;amp; Tracking Engineer (hiring), and you will report to Julian, Team Lead Growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;This position is a permanent contract (CDI) based in Paris, hybrid.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;💼 About the job&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the B2B lifecycle, from lead to active merchant&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and run the journeys that drive revenue: lead nurturing, onboarding, activating signed merchants who haven&#39;t taken a first payment, retention and win-back.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reach the right merchants at the right moment with the right message, using segments built on live data (industry, size, country, TPV, product usage).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run a yearly campaign calendar (seasonal moments, product launches, credit upsell) next to the always-on journeys, with clear pressure rules. Start with email, then add in-app, POS materials for in-store merchants, and new channels when the data supports them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help drive Alma&#39;s move towards consumers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Alma is opening up to B2C, with new consumer products on the way. You&#39;ll be the first lifecycle person to work on it, and you&#39;ll get to invent how Alma talks to consumers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;It starts small next to the merchant work and is set to grow fast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the migration off HubSpot&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help pick the platform. Braze is the front-runner, and if you think &lt;a href=&quot;http://Customer.io&quot;&gt;Customer.io&lt;/a&gt; or another tool fits better, make the case.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Audit what runs today, decide what to rebuild, improve or drop, and plan the switch so no key communication stops along the way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;With the Growth Engineer and Data, define the data model, consent management and deliverability setup, then switch off HubSpot marketing on schedule.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measure what you ship&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use control groups and A/B tests by default. Report on activations, reactivations and influenced TPV rather than open rates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build your own segments and analyses, and share what works with Sales, Account Management and Revenue Marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be the CRM project lead across Revenue&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align Sales, Account Management, Ops, Product Marketing, Brand and Legal on shared campaigns: you own the brief-to-delivery workflow, set the pace and arbitrate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make other teams autonomous on simple communications (templates, tone of voice, golden rules), so you can focus on the programmes that move revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🗓️ Your first months&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Months 1–3:&lt;/strong&gt; you audit our current lifecycle (HubSpot workflows, onboarding emails, scattered tools), give your recommendation on the target platform and define its setup with the Growth Engineer, and keep priority campaigns running while you prepare the switch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By month 6:&lt;/strong&gt; onboarding, activation and retention journeys run on the new platform with control groups; HubSpot marketing is switched off; a yearly campaign calendar is shared with Sales, Account Management and Product Marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🧰 You will work with&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lifecycle:&lt;/strong&gt; Braze, &lt;a href=&quot;http://Customer.io&quot;&gt;Customer.io&lt;/a&gt; or equivalent (decision in progress). HubSpot until we switch it off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Revenue systems &amp;amp; data:&lt;/strong&gt; Salesforce (system of record), BigQuery, Looker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Claude Code (skills, connectors), Notion, Linear&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🧩 About you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To succeed in this job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in lifecycle, CRM or marketing automation, across both B2B and B2C. On the B2B side, you have run programmes hand in hand with Sales or Account Management on large portfolios (1,000+ accounts). On the B2C side, you have built consumer activation and engagement journeys at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A campaign manager first: you turn a business goal into a segment, a timing and a message, and you can show the revenue impact of your past programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on with a modern customer engagement platform: Braze, &lt;a href=&quot;http://Customer.io&quot;&gt;Customer.io&lt;/a&gt;, Iterable or equivalent. You build journeys, segments and personalisation yourself, and you have opinions on what each tool does well and where it falls short. Having led or contributed to a platform migration is a strong asset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data autonomy: you pull your own segments and results from a BI tool (Looker or equivalent), design tests with control groups, and understand how data flows between a CRM, a warehouse and a marketing platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional leadership: you have owned projects involving several teams without formal authority, and you know how to prioritise when everyone needs your time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent writing in native-level French (mandatory) and fluent English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And it will be nice if you also&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have set up Braze, &lt;a href=&quot;http://Customer.io&quot;&gt;Customer.io&lt;/a&gt; or a similar platform from scratch, or helped choose one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have set up email deliverability (sending domains, SPF/DKIM/DMARC, IP warm-up).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Already use AI in your daily work for copy, QA or analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked in fintech, payments, a card launch, or with retail merchant networks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Speak Spanish, Italian or German.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don&#39;t meet every single requirement? At Alma, we believe great hires come from diverse paths. If this role excites you, we encourage you to apply. We value potential, curiosity and the ability to grow as much as experience.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🧘 What&#39;s in it for you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact&lt;/strong&gt;: 26,000 merchants in 10 countries, thousands of signed merchants still to activate, and a consumer audience to build. Every journey you ship shows up in TPV.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A clean start&lt;/strong&gt;: you join in time to weigh in on the platform and set it up properly (data model, deliverability, governance) instead of inheriting years of workflow debt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage&lt;/strong&gt;: an AI-native team and engineers next to you for the data plumbing, so you spend your time on segments, messages and results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: a Team Lead Growth who designed this way of working, and close partners in Sales, Account Management, Ops and Product Marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🤑 Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive salary&lt;/strong&gt; based on 12 months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profit sharing and employee savings plan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health insurance&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;strong&gt;100%&lt;/strong&gt; covered by Alma including family package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disability insurance&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;strong&gt;100%&lt;/strong&gt; covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sport&lt;/strong&gt;: partnerships with &lt;strong&gt;Gymlib&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Classpass&lt;/strong&gt;, or &lt;strong&gt;€30/month&lt;/strong&gt; reimbursement for your sports activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maternity/paternity leave&lt;/strong&gt;: salary maintained at 100% during leave with no seniority requirement. Return to work at 4/5 schedule paid at 100% for 8 weeks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sustainable Mobility Package (FMD)&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;strong&gt;€544.80/year&lt;/strong&gt; (excluding full remote contracts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meal vouchers&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;strong&gt;€10/day&lt;/strong&gt;, 50% covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mental health&lt;/strong&gt;: free access to MindDay platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid time off&lt;/strong&gt;: 25 days/year (+ additional paid leave granted for employees on executive contracts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to our &lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development Platform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2 weeks of full remote possible&lt;/strong&gt; per year in summer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🎯 Interview Process&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Video call with a Talent Acquisition team member&lt;/strong&gt; to understand your path, motivation &amp;amp; present you the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Video call with your future manager&lt;/strong&gt; to deep dive the role, the team, your profile and answer all your questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Case study (in house) with a panel of Revenue leaders&lt;/strong&gt;: design a lifecycle programme for a merchant segment, plus a hands-on exercise in a marketing automation tool.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1 or 2 additional interviews&lt;/strong&gt;: meetings with Revenue stakeholders (Ops, Account Management, Product Marketing) to assess business sense and team fit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🌍 Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Alma, we believe that diversity fuels innovation and makes our community stronger. We are committed to building a workplace where every person feels seen, respected, and empowered to do their best work whatever their gender, background, ethnicity, age, sexual orientation, religion, disability or lived experience. As an equal opportunity employer, we welcome applicants from all walks of life, and all employment decisions are made based on qualifications, merit, and business needs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;🧡 &lt;/span&gt;About Alma&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Alma, we believe sustainable commerce depends on fair, well-balanced trade. Because finance plays a pivotal role in business, our mission is to put it back in its rightful place: serving merchants and consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our installment and deferred payment solutions help merchants boost sales by 20% or more, increase customer loyalty, and deliver a seamless shopping experience, without encouraging bad debt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the buy now pay later leader in France and active in 10 European countries, we&#39;ve empowered over 25,000 merchants and 10 million consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With 380+ Almakers and €100M+ ARR, Alma is scaling rapidly across Europe as a member of the Next40, and we&#39;re just getting started!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;👐 &lt;/span&gt;About the team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join the Growth team and work closely with Revenue Operations, Account Managers, Business Analysts, Marketing, Data, and merchant technical teams. You will help Alma apply to its own website the experimentation and measurement expertise we bring to merchants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a permanent, full-time position based in Paris, with a hybrid working model. Professional French and English are required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;💼 &lt;/span&gt;About the job&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Experimentation &amp;amp; Tracking Engineer, you will own web experimentation at Alma: the A/B tests we run on merchant websites, the measurement of what happens on our own website, and its continued development following our recent redesign.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead merchant experimentation from opportunity to readout&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualify testing opportunities against technical and volume eligibility criteria, then design each test with the merchant: scenario, traffic split, pages, events, KPIs, duration, and stopping rule.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement variations and event tracking in Kameleoon, run the live phase, check data quality, and present the first results to the merchant alongside the Account Manager and Business Analysts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own web tracking and measurement quality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and maintain the tracking plan for Alma&#39;s website across 8 markets, implementing it through GTM, GA4, or equivalent tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure reliable data flows into Salesforce, BigQuery, and Looker, while owning consent and GDPR compliance, deduplication, attribution, and reconciliation across sources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and optimize &lt;a href=&quot;http://almapay.com&quot;&gt;almapay.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and evolve landing pages, product pages, market pages, and local content following the website redesign.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run a CRO programme on Alma&#39;s own funnels, starting with the demo request, while maintaining performance, Core Web Vitals, technical SEO, and hreflang across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale the experimentation practice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn the existing framework, documentation, and tooling into a repeatable practice, with a target of 8 merchant tests going live over the year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share standards, learnings, and results with Growth, Revenue Operations, Data, Marketing, Sales, and Product stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;🧰 &lt;/span&gt;You will work with&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kameleoon, Google Tag Manager, Google Analytics 4, JavaScript, HTML, CSS, Salesforce, BigQuery, Looker, Looker Studio, Metabase, n8n, Make, Notion, Slack, GitHub.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;🧩 &lt;/span&gt;About you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To succeed in this job&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 3 to 5 years of experience in experimentation, web analytics, CRO, or measurement-oriented web development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have hands-on experience with GTM and GA4, or equivalent tools, including consent mode, data quality, and debugging issues that can fail silently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are self-sufficient in JavaScript and HTML/CSS, including DOM manipulation, variation building, and debugging on websites you did not build and cannot fully control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand the fundamentals of test validity, including sample size, stopping rules, and what makes an experiment result trustworthy. You are also comfortable working with clients and technical stakeholders in French and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And it will be nice if you also&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have an e-commerce or payments background, with familiarity with checkout journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can use SQL to pull and investigate your own data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked with Kameleoon, Optimizely, AB Tasty, VWO, or a similar experimentation platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Speak Spanish, Italian, or German.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Don&#39;t meet every single requirement? At Alma, we believe great hires come from diverse paths. If this role excites you, we encourage you to apply. We value potential, curiosity, and the ability to grow as much as experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;🧘 &lt;/span&gt;What&#39;s in it for you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you join, you will be able to grow and impact on:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning a broad, high-impact scope as Alma&#39;s internal reference for experimentation and tracking, with the autonomy to shape the practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seeing the direct business outcomes of your work: your tests inform how Alma wins and retains merchants, and your findings are presented to real customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working across dozens of merchant websites, 8 markets, and several CMS platforms, while being supported by a central Data team and Business Analysts for deeper analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;🤑 &lt;/span&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary based on 12 months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Profit-sharing and employee savings plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance: 100% covered by Alma, including family package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disability insurance: 100% covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sport: partnerships with Gymlib and ClassPass, or €30/month reimbursement for your sports activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maternity/paternity leave: salary maintained at 100% during leave with no seniority requirement. Return to work at a 4/5 schedule paid at 100% for 8 weeks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sustainable Mobility Package (FMD): €544.80/year, excluding full-remote contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meal vouchers: €10/day, 50% covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health: free access to the MindDay platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid time off: 25 days/year, plus additional paid leave for employees on executive contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to our Learning &amp;amp; Development Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 weeks of full remote possible per year in summer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;🎯 &lt;/span&gt;Interview Process&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Video call with a Talent Acquisition team member to understand your background and motivation, and present the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Video call with the hiring manager from Revenue Operations &amp;amp; Growth to discuss the role, the team, your experience, and your questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical case: scope an A/B test from a real merchant scenario and present your approach, including project management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-interviews with a Sales or Account Management stakeholder and a Business Analyst you will work with.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Final conversation with leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
