&lt;p&gt;Artefact is an international consulting and engineering company specialising in data and AI, and a European leader in its field. Our headquarters is located in Paris. For the past 10 years, we have focused on designing and deploying artificial intelligence technologies and data-driven solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Paris, we are now present in 24 countries across all continents, with 1,700 employees worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to help businesses unlock the full potential of AI and data by developing bespoke solutions tailored to their specific business challenges. As pioneers in this domain, we combine technological expertise with operational excellence, working closely with leading players in the market. Our clients span all key sectors of the economy – including industry, retail, luxury, FMCG, healthcare, and finance – and include major international groups.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond consulting, we are strongly committed to promoting ethical and accessible AI. We have launched the School of Data to support career transitions into tech roles, and established an AI Research Centre in both Paris and Shanghai.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the context of Artefact’s accelerating growth, we are looking for a B2B Marketing Intern to join our Marketing team starting in &lt;strong&gt;January 2027&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you passionate about B2B marketing in the Tech area and want to work in an environment where your impact on business growth is recognised?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like you, and you’re ready to step-up your career and level of responsibility, then you might just be our next &lt;strong&gt;B2B Marketing Assistant Intern.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Marketing team at Artefact directly contributes to the business by engaging with existing clients and prospects to convert them as leads to generate sales. We do so by working closely with the heads of departments &amp;amp; consultant teams, as well as using KPI to make sure we create the right marketing deliverables and use the right channels to drive engagement, and ultimately leads and revenue.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We do this through &lt;strong&gt;demand generation campaigns&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;events/webinars’ organisation&lt;/strong&gt;, combined with &lt;strong&gt;PPC &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;social advertising &lt;/strong&gt;to ensure brand and lead-gen campaigns support business objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be working closely with the rest of the Artefact’s worldwide Marketing team, that’s why fluently speaking in English to share your best practices and train your peers is also required. You will be collaborating with the Marketing Specialists Global and France of the team, who report to the CMO of the Group, all based in Paris.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using our marketing automation tool (Pardot) to conceive and roll-out mailing and lead nurturing campaigns (mailings, newsletters, landing pages) to drive customer acquisition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helping to organize events (webinars, business breakfasts, podcasts, participation in trade fairs &amp;amp; conferences with booths and speaking slots) and ensure a multi-channel attractive communications of these events through our website &amp;amp; landing pages, mailing series and social media (LinkedIn and Instagram).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing LinkedIn advertising campaigns according to objectives (awareness, acquisition) mixing organic and paid approach, to support and generate leads for the management team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Copywriting for PPC ads (LinkedIn) and landing pages thanks to engaging and attractive communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinating with our design team and briefing them to craft impactful and visually appealing assets that effectively communicate our key messages on social media every day..&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyzing our Marketing Performance dashboards to understand and improve how our inbound marketing activity turns into and converts customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building effective stakeholder relationships (the Growth Tribe (Consulting Partners &amp;amp; Directors) freelancers, agencies, Tech Partners), ensuring all parties are kept informed throughout the campaigns and post activation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The candidate will be an enthusiastic and hardworking young professional, excited to join our fast paced marketing team. You will be a confident communicator, have a passion for lead generation and a genuine interest in the tech industry and BtoB marketing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master in Marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency in English&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management and multitasking skills in a deadline-driven environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with CRM and Marketing Automation automation systems such as Salesforce.com and Eloqua/Pardot/HubSpot etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;LinkedIn expertise in organic and paid&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills (copywriting, editing and presentation) and ability to easily interact with virtual colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to details&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A logical thinker, who’s proactive and results driven&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High level of motivation, confidence and resilience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team player, able to collaborate and communicate with other marketing professionals around the world&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Artefact, we recruit our employees solely based on our needs and the individual merits of each candidate. We are committed to developing their professional skills and responsibilities without any form of discrimination – including, but not limited to, beliefs, gender, age, disability, ethnic origin, sexual orientation, or affiliation with any political, religious, trade union, or minority group.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(Stage) Assistant Project Manager Hackathons &amp;amp; Innovation - F/H&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage fin d&#39;études&lt;/strong&gt; (6 mois)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Début :&lt;/strong&gt; Janiver 2027&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lieu :&lt;/strong&gt; Paris 9e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📌Qui sommes-nous ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify; line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Chez &lt;strong&gt;Artefact Adopt AI&lt;/strong&gt;, nous propulsons &lt;strong&gt;l’innovation &lt;/strong&gt;à travers des &lt;strong&gt;événements&lt;/strong&gt; d’envergure : Ateliers d&#39;innovation participative, Programmes d&#39;intrapreneuriat, et notre format phare : des &lt;a href=&quot;https://adoptai.artefact.com/content/hackathons&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hackathons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Notre mission ? Connecter et faire collaborer un écosystème d&#39;acteurs clés — étudiants, experts Tech et métiers, décideurs, startups, chercheurs — autour des technologies actuelles et de demain :&lt;strong&gt; IA, Robotique, Quantique…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;En tant qu’Assistant Project Manager, tu co-pilotes ces programmes immersifs de A à Z pour faire émerger des prototypes et solutions, répondant à des problématiques réelles d’aujourd’hui et du futur.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚀 Tes défis au quotidien&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ol style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gestion et suivi de projet &lt;/strong&gt;: Tu participes à la création et au suivi des supports de pilotage, ainsi qu’à la gestion des jalons clés de nos expériences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coordination &lt;/strong&gt;: Tu assures une communication et une coordination fluides entre tous les acteurs du projet.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sourcing &amp;amp; Animation digitale&lt;/strong&gt; : Tu pilotes le recrutement des participants, le ciblage des experts (mentors, jurys) et l&#39;animation de nos plateformes en ligne.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestration J-J&lt;/strong&gt; : Tu gères la logistique des temps forts et participes activement à la facilitation, animation et à la coordination générale le Jour-J.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production de Livrables&lt;/strong&gt; : Tu conçois les supports de communication (slides, briefs, kits) et structures les synthèses post-événements pour valoriser nos réalisations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤖 Ta mission bonus : AI Playground&lt;/strong&gt;. Tu testes et intègres des solutions IA/tech pour booster nos propres process et enrichir l&#39;expérience des participants.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👤 Ton profil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Parcours :&lt;/strong&gt; Fin d&#39;études (Master 2) en École de commerce, Ingénieur, Université, IEP, Master Innovation, Management, Gestion de Projet.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset&lt;/strong&gt; : Tu as une vraie rigueur d&#39;organisation, excellent relationnel, autonomie et force de proposition. Tu as une appétence forte pour l&#39;innovation, l&#39;écosystème Tech/IA, la gestion d&#39;événements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outils&lt;/strong&gt; : Tu sais opérer Canva, des outils visuels (Klaxoon/Mural), Lemlist et tu joues souvent avec des outils d&#39;IA Générative (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini etc.).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Langues&lt;/strong&gt; : Français et Anglais courants (contexte international).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎁 Ce que nous t&#39;offrons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Immersion&lt;/strong&gt; : Le meilleur spot pour comprendre concrètement les enjeux et usages de l&#39;IA, la Tech et l’innovation de rupture aujourd&#39;hui.Réseau unique : Tu seras en contact direct des acteurs clé étatiques, de la tech, des startups, des écoles et de l&#39;industrie.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Un cadre de travail stimulant&lt;/strong&gt; au sein d&#39;une équipe à taille humaine, dynamique, bienveillante et responsabilisante.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Gratification compétitive, tickets resto, télétravail flexible.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comment postuler ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Envoie-nous ton &lt;strong&gt;CV&lt;/strong&gt; accompagné d’un &lt;strong&gt;support de motivation original &lt;/strong&gt;(libre cours à ta créativité – points bonus pour une utilisation appropriée de solutions IA !).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Artefact, nous recrutons nos collaborateurs uniquement en fonction de nos besoins et des qualités propres de chaque candidat. Nous assurons le développement de leurs compétences professionnelles et de leurs responsabilités sans discrimination d’aucune sorte. Le groupe s&#39;engage à reconnaître et promouvoir tous les talents, quels que soient leurs croyances, âge, handicap, parentalité, origine ethnique, nationalité, identité de genre, orientation sexuelle, appartenance à une organisation politique, religieuse, syndicale ou à une minorité, ou toute autre caractéristique qui pourrait faire l&#39;objet d&#39;une discrimination.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Manager - Agent Experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Paris, France preferred, open to London applicants (hybrid, three days a week in the office)&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team: &lt;/strong&gt;Customer care&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; €46,000 – €55,000 / £47,000 – £59,000&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluency in French &amp;amp; English&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract: &lt;/strong&gt;Permanent&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting To:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead Product Manager&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role requires an existing right to work in the EU. We can’t offer visa sponsorship, but we review sponsorship role by role, so keep an eye on our careers site for future opportunities&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Kaluza&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/&quot;&gt;Kaluza&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today’s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our platform orchestrates millions of real-time decisions across homes, devices, markets and grids. By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable, affordable and adaptive to everyday life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With teams across Europe, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Roadmap:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the end-to-end strategy for Kaluza Agent Experience (KAE) within the European market—grounded in global product goals but sharpened by local client needs and agent behaviors. Driving core operational metrics (AHT, FCR, CSAT, AI adoption, onboarding)ensuring capabilities improve agent/customer outcomes.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Journey Design &amp;amp; UX Consistency: &lt;/strong&gt;Act as guardian of agent UX across KAE to ensure coherence across the experience. Partnering with UX and domain teams to apply shared patterns consistently, reduce agent cognitive load, and maintain alignment and compliance with the design system as new automation and assistive/AI capabilities are introduced.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Integrations &amp;amp; Client Onboarding:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive technical and product integrations with third-party platforms and oversee spinning up new KAE instances end-to-end for incoming clients from discovery through go-live.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ensure Accessibility &amp;amp; Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; Champion EU accessibility regulations by design, translating regulatory and market-specific needs into actionable engineering requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engage Clients &amp;amp; Drive Value:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the trusted expert for clients on agent experience, advocating for platform-first configuration over bespoke builds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on Delivery &amp;amp; Enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain active involvement across the entire Product Development Life Cycle (PDLC)—from agent discovery sessions to feedback loops—and produce materials to support successful client adoption.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;(Note: Travel to client sites e.g., Brussels, is expected at roughly 1–3 trips a month initially, tapering to 1–2 times a quarter.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring &lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ideally, you’ll have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contact Centre &amp;amp; UX Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep experience owning end-to-end user journeys for high-frequency operational tools (e.g., agent desktops), with hands-on craft in user research, journey mapping, and usability testing with agents and supervisors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EU Accessibility &amp;amp; Platform Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong working knowledge of EU accessibility standards alongside proven experience integrating products with complex third-party platforms and vendor ecosystems.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Delivery &amp;amp; Market Expansion:&lt;/strong&gt; Successful track record implementing or localizing a product for external enterprise clients, taking solutions from zero to live through discovery, configuration, and change management.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Informed Judgement &amp;amp; Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability using operational metrics (AHT, FCR, CSAT, agent effort) to defend product decisions, coupled with a platform-first mindset that prioritizes existing capabilities over custom code.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bilingual Capability:&lt;/strong&gt; Full professional bilingual fluency (written and spoken) in both English and French.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What will set you apart&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Experience leveraging AI tools, machine learning capabilities, or LLM integrations within product workflows to enhance platform intelligence and automation directly into customer service desktop environments.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience within SaaS platforms, the energy sector, or large-scale utility migrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience to scale UI consistency across different product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience to scale UI consistency across different product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you&#39;ll work&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We offer flexible working, with an expectation of 3 days a week in the office. This gives us the best of both: real time together to collaborate and build relationships, with the flexibility to work in the way that suits you best the rest of the week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Five values guide how we work at Kaluza:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Play to win:&lt;/strong&gt; Collective pride in decarbonising energy at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solve the real problem:&lt;/strong&gt; Cutting through complexity to focus on real-world outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build trust every day:&lt;/strong&gt; Consistency, transparency and doing what we say.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the outcome:&lt;/strong&gt; Full accountability, wins and setbacks, without ego.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go further together: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaboration, respect and different perspectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial &amp;amp; Insurance: &lt;/strong&gt;Discretionary bonus, Alan Mutuelle Health Insurance, x3 Life &amp;amp; Death insurance (Prévoyance) via Alan, and standard Sécurité Sociale contributions (pension, family allowance, unemployment insurance)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Allowances:&lt;/strong&gt; 50% commuting expense reimbursement, €200 Home Working Allowance, and €150 Learning Fund&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time Off &amp;amp; Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; 25 days holiday + bank holidays + RTT days, Moments That Matter Leave, Compassionate Leave, two paid Volunteering Days, Flexible Working, and Career Break eligibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We want the best people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’re keen to meet people from all walks of life — our view is that the more inclusive we are, the better our work will be. We want to build teams which represent a variety of experiences, perspectives and skills, and we recognise talent on the basis of merit and potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come as you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want to meet people from all walks of life. The more inclusive we are, the better our work will be, and we recognise talent on merit and potential. If you’re excited about the role but don’t tick every box, we’d still love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/careers/&quot;&gt; careers page&lt;/a&gt; and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/kaluza/&quot;&gt; LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;. Our Applicant Data Protection Policy is&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/applicant-data-protection-notice/&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h4&gt;Personal Buying experience&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior UX Researcher&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In a nutshell&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior UX Researcher (IC3)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Lille&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Timing: ASAP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Context &amp;amp; project&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Decathlon’s mission is to bring people together through sport and make wellbeing accessible for all. To make this mission a reality, Decathlon relies on In-Store teammates who embody the human touchpoint between our brand and our customers, and are key enablers of Store business. This is exactly where your mission comes in: unlocking a deep understanding of our in-store teammates to identify key pain points and turn them into clear business opportunities. Working in a dynamic omnichannel context, you will partner closely with product teams to guide the creation of simple, efficient, and field-adapted experiences—enabling our teammates to be as impactful as possible with our customers while bridging the gap between user needs, business goals, and technological opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Digital plays a pivotal role in the quality of the connection built during moments shared between customers and teammates. How? By ensuring every In-Store Decathlonian works in an efficient and adapted environment that seamlessly supports their daily tasks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this context, we’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;UX Researcher&lt;/strong&gt; to dive into In-Store behaviors and elevate the &lt;strong&gt;Personal Buying Experience&lt;/strong&gt;. Your mission will be to uncover the needs and friction points of our teammates on the floor, identify and build strong opportunities, while supporting our product team in their craft.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;User Researcher&lt;/strong&gt;, you will enrich our &lt;strong&gt;User Knowledge&lt;/strong&gt; and drive the tangible impact of your findings on our in-store tools. You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Decode the field:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct in-store observations to map the real-world practices, workflows, and pain points of our store teammates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guide decision-making:&lt;/strong&gt; Turn qualitative and quantitative data into actionable strategic insights to shape the product roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Promote a User-first culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Feed our team&#39;s knowledge repository to align Designers, Product Managers, and Tech leads with the reality on the shop floor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role &amp;amp; responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Designer / Researcher, you will act as a &lt;strong&gt;key partner with cross-functional product teams&lt;/strong&gt; to&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;influence and enlighten decisions&lt;/strong&gt;, whether long-term strategy, quarterly roadmaps or day-to-day tactics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;build a &lt;strong&gt;shared understanding / empathy&lt;/strong&gt; of the current customer experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ensure that we identify and tackle &lt;strong&gt;the most relevant opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;build long-term impact&lt;/strong&gt; (outcomes) rather than features (outputs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;build and feed a long term &lt;strong&gt;user and customer knowledge strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Craft / Core skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy &amp;amp; Framing -&lt;/strong&gt; Support product decisions (product outcomes, opportunities, solutions) through research insights and Opportunity Solution Trees (OSTs) / Identify and prioritize research plans with stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Research / Problem Discovery -&lt;/strong&gt; Uncover and refine opportunities through qualitative and/or quantitative research / Map end-to-end journeys &amp;amp; opportunity spaces / Make your findings easily accessible and understandable to your stakeholders (readouts, documentation, etc.) / Support teams to setup continuous discovery “habits” (eg. regular &amp;amp; holistic insights gathering, insights library, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Discovery &amp;amp; Testing -&lt;/strong&gt; Support designers &amp;amp; product trios by actively contributing to design critiques &amp;amp; test sessions / Provide research methodology guidance when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusivity &amp;amp; Ethics -&lt;/strong&gt; Craft research methodologies &amp;amp; outputs that fully include the diversity of our users and tackle possible biases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Behaviors / Soft skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence -&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely and proactively with all expertises (product, business, engineering, countries, etc.) to influence strategies, prioritization and discovery/delivery roadmaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional collaboration (functional management) -&lt;/strong&gt; Involve your product teams and stakeholders throughout your research/design process, leveraging the right methods and/or storytelling, creating a safe environment for feedbacks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design collaboration - &lt;/strong&gt;Contribute to elevate the research practices, run and/or participate to collaborative design sessions with your peers across multiple teams (New Business Models, eCommerce, InStore, …)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth mindset -&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively identify and build on your strengths and improvement areas, turn failures into positive learning lessons (for you and for others)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Behaviors / Soft skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence&lt;/strong&gt; - Work closely and proactively with all expertises (product, business, engineering, etc.) to influence strategies, prioritization and discovery/delivery roadmaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional collaboration &lt;/strong&gt;- Involve your product team and stakeholders throughout your design process, leveraging the right methods and/or storytelling, creating a safe environment for feedbacks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design collaboration&lt;/strong&gt; - Contribute to elevate the design practice, run and/or participate to collaborative design sessions (co-design, design critiques) with your peers across multiple teams (New Business Models, eCommerce, …)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth mindset&lt;/strong&gt; - Proactively identify and build on your strengths and improvement areas, turn failures into positive learning lessons (for you and for others)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join the In-Store adventure?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here are a few challenges you may tackle if you join the In-Store adventure&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enhance the human bound&lt;/strong&gt; - Simplifying complexity and leveraging store teams and management, building more and more quality time spaces between our customer and our teammate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve Store efficiency&lt;/strong&gt; - Empower our teammates on the field, understand their pain-points and provide strong, efficient and scalable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reinforce the end-to-end, omni experience&lt;/strong&gt; - Contribute to an high &amp;amp; amazing end-to-end experience for our customer, by designing the best digital experience for our teammates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design the store of tomorrow&lt;/strong&gt; - Leverage on digital to support the store evolution, and design the futur of our actual main touchpoint with the customer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-Store might be a perfect match for you if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want to support the teammates, and be at the heart of Decathlon&#39;s ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love collaborating with a wide variety of expertises &amp;amp; stakeholders (your product team, but also people from eCom, Business, Countries, Sports, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want to be part of a lovely &amp;amp; united team, always ready to help each other or share good laughs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want to play a key role in transforming Decathlon’s stores !&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible working:&lt;/strong&gt; 2 days of remote work per week;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work locations:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to work from any Decathlon Digital office in Lille, Paris, or Nantes;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-quality gear:&lt;/strong&gt; Equipment provided in line with your mission and our social commitments (Mac, Windows, or Chromebooks);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global reach:&lt;/strong&gt; A local project team within a worldwide network (offering international career opportunities);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skill development:&lt;/strong&gt; Continuous growth and support (diverse projects, technical certifications from year one, internal and external training, etc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation package:&lt;/strong&gt; Competitive package (employee profit-sharing, monthly/quarterly bonuses).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That&#39;s exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Store layout&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Digital Product Designer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In a nutshell&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior Product Designer (IC3)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Lille&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Timing: ASAP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Context &amp;amp; project&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Decathlon’s mission is to bring people together through sport and make wellbeing accessible for all. To align this mission with planet boundaries, Decathlon relies on In-Store teammates who embody the human touchpoint between our brand and our customers. This is exactly where your mission comes in: designing simple, efficient in-store experiences that make our teammates&#39; lives easier, enabling them to be as effective and impactful as possible with our customers. Within an omnichannel context, your mission will be to combine operational excellence with user needs, bridging the gap between operational requirements, business objectives, and technological opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Digital plays a pivotal role in the quality of the connection built during moments shared between customers and teammates. How? By ensuring every In-Store Decathlonian works in an efficient and adapted environment that seamlessly supports their daily tasks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this context, we’re looking for a Senior Product Designer to elevate our digital strategy within the Store Layout domain. As part of a dynamic team, you will shape a digital solution that empowers central teams to deliver international and localized visual assets, while enabling stores to effortlessly manage their in-store communication. Your role is to establish a comprehensive end-to-end user experience connecting merchandisers with store staff, driving more performant store layouts and streamlined daily operations for 80,000+ users across the globe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Product Designer, you will join a cross-functional team (Product, Engineering, Business, etc.) and have the responsibility to participate in the discovery process, to continuously improve and develop the new product and to help with the change management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role &amp;amp; responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Designer, you will act as a key partner with cross-functional product teams to&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;influence and enlighten decisions, whether long-term strategy, quarterly roadmaps or day-to-day tactics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ensure that we identify and tackle the most relevant opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;explore &amp;amp; de-risk solutions that are desirable… but also viable and feasible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;build long-term impact (outcomes) rather than features (outputs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Craft / Core skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategy - Support an holistic vision of &quot;Personal Buying Experience&quot; domain (omnichannel journeys and ecosystems)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Problem Discovery - Uncover and refine opportunities through qualitative and/or quantitative research / Map &amp;amp; help prioritize product decisions with Opportunity Solution Trees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solution Discovery - Explore &amp;amp; co-create multiple solutions / Prototype early, iterate often / Design usable interfaces aligned with our design system and accessibility standards (WCAG)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Testing - Constantly de-risk the relevance, usability and impact of explored solutions, using the most adapted method (usability tests, A/B tests, surveys, …)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Behaviors / Soft skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence - Work closely and proactively with all expertises (product, business, engineering, etc.) to influence strategies, prioritization and discovery/delivery roadmaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional collaboration - Involve your product team and stakeholders throughout your design process, leveraging the right methods and/or storytelling, creating a safe environment for feedbacks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design collaboration - Contribute to elevate the design practice, run and/or participate to collaborative design sessions (co-design, design critiques) with your peers across multiple teams (New Business Models, eCommerce, …)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth mindset - Proactively identify and build on your strengths and improvement areas, turn failures into positive learning lessons (for you and for others)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join the In-Store adventure?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here are a few challenges you may tackle if you join the In-Store adventure&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhance the human bound - Simplifying complexity and leveraging store teams and management, building more and more quality time spaces between our customer and our teammate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve Store efficiency - Empower our teammates on the field, understand their pain-points and provide strong, efficient and scalable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reinforce the end-to-end, omni experience - Contribute to an high &amp;amp; amazing end-to-end experience for our customer, by designing the best digital experience for our teammates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design the store of tomorrow - Leverage on digital to support the store evolution, and design the futur of our actual main touchpoint with the customer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In-Store might be a perfect match for you if…&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want to support the teammates, and be at the heart of Decathlon&#39;s ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love collaborating with a wide variety of expertises &amp;amp; stakeholders (your product team, but also people from eCom, Business, Countries, Sports, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want to be part of a lovely &amp;amp; united team, always ready to help each other or share good laughs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want to play a key role in transforming Decathlon’s stores !&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working: 2 days of remote work per week;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work locations: Ability to work from any Decathlon Digital office in Lille, Paris, or Amsterdam;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-quality gear: Equipment provided in line with your mission and our social commitments (Mac, Windows, or Chromebooks);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global reach: A local project team within a worldwide network (offering international career opportunities);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skill development: Continuous growth and support (diverse projects, technical certifications from year one, internal and external training, etc.);&lt;/li&gt;
